window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1401,"title":"Chapter 1401 Suppressing the Battlefield Alone","paragraphs":["1401 Suppressing the Battlefield Alone","They were planning to use the whole army to kill Chu Yunfan. With the support of the military formation, the Great Energy Force Array formed by the thirty-six Cores had reached a shocking level.","This was the strongest lineup that could be assembled after the Imperial Court had suffered heavy losses one after another. The combined strength of thirty-six Cores was not inferior to an ordinary fledgling Void Core, and might even surpass them.","Boom!","The attack of the array masterscombined to form a terrifying attack. It swept toward Chu Yunfan like a flood.","Chu Yunfan also let out a long roar and leaped up. He was not afraid and aimed a kick the array masters Almost instantly, a terrifying martial will was released. It was not a stomp, but it was as if the sky had collapsed.","A terrifying attack instantly erupted and the terrifying attacks from both sides collided.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Loud booms sounded out as the two sides collided fiercely, like two huge missiles bombarding each other. The people in the distance could only see the two sides bombarding each other crazily, and all kinds of terrifying attacks were released.","The thirty-six Core array masters kept changing their formation, turning into shocking attacks to attack Chu Yunfan. On the other side, Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying. He was like a god floating in the sky. His expression was extremely cold, and he kept stomping down. He did not use any shocking martial arts. Just by continuously stepping down, it was as if pieces of the sky were falling down.","At the same time, he was also suffering from all kinds of attacks from the army. Countless arrows were like a storm that almost covered the sky. But even so, his body continued to erupt with the power of thunder to block the arrows. Everyone was dumbfounded, especially those on Wei Wuya’s side.","The various major powers’ scouts stared at this scene as if they were witnessing a miracle. However, they soon realized that Chu Yunfan was bombarding the array with every step he took. It was as if the entire array was about to be shattered.","Everyone saw that even with the combined strength of thirty-six array masters and the combined aura of a million troops, they were still unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan. What a terrifying situation this was.","Chu Yunfan, who was flying in the air, was like a god of war. No one could resist.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Loud booms rang out. Every time Chu Yunfan struck, he would collide into the incoming attacks with shocking power. However, what truly shocked everyone was that Chu Yunfan was pushing back the thirty-six people step by step, all the way into the depths of the million-strong army.","At this moment, another figure flew up, bringing with it an earth-shattering force as it rushed into the sky. On a closer look, who else could it be but Ye Fei?","“He has become stronger!”","“That’s right, he really has become more terrifying!”","“But this is all normal. General Ye Fei cultivates the path of killing on the battlefield. This is his home ground.”","Everyone found that Ye Fei was becoming stronger. He was clearly absorbing battle energy from the battlefield to make himself stronger.","Ye Fei and the array masters formed a pincer attack on Chu Yunfan. One in front and one behind, they launched a crazy attack on Chu Yunfan.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan truly displayed his terrifying strength. A pair of thunder wings spread out behind him, and his entire body was as fast as thunder. Different from the domineering mode that ignored all attacks before, his current mode was extremely fast. It could almost be said that he had split into two figures.","Everyone was shocked to find that Chu Yunfan could suppress the Ye Fei with one hand and the thirty-six array experts with the other.","“Too strong, too terrifying. Is Chu Yunfan still human?”","“That’s right. I finally understand how he was able to kill the First Guardian.”","“Chu Yunfan alone can suppress everyone. Look at him withstand it at all.”","When the scouts saw this scene, they were almost scared to death. Chu Yunfan was too strong, like an invincible god of war. Even though Ye Fei had set up a series of traps to deal with Chu Yunfan, he still had no way to deal with him.","On the other hand, Wei Wuya and the others were extremely excited. The stronger Chu Yunfan was, the greater their chances of success. Even when a million troops were sent to encircle Chu Yunfan, they still didn’t take the opportunity to defeat them because they all knew that Chu Yunfan was the one who would decide the outcome, not the mob.","Even if these mobs were defeated and slaughtered, as long as Chu Yunfan was still around, he could gather an army of the same size within minutes. It was not difficult for them to go their separate ways.","At this time, the battle had reached the depths. Chu Yunfan seemed to have entered a state of enlightenment. Although neither side was his match and he suppressed both sides alone, it was not a state of ease. On the contrary, it could be said that he had used all his strength.","Under such circumstances, all of his potential was released, and he slowly comprehended the final Core Stage Great Dao. This was completely different from what he sensed from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. This was completely based on Chu Yunfan’s own comprehension and ran deeper into his soul. The more profound his comprehension was, the stronger Chu Yunfan’s strength would be.","Ye Fei couldn’t even raise his head. He had already calculated everything, but he had miscalculated Chu Yunfan’s strength. He thought that by relying on the battle energy of the million strong army to cover the sky and block the spirit energy in the outside world, even if Chu Yunfan had boundless divine power, he would be exhausted after a series of battles.","Cores were known to have boundless divine powers. In fact, there was a limit to their powers. It was just that they were far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","That was enough to force Chu Yunfan into a dead end, but in the end, Chu Yunfan forced them into a dead end."]},{"number":1402,"title":"Chapter 1402 Breaking the Great Energy Force Array","paragraphs":["1402 Breaking the Great Energy Force Array","Chu Yunfan was like a magnet, locking them firmly in their surroundings. Their continuous attacks, other than wanting to force him to death, were also locked into this range.","“Monster... He’s a monster. How was such a monster produced in Great Wei?” Ye Fei said in disbelief. He simply could not believe that such a situation would actually happen.","At this moment, he felt a little regretful. He shouldn’t have agreed with the emperor’s strategy to find trouble with Chu Yunfan. Surrounding and killing Chu Yunfan was the wrong choice. From the perspective of the country, such an uncontrollable person should be eliminated as soon as possible, but in fact, they had underestimated Chu Yunfan’s growth speed and strength.","From the moment the plan started but failed to kill Chu Yunfan, this policy was already a big mistake. And this terrible mistake might even lead to the destruction of Great Wei.","Such a treasonous thought that had never appeared in his mind before actually appeared in his mind. It was originally impossible, but the situation on the battlefield made him have such a thought. He controlled all of Great Wei’s armies and could be said to have a high position and great power. However, it was also because of this that he truly understood that this was the last lineup that Great Wei could bring out.","It was supposed to be used to deal with the Jinzhanghan’s invasion, but now it was used on one person.","One could imagine how terrifying and difficult Chu Yunfan was to deal with in their hearts. However, it was also because of this that once he broke through their front lines, the consequences would be unimaginable. Chu Yunfan and Wei Wuya’s troops would aim directly for the Imperial Capital. At that time, the Imperial Capital would be a flat land with no dangers to defend and no soldiers to defend it.","At the thought of this, Ye Fei’s eyes flashed with a terrifying killing intent. It was blood-red.","“No, even if it’s for Great Wei, I have to keep you here. Even if I die, you won’t have a good life!” Ye Fei roared.","“If you want to drag me down with you, then let’s see if you have the ability.”","Chu Yunfan’s cold and merciless words entered the state of enlightenment. He had entered a wonderful state where he threw away all his emotions and used absolute rationality to control his actions.","“Go to hell!”","Ye Fei roared and swept out the spear in his hand. The spear pierced through the sky and aimed directly toward Chu Yunfan’s face. The speed was fast and swift, and the spear was accurate and ruthless. In an instant, it was already in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it and just waved his hand. The sleeve of his robe turned into an iron sleeve and collided with at the tip of Ye Fei’s spear.","Bang!","The spear trembled violently, and the terrifying power boiled. With the collision of the two sides as the center, it spread out in all directions and killed hundreds of soldiers. Although they were already quite a distance away, the aftershock of the battle between the two sides only took an instant to reach them.","They simply couldn’t leave. Millions of soldiers surrounded this place. Their goal was to trap and kill Chu Yunfan. Even if they suffered heavy casualties, they would never let him go.","The front line was the imperial guards. Even if they fought to the last man, they would not surrender. This was an iron army—an army with a true iron will.","The group of people that Chu Yunfan had encountered before was the same. Even if there was only one person left in the battle, not a single person fled.","Thud, thud, thud.","“River Sunset Slash!”","Taking advantage of this opportunity, Chu Yunfan’s other hand grabbed at the void and pulled out a ball of thunder. In an instant, this thunder ball turned into a long sword. The sword light boiled in mid-air and expanded in the wind. In just a moment, it had already grown to hundreds of feet long and ruthlessly slashed down toward the Great Energy Force Array.","Boom!","The sword came down. The thirty-six array masters could not hold out any longer. They had relied on the array to forcefully endure the previous series of attacks. However, the strength of their bodies could not be compared to Chu Yunfan’s. The same force could not even hurt a single hair on his body or even make him frown.","However, for them, it might be something that required a huge amount of divine power to suppress. This series of attacks was continuous, like waves of tsunamis sweeping over. And now, it was the last straw that broke the camel’s back. All of their perseverance finally collapsed at this moment.","The person with the weakest cultivation was the first to be unable to uphold the array, he spat out a mouthful of blood and stumbled out of formation. Although there was someone to replace him immediately, the power of this Great Energy Force Array immediately dropped by a level due to the lack of one person.","Chu Yunfan was in an unprecedented calm state. His entire brain was like a supercomputer with precise calculations. All the fighters fell into his eyes. How could he miss such an opportunity?","In teh blink of an eye, another sword slashed down.","“River Sunset Slash!”","Boom!","Another terrifying sword light descended, and the entire array formation suddenly trembled. This time, it was not just one, but more than twenty fledgling Void Cores with the weakest cultivation were sent flying. These masters spat out blood and flew backward. All of this happened in an instant. They did not even have time to react before they were defeated by Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s third River Sunset Slash had already landed and swept across the array.","Boom!","This time, the remaining dozen or so fledgling Void Cores could no longer withstand the attack. They all spat out blood and retreated. They were unable to block the attack.","The entire thirty-six Great Energy Force Array shattered like glass. It exploded in mid-air and could not be maintained.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan raised his arm high up, and countless sword lights gathered in his hand. Ye Fei, who was beside him, finally reacted and hurriedly roared, “No!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Chu Yunfan’s sword light slashed down. It turned into thirty-six sword lights in the air and slashed at the thirty-six Cores."]},{"number":1403,"title":"Chapter 1403 Heavy Casualties, Unable to Escape","paragraphs":["1403 Heavy Casualties, Unable to Escape","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","In the sky, the sword light divided into thirty-six shocking long arcs that directly slashed at the thirty-six figures, instantly killing them.","After the thirty-six Void Cores broke away from the protection of the array, they could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan. His strength had clearly exceeded the limits of their imagination.","“Nooooo!”","On the battlefield, Ye Fei let out an angry roar. He watched helplessly as all the Cores died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. The anger in his heart erupted.","He was simply furious!","At the same time, he felt a chill in his heart. He had made such careful arrangements and had such a strong lineup, but in the end, he still couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan. He had killed thirty-six Cores in one go.","The loss was unimaginable!","Chu Yunfan had killed more than one or two experts in Great Wei. When Ye Fei thought of this, the fire in his heart completely exploded!","Boom!","The spear in his hand stabbed out. In the blink of an eye, dozens of spear shadows were stabbed out and exploded in mid-air. As far as everyone’s eyes could see, the spear lights caused a large area of the air to collapse, forming a raging tide that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Rumble!","The spear’s radiance instantly covered Chu Yunfan, and the terrifying tide it set off drowned everything.","“Did that work?” someone exclaimed.","The two camps had completely different moods when they saw this scene. The Imperial Army was naturally very excited. They were shocked that Chu Yunfan had suppressed them and now, the situation had finally turned around.","As for Wei Wuya’s side, they looked at each other with panic on their faces. They were like frightened rabbits. The slightest movement could make them panic.","Suddenly, a huge hand reached out from the violent energy wave, sweeping toward Wei Wuya like a pair of wings.","“Sh*t!”","Ye Fei immediately hurriedly retreated, feeling a terrifying pressure sweeping over. Behind him, he condensed and absorbed the battle energy of the million soldiers, turning them into a terrifying tide that rushed into the sky. He was using a secret technique to borrow the battle energy of the million strong army. Then, he thrust out his spear again and collided with the giant hand.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan stomped down with his foot.","Boom!","The air exploded under his foot as if the sky was crushing down.","“Again!”","Ye Fei refused to admit defeat. He burned all his divine power and swept out with his spear, colliding with Chu Yunfan’s foot.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","A series of explosions sounded out like thunder within the army. The battle between them raged among the million strong army. Even the army did not dare to attack anymore because Ye Fei might also be injured by their indiscriminate attacks.","To Chu Yunfan, these attacks did not matter at all and could not hurt him. However, for Ye Fei, it was impossible for him to ignore these attacks like Chu Yunfan, so they could only give up the plan to encircle Chu Yunfan.","In this battle, they had completely become spectators and had no way to interfere.","On the contrary, the aftermath of the battle between the two swept everyone off their feet. They couldn’t dodge, and no matter how fast they were, they couldn’t be faster than Chu Yunfan.","The army of one million soldiers was so frightened that they were thrown off their horses. Only the 100 thousand soldiers of the Imperial Army were the elites of the elites, and they dared to fight to the last person without batting an eyelid. Although the other soldiers were also quite elite, they could not face death without changing their expressions.","The entire army was so frightened that they were thrown off their horses. It could be said that wherever Chu Yunfan and Ye Fei fought, the army would be thrown off their horses. It was as if the entire place where the army was stationed had become their personal battlefield. They had no way to resist or even escape because they were surrounded by their own people. There was no space for them to escape.","The battle continued to intensify and escalate.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was unparalleled. He was like a demon god. He either punched out, stomped down, or slashed down with his sword. There was no time for repetition. Just like that, he beat Ye Fei until he could not attack and could only forcefully resist.","And Ye Fei was not an ordinary person. Although his cultivation was no match for Chu Yunfan’s, with the help of the battle energy of millions of troops, he could contend with Chu Yunfan without falling into a disadvantage.","The battle between the two sides spread from the ground all the way to the sky. Ye Fei deliberately lured Chu Yunfan away. The battle between the two sides caused greater losses, but Chu Yunfan did not care as his real target was Ye Fei.","“Go! Destroy the rebels!”","While Chu Yunfan was being lured away, millions of soldiers charged forward like a tsunami.","“Pass on my orders. Hold on until Master Chu returns. Only then will we have hope. Otherwise, everyone will die!” Wei Wuya roared.","The soldiers on Wei Wuya’s side gripped their weapons tightly. They knew that they could only win if they persisted until the end. And their hope of victory was Chu Yunfan—the man who could kill a million enemies in an army.","Boom!","The two sides collided like two terrifying tsunamis. Bloody waves surged out. The collision of more than one million people was extremely terrifying. The battle energy and all kinds of killing intent rushed into the sky and tore the clouds apart.","The Imperial Army was not only larger in number, but also more elite. Their sweeping momentum was even more astonishing. In contrast, the rebel army gritted their teeth. The fact that Chu Yunfan had killed thirty-six Cores in a row had undoubtedly encouraged them, and it had also given them hope of success.","‘Persevere to the end, and there will be hope!’"]},{"number":1404,"title":"Chapter 1404 The Battle Erupts","paragraphs":["1404 The Battle Erupts","A bloody and cruel battle instantly erupted.","This was a cruel civil war. On a battlefield like this, even Divine would instantly die if they were locked onto by thousands of arrows. Only Cores could barely survive.","However, there was no such experts, because Chu Yunfan had already slaughtered the Cores that both sides had sent out. Now, on the battlefield, the most powerful players were Divines.","Although these Divine were terrifying, they were far inferior to Cores. On the battlefield, Chu Hongcai fought his way through and casually killed dozens of soldiers from the Imperial Army. However, more soldiers flew toward him.","This was the first time he truly understood what the battlefield looked like. It was completely different from what he had imagined. It was more bloody and terrifying.","“Persevere! Persevere until the end and we will win!” Chu Hongcai roared and stabbed several Imperial Court soldiers to death with the spear in his hand.","However, his active performance attracted the Divines of the Imperial Army. These Divines were specifically seeking out the experts of the rebel army, and their numbers were far more than Chu Hongcai and the others.","Chu Hongcai and the others held on with their last breath. Every minute and second felt like a year, and every minute felt like a century had passed. There was only one thought left in their minds: Kill, kill, kill!","In the sky, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Ye Fei was progressing intensely. Ye Fei deliberately lured Chu Yunfan away so that the Imperial Army could smoothly quell the rebellion.","“Chu Yunfan, your rebellion will not succeed today. All of you will die!” Ye Fei roared.","“Really?” Chu Yunfan laughed loudly. “I know you want to distract me so that your army can destroy ours, but have you ever thought about how much battle energy you can borrow after you’re far away from the army?”","Chu Yunfan didn’t care. At this moment, they were already high in the sky. From afar, they could only see black spots on the ground. One could imagine how far away they were. At such a far place, Ye Fei’s battle energy was already very weak.","In essence, the battle energy in these battle formations came from the army of 1 million soldiers. After pulling far away from the army, Ye Fei could borrow much less battle energy. Although Chu Yunfan was not afraid of an expert who could continuously borrow battle energy, he felt that it was very troublesome. Now that Ye Fei had lured him away, in reality, it was actually a good thing for him.","‘Oh no!’ Ye Fei suddenly thought of this point and hurriedly flew down.","“It’s a little too late to think of that now!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","He had been waiting for this opportunity for too long. One battle was enough to decide the outcome. His eyes were incomparably indifferent. At the same time, a long sword appeared in his hand. The sword light tore through the sky and slashed down like a long river.","Boom!","This was the River Sunset Slash. The sword light struck Ye Fei head-on.","Ye Fei could not react in time and could only barely resist.","Bam!","The sword light hit him, and the armor on his body shattered. Although most of the power had been absorbed by his armor, the remaining power still caused him to be heavily injured.","Spurt!","He immediately realized that he had lost. It could be said that he had been defeated. He couldn’t find any excuse to cover it up, because he had indeed failed. Moreover, he was defeated by Chu Yunfan with absolute strength without any tricks.","He kept retreating, but strangely, Chu Yunfan didn’t chase after him. When he looked over, he saw Chu Yunfan taking a step forward and instantly rushing in front of him.","“Ye Fei, surrender. If you surrender, you will retain your position as the Great General of the kingdom. After all, this is not a change of dynasty. It’s just an internal struggle of the imperial family,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","He originally wanted to kill Ye Fei, but he suddenly changed his mind. Ye Fei had a huge influence in Great Wei. Not only was he powerful and the second strongest expert in the world, but it was also because his students and subordinates were all over the army. If he could subdue Ye Fei, he could quickly stabilize the court.","This was undoubtedly very important to Great Wei.","“You want me to surrender? Chu Yunfan, stop dreaming. Don’t underestimate me too much. I’m the current Great General, and you want me to surrender to the rebels? In your dreams.”","Ye Fei let out an angry roar. Only now did he truly display the strength of a soldier. Even if he was on the verge of death, he had no intention of surrendering.","“What do you think made me the Great General? I was originally a child of a poor family. It was the current emperor who promoted me to a humble position. It was because of His Majesty’s appreciation that I had the opportunity to stand out. Now, I have the power to control the army of the world. I’ll never be able to repay His Majesty’s kindness in my entire life,” Ye Fei sneered. “Do you think it’s possible for me to surrender?","“Chu Yunfan, even if I die, I won’t surrender. You have to die with me!”","Ye Fei roared, and the divine power in his whole body burned up. The aura that was slowly declining boiled up. He used a secret technique that could burn his own divine power and make his divine power soar in a short period.","“I thought I would never have the chance to use this move. I didn’t expect this day to come where I would have to use it.","“Heaven and Earth Unification!”","Ye Fei roared, and his entire body turned into a white tiger that pounced toward Chu Yunfan with the momentum of Mount Tai.","But just as he moved, he realized that a long sword had appeared in his chest and pierced through it."]},{"number":1405,"title":"Chapter 1405 A Satisfying Victory","paragraphs":["1405 A Satisfying Victory","Ye Fei’s eyes widened. The divine power that he had just gathered in his body instantly dissipated. He could even feel his life force rapidly leaving his body.","He couldn’t believe it. He had just used his final attack to take Chu Yunfan away and kill this monster who would affect the entire Great Wei. Who knew that he would be killed by Chu Yunfan in an instant?!","He didn’t even see how Chu Yunfan appeared before he was stabbed in the heart by Chu Yunfan’s sword. All his strength was being drained away. Scenes from the past flashed past his eyes. He was once a nameless soldier among the countless soldiers of Great Wei. Later on, he relied on his outstanding talent to rise continuously in the army. Then, he was valued by a prince of that time and became his spokesperson in the army.","After the current emperor succeeded to the throne, Ye Fei became a great general who shook the world. In this life, he had lived in poverty and also lived in glory as he was below one person and above tens of thousands of people.","He no longer had any regrets!","He didn’t even see how Chu Yunfan appeared before he was stabbed in the heart by Chu Yunfan’s sword. All his strength was being drained away. Scenes from the past flashed past his eyes. He was once a nameless soldier among the countless soldiers of Great Wei. Later on, he relied on his outstanding talent to rise continuously in the army. Then, he was valued by a prince of that time and became his spokesperson in the army.","After the current emperor succeeded to the throne, Ye Fei became a great general who shook the world. In this life, he had lived in poverty and also lived in glory as he was below one person and above tens of thousands of people.","He no longer had any regrets.","‘Your Majesty... I’m sorry. I’ll shall be stepping down first...’ Ye Fei’s thoughts slowly drifted and finally disappeared.","Chu Yunfan sighed. To him, the best ending was for Ye Fei to surrender and help him quickly stabilize the government of Great Wei. However, to Ye Fei, dying on the battlefield was undoubtedly the best ending.","Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything. He put Ye Fei’s corpse into the Mountain River Diagram, turned it into a bloody mist, and watered the Brahma Tree.","At this time, the rebel army had entered an extremely dangerous stage. The morale that Chu Yunfan had forcefully boosted had already been used up. Morale could not last forever, and they were being killed in large numbers. The 100 thousand Imperial Army soldiers had led the charge, launching a frenzied slaughter. This motley crew of soldiers could not withstand a single blow from this army of more than a million.","Gradually, all the battle lines were defeated.","Wei Wuya, who was in the middle of the army, didn’t think about this at all because he had fallen into a trap. A few peak Divines from the Imperial Court had joined forces to charge into the middle of the army. Although the thousands of elites they had brought with them had all died in battle, they had miraculously killed their way into the middle of the army.","Wei Wuya was undoubtedly in the greatest danger of his life. In just a few moves, he was beaten back step by step. If this continued, he would be dead in a few more moves.","“Why isn’t Master Chu here yet?”","Wei Wuya was sent flying, spitting out a mouthful of blood. His head was spinning from the blow, and the generals of the Imperial Court didn’t let this opportunity slip by, immediately chasing after him.","Wei Wuya couldn’t sense any chance of victory, and his face couldn’t help but turn pale.","At this moment, several arrows shot through the air, instantly nailing the generals who had been pursuing Wei Wuya to the ground. These few were already powerful existences at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. It would not be easy for even an ordinary Core to kill them. However, such terrifying existences were nailed to the ground. Half of their bodies were blown up, and they died an extremely miserable death.","“We’re saved!”","Wei Wuya heaved a sigh of relief. At this moment, he looked up at the sky in surprise and joy, only to see a figure dressed in black robes floating above the army. The figure held a thunder bow in his hand, and those arrows had been shot by him.","“Master Chu!” Wei Wuya called out in delight, his entire body trembling. He didn’t even care about the soldiers who had rushed over to reinforce him. His personal guards had just been slaughtered by the generals of the Imperial Court.","He knew that Chu Yunfan’s appearance here meant that the battle between him and Ye Fei had been decided. As for who won and who lost, it was very clear.","Thinking of this, Wei Wuya couldn’t control himself. Ever since he took the risk to save the Chu clan, he had been living in fear and trepidation. For a rebellion, he would either win or die. There was no other possibility. The possibility of him winning was very small. Now that Chu Yunfan had won, he would also win.","He actually won!","Although the fierce battle raged on, he knew that even if the Imperial Court had a million soldiers, they would not be able to turn the situation around.","After shooting a few consecutive arrows to save Wei Wuya, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He immediately looked at the other side of the battlefield, and the thunder bow in his hand kept shooting arrows.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","Every arrow did not miss. This was the most terrifying part. Every arrow would take away a Divine from the Imperial Army. For a moment, the experts in the rebellion felt relieved.","Chu Hongcai, who was facing the simultaneous attacks of several experts, had been forced into a desperate situation. This was a situation that he had never faced in all his previous battles. Although he had fought in the past, they were just sparring. The subsequent battles were basically smooth sailing. There was no danger at all.","Later on, with Chu Yunfan’s help, he easily reached the Divine Abilities Stage. But unlike Chu Yunfan, who had experienced countless near-death battles, Chu Hongcai had never experienced such a battle.","His first battle was such a terrifying one. To him, it was undoubtedly already stretched to the limit. He was relying on his breath to support himself. However, when faced with the experts of the Imperial Army who were far stronger than him and far more numerous than him, he was simply unable to resist.","After a bloody battle, he was forced into a corner. He had gained a lot from this battle, but he had no time to think about it in the middle of the battle. Suddenly, just as he felt that he could not hold out any longer, a few arrows pierced through the air. The opponents that he could not resist were nailed to the ground.","“Brother Fan?”","Chu Hongcai immediately looked up at the sky. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","He heaved a sigh of relief. Chu Yunfan had won, which meant that they had won. In a situation where their strength was completely inferior, Chu Yunfan was their only hope.","Such a situation happened everywhere. Soon, the entire battlefield was in an uproar.","Chu Yunfan had won, and they would also win!"]},{"number":1406,"title":"Chapter 1406 Another Nuclear Bomb Was Revealed, and the Whole Line Collapses","paragraphs":["1406 Another Nuclear Bomb Was Revealed, and the Whole Line Collapses","The news of Chu Yunfan’s victory quickly spread throughout the entire battlefield. In fact, there was no need to say anything because Chu Yunfan was flying in the sky. Between him and Ye Fei, it was clear who had won and who had lost.","Ye Fei was beaten up by Chu Yunfan!","In a short time, everyone knew about this, especially the scouts from the various factions outside the battlefield. They knew what had happened. Compared to the millions of soldiers fighting each other in the battlefield, who did not have the time to pay attention to the battle of life and death above, they could see it all too clearly.","They even saw Chu Yunfan kill Ye Fei.","Andl Ye Fei had no strength to fight back at all. Previously, he could barely contend with Chu Yunfan by relying on the battle energy of the million strong army. But without the support of battle energy, he was no match for Chu Yunfan. He was killed by Chu Yunfan in a few moves.","In an instant, the morale of the rebel army side soared. Chu Yunfan had won, which meant that Chu Yunfan had his hands free to help them.","On the other hand, the morale of the Imperial Army plummeted. Furthermore, as Chu Yunfan killed all the Divine generals on the spot, they did not even have a single person who could command them. The million-strong army was in chaos, fighting on their own.","There was no way for them to unleash their full strength.","At this time, Chu Yunfan took out a small missile launcher with a nuclear bomb already at the ready.","Boom!","A nuclear bomb once again appeared in this world with a long tail of flames.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of terrifying explosions instantly erupted, and a huge mushroom cloud exploded behind the Imperial Army. Terrifying flames engulfed everything in the blink of an eye. Everything within the attack range was instantly devoured.","What was even more terrifying was that the explosion was ten times more terrifying than the aftermath of Chu Yunfan and Ye Fei’s battle. In an instant, more than 100 thousand Imperial Court soldiers were either vaporized or killed by the aftershocks. There was no exception.","Whether it was a Divine general, an Innate soldier, or an ordinary Acquire warrior, they all met the same fate in front of the nuclear bomb.","With just one, more than 100 thousand soldiers disappeared.","Because they were too close to each other, they were densely packed. This allowed the nuclear bomb, a weapon of mass destruction, to unleash 200% of its power. Originally, they had gathered together to increase the power of their charge, but now they had become living targets. The ground of the battlefield shook violently like an earth dragon turning over.","Everyone was dumbfounded. At this moment, it was as if the entire world had fallen silent. The scouts were dumbfounded. They had only heard of such a weapon before, but they had never seen it. From the bottom of their heart, they were unwilling to believe that such a terrifying weapon existed.","This was no longer a massacre. This was evaporating! Yes, it was evaporating in an instant, turning into nothingness!","No matter what kind of existence it was, in front of this terrifying power, it was incomparably small as if it was the roar of nature.","“Wh-What the hell is this?!”","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s hidden trump card? Why didn’t he use it before? Why did he only use it now?”","“Because he’s confident that he can defeat Ye Fei. He wants to defeat Ye Fei in front of everyone and establish his invincible power.”","“What a cunning man. He calculated everything. He’s absolutely terrifying!”","In an instant, the scouts were in an uproar. The war had completely exceeded their expectations. Whether it was the situation, the scale, or the outcome, it was far beyond their expectations. Without a doubt, even they knew that the outcome of this battle had already been decided. Chu Yunfan was the undisputed winner. Those people could not stop him at all.","“The Imperial Court has failed. It’s over!”","“That’s right, the Imperial Court is about to change. Even if you beat me to death, I wouldn’t have believed that the combination of Wei Wuya and Chu Yunfan would actually win.”","“After this battle, the Imperial Court no longer has the strength to contend against Wei Wuya.”","Everyone realized that Great Wei was about to change. At the same time, they chose to pass on the results of this battle to their respective masters as that was what the various large factions had sent them here for. The outcome of this battle would determine the situation of Great Wei in the next few decades. Those who did not participate in this battle needed to know the final outcome.","If the Imperial Court won, then everyone would be happy. They would not have any changes. However, if Chu Yunfan and Wei Wuya won, the entire world would be shaken and a new reshuffle would be ushered in.","On the battlefield, the reactions of the armies on both sides were much more direct. The morale of Wei Wuya’s troops immediately soared, and they managed to block the Imperial Court’s attack without being forced back.","On the other side, the morale of the Imperial Army was plummeting. Even the extremely determined imperial guards were fleeing. At this moment, Ye Fei was already dead, and Chu Yunfan has also killed the Divine generals in their army. Those thirty-six Core array experts had also been killed.","They no longer had a leader. Everyone was fighting for themselves. They didn’t know what the overall situation was like. Their morale plummeted, not to mention Chu Yunfan’s nuclear bomb. It was as dazzling as the sun. It was difficult for these people not to see it.","Although only 100 thousand people had been killed by the nuclear bomb, the terrifying chain reaction had just begun. The soldiers understood that it was not just the experts in the army, but even they would not be able to escape death. A nuclear bomb could kill 100 thousand soldiers. The million-strong army here seemed to be a lot, but in reality, they couldn’t withstand a few explosions. Even the imperial guards were terrified.","This was an unprecedented method of war. It was not even a massacre like in the past. They were completely vaporized in an instant.","This method instantly destroyed all their psychological defenses, making them unable to raise their fighting spirit."]},{"number":1407,"title":"Chapter 1407 The Great Wei Kingdom’s Change","paragraphs":["1407 The Great Wei Kingdom’s Change","This method of war was beyond their imagination. All their efforts were meaningless in the face of a nuclear bomb. Martial arts were not completely helpless against nuclear bombs. This was evident in the Infinite Demon Mountain that the Federation targeted.","However, the people of this world had never seen such technological means before. For a moment, they did not know how to defend themselves. It even exceeded the limits of their imagination.","“Great General Ye Fei is dead! Those who surrender will be spared death. Those who don’t will have the same ending as him!”","Just as the Imperial Army was dumbfounded, Chu Yunfan’s voice appeared at the right time.","The Imperial Army, which had been determined, finally could not hold out any longer. Other than a small number of elites who were stubbornly resisting, the army that had been fighting had collectively lost the will to fight. The sight of an army of a million soldiers being disarmed was incomparably shocking and spectacular.","“We won! We won!”","It was unknown who shouted, but the rebel army was completely shaken. Everyone cheered, and the entire battlefield became a sea of joy.","It had not been easy to win this battle. Although the two sides hadn’t truly fought for very long, the Imperial Army was far more powerful than theirs. In just a short time, more than 50 thousand people had died at the hands of the Imperial Army.","This was a terrifying matter. The difference in combat strength between the two sides could be imagined.","It could even be said that in front of the Imperial Army, which had the complete advantage in strength and numbers, if Chu Yunfan had not turned the tide at the end, the Imperial Army would not have needed much time to kill them.","It could be said that they were doing their best to fight for that sliver of possibility. Even though they knew that the possibility of this was too small, it was this extremely small possibility that allowed them to persist until the end.","And now, they had finally won. Their persistence had not been in vain. From today onwards, they were no longer rebels of the Imperial Court, but a true army of the Imperial Court.","Although the regime in the far away capital had not been overthrown, everyone knew that it would happen sooner or later.","Everyone cheered, but Wei Wuya and the other generals were still very clear-headed. They knew that it was still too early to celebrate, so they hurriedly organized their troops to accept the surrender.","There were many things involved in the surrender of nearly a million people. It was enough for them to be so busy that their feet did not touch the ground.","High up in the sky, Chu Yunfan nodded with satisfaction. This was exactly what he wanted to see. The reason why he chose to kill the Cores like Ye Fei first instead of using nuclear bombs was for this moment. To capture the bandits, they had to first capture the leader. They had to kill Ye Fei and the others first, then kill those ordinary Divine generals, crippling their ability to command. Finally, they would use a nuclear bomb to force down the Imperial army.","If it was the other way around, the Imperial Army would be much more patient when they were organized. He would only be able to force the Imperial Army to land if he slaughtered more than half of these people. This was something he was unwilling to do. After all, it would hurt the vitality of Great Wei. Since there was a better way, there was no need to do it.","While Wei Wuya and the others were still in a daze over the surrender, the news of the rebel army defeating the Imperial Army in the Battle of Conglong spread throughout all of Great Wei overnight. All of the factions were dumbfounded. The eighteenth prince had managed to pull off such an impossible feat!","The strength of both sides was not on the same level in any way. The only thing that could be considered balanced was probably Chu Yunfan’s cutting-edge strength. However, in this kind of confrontation between millions of troops, even a Void Core could not change the situation.","No one expected that Chu Yunfan would manage to turn the situation around. After Chu Yunfan killed Ye Fei, he forced the million strong army to surrender.","And that demonic weapon once again became the topic of discussion in the clamor. After slaughtering the Great Formless Sect, the nuclear bomb once again showed its might. This time, the result of its might was that it forced down nearly a million troops, instantly reversing the situation of both sides.","Everyone realized that with the victory of this crucial battle, Wei Wuya’s campaign to purge the Imperial Court had become a success. The Imperial Court no longer had the strength to suppress the rebellion. Of course, Great Wei did not only have a million troops. However, other than these million elites, most of them were local garrison troops. Although there were many of them, they were useless. Moreover, they could not be gathered in a short period.","If the original strategic initiative was with the Imperial Court, then the current strategic initiative was in Wei Wuya’s and Chu Yunfan’s hands. The Imperial Capital was like a ripe fruit, and they could attack whenever they wanted. Everything was up to them.","The skies of Great Wei was about to change. The Imperial Court was about to fall, while Wei Wuya had become the rising sun.","All the major forces were well-informed, and they quickly heard that the emperor had killed more than ten palace maids and eunuchs in the Imperial Capital. However, it was useless. The million strong army had been forced to surrender, and the Imperial Court had lost its main fighting force. Moreover, the death of those Divine and Core generals, as well as Great General Ye Fei, had made the Imperial Court unable to find anyone to lead the army.","The situation was now leaning toward Wei Wuya and Chu Yunfan’s favor. After this battle, there was a fundamental change in the hearts of the people. Overnight, the various major powers sent representatives to meet Wei Wuya and express their support for him. Some of the more explicit ones even urged Wei Wuya to ascend the throne as soon as possible.","Fortunately, Wei Wuya wasn’t that stupid. He knew that it wasn’t the right time to ascend the throne. The most important thing was to seize the Imperial Capital and become the rightful emperor of Great Wei.","With the support of the various major powers, Wei Wuya’s side had enough civil officials to manage the various regions. The initially restless cities of the south became well-behaved, no longer daring to disobey. The various factions that had been watching from the sidelines sent their descendants to join the army to clear the Imperial Court. The originally insufficient number of officers was also filled up in an instant.","It could be said that the situation was unprecedentedly good."]},{"number":1408,"title":"Chapter 1408 The Soaring Power","paragraphs":["1408 The Soaring Power","At Conglong, in the back garden of the Marquis Zhongxin residence. Chu Yunfan sat on the stone bench and sipped on cups of tea. His face revealed a peaceful expression.","He had already unleashed all his potential. Although he seemed to be invincible and looked a majestic sight in the battle against Ye Fei, easily killing him and the thirty-six other Cores, he had to perform at his very best and had gained many insights.","Before long, he would be able to gather all the divine power in his body into his meridian and turn it into a Void Core. The Great golden core Path was right in front of him. Although he was still far from the golden core, he had to eat one bite at a time and build his foundation piece by piece, so he was not in a hurry. When his cultivation entered the Void Core Stage, there was no doubt that his combat strength would completely surpass the Void Core Stage and reach another level.","Suddenly, the sound of hurried footsteps could be heard as a figure appeared in front of him. It was none other than Wei Wuya.","The prince’s face was filled with fatigue and excitement. He hadn’t rested for the past few days and nights. As a higher-up, he had too many things to arrange: the reward for the 300 thousand rebel soldiers, the rewards and treatment of the dead and wounded, and the treatment and reorganization of the million captives. After all, he could not leave this million soldiers alone. To find a place to imprison them was impossible, so the best method was to integrate them into his own army.","This was very difficult in itself. He had to disrupt the original organization and insert his own people. He also had to prevent the million strong army from exploding and rebelling. Apart from that, he had to meet and appease the loyalists from the various factions one by one.","Originally, Wei Wuya was worried that no one was willing to join him. Other than the Chu clan, who was tied to the chariot, the other forces were all watching. No one stood up to support him.","However, his problem now was that he had too many factions wanting to join him, and he could not appease them at all. In the end, he could only meet them one by one instead of meeting them in groups.","Wei Wuya had been busy for a few days and nights before he was finally finished. He had to deal with every single one of these matters personally. Even though he was at the upper stage of the Divine Abilities Stage, he was exhausted.","However, even though he was exhausted, he felt extremely excited at this moment. He had never felt this way before. Everyone had to kneel at his feet and let him make the decisions. This was the taste of power.","It was like the sweetest poison that could make people addicted.","Fortunately, Wei Wuya had not lost his mind. He knew who was the one who had really established everything—Chu Yunfan.","“I’m finally done with my work. I haven’t had the time to visit you for the past few days. I hope you will forgive me, Master Chu.” Wei Wuya clasped his hands in greeting and sat opposite of Chu Yunfan.","After not seeing Wei Wuya for a few days, he now had the bearing of a true king. However, this was to be expected. The so-called bearing and aura could only be nurtured after being in a high position for a long time, not born. Although he was originally a prince, he was a prince who was not favored. It was impossible for him to cultivate the demeanor of a king in a high position.","“It’s fine. I haven’t congratulated you yet, Your Highness.” Chu Yunfan didn’t mind and just smiled.","At this point, Wei Wuya couldn’t help but smile too. Although he didn’t accept some people’s suggestion to immediately ascend the throne, in order to make himself seem legitimate, he self-proclaimed himself as regent.","He then became the rightful regent, completely different from his previous identity.","However, Wei Wuya could be arrogant in front of others, but he did not dare to show off in front of Chu Yunfan. He knew that all of this was built on Chu Yunfan’s persistence. If Chu Yunfan said that he did not support him, his current power would collapse on the spot. After all, he had to rely on Chu Yunfan to force the million strong army to surrender and obtain the support of countless forces.","“Master Chu, you must be joking. All of this is because of you. I would never forget it,” Wei Wuya hurriedly said.","Chu Yunfan smiled but didn’t say anything. Wei Wuya then said, “I’ve already issued a decree to confer Marquis Zhongxin the title of Duke Zhongxin, a first-class duke. Once the great cause of purging the court is completed, I will confer the new Marquis Zhongxin the title of ‘King Chu.’ What do you think, Master Chu?”","As Wei Wuya spoke, he carefully glanced at Chu Yunfan. He knew that Chu Yunfan wasn’t interested in these things, but he should be satisfied with the title of the Chu clan.","As expected, Chu Yunfan nodded with a smile and said, “Then I’ll thank Your Highness on behalf of the residence.”","Although he wasn’t interested in these things, the matriarch would be very pleased to hear this news. It could also be considered as repaying the Chu clan for taking him in.","“What are you talking about? This is the reward for being courageous,” Wei Wuya hurriedly said, “If it weren’t for the help of Marquis Zhongxin, I would be even busier!”","Wei Wuya couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air as he thought of so many things. Fortunately, with the full help of the Chu clan, he barely managed to settle the matter in a few days.","“Now that we have defeated the Imperial Army, we should be able to march into the Imperial Capital,” Wei Wuya said.","Right now, his position as regent was self-proclaimed and didn’t count. Only when he invaded the capital and became the legitimate ruler of Great Wei would everything count. Now that he had finally managed to reorganize the million strong army, he could not wait to invade the Imperial Capital and change the dynasty.","He now understood why Chu Yunfan had said that no matter what the problem was, as long as he won, it could be completely covered up. Chu Yunfan didn’t even bother to deal with the problems he had in the past. After winning this battle, all the problems were solved.","All problems were nothing in front of a super victory. By the time he took down the Imperial Capital, the problems he faced now were nothing.","“Indeed,” Chu Yunfan said as he nodded, ” This is a good opportunity. If this drags on, the Imperial Court will continue to recruit troops from all over the country. It will only prolong the war and damage the entire country.””","“That is as well, but I’m afraid that Yun Huang’s Monster Subduer Sect might make a move now.” Wei Wuya’s face was filled with worry.","Yun Huang’s reputation was not something that Ye Fei could compare to. In fact, Yu Huang was already a world-renowned top expert even before Ye Fei debuted. Though Chu Yunfan displayed shocking strength, it did not give Wei Wuya the slightest sense of security."]},{"number":1409,"title":"Chapter 1409 The Final Battle","paragraphs":["1409 The Final Battle","Chu Yunfan had killed four of Great Wei’s five great experts in one go. Such a record shocked the entire country. This turned Chu Yunfan from a potential future expert into a true invincible expert.","However, among the five great experts of Great Wei, only the number one, Yun Huang, was completely different. Among the five great experts of the previous generation, Yun Huang was already firmly ranked first. To many people, they grew up hearing about Yun Huang. Among the five great experts of the previous generation, Yun Huang was already ranked first. After the five great experts changed, he was still firmly in the first place. During this process, it was not that no one had challenged him, but it was useless because they all failed.","In the beginning, there were still experts who could match him, but toward the end, there was not even a decent opponent. Unlike outsiders like Chu Yunfan, who did not care much about Yun Huang, Wei Wuya was different. He was afraid of Yun Huang from the bottom of his heart. He wasn’t the emperor, so he didn’t have many cards up his sleeve. He only had Chu Yunfan.","If Chu Yunfan was defeated, at worst, he could just run away. The court of Great Wei could not do anything to Chu Yunfan, but he was different. If Chu Yunfan was defeated, his current high and mighty might would collapse.","He had no choice but to believe in Chu Yunfan. However, he did not believe that Chu Yunfan could defeat Yun Huang like he was chopping vegetables.","“He won’t make a move. If he wanted to make a move, he would have done so long ago.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","The number one expert in the world, the Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang, was naturally a big focus of his attention. He even knew some of the differences between Yun Huang and others. However, since Yun Huang did not make a move earlier, it was likely that he would not stop Chu Yunfan later because that would be meaningless.","Unlike Ye Fei and the First Guardian, Yun Huang had always been obedient. They suppressed the monsters in the western mountains all year round, preventing them from entering Great Wei on a large scale to cause trouble. Therefore, he probably wouldn’t choose to risk his life for Great Wei’s Imperial Court. That would be meaningless. This was also the reason why Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief.","If Yun Huang attacked, it would have undoubtedly put a huge pressure on Chu Yunfan. Although he was not afraid, it was almost impossible for the rebels to win this battle so unscathed.","“But it doesn’t matter. Even if he attacks later, it’s useless because it’s already too late,” Chu Yunfan said, “In fact, I do want to fight him. He’s the number one person in the world.”","“Master Chu, don’t be rash!”","Wei Wuya almost jumped in fright at Chu Yunfan’s thought. No matter what, he did not wish for Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang to have a huge battle before the world was settled. It would be great if Chu Yunfan won. If Chu Yunfan became the number one person in the world, the Imperial Capital would surrender without a fight. However, if Chu Yunfan was defeated, everything would be gone.","This was a situation that Wei Wuya absolutely did not want to see!","“Don’t worry. If he doesn’t come to find me, I won’t go to him for the time being.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","“That’s good, that’s good!” Wei Wuya patted his chest. “In that case, I’ll go down and make the arrangements. As the saying goes, a long delay will bring about many dreams. Why don’t we just mobilize our troops to the Imperial Capital tomorrow to clear out the emperor’s side?”","“Okay!” Chu Yunfan nodded.","This battle had to be resolved sooner or later, and it was better to resolve it as soon as possible. Anyway, with him guarding the front, there was no need to worry about any accidents. By now, the Imperial Court should have exhausted all their tricks. The millions of troops being forced to surrender was enough to make the Imperial Court panic. This was the best time to take advantage of weaknesses and take lives.","The next day, at dawn, the rebel army, which had just undergone a certain degree of repair, began to set off toward the Imperial Capital. However, unlike the previous 300 thousand soldiers, who were mostly just a motley crew that could only scare people, the current rebel army had a total of over a million people, and almost all of them were elites. Among them, there were even 100 thousand Imperial Guards, the elites of the elites.","The movement of a million troops could not be hidden from others, and the rebel army did not plan to hide from others. Under the eyes of the scouts of the various large factions, the army set off.","And this news spread throughout the entire Great Wei within a day.","Everyone knew that this was only a matter of time. After all, after Chu Yunfan had single-handedly turned the tide of the battle, the Imperial Army had been reduced to ashes. It was only a matter of time before the Imperial Army marched into the capital.","Great Wei was about to change.","The entire Imperial Court had lost its prestige. Everyone could see that whether it was in terms of strength or the support of the people, the scales had begun to tilt toward the side that was clearing out the Imperial Army.","There were even cases where the Imperial Court was unable to mobilize the border guards. The border guards stationed in the north refused to be transferred to the mainland to quell the rebellion.","News of that battle spread throughout Great Wei over time. In terms of experts, Chu Yunfan’s existence was invincible. He had killed four of the five experts in a row. How could any other expert compete with him?","Moreover, he had nuclear bombs. How could ordinary people resist the bombardment of such a weapon? There was no chance of winning at all.","As for the local garrison troops, they heard the news on the way to the rescue of the emperor. They rolled back to the local area overnight and did not dare to send out any more troops.","The prestige of the Imperial Court had completely collapsed. At this moment, the capital of Great Wei was like a turtle in a jar, waiting for the rebel army to go north to clear them out.","For this reason, Wei Wuya promised a generous reward. After the capture of the Imperial Capital, everyone would be rewarded, and he would forgive them for their previous actions. Under such circumstances, the morale of the rebellion was high as they marched into the Imperial Capital.","In just half a month, the vanguard troops had already advanced to the vicinity of the Imperial Capital’s south gate.","The Imperial Capital was already in chaos. Although there were still 200 thousand garrison troops in the Imperial Capital, they were nothing compared to the million strong army that had come to clean up the Imperial Court.","There were countless dignitaries in the city, and those who could escape had already fled. Some of them were secretly communicating with the rebel army to execute the clean up, while others had long fled. There were those who were truly willing to stay behind and die with the Imperial Court, but they were too insignificant in front of the rebel army.","A day later, the million-strong army of the rebellion finally arrived at the Imperial Capital. The final battle was about to begin."]},{"number":1410,"title":"Chapter 1410 Three Months Later, I Will Go to the Monster Subduers","paragraphs":["1410 Three Months Later, I Will Go to the Monster Subduers","Millions of soldiers gathered in the Imperial Capital, surrounding the city.","The city walls of the huge Imperial Capital were already hundreds of feet tall. It was the tallest city wall in the entire Great Wei. There were also all kinds of defensive facilities. It could be said to be the strongest fortress in Great Wei.","But there was a fundamental problem in the Imperial City—there were not enough guards.","Most of the soldiers in the Imperial Capital had gone to the south to quell the rebellion. They were forced to surrender and returned to the Imperial Capital as part of the rebel army. This in itself was very ironic.","Suddenly, just as the army was about to attack the city, a figure flew over from afar and hovered above the main formation of the rebel army. Instantly, the entire battlefield fell silent. The 100 thousand Imperial Guards in the middle army formation were intimidated by this one man.","On the battlefield, countless people looked at him. He was a middle-aged man in his fifties. He had a medium build and a handsome face. One could vaguely see the elegance of his youth.","“That’s the number one expert in the world, the sect master of the Monster Subduers, Yun Huang!”","Someone recognized the identity of the person who had come, and everyone could not help but suck in a cold breath. They felt as if a huge rock was pressing down on their hearts. Was there going to be more waves?","Everyone knew very well that if there was someone who could stop the rebel army, it would definitely be Yun Huang. That was the number one expert in the world. If he could defeat Chu Yunfan, then this army would instantly collapse as the soul of the entire army was not Wei Wuya, but Chu Yunfan.","Once Chu Yunfan was defeated, the entire army’s spirit would crumble!","Initially, they did not encounter any obstructions before arriving at the Imperial Capital. Many people even thought that there would not be any obstructions. Yun Huang should not interfere in this matter. After all, no matter who won or lost, with his honorable status, he should not be able to advance any further. However, they only discovered now that their guess was completely wrong. This was the greatest test for the army.","Seeing Yun Huang appear, the million strong rebel army fell silent. On the contrary, the guards on the city walls cheered. This man was be their greatest hope.","“Which one of you is Chu Yunfan?” Yun Huang said slowly as he looked at the central army formation below.","Under everyone’s gaze, Chu Yunfan walked into the air step by step. The two great experts of the empire were confronting each other. One side was a top expert who had been the number one expert in the world for hundreds of years, while the other side was a terrifying existence who had turned the world upside down with his own strength. Both of them had illustrious reputations in Great Wei—terrifying existences that ordinary people could not imagine.","“Yun Huang? I’ve heard a lot about you,” Chu Yunfan said lightly and then cupped his hands in greeting.","“As expected. You’re as rebellious as the rumors say,” Yun Huang said slowly.","“I’m a person who treats people with respect. If they deserve my respect, I will naturally respect them,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Interesting. Can you guess why I came today?” The corners of Yun Huang’s mouth twitched.","“Are you here to stop us from cleaning up the court?” Chu Yunfan said.","Yun Huang shook his head and said, “I did receive a request from the emperor to get rid of you. However, I’ve never been interested in the internal affairs of the imperial family. The Monster Subduers is doing its best to suppress the monsters. Why would I care about this?”","“Then why did you come here?” asked Chu Yunfan.","“I’m not interested in the internal affairs of the imperial family. As long as it’s not an external enemy, I don’t want to interfere. But I’m interested in you. You’re strong enough to be my opponent,” Yun Huang said, “In fact, it’s been too long since someone strong enough to be my opponent has appeared.”","“Hmm? You want to fight me?” Chu Yunfan could feel the battle intent from Yun Huang.","Unlike the others, Yun Huang’s fighting spirit was very pure. He wanted to fight with him. It didn’t matter whether it was him or anyone else. As long as it was an expert, it was enough. This was a pure warrior. Chu Yunfan had seen this kind of person before, just like Fu Wentai, who was related to Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","“I want to fight you, but not the current you. You’re not my match now.” Yun Huang shook his head. “If If I fight you now, it’s no different from killing you. Three months. I’ll give you three months to break through. Three months later, I’ll fight you.”","Everyone was in an uproar. No one had expected that Yun Huang had not come here to stop the rebel army, but only to fight Chu Yunfan. Many people felt that they could not understand it, but there were even more people who could. This was the pure heart of a martial artist—something many people had lost.","It was purely because Yun Huang wanted to fight with an expert.","Hearing Yun Huang’s words, Wei Wuya and the other higher-ups of the rebellion heaved a sigh of relief. Yun Huang had finally appeared, but fortunately, it was not the most dangerous situation. Three months later, the entire operation would be over. At that time, it would be up to Chu Yunfan.","On the city wall, an old man in a royal robe was completely dumbfounded. He had not expected that after spending countless prices and favors to finally invite Yun Huang, the result would be like this.","He was the emperor of Great Wei, but at this moment, he truly understood what it meant to be fickle. What he thought was a major military matter was nothing in front of a true top-notch expert. It was simply meaningless.","He thought that he could dominate everything, but whether it was Chu Yunfan or Yun Huang, they were existences beyond his imagination. His power was useless. In this world, strength was the foundation that determined everything.","Chu Yunfan did not care about what the others thought. He looked at Yun Huang and said with a smile that was not a smile, “What if I can’t break through in three months?”","“Then you will die,” Yun Huang said slowly, “It will be your fate. If you can’t break through within three months, you’ll die in my hands.”","Everyone felt a chill run down their spines. They could feel that Yun Huang was not lying. This might really be what Yun Huang was thinking.","“All right. Three months from now, I’ll go to the Monster Subduers. See you there.”"]},{"number":1411,"title":"Chapter 1411 The Imperial Capital Surrenders, Victory","paragraphs":["1411 The Imperial Capital Surrenders, Victory","Chu Yunfan said this without hesitation. Facing the challenge from Yun Huang, he had no intention of retreating and directly agreed.","Yun Huang lacked a worthy opponent, but so did he.","Now, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was already at the peak of the Void Core Stage. In Great Wei, it was difficult to find a match for him. Previously, whether it was Ye Fei or the First Guardian, they were not his match at all.","Yun Huang served as a rare opponent for him.","Because of the aura he released, Chu Yunfan guessed that Yun Huang was an expert who had already surpassed the Void Core Stage and had already firmly reached the Core Form Stage!","In the Core Stage, there were three major stages. The first stage was the Void Core Stage. As the name suggested, it was to gather all the mana in the body and turn it into a Void Core in the meridians.","This was just a phantom of the golden core and could only be considered the first step. After that, it was the Core Form Stage. Experts in this level would begin to try to turn the illusory core into a solid core. This realm was the Core Form Stage.","At this stage, the meridian would begin to have a physical body. It was not like before, where it was just a phantom, or rather, it was just a meridian that existed in concept. And their combat strength would undergo an earth-shattering change along with this process. It could be said that theses were existences that completely surpassed the peak Void Core Stage.","Although Yun Huang was not the strongest in the Core Form Stage, and Chu Yunfan could even sense that he had just broken through not long ago, facing Void Cores and Core Formers were completed different.","That was why Yun Huang sighed with emotion. Invincibility was a kind of loneliness.","After breaking through to the Core Form Stage, whether it was Ye Fei or the First Guardian, they were no match for him. The two sides were not on the same level at all. Similarly, if Great Wei’s Imperial Court could be said to have a certain degree of deterrence against Void Cores, then to Core Formers, the country as a unit no longer had any deterrence.","At the very least, a country at the level of Great Wei was not a threat to a Core Former at all.","Core Formers were much stronger than Void Cores. Moreover, their golden cores had already formed a physical body. As the saying went, if one swallowed a golden core, their fate would be in their own hands. Even if he was surrounded by 100 thousand Blood Barbarians, an existence of this level could easily kill them. There was nothing to be afraid of.","It was laughable that the emperor wanted to control such a high-level expert and make him work for him. Wasn’t that a joke? There was no such possibility.","The Void Core Stage and the Core Form Stage were two completely different concepts. They were far more powerful than one could imagine.","That was why Yun Huang could completely ignore the words of the emperor. He did not even care about offending the emperor because it did not matter.","And now, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, while his combat strength was at the peak of the Void Core Stage. Once he broke through to the peak Void Core Stage, his combat strength would also improve. At that time, he would have the strength to fight Yun Huang.","Chu Yunfan felt his blood boiling at the thought of fighting a strong enemy. It had been a long time since he felt this way.","“Good lad. You actually dare to go to my sect? I’m really impressed by you!” Yun Huang exclaimed.","Everyone understood why—they all knew that the Monster Subduers was Yun Huang’s territory. It could be said that he had the geographical advantage and commanded the people in the Monster Subduers.","In a war, the right time, the right place, and the right people were important. In a battle between warriors, the right time, the right place, and the right people were also important. And in the Monster Subduers, Yun Huang’s geographical advantage would be maximized.","Chu Yunfan chose to personally find the Demon Subduers, which was undoubtedly giving up the geographical advantage. At the same time, this was also a reflection of his confidence. If he wasn’t confident enough, he wouldn’t have dared to do this. It was because of this that Yun Huang looked at Chu Yunfan in a different light.","“I hope that you really have such strength and are not boasting,” Yun Huang said indifferently.","“Whether or not I have such strength, we’ll see in three months,” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“Very well, then I’ll wait for you to come to the Monster Subduers.” Yun Huang nodded. “You may proceed. Just don’t cause any more suffering.”","After saying that, Yun Huang stepped on a ray of light and disappeared from the spot. Everyone was dumbfounded. Was it over just like that?","The collision that many people were secretly anticipating had ended just like that?","The experts in the rebellion heaved a sigh of relief. As for the forces on the Imperial Capital’s side, they were all pounding their chests. They had not expected Yun Huang to be so unreliable and deceitful.","From the conversation between the two parties, it was not difficult to deduce that Chu Yunfan’s strength was probably a level lower than the current Yun Huang. If Yun Huang was willing to make a move, Chu Yunfan would probably be defeated and they could turn the situation around.","Who knew that Yun Huang would just make a so-called opponent and let Chu Yunfan go?","As for the possibility of Chu Yunfan being defeated by Yun Huang three months later, it had nothing to do with them. After three months, everything would have been settled. Everything in Great Wei would be over by then.","They simply couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan in his current state. Originally, the defense of the Imperial Capital could stop the Jinzhanghan from moving south for more than a year. But now, they did not have enough people, and they did not have the slightest confidence in facing Chu Yunfan’s fierce attack.","“Yun Huang is unreliable!”","“How could this be? Yun Huang is so treacherous!”","“It’s over... It’s over!”","On the contrary, the morale of the rebellion army was greatly boosted. Victory was right in front of them.","Suddenly, just as Wei Wuya was about to give the order to attack the Imperial Capital, a white flag was raised. Everyone was dumbfounded. The Imperial Capital had surrendered.","In the beginning, no one believed it. They all thought it was a trap. However, they soon realized that this was not a trap. They really had surrendered.","The defenders of the Imperial City walked out and surrendered one after another. Soon, they got the whole story from the surrendering guards. It was the emperor who had personally issued an imperial edict, asking them to surrender to the army outside the city. The defenders in the city did not have much morale, so they naturally went along with the flow and left the city to surrender. Even the most stubborn of them did not have the slightest intention of resisting.","Even the emperor had surrendered. What was the need for them to fight to the death?"]},{"number":1412,"title":"Chapter 1412 The Death of the Emperor, Everything Was Finally Over","paragraphs":["1412 The Death of the Emperor, Everything Was Finally Over","Imperial Capital, Imperial Palace.","The imperial palace of Great Wei was naturally not shabby. On the contrary, it was connected by many paths, like a city within a city.","In the magnificent palace, Chu Yunfan finally met the legendary emperor of Great Wei. He was an old man with half a head of silver hair. He wore a royal robe and had a unique aura. It was the aura of a true superior who had been in a high position for many years.","“I didn’t expect us to meet under such circumstances,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at the emperor.","“I didn’t expect this either,” the emperor echoed.","A complicated expression flashed through his eyes. He had long known about the existence of such a person from the intelligence of the Agency of Secrets. However, at that time, according to the agency, Chu Yunfan was just a new generation expert with a promising future. Although Chu Yunfan could already be considered an outstanding talent at that time, he was still nothing.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan’s strength was getting stronger and stronger. Soon, he was so strong that even Great Wei had to pay attention to him. Half-step Cores were considered local tyrants. There were many such people in various places, and they had become the focus of the agency.","But in the end, they could only be regarded as a vassal of a region, but Cores were different. They were experts who could influence the situation of the entire country. Although not every one of them was an existence at the level of the five great experts, one had to admit that such an existence was something that even Great Wei’s imperial family had to be very afraid of.","However, by the time Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was confirmed to be a Core, it was already too late. In a short time, Chu Yunfan had developed into a behemoth, reaching a level that the emperor could not imagine.","It had only been a short while, but things had already developed to a point where he could not control it. As for Chu Yunfan’s youth, although he had long known about it, when he really saw it, he could not help but feel very surprised.","Chu Yunfan was at most 20 years old. He even looked like an 18-year-old teenager. This was the most terrifying thing. He felt a chill in his heart. Such a person was too monstrous.","“Do you regret it?” Chu Yunfan looked at the emperor. If it weren’t for him, there wouldn’t be so many waves. He could have left without any worries.","“I...I don’t regret it!” the emperor said through gritted teeth. His eyes were unusually firm, but there was some regret in his heart. It was not that he regretted attacking Chu Yunfan, but that he regretted not attacking Chu Yunfan earlier.","He should have taken action before Chu Yunfan had grown to such a stage where he could not control the situation. He didn’t think that there was anything wrong with taking action. He was an emperor, and his first choice was to destroy an existence that he couldn’t control. This was because this was determined by the nature of one born to be an emperor.","“Very well.” Chu Yunfan looked at the emperor. If he knelt down and begged for mercy, Chu Yunfan would look down on him. But now, he didn’t care, because no matter what he did, it was impossible to change the current situation.","“I wanted to kill you myself, but since you surrendered at the last moment and didn’t commit any more sins, I’ll gave you some face,” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","With that, he walked out and gave the father and son time to say their final goodbyes.","After Chu Yunfan left, the emperor stared at Wei Wuya and suddenly burst into laughter. “Well done. As expected of my child. You’re bold, my son!”","In truth, before this incident, he would never have thought that it would be Wei Wuya. After all, Wei Wuya wasn’t outstanding among his many children, and he didn’t have any impression of Wei Wuya. He only cared about the few princes who had the strength and ability to fight for the throne.","As for the other princes, they were usually taken care of by the Imperial Court. This had always been the case in Great Wei. The neglected sons of concubines lived stable lives, with no chance of making a comeback. However, Wei Wuya had completely broken this rule. Although he had borrowed the power of others, it had to be said that this was very unexpected.","“Father, I didn’t want this to happen.” Wei Wuya sighed. “In fact, all these years, all of the princes feel as if you don’t think of us more than dogs. To outsiders, we may seem like princes and have great honor, but in reality, all of us have lived in fear, afraid that one of our brothers will find us an eyesore and eliminate us.”","“You don’t have to say any of this,” the emperor said. The corners of his mouth curled up into a cold smile as he said, “Great Wei has a feudal system, so of course, there will only be one winner in the end. Even if you live like dogs, you can still live well. It’s better than dying. Forget me. Even your children will be like this in the future. The imperial family will enjoy glory and wealth, and this is just one of the prices.”","The emperor’s words left Wei Wuya speechless. After all, this was the fate of the imperial family. To ensure the stability of the family, every emperor had no choice but to give birth to many princes. However, there was only one emperor in the end, so it was naturally impossible for everyone to be treated well.","This was fate.","“Do you know why I announced my surrender? It’s not because I’m afraid of you. In fact, even with Chu Yunfan’s help, it won’t be so easy for you to enter the capital. At least I’ll make you pay the price before I die,” the emperor proclaimed as he stared at Wei Wuya. “You’re my son. Although you’re not my favorite, the throne won’t be considered to have fallen if it’s in your hands.”","Wei Wuya took a deep breath and said, “In that case, then I’ll’d for you to write an abdication edict, Father.”","The Emperor stared at Wei Wuya and said, “As the Emperor of Great Wei, I choose to surrender and let you take over the country. However, as a father, I have to punish you, you naughty boy. You will carry the title of usurper and live in its shadow for the rest of your life!”","As he said that, the emperor suddenly circulated his divine power. All the meridians in his body instantly exploded, breaking his own meridians.","‘Oh no!’","Wei Wuya thought that it was bad, but it was already too late to stop it. He could only watch helplessly as the emperor fell. He could vaguely see the emperor silently mouth the words, “Be careful of Chu Yunfan.”"]},{"number":1413,"title":"Chapter 1413 A New Emperor Ascends to the Throne, Changing the Regime","paragraphs":["1413 A New Emperor Ascends to the Throne, Changing the Regime","“You wanted to teach me a lesson before you die?” Wei Wuya looked at the emperor’s corpse with a complicated expression. He had never expected that his father would die in front of him in such a way.","The emperor had severed his meridians and died. In the end, he refused to let Wei Wuya inherit the throne safely.","However, Wei Wuya did not care. Even if his father had written an abdication edict, he was still a usurper. It was just a little more serious now. As for being careful of Chu Yunfan, how could he not know.","He didn’t dare to say it out loud, but he knew very well that he and Chu Yunfan were allies. To him, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the better it would be for him, because his chances of success would be higher. However, now that his cause had succeeded and the army had entered the capital, he was about to ascend the throne. The conflict between him and Chu Yunfan would immediately surface.","No ruler would wish for the existence of another potential emperor floating above their heads. This was a very common situation in the Spirit Realm. If a dynasty didn’t have a powerful expert to support it, it would often be easily overturned. However, he would not be as wary of Chu Yunfan as his father. Although Chu Yunfan was a threat to him in the long run, he was also a rare backer.","Without Chu Yunfan’s deterrence, how could he resist the prying eyes of all parties?","However, in the long run, this was indeed a problem that needed to be paid attention to. Perhaps, bringing in the Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang, would be an excellent choice. Although he had never thought of suppressing Chu Yunfan, it was impossible. After all, Chu Yunfan could destroy him with a single thought.","But if he brought in Yun Huang and Chu Yunfan to restrict each other, it would be much easier for him to become the emperor. This was also the way for him to survive in the cracks. He forcefully seized the throne, and this was one of the repercussions.","This was something Wei Wuya had to bear. With Chu Yunfan’s age, it would take several generations for the imperial family to not be restrained. It would only be possible if Chu Yunfan died.","At this moment, Wei Wuya thought of many things. He had to admit that his father was indeed a cunning fox. As the saying goes, the older the ginger, the spicier. Just one sentence had aroused his fear of Chu Yunfan.","Soon, Chu Yunfan saw Wei Wuya walk out from the palace. Although Chu Yunfan was outside, he could still hear what was happening inside. The decisiveness of the emperor had surprised him.","The emperor must have been very clear that he would die this time because Chu Yunfan would not let him live no matter what. His only path was death. The only thing he could choose was how he died and whose hands he died in.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t expect the emperor to be so ruthless. He was willing to surrender, but he refused to leave behind an abdication edict. This was a slap to the face of his son, Wei Wuya, saying, “You’re still too inexperienced to fight me.”","However, none of this had anything to do with him. In any case, Wei Wuya was the one who would be embarrassed.","After coming out, Wei Wuya glanced at Chu Yunfan and said, “Pass down the imperial decree. The first prince has rebelled against his superiors and raised an army to attack the Imperial City. He had dared to kill his father. His crime is heinous. The first prince’s entire family is sentenced to be executed. All relatives who have alienated him will be banished to the border. The third, fourth, eighth, ninth, and tenth prince are all involved in this rebellion. They will all be beheaded. However, I am merciful to my family. If they come up clean in the investigation, they will be spared the death penalty.","“Imprison the Imperial Court. Without my orders, no one is allowed to visit!”","Chu Yunfan looked at Wei Wuya in surprise. He was truly ruthless. All of the princes mentioned were, without exception, the most popular candidates for the throne, especially the first and second princes. Now that the second prince had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands, the first prince’s entire family were to executed. In addition, all the other princes were to be beheaded and their relatives imprisoned. Even those who were estranged from them had been imprisoned or exiled.","It was equivalent to uprooting and killing all the princes who might threaten his throne. Although there were many princes left, they did not have much influence, let alone pose any threat. After all, not everyone was like Wei Wuya, able to find a supporter like Chu Yunfan and miraculously obtain the final victory.","His personal guard hurriedly went down to give the order. Wei Wuya let out a long sigh of relief. Chu Yunfan was only a long-term concern to him, but these people were immediate worries. Now that the army had entered the city, he could take advantage of the chaos and complete everything with lightning speed. When everything was settled, the various factions would no longer have the chance to object even if they wanted to. The core of everything was to cut the knot quickly.","“Aren’t you afraid of being criticized by others?” Chu Yunfan asked with a faint smile.","“The criticisms toward a ruler will surely not be small. It will be the same in life and death. I’ve long been prepared, but I will use the truth to shut everyone up and let everyone know that it is not wrong to hand the country to me,” Wei Wuya slowly said.","“I’ll need you help to take care of this, Master Chu.” Wei Wuya bowed deeply to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan said,” I can’t help you with all this. At most, I can help you intimidate the villains. However, if you want the world to shut up, you have to rely on yourself. Choosing talents and governing the country has nothing to do with me.”","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had no intention of interfering, Wei Wuya heaved a sigh of relief. At least he didn’t have to worry about Chu Yunfan suddenly interfering and overthrowing his regime. After all, from the looks of it, it wasn’t difficult for Chu Yunfan to do this.","“You can handle these things. I’m going into seclusion to prepare for the battle in three months,” Chu Yunfan said.","“All right, then I wish you a great victory, Master Chu.” Wei Wuya was so happy that Chu Yunfan didn’t even step out to criticize him.","Following Wei Wuya’s orders, the first prince and the other princes who hadn’t been able to escape in time were captured by the army. Immediately after, orders were issued one after another, shocking the entire Imperial City.","The first prince’s entire family was executed, and the other princes who had previously fought for the throne were also captured and beheaded, and their relatives were imprisoned.","Everyone remained silent under these bloody orders. No one dared to challenge the dignity of the eighteenth prince who had just seized the throne.","Then, an even bigger piece of news shocked the entire Great Wei. The original emperor had been killed in the rebellion initiated by the first prince. The eighteenth prince, under the support of many officials, ascended the throne and became the new Emperor of Great Wei.","A new chapter in the history of Great Wei had begun."]},{"number":1414,"title":"Chapter 1414 Everyone Watched, Pill Success","paragraphs":["1414 Everyone Watched, Pill Success","The new emperor ascended the throne, while the old emperor died in the so-called rebellion. All the forces adopted a taciturn attitude toward this. After all, the ascension of a new emperor was not a normal change of throne. It involved a rebellion.","However, no one mentioned the so-called rebellion anymore because the victor was new ruler. The person who had obtained the final victory was Wei Wuya, so naturally, no one mentioned the rebellion anymore. As for the first prince launching a rebellion and killing the old emperor, no one believed it, but it didn’t matter whether they believed it or not.","The new emperor, who controlled an army of a million, issued a request to summon all the major factions in the various regions. This time, the major factions did not dare to ignore it and hurriedly sent people to meet him. There were some people who tried to rebel, but under the attack of the million strong army, they were quickly annihilated.","The new emperor ascended the throne, and all the lands submitted to him. Great Wei regained its peace. At least, on the surface, it looked like this.","The new emperor, Wei Wuya, had done everything he could in a short period. All that was left was to slowly adjust and adapt. This was because there had never been such a situation in history. From ancient times to the present, there had never been an unremarkable prince who had successfully rebelled.","Especially since Great Wei was not at the end of the dynasty, and could even be considered to be at the peak of the dynasty, that was something unprecedented. No one had any experience. Everyone was trying to get used to it.","As the matter of the Imperial Court was settled, and Wei Wuya was busy with the affairs of the various regions, everyone’s gaze once again locked onto Chu Yunfan. To be precise, it was locked onto Yun Huang and Chu Yunfan.","Everyone was waiting for the battle between Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang.","The news of the three-month agreement spread throughout the entire Great Wei in practically a single night. For the various major forces in Great Wei, this might be a battle that could determine the future of the entire Great Wei. This was especially true after Wei Wuya took over the world. In reality, there were still many powers in the world who were unwilling to submit to the new emperor, but they didn’t have the strength to resist.","Especially Chu Yunfan. To them, he was no different from a divine mountain. He was an existence that could not be reached and could not be resisted. However, Yun Huang had said before that if Chu Yunfan was not a match for Yun Huang in the battle three months later, he would die at the hands of Yun Huang.","Without Chu Yunfan’s support, Wei Wuya was like a ferocious tiger whose spine had been whipped. Naturally, it would be impossible for him to be revered by others like before. There was even the possibility of overthrowing him. Even though he had a million soldiers in his hands, everyone knew that they were all soldiers that had been recruited. They were not loyal.","It was because of this that some of the forces were suppressed. Three months later, everything would be clear. The battle three months later would be the one that would decide everything.","Everything was being restored. The Imperial Court was operating at a rapid pace. Other than some die-hard supporters of the old emperor and some people who had deep ties with the princes, most of the officials in the Imperial Court had been restored to their original positions. Of course, all kinds of rewards had never stopped. The biggest reward was naturally given to the Chu clan.","Chu Yaowei, who was originally a marquis, was conferred the title of King Chu. He became the first king with a different surname. One could imagine how glorious he was.","Apart from that, Chu Yaowei was promoted to the position of general, in charge of the military forces of the world. The other members of the Chu clan also received their own rewards. Naturally, many people were envious of this, but no one dared to say anything.","Firstly, the Chu clan had risked their lives for the new emperor. This was naturally unquestionable. Secondly, Chu Yunfan was their backer. In the eyes of many people, even if Chu Yunfan was not the first in the world, he was at least the second in the world. Naturally, he was qualified to protect them.","In addition to the Chu clan, Chu Yunfan was also granted the title of national master. At the same time, he was also the First Guardian of the imperial family. In theory, the Guardian Bureau was now Chu Yunfan’s subordinate.","In the Imperial Capital, in a newly built grand mansion, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in front of a huge alchemical furnace and was making pills. What he wanted to make was naturally the Essence Gathering Pill that would help him break through.","With his current cultivation, he was already at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. All the potential in his body had been released, and he was only one step away from breaking through to the Void Core Stage. If he wanted to battle Yun Huang three months from now, he would have to rely on the Essence Gathering Pill.","For ten days, Chu Yunfan was making pills non-stop. At the same time, he constantly condensed the alchemic fire to speed up the process. Otherwise, just making the Essence Gathering Pill would take a long time.","During these ten days, Wei Wuya had sent over many cultivation items, mainly low-grade spirit stones. He had sent over a total of 50 million low-grade spirit stones. As long as Chu Yunfan had the need, he could continue to ask Wei Wuya for it.","Although Wie Wuya was somewhat wary of Chu Yunfan, he was knew that he could sit firmly on the throne because of Chu Yunfan’s deterrence. If Chu Yunfan met with an accident, then he would not have a good ending. Now, they were all on the same boat.","Chu Yunfan accepted it without hesitation. When he was about to break through, he would also need a large amount of spirit energy to assist him in breaking through. The poor in literature and the rich in martial arts. Cultivation itself required a huge amount of resources. It was not something that the poor could afford. With Wei Wuya as the emperor at his back, Chu Yunfan could focus on his cultivation and didn’t need to worry about anything else.","Suddenly, white smoke rose from the furnace and filled the entire alchemy room.","It was the smell of medicine.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the lid of the alchemical furnace flew up. He flew over and could see five thumb-sized pills lying quietly in the furnace. These pills were orange-yellow in color and looked quite extraordinary. After the medicinal fragrance dissipated, he could even vaguely see some light contained in them.","That was the phenomenon that could only be seen when the quality of the pill was high.","However, this was just child’s play for alchemy. In the Ancient Zenith Civilization, some of the pills refined by Alchemy Emperor caused phenomenons from the sky as soon as they were done. There were even thunder tribulations from the sky. According to rumors, the legendary divine pills could even take on a human form. That was a true divine-grade.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the five pills flew into his hand. He put them into the porcelain bottle, leaving only one pill and swallowing it."]},{"number":1415,"title":"Chapter 1415 Breakthrough, Void Core Stage!","paragraphs":["1415 Breakthrough, Void Core Stage!","As soon as the Essence Gathering Pill was swallowed, it turned into a warm current and spread into Chu Yunfan’s limbs and bones. He felt that every single cell of his was filled with an unimaginably powerful energy.","Chu Yunfan’s body was far more powerful than an ordinary person’s. The energy contained in each of his cells might be more than the energy of an ordinary person’s entire body. If he self-destructed, it would probably form a small nuclear explosion scene on the spot.","This was the most terrifying part.","One could imagine how much energy Chu Yunfan’s body could hold. Even so, the energy of the Essence Gathering Pill spread to his limbs and bones, into every cell of his body, making him feel as if every cell in his body was about to explode.","This energy far exceeded the limit of what his body could condense. And this was also the path that one had to take to break through to the Void Core Stage.","Divines stored their divine power in every cell and meridian. However, there was a limit to the amount of divine power stored. It was impossible to store it indefinitely. Even if Chu Yunfan’s body capacity was like a river compared to an ordinary person’s water tank, it would eventually be filled up. Once it was filled up, it would not be able to store any more divine power.","The Void Core Stage was a different way to turn all of one’s divine power into a golden core and leave it in the meridian. The qi sea meridian in the body was turned into a golden core. In this way, he could store ten times, twenty times, or even a hundred times more mana than those at the Divine Abilities Stage. Once this hundredfold divine power was released, it was the most terrifying and almost earth-shattering level.","In order to achieve this step, it would normally require years of accumulation and cultivation of mana to the extreme. Only after surpassing this limit could one form a golden core using a secret technique. Every family had their own methods, and Chu Yunfan’s method was naturally the best. Even in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, it was second to none.","Chu Yunfan circulated his divine power and concentrated it all in his meridian. He felt that his meridian was about to explode from this endless divine power.","“Success or failure depends on this move!”","Chu Yunfan exclaimed to himself. His entire body emitted a faint light like a god. At the same time, countless thunder energy boiled around him. Endless divine power flowed into his meridian without stopping for even a single moment.","Time flew by as he cultivated.","A month later, in the Imperial Advisor’s residence, two figures were pacing back and forth, seemingly a little nervous. If an outsider saw this, they would know that this was Chu Yaowei and Chu Hongcai, the two people who had become popular recently.","“Brother Fan hasn’t come out of seclusion yet. I don’t know how long it will take for him to come out,” Chu Hongcai said anxiously, “I just heard that the Monster Subduers has sent a challenge. The battle in two months is unavoidable.”","Chu Yaowei was a little anxious, but he was not that anxious. He just said, “There shouldn’t be a problem. Yunfan isn’t the kind of person to talk big. Since they agreed to fight in three months, there must be no mistake.”","“Yun Huang is the number one expert in the world, and he took advantage of others when they were in danger. If Brother Fan cultivated for a few more years, what would he be?” Chu Hongcai said discontentedly.","The others were afraid of Yun Huang and did not dare to say anything, but he was not.","“There are some things that we can’t interfere with. His Majesty has already sent people to urge him many times over the past few days. He has been asking if Yunfan has already come out of seclusion.”","Chu Yaowei frowned. He knew why the emperor was so concerned. Because they were all in the same boat. If Chu Yunfan lost, the Imperial Court, which seemed to be thriving, would instantly collapse.","“There shouldn’t be a problem. Brother Fan should be able to do it!” Chu Hongcai said, “Your Highness, I’m sure you must be very busy. Leave this to me. I will inform you as soon as I have news.”","Chu Yaowei thought for a while and said, “Okay, if you hear anything, let me know immediately.”","He didn’t stay for long because he had a lot of things to do.","Chu Yunfan, who was in seclusion in the alchemy room, did not know how anxious the people outside were because of him. The divine power in his entire body was boiling as he carried out the final condensation.","Boom!","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s terrifying divine power turned into a vast ocean and swept out. At that moment, he dove into the Mountain River Diagram to prevent the entire alchemy room from being destroyed. The terrifying divine power was still boiling. Compared to the divine power that he had released earlier, it was at least twice as strong.","Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes. He knew that he had completed his breakthrough. He had condensed a void core in his meridian!","The reason why it was called a void core was that this golden core had just gained a phantom form. It could not be considered to have taken shape. This golden core was very fragile. If it suffered too much attack, it would immediately explode. However, if a true golden core was formed, it would not be easy to defeat. It would be ten times or a hundred times stronger than this. When he had truly formed a golden core into his stomach. From then on, his life was up to him and not the heavens.","But even so, Chu Yunfan could feel that after condensing the void core, his strength had more than doubled. His combat strength had truly broken through the limit of the Void Core Stage.","The golden core in his meridian was rotated continuously. Every time it rotated, the divine power in his body became stronger. The speed of this process was shocking. However, at the same time, during this process, he had to absorb countless spirit energy. Only when there was enough spirit energy could he support the growth of the golden core.","The 50 million low-grade spirit stones that Wei Wuya had sent over had all been absorbed. It was already good enough for an ordinary expert at the peak of the divine-tier to absorb a few million low-grade spirit stones’ spirit energy when he broke through to the Core Stage. It was simply unbelievable that Chu Yunfan had absorbed ten times more than their limit.","It was simply unimaginable that even a peak Void Core would not be able to absorb so much spirit energy into their body in one breath. Otherwise, their body would explode and they would die. Everyone had their limits, and Chu Yunfan’s limits were beyond their imagination.","After having a golden core in his body, it was as if he had an additional heart. As the core contracted, the spirit energy circulated through his body.","In short, he was powerful—unimaginably powerful."]},{"number":1416,"title":"Chapter 1416 Great Advancement in Cultivation, Mastery of Martial Skills","paragraphs":["1416 Great Advancement in Cultivation, Mastery of Martial Skills","After breaking through into the Void Core Stage, there was a drastic change compared to when he was still in the Divine Abilities Stage.","This is a process of breaking through one’s limits.","Heaven and earth were endless, but human strength was limited. This was one of the basic concepts of cultivation. Cultivation was the process of constantly breaking through one’s limits. And this breakthrough was simply an earth-shattering change for Chu Yunfan.","Most importantly, he was still breaking through and becoming stronger.","The void core in his body seemed to have given him an extra heart. Every time his heart beat, the blood in his body would circulate once. Now, every time the void core in his body rotated, the divine power in his entire body flowed once, and his divine power increased by a bit.","This speed was extremely fast and shocking.","At this stage, the demand for spirit energy would also far exceed his previous imagination. The void core was constantly condensing, and in the process of finally transforming into the golden core, it would need to absorb countless amounts of energy. Thus, even though he had absorbed all the low-grade spirit stones that Wei Wuya had given him, it still wasn’t enough.","“The resources used to cultivate in the Core Stage are ten times or even a hundred times more than those used in the Divine Abilities Stage. No wonder Great Wei can’t support many people even with its national strength.” Chu Yunfan sighed.","With the national strength of Great Wei, it could be said that there were countless citizens. However, such a large country could only raise so many Cores. With the number of Cores and the vast number of citizens, it could be said that it was one in a million. Every Core was a giant beast that could swallow gold. They either relied on a huge monster to cultivate or they established their own force to cultivate. There had to be someone who could support their cultivation.","However, if the Cores outside heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they would probably roll their eyes. Although Cores were indeed a huge resource consumer and could be called a gold-devouring beast, they were definitely not at his level. He had just broken through to the Void Core Stage, but his consumption consumption rate was much faster than the average Void Core. They were not on the same level at all!","After a month of crazy consumption, Chu Yunfan had absorbed all the 50 million low-grade spirit stones that Wei Wuya had given him. In the Mountain River Diagram, he still had 30 million low-grade spirit stones, which was enough to support his cultivation for a time.","After breaking through, Chu Yunfan felt a spurt of energy. Without any hesitation, he swallowed another Essence Gathering Pill. In an instant, countless energy boiled and spread into his limbs and bones.","If he had been a little flustered by the medicinal effects of the Essence Gathering Pill before, he could be said to be calm now. Everything was under his control. The void core that had formed in his body was spinning crazily, absorbing the medicinal power and turning it into his own divine power to grow.","If outsiders saw Chu Yunfan’s brutal cultivation method, they would probably be scared to death. Even a Core would not be like Chu Yunfan, who devoured energy crazily without any screening. Their body would soon explode and their golden core along with them.","However, Chu Yunfan was able to hold on. He used the Celestial Devouring Art and crazily devoured the medicinal strength contained in the Essence Gathering Pill.","In the blink of an eye, an entire month of cultivation had passed. In the Imperial Advisor’s residence, Chu Hongcai waited anxiously for an entire month, but Chu Yunfan still had not come out of seclusion.","He could only choose to give up. It seemed like Chu Yunfan would not come out of seclusion anytime soon. However, there was only a month left until his three-month agreement with Yun Huang.","Everyone, no matter which side they were from, began to make preparations. In the Imperial Advisor’s residence, or more accurately, in the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan had already finished his cultivation and seclusion.","After a whole month of cultivation, Chu Yunfan had undergone a tremendous change from a month ago. After consuming two more Essence Gathering Pills, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had almost naturally reached the peak of the fledgling Void Core Stage. He stopped his cultivation because he would need to spend more time if he wanted to advance further, and he did not have that much time left.","There was only one month left in the three-month agreement. Chu Yunfan had to starting practicing his techniques.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and punched out. In an instant, eight deity illusions appeared around him and blasted forward. The eight illusions were the Deva, Ryu, Asura Gandharva, Garuda, Jinnara, and Mahoraga.","When these eight deity illusions combined into one, it truly had earth-shattering power.","This punch was earth-shattering, but at the same time, Chu Yunfan had used up all his divine power, and his face turned pale. The power of the Eight Astonishing Punches was too shocking. Therefore, he usually only used the Asura Punch or the Garuda Punch.","These eight parts of the Eight Astonishing Punches could be split into eight powerful punch techniques or combined into one and used all at once. If the eight techniques were released separately, its consumption was naturally nothing for Chu Yunfan. He could withstand it, but it was another matter when the eight techniques were combined.","This technique would deplete Chu Yunfan’s divine power in an instant. With the current density of Chu Yunfan’s divine power, he could judge how amazing the full power version of the Eight Astonishing Punches was.","In fact, Chu Yunfan had already mastered the complete Eight Astonishing Punches. After performing it time and time again, many of the mysteries were no longer a secret to him. However, he didn’t dare to use it. If he used it, his blood essence would probably be instantly sucked dry given that he was only in the divine-tier previously. If that happened, it might even hurt his foundation.","However, now that he had reached the Void Core Stage, Chu Yunfan had the ability to use the complete Eight Astonishing Punches. However, when he unleashed this punch, he still had to drain the divine power in his body. He even had to burn a portion of his blood essence as the price to unleash it.","It could be said that once he used it, Chu Yunfan might lose his combat strength for a short period. However, at the same time, the power of this move was extremely terrifying. With such a move, even an fledgling Core Former would be instantly killed. He could even severely injure a intermediate Core Former."]},{"number":1417,"title":"Chapter 1417 The Time of Three Months Is Up","paragraphs":["1417 The Time of Three Months Is Up","Although this move had gradually become a usable move with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, it still required a huge price. It could only be used as a trump card and could not be used easily.","And this was definitely not the full power of the Eight Astonishing Punches. With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, he could only barely display the Eight Astonishing Punches. Even so, it was still so powerful.","If Chu Yunfan was willing to pay the price, he could even increase the power of the Eight Astonishing Punches by several times, but the price was too high. At least, he was not willing to pay that price now. It was not worth it.","Normally, as long as he used any of the eight divisions of the Eight Astonishing Punches, he would be able to defeat a strong opponent.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan felt that the blood essence in his body slowly replenish, and his divine power recovered rapidly. He still had a lingering fear. At that moment, all the divine power and a part of his blood essence were sucked dry.","This was why he was barely able to display a portion of the power of the Eight Astonishing Punches. If it was an ordinary Void Core, they would not be able to do this. Ordinary Core Formers would be instantly injured by the backlash. It was only because he had the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique that his body was far superior to ordinary people that he could persist.","After practicing the Eight Astonishing Punches, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He flew up into the sky, or rather, he walked step by step into the void. His aura increased crazily as he walked into the void step by step. With every step, the aura around him increased by a lot. Finally, he reached the limit, and his aura also climbed to the limit.","Chu Yunfan then stomped down fiercely. It was a martial technique, a martial technique that was close to Dao. In an instant, an endless amount of netherworld spring water gushed out from under Chu Yunfan’s feet. The water turned into a terrifying power and fell toward the sky.","Boom!","The entire space within the Mountain River Diagram trembled slightly. The air collapsed under Chu Yunfan’s feet. It was as if his kick was not a simple stomp, but a fall from the sky.","“This Nine Netherworld Stomps are indeed impressive!”","After taking this stomp, Chu Yunfan even had the illusion that the world was going to prostrate at his feet. That kind of lofty aura was enough to make everyone go crazy.","The name of this technique was Nine Netherworld Stomps. It was a set of amazing techniques from the Ancient Zenith Civilization recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. It was different from ordinary leg techniques. This set of techniques focused on looking down and trampling on everything.","He would trample everything under his feet and destroy everything with the power of the netherworld.","This set of leg techniques came from a peerless expert named Netherworld Emperor of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, and when the Netherworld Emperor executed the Nine Netherworld Stomps, the water that swept out was not an evolution of martial will, but real netherworld water. With a single stomp, it was as if the netherworld had toppled over. No matter what kind of powerful enemy it was, it would be destroyed under this terrifying stomp.","According to rumors, netherworld water was a type of water that only existed in the world of the dead. It was said that if a living person came into contact with it, they would be completely corroded. It was the dividing line between the world of the dead and the world of the living. No one could cross this dividing line.","However, the Netherworld Emperor was able to draw the water from the world of the dead for his own use. His cultivation had reached an incredible level.","After he stomped down, Chu Yunfan raised his foot and stomped down again without hesitation.","“Second Netherworld Stomp!”","Boom!","The entire sky trembled even more violently. The power of the second stomp was far greater than the first. In fact, the power of each stomp of the Nine Netherworld Stomps was increasing. When one reached the ninth stomp and cultivated it to the extreme, one could crush an entire world with a single stomp. It was an extremely powerful martial art.","Of course, Chu Yunfan could not reach that level at the moment, but even so, the power of the Second Netherworld Stomp was already very shocking.","“Third Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan took another step forward, but compared to before, he was starting to feel a little tired. He wasn’t as relaxed as before. However, this stomp seemed to shatter the sky. The air collapsed in a large area. It was at least twice as powerful as the first stomp.","Half of the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body was drained. However, in the next moment, the golden core in his body rotated once, and the divine power was continuously replenished. This was the terror of a Core. Compared to this, a Divine’s instantaneous burst of divine power could not be mentioned in the same breath, and their recovery ability was not on the same level.","Previously, Chu Yunfan was able to defeat a Void Core by relying on his incomparably powerful physical body to resist. It was an unreasonable fighting style.","“Fourth Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan roared and stomped down again. The divine power in his body was instantly exhausted. In his mind, countless information about the Fourth Netherworld Stomp appeared. This stomp was enough for him to comprehend a lot.","This stomp had drained all of his divine power, but it also caused the entire space to tremble violently. Its power was so great that it had simply reached a shocking level. Under this Fourth Netherworld Stomp, even a Core Former would be sent flying.","Chu Yunfan stopped and panted heavily.","“It seems that I can only use four stomps at most. However, even if it’s only four, its power is enough.” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. The imaginary enemy he was facing when he stepped out with his fourth stomp was Yun Huang.","Such power was enough to defeat Yun Huang. No matter how strong he was, he would collapse in front of his Fourth Netherworld Stomp.","Yun Huang was too arrogant and too confident. To him, three months was not enough for Chu Yunfan to have a drastic change. At most, Chu Yunfan could barely become an expert who could fight with him for a day. However, he never expected Chu Yunfan to have such a drastic change in just three months.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had broken through from the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage to the peak of the fledgling Void Core Stage in an instant. He had even cultivated all eight parts of the Eight Astonishing Punches and a portion of the Nine Netherworld Stomps.","It could be said that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had increased by almost ten times compared to before. It was completely different.","“Just you wait!”"]},{"number":1418,"title":"Chapter 1418 The Three-Month Pact, the World’s Attention","paragraphs":["1418 The Three-Month Pact, the World’s Attention","The three-month deadline had quietly arrived.","For Chu Yunfan, time was of the essence in cultivation. Every day was precious, and he had to seize every minute and second to cultivate. However, to the people outside, every minute and every second felt like a year.","Three months later, the number one expert in the world, Yun Huang, challenged the publicly acknowledged number two expert, Chu Yunfan. This was to be the most glorious battle in a hundred years.","Yun Huang was the current sect master of the Monster Subduers, the greatest master of Great Wei. Although the Monster Subduers was located at the western border, no one dared to underestimate his influence.","For many years, Yun Huang had been guarding the west of Great Wei, suppressing the endless monsters in the west, and preventing them from causing trouble to the world. It could be said to be the guardian of the entire world. Although he didn’t speak much and even the matters of the Core Council were handled by Blood King, no one dared to underestimate his existence.","For many years, he had always been the number one expert in the world, and no one could shake his position as the number one. There were even people who joked that even if the world did not have the emperor of Great Wei, it could not do without Yun Huang. Although this was just a joke, it could be seen how much influence Yun Huang had throughout Great Wei.","Although Chu Yunfan’s rise was recent and short, his influence could not be underestimated. Since the day he rose, he had killed four of the five experts of Great Wei. His viciousness and ferocity caused everyone to have a whole new level of respect for him, and he even helped Wei Wuya to wipe out the imperial faction.","To everyone’s surprise, this person whom no one thought highly of actually succeeded. In one fell swoop, he had established the current situation of Great Wei. It could be said that he had stirred up the entire Great Wei with his own strength. Even those who disliked him had to admit Chu Yunfan’s influence on the world.","And now, the two of them were finally going to fight.","Three months ago, when Yun Huang sent out a challenge in front of the two armies and Chu Yunfan accepted the challenge, it could be said that this news was like a tsunami that swept through the entire Great Wei.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on the two of them.","Everyone knew!","“Yun Huang wants to battle Chu Yunfan?”","“This is big news. Yun Huang is the number one expert now, but he will eventually die of old age. After he dies, Chu Yunfan will definitely become the number one expert.”","“I think there’s no need to wait until Yun Huang dies. With Chu Yunfan’s current growth rate, Huang Yun probably won’t be Chu Yunfan’s even while he’s still alive. The only difference is whether he can do it in ten years or twenty years.”","“No matter what happens in the future, just the now is already shocking enough. In the past hundred years, Great Wei has not had such a brilliant battle. Even if we look back to hundreds of years, I’m afraid there are no abnormal battles that can be compared to this.”","When countless people heard this news, their eyes lit up. A battle between such a powerful expert was probably something they could never imagine. However, it was obvious that these people were divided into two groups.","One group was optimistic about Chu Yunfan.","“I think Chu Yunfan will win. Yun Huang is old after all, and his fists are afraid of the young. No matter how strong his blood essence is, he’s no match for Chu Yunfan. As long as Chu Yunfan can drag on until the later stages, he will definitely exhaust Yun Huang to death/”","“That’s right. Chu Yunfan is good at creating miracles. From the day he debuted, he has never disappointed anyone. It can even be said that he himself is synonymous with miracles.”","“You all think that three months is not enough to do anything, but I feel that three months later, Yun Huang might not be able to kill Chu Yunfan.”","However, most people were more optimistic about Yun Huang, who had been the number one expert in the world for many years.","“Tsk tsk, have you forgotten? Three months ago, Chu Yunfan had personally admitted that he was not a match for Yun Huang in front of the two armies. A mere three months is like the snap of a finger for the cultivation of experts. It’s not enough to turn the situation around.”","“That’s right. It’s only three months. What can Chu Yunfan do? Chu Yunfan will become the number one in the future? After this battle, whether Chu Yunfan could survive or not is another matter. If he can’t withstand it, he’ll probably die at Yun Huang’s hands!”","“That’s right, Yun Huang is not a soft-hearted person. Countless high-leveled monsters have died in his hands. He guards the border of the empire and is said to be an extremely tough person.”","“Yun Huang will definitely win this battle. In the past hundred years, there have been people like Chu Yunfan who overestimated themselves, but so what? In the end, Yun Huang is number one.”","The two sides argued endlessly. Both sides could come up with a large number of reasons to prove that they were right, but Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang had never fought before. Of course, all of this was just speculation.","There was no doubt that the most glorious battle in a hundred years had attracted the attention of many experts from all over Great Wei.","“Let’s go to the Monster Subduer Sect. If I can see such a battle in my life, I will die without regrets!”","Experts from all over the world had set off early on. In Great Wei, there were countless experts from all directions and forces. There were experts from the government, the army, the underground world, and even itinerant cultivators with powerful cultivation bases. There were also sect masters of sects and masters of aristocratic families.","All of these people had extremely prominent identities. Usually, the place they walked would tremble when they stomped their feet. But now, everyone was on a pilgrimage to the Monster Subduers.","In an ancient family, many descendants of the family waited quietly. Suddenly, a figure flew out from the depths of the clan’s ancestral land. Everyone looked at the old man in surprise.","“The great ancestor has come out of seclusion. That’s great!”","“He’s still alive!”","“The great ancestor is getting stronger and stronger!”","Amidst the exclamations of the crowd, the figure did not even look at them. He only looked in the direction of the Monster Subduers.","“Great Ancestor, why did you come out of seclusion?” the clan leader asked respectfully. He did not dare to show any disrespect in front of the person who relied on him.","“How can I not join in the fun of the battle between the world’s number one and the number two?” the person said slowly. After he finished speaking, he turned into a stream of light and disappeared into the sky."]},{"number":1419,"title":"Chapter 1419 Gathering in the Monster Subduer Sect, Everyone Sighed","paragraphs":["1419 Gathering in the Monster Subduer Sect, Everyone Sighed","At the northern border of Great Wei, on the endless wall, a figure was like an overlord in the world. With a spear, the entire mountain in the distance was blasted into pieces.","After a long time, that person put away his spear and looked at the interior of Great Wei. He thought, ‘It’s about time.’ He turned around and flew straight into the depths of Great Wei.","At the same time, in the middle of Great Wei, in a forest, an old man dressed in simple clothes and wearing a bamboo hat strode out of the forest. His body carried a powerful aura. When he was in the forest, all the monsters and wild beasts in the forest crawled along the ground. There was not a sound in the entire forest. Even the chirping of birds and the chirping of insects did not exist. Even the sound of the wind blowing was controlled. It was as if one person controlled the entire world.","After walking out of the forest, the old man suddenly smiled. “Interesting, interesting. Such a powerful junior actually appeared in this world. I want to go and take a look.”","After saying that, the old man stepped out of a beam of light and headed in the direction of the Monster Subduers at the western border.","***","At the same time, in various parts of Great Wei, Cores who usually did not appear easily began to come out of seclusion and rush to the Monster Subduers. All parts of Great Wei were shocked that these people were coming out of seclusion. From what they knew, many of these people should have fallen a long time ago. Who would have thought that they were still alive?","Ordinary things could not alarm these Cores. Only things like the battle between the world’s number one and number two expert could alarm them.","“My God, these experts are coming out one by one. I thought they were all dead. I didn’t expect them to be still alive!”","Countless people felt their souls trembling.","“These old fellows have come out of the mountains. I’m afraid the entire situation of Great Wei will be overturned!”","This was the first time many people knew about the existence of these people, especially many young experts. To them, when they were just born, these experts had either lived in seclusion or had been rumored to have fallen. Who would have thought that they would actually be able to see these experts come out? The shock in their hearts could be imagined.","Many experts had already become famous in the world a long time ago. If they had left the mountain early, it would have been difficult to determine the ranking of the five experts. At the very least, Mi Siyuan and Blood King were probably not good enough to be ranked among the top five experts in the eyes of many people.","Although many of these people were experts of the previous generation, their strength was not something that ordinary people could imagine.","On this day, at the foot of the Mount Zhenyao where the Monster Subduer Sect was located, countless experts from all over the world rushed up from the foot of the mountain. To show their respect for the number one expert in the world, the ordinary Divines did not dare to fly. They could only walk up. Only Cores had the right to fly toward the Monster Subduers, but they did not dare to fly directly to the top. They would usually land on the square midway up the mountain. Even a Core wouldn’t dare to be impudent in front of the world’s number one.","At the foot of the Mount Zhenyao, there was an incomparably huge Monster Subduer Stele standing on it. It towered over a hundred meters tall. On it, there were ancient characters that could not be understood.","It was said that in the ancient times, a peerless demon was suppressed under this huge stele. This Monster Subduer Stele was established because of this. The Monster Subduers was the legacy passed down by the expert who suppressed this peerless demon.","That was why the Monster Subduers had chosen for generations to be located in the most remote place in the west. However, this was only an ancient legend. No one knew if it was true or not. Not even the members of the Monster Subduers knew if it was true or not.","That has transpired too many years ago. It was so long that time could bury everything.","At the base of stele, a divine-tier martial arts expert led a group of Innate disciples and kept sighing.","“Monster Subduers is indeed the number one sect in the world. Even its base is extraordinary. It’s said that the Monster Subduers existed before Great Wei. I don’t know if it is true or not,” someone said with a sigh.","For a sect like theirs that had only been established for a hundred years, or even a few hundred years, from the day they were founded, the Monster Subduers was already the number one sect in the world.","This prestige was deeply imprinted in their minds.","They watched as many of the divine-tier elites strode forward like agile monkeys. In just a moment, they had already disappeared from the foot of the mountain. They followed the stairs and headed straight for the square on the mountainside.","In the sky, there would be streaks of light flying past from time to time. They were all extremely powerful Cores.","“What a terrifying battle—a battle between the world’s number one and number two. Tsk, tsk. Perhaps only the mysterious expert beside Great Wei’s great ancestor had charged into the Imperial Capital of the previous dynasty and killed the First Guardian of the previous dynasty, winning a crucial battle for Great Wei.”","Some people cried out in surprise, but even more people recalled the battle at the beginning of the founding of Great Wei. It was after that battle that Great Wei’s founding ancestor completely obtained the advantage over the previous dynasty and led his troops to the Northern Expedition to seize the world.","That battle had a far-reaching impact. Even now, many people were still talking about it.","“Heavens, I have never seen any of these experts before. If it wasn’t for the battle between Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang, it would have been difficult to alarm these old monsters,” a disciple exclaimed.","On the side, the Divines were shocked because even they did not know that there were so many experts in Great Wei after Chu Yunfan had killed so many experts. They were all hidden in the dark, and the world did not know that they were still alive.","As for the remaining half-step Cores, they were even worse. Heroes from all over the world had arrived. There were more than 200 of them, and they could not afford to offend any of them.","“But Master, even though Chu Yunfan has killed four of the top five experts in the world and is extremely ferocious, Yun Huang is still the world’s number one. I’m afraid that Chu Yunfan is not his match,” a disciple said.","“Who knows about this kind of thing? I can’t judge either, because either of these two people’s levels is far stronger than even me.” The Divine sighed. “Let’s go. We shouldn’t delay any longer. Otherwise, we won’t be able to make it in time for the battle.”","After the Divine sighed, he led his disciples up the stairs and joined the crowd, heading toward the square at the mountainside."]},{"number":1420,"title":"Chapter 1420 Overwhelming Twists","paragraphs":["1420 Overwhelming Twists","When they arrived at the square on the mountainside, they realized that the entire palace was already packed with people.","Originally, this square was used by the Monster Subduers disciples for their morning exercises. However, no one expected that the battle between Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang would attract more than ten thousand people. Among these ten thousand people, the weakest were peak Innates. Moreover, these were the weakest who did not dare to speak.","The ordinary ones were all Divines, and the truly advanced ones were the Cores who stood at the forefront. Each of them exuded an extremely terrifying aura. One person was enough to suppress the entire scene. Fortunately, they were clearly restrained. They controlled their auras to a radius of three feet and did not spread out.","But even so, it was enough to make the Monster Subduers disciples, who were the hosts, extremely wary. Countless Monster Subduers disciples had been waiting solemnly around the square. If there was any problem, they would rush out to maintain order. Even though the Monster Subduers was known as the number one sect in the world, they still did not dare to relax in the slightest when facing this group of experts who could be said to be the most powerful in Great Wei.","Among this group of people, Chu Yaowei, the current King of Chu, and the many experts from the Imperial Court’s Guardian Bureau were definitely the most special. From a certain point of view, they were all supporting Chu Yunfan, and all of the Monster Subduers naturally supported Yun Huang.","However, the Monster Subduers did not neglect them. After all, although the Monster Subduers was powerful, it still needed to rely on Great Wei.","After everyone arriveed, they looked at the dozens of Cores in front of them and could not help but be speechless. These were people who Chu Yunfan and Wei Wuya hadn’t been able to startle even when they had fought their way to the capital. But now, they had been attracted by the battle between Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang.","However, for martial artists like them, the change of dynasties was not a big deal. Instead, it was not as important as the battle between the top masters.","“Isn’t that Great Ancestor Ouyang of the Ouyang aristocrat clan? I thought he had passed away decades ago. I didn’t expect him to still be here!”","“That’s right, and it’s not only the Ouyang clan, but also the previous sect master of the Dawn Cloud Sect. Dawn Cloud had announced that their old sect master had passed away. I didn’t expect that he would appear.”","“I even saw the commander of the Great Wall Army in the north. He’s the commander of the hundreds of thousands of soldiers in the north!”","The crowd discussed fervently. They recognized the identity of each Core one by one. Each of them would cause a wave of exclamations. Each of them was a famous existence. Even if some of them looked like an unremarkable old man, they might have had unimaginable glory a long time ago.","However, Chu Yunfan still had not showed up. This made many people impatient.","“Why hasn’t he appeared? Is he afraid? Chu Yunfan is a coward!” someone said, and it immediately resonated with many people.","After all, although Chu Yunfan was strong, he had personally admitted three months ago that he was inferior to Yun Huang. If he did not break through in these three months, he might not appear.","This was logical!","“You’re all so noisy.”","The person saw that his words had resonated with everyone, and a smug expression appeared on his face. Just as he was about to continue speaking, he saw the northern Great Wall Army’s commander, who was dressed in armor, shouted coldly. He casually slashed out a saber light and cut this person in half.","The crowd fell silent. They didn’t dare to say anything. Although they were all big shots in front of others, they were nothing in front of Cores.","The other Cores also showed a disgusted expression. Although many of them did not like Chu Yunfan and were waiting to see him suffer or even be killed by Yun Huang, in their hearts, Chu Yunfan was indeed a strong person. He was not someone these ants had the right to slander.","There was no need to say anything to maintain the high and mighty status of a Core. They would form a tacit understanding.","At this moment, everyone understood that they had violated the taboo of these Cores. No matter what, Chu Yunfan could not be humiliated lightly, and neither could these experts.","All of a sudden, just as everyone was discussing, a figure appeared in the sky. It was a young man in black robes. He stood with his hands behind his back and slowly walked over in the sky. He seemed slow but was actually fast. In just a moment, he had already arrived above the square. He looked at everyone and said, “Chu Yunfan has come to pay his respects to the three month agreement. Are you here, Senior Yun Huang?”","Everyone was instantly in an uproar. It this was the legendary Chu Yunfan.","The first impression Chu Yunfan gave them was that he was young. He was really too young. Most of them had never seen him in person. They had only heard rumors about him. This was the first time they had seen him in person.","However, when they saw him, they realized that Chu Yunfan looked at most twenty years old. It could even be said that he was a teenager of seventeen or eighteen years old. According to the rumors, not only did he look young, but he was really young.","Many people couldn’t help but feel extremely emotional, especially those Cores. They couldn’t help but change their expressions. They knew how difficult it was to cultivate to the Core Stage, but Chu Yunfan had completely broken this rule and their understanding.","Many people looked as if they had seen a ghost. If they hadn’t released their divine will and still felt that Chu Yunfan was unfathomable, they would have thought that they had made a mistake. He was much younger than their descendants!","Suddenly, at this moment, a figure flew out from the depths of the Monster Subduers and shouted, “Chu Yunfan! If you want to challenge my master, you’ll have to go through me first. If you can’t even defeat me, then admit defeat as soon as possible!”","Everyone looked over and saw it clearly. It was a middle-aged man in a luxurious robe. This middle-aged man had thick eyebrows and big eyes. His aura was shocking. He flew up high and confronted Chu Yunfan from afar.","“Isn’t that the chief disciple of the Demon Subduers, Yun Tian?”","“That’s right, it’s him. Although Yun Huang is the Monster Subduers’ master, he has long been out of business. In fact, Yun Tian is the Monster Subduers’ true sect master.”","“Looks like there will be more twists and turns!”"]},{"number":1421,"title":"Chapter 1421 Half-Step Core Form Stage","paragraphs":["1421 Half-Step Core Form Stage","Chu Yunfan looked at the chief disciple of the Monster Subduers, Yun Tian, who had suddenly appeared in front of him.","During this period, Wei Wuya had also sent over a lot of information about the Monster Subduers. Among them was information about Yun Tian. Although he was only the chief disciple of the Monster Subduers, he was already the sect master of the Monster Subduers.","Furthermore, it was said that Yun Tian was a orphan. Later on, Yun Huang brought him to the Monster Subduers and was made a disciple of the Monster Subduers. Therefore, Yun Tian should be a confidant of Yun Huang.","Compared to Yun Huang’s great reputation, Yun Tian’s reputation in Great Wei was much smaller. Yun Huang was the number one expert in the world, while Yun Tian was only active in the western border of Great Wei. Hence, he was not as famous as Yun Huang.","However, from the information recorded by Great Wei’s imperial family, it was not like that. Although Yun Tian was not famous, he was very strong. He had once fought with General Ye Fei, who was known as the number one person in Great Wei Army. The result of the fight was actually a draw, and neither of them could do anything to the other.","In the information of Great Wei’s imperial family, there was quite a lot of information about the Monster Subduers. After all, such a sect had already stood at the border of the empire before the establishment of Great Wei.","The Imperial Court had never been at ease with them. Even though the Monster Subduers had always maintained a neutral stance during the change of dynasties, it was just like how the old emperor had attacked Chu Yunfan. It was enough if it was too powerful.","However, compared to Chu Yunfan, who was alone, the Monster Subduers was powerful. Over the years, it had more authority than Great Wei’s imperial family at the western border of Great Wei. No one knew how many disciples had come out of the Monster Subduers. After all, other than the core disciples, there were countless outer disciples in the Monster Subduers. If the outer disciples could not break through at a certain age, they would be persuaded to leave.","Over the years, it could be said that countless forces on the western border of Great Wei were more or less related to the Monster Subduers. If they wanted to touch the Monster Subduers, the entire western border of Great Wei would probably rebel.","In addition, the Monster Subduers did not have any thoughts of rebellion. They had always been guarding the western border of Great Wei. Therefore, Great Wei’s imperial family turned a blind eye to this situation. After all, if they really fought, they might not be able to deal with the Monster Subduers.","Compared to the Monster Subduers’ massive power at the western border of Great Wei, the power of the Great Formless Sect in the southern part of Great Wei was not worth mentioning at all. They were not on the same level.","Everyone looked over as if they wanted to see how Chu Yunfan would react. In particular, many people thought that Yun Tian’s actions were equivalent to provoking and slapping his face. After all, Chu Yunfan’s opponent was Yun Huang, but Yun Tian had jumped out first.","Even though he was only a junior, Yun Tian was much older than Chu Yunfan. However, this did not change the fact that he was provoking Chu Yunfan.","To their surprise, Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He only said indifferently, “Tell your master to come out. You’re not my match, so there’s no need to waste time.”","Chu Yunfan’s words completely angered Yun Tian. Chu Yunfan was not looking down on him, but simply ignoring him. Chu Yunfan did not put him in his eyes at all. Although he was the chief disciple of the Monster Subduers by name, he was actually the sect master of the Monster Subduers. Wherever he went, others had to give him face. Even the emperor of Great Wei had to treat him with courtesy.","And this Chu Yunfan was just a junior. He was not even a fraction older than him, yet he dared to ignore his existence.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re too arrogant. Do you think you can be presumptuous just because you defeated the other five masters? Do you really think that they represent the peak of the entire Great Wei? It’s just that we don’t want to fight for these so-called titles. Otherwise, how could people like Mi Siyuan and Blood King be qualified?” Yun Tian sneered.","Chu Yunfan was silent for a moment. He had once thought that Mi Siyuan was indeed strong enough to become one of the five great experts of Great Wei. However, that was not the case. There were many hidden experts in the world.","Among the Cores who had come to the square today, there were more than a dozen late Void Cores, and each of them had cultivation far above Blood King’s. And there were even a few people among them whose cultivation was not inferior to General Ye Fei and the First Guardian that he had killed. They were all existences who had already stepped into the peak Void Core Stage.","With the existence of such people, Mi Siyuan, Blood King, and the other five experts were just a joke. If it was Chu Yunfan at that time, he might have felt a headache facing such a situation. However, for the current him, this was nothing. He had already successfully stepped into the Void Core Stage. In terms of cultivation level, he was the lowest among these people. However, in terms of combat strength, he did not care about these so-called experts at all.","“It doesn’t matter. Since you want to try, I’ll let you know that your pride is nothing in front of me!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Very well. In that case, let me teach you a lesson!” Yun Tian’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. To him, his master, Yun Huang, was the strongest person in the world. He had grown up looking at his master’s back. Now, there was actually someone who dared to challenge his master. Even if his master had personally issued a challenge, he could not accept it. If Chu Yunfan wanted to challenge his master, he had to step over his body first.","Yun Tian began to make his move. A terrifying aura erupted from his entire body. This aura soared into the sky, completely shocking all the experts present. The Cores’ expressions changed completely. Among them, there were more than a dozen late Void Cores, and there were even a few [eak Void Cores. However, in front of this imposing manner, they were nothing.","This person was already about to enter the Core Form Stage!","Everyone in the Core Form Stage understood what it meant to enter this level. That was because there was only one Core Former in Great Wei, and that was Yun Huang.","And Yun Huang was like the giant of Great Wei, no one dared to offend them.","And now, Yun Tian was probably about to step into the Core Form Stage.","Many people thought of the many legends about Yun Tian. As an orphan, he was brought back by Yun Huang and was carefully nurtured because of his outstanding talent. In the words of Yun Huang, he was a talent that could be seen by martial arts experts with the naked eye.","It could be seen how shocking Yun Tian’s talent was."]},{"number":1422,"title":"Chapter 1422 A Mid-Grade Spirit Weapon? He Was Sent Flying With a Punch!","paragraphs":["1422 A Mid-Grade Spirit Weapon? He Was Sent Flying With a Punch!","Looking at it now, it was indeed true. According to this trend, Yun Tian would step into the Core Form Stage within ten years. When that happened, the Monster Subduers would have two Core Formers. Many people knew what this meant for Great Wei.","A Core had a nationwide influence in Great Wei and could be said to be a giant. However, a Core Former was another matter.","That was a terrifying existence that completely surpassed the entire country.","If he stood on the side of the country, he would be the protector of the entire country. However, if he stood on the opposite side of the country, it would be a terrible disaster.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan. How was he going to face Yun Tian, who was already at the half-step Core Form Stage? After all, judging from the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed previously, although he was above the ordinary peak Void Core Stage, he might not be Yun Tian’s match. Chu Yunfan might have entered the half-step Core Form Stage, but that was only their guess. However, it was true that Yun Tian had entered this level.","In an instant, the square sensed the explosion of this aura. A light purple barrier was formed, protecting the entire square. Countless Monster Subduer disciples looked up at Yun Tian in the sky with admiration. If sect master Yun Huang was their god, then Yun Tian was their leader. He was the greatest hope of the Monster Subduers.","In the next moment, Yun Tian began to make his move. A terrifying attack was launched in an instant.","“Stele Strike!”","Yun Tian brought with him a terrifying aura. A huge hand pressed down on the void, setting off a terrifying tide that bore down on Chu Yunfan with an overwhelming force.","This attack had surpassed the ordinary peak Void Core Stage. It possessed a portion of the power of the Core Form Stage. It was even close to Chu Yunfan’s strength before he broke through.","At that time, although Chu Yunfan had yet to break through, his combat strength had already completely surpassed that of an ordinary peak Void Core. Otherwise, just an ordinaryp peak Void Core would not even interest Yun Huang.","After all, the Core Form Stage and the Void Core Stage were two completely different concepts.","This large hand transformed into a stele in mid-air. It was identical to the Monster Subduer Stele at the foot of the Monster Subduers’s mountain. This was the martial art created by the ancestors of the Monster Subduers based on the Monster Subduer Stele. It had the terrifying power to kill countless enemies.","Although it was not aimed in their direction, the expressions of many of the Cores in the square changed. It was truly too frightening. Even a peak Void Core could not remain completely indifferent in the face of such an attack.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at this attack. He didn’t move at all and just tore it with both hands.","Riiiiip!","Everyone heard a tearing sound and saw Chu Yunfan’s hands emitting golden light. With a terrifying power, he tore the entire Stele Strike into two halves. He directly revealed Yun Tian’s true appearance, which could not affect Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","Yun Tian’s expression changed. He had never expected that his move would be so easily broken by Chu Yunfan. A solemn expression flashed across his eyes because he finally realized that Chu Yunfan’s strength was probably not inferior to his. It was not like what he had originally expected that Chu Yunfan only slightly stronger than an ordinary peak Void Core.","It was precisely because of this deduction that he felt that he could fight on behalf of his master. A mere Chu Yunfan was not enough for his master to personally fight.","But now, it seemed that this Chu Yunfan was definitely a great enemy.","All of a sudden, Yun Tian made his move. He made a complicated seal in his hand, and his divine power began to boil crazily. Then, a small stele flew off of his body. At first glance, this stone tablet was almost identical to the huge Monster Subduer Stele at the foot of the mountain. Even the words engraved on it were identical. However, its size was much smaller, only a few meters tall. However, this stele that was only a few meters tall erupted with extremely terrifying power.","“A middle-grade spirit weapon!” one of the Cores exclaimed.","The other Cores’ expressions changed as well. The magic weapons used by Cores were naturally not the magic weapons used by ordinary people, but spirit weapons. It was just that ordinary Void Cores used low-grade spirit weapons, while Core Form Stage experts used middle-grade spirit weapons.","To refine a middle-grade spirit weapon, the various materials and wealth required were not something that ordinary factions could afford. Now, Yun Tian possessed a middle-grade spirit weapon before he had even stepped into the Core Form Stage.","One could imagine how rich the Monster Subduers was.","If it were them, they might not be able to do it even if they gathered the strength of the entire sect. This was because even if they could gather the materials, they might not be able to refine it. Weapon refinement techniques were the secret techniques of each sect. Without that foundation, it was impossible to do it.","In their hearts, besides feeling that the Monster Subduers’ foundation was indeed boundless, they also understood why Yun Tian dared to challenge Chu Yunfan so arrogantly.","With such a middle-grade spirit weapon in hand, it was almost a crushing blow when facing an expert of the same level. It was not something that an expert of the same level could contend with at all. Even Core Formers had to be careful.","However, while they were still thinking about how Chu Yunfan would respond, they saw that Chu Yunfan still had an indifferent expression on his face. Then, he threw a punch.","Boom!","There was a huge explosion, and Chu Yunfan punched out. The terrifying sound turned into a shockwave that swept in all directions. Even the purple enchantment barrier above the square was shaking violently.","Then, everyone saw that the small stele that was originally suppressed was sent flying. Yes, it was sent flying in front of everyone.","Everyone was completely dumbfounded!","There was a deathly silence, and everyone’s mouths were wide open, especially those Cores. They thought that Chu Yunfan would be injured by the small stele, or he would also take out a magic weapon to resist. This was normal, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would actually send the small stele flying with a punch."]},{"number":1423,"title":"Chapter 1423 Yun Tian’s Defeat!","paragraphs":["1423 Yun Tian’s Defeat!","“F*ck!”","Many people could not help but curse. When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, it was as if they were looking at a monster.","Who would counterattack such a middle-grade spirit weapon with their bare hands? Even a Core Former could not casually send a middle-grade spirit weapon flying with a single punch.","In fact, they had guessed correctly. Even among Core Formers, it was rare to see such a thing. Only those experts who specialized in physique cultivation could do such a thing. There were many ways to defend against a middle-grade spirit weapon, but sending it flying with a punch was undoubtedly the most terrifying method, and also the most shocking method.","Many people’s pupils could not help but shrink slightly. At this moment, they realized that they had underestimated Chu Yunfan. They had completely underestimated him!","This guy who was of unknown origin had rose at such an astonishing speed. How could such a person be an ordinary person?","Not only was everyone dumbfounded, even Yun Tian was completely dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan’s punch was too powerful. It even shook his primordial spirit in the small stele. The damage was reflected on his body and shook his internal organs.","Yun Tian’s expression finally changed. It was no longer as confident as before. He finally understood that he had probably encountered an extremely terrifying existence. No wonder even his master, who he regarded as a god, wanted to issue a battle invitation to him. It was laughable, and Yun Tian thought that Chu Yunfan was only so-so.","However, the battle had already reached this point. He naturally had no reason to retreat. He couldn’t afford to lose, and neither could the Monster Subduers.","However, before he could react, Chu Yunfan had already made his move. He shouted, “Yun Tian, since you’re so stubborn, I’ll let you experience the ultimate art I’ve recently learned. Let’s see how long you can last.”","“You’ve gone too far!” Yun Tian shouted.","Chu Yunfan’s attitude of not putting him in his eyes had completely angered him. Although he now recognized the reality and felt that he might not be as good as Chu Yunfan, he was still an expert on the same level. Chu Yunfan actually dared to look down on him like this, which made him instantly furious.","“First Netherworld Stomp!” Chu Yunfan shouted. He didn’t want to talk to Yun Tian anymore, so he stomped on Yun Tian.","In everyone’s eyes, it was as if it was no longer a foot, but a sky that was crushing down. A terrifying power accompanied the netherworld water that was formed by martial will, and it covered the sky and covered the earth as it headed toward Yun Tian.","Boom!","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to step on Yun Tian’s body, the small stele appeared on Yun Tian’s body. This middle-grade spirit weapon could be used for both offense and defense. It had endless magical uses. This was also the fundamental reason why he felt that he could compete with Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s foot landed on the small stele. With a loud sound, the stele shook violently. Yun Tian, who was inside, did not have time to be proud.","He spat out a mouthful of blood and a terrifying rebound force crushed his body, crushing all the bones in his body. He was simply like a kite with a broken string and was thrown far away.","Everyone was dumbfounded. Was this Chu Yunfan’s real attack?","Before this, he was just passively defending, but now, Chu Yunfan was truly making a move. He sent Yun Tian flying with a single step, causing him to be seriously injured.","“What kind of martial art is this? It can injure the person inside through a middle-grade spirit weapon?” a Core said with his mouth agape. This was simply an unbelievable miracle.","At this moment, they were completely convinced. Whether it was offense or defense, the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed far exceeded their imagination.","If it were them, even if a dozen Cores attacked Yun Tian, they might not be able to break through the protection of the small stele on his body. It could not hurt a single hair on Yun Tian.","However, who knew that Chu Yunfan would seriously injure Yun Tian with just one stomp?!","It took Yun Tian a long time to stray himself. A hint of fear finally flashed in his eyes. If it wasn’t for the small stele blocking most of Chu Yunfan’s strength at the critical moment, he would have been seriously injured and fainted from the stomp. He might even have been trampled to death.","Chu Yunfan actually had such terrifying strength. It was not within his expectations at all. This strength made him feel like he had a fishbone stuck in his throat.","He didn’t think of dodging Chu Yunfan’s stomp because he couldn’t dodge it. It was as if there was a terrifying force suppressing him. It was a terrifying feeling as if the sky was collapsing. After reaching his level of cultivation, it could still make him feel like it was unless to step into the Core Form Stage.","But how was that possible? He had cultivated for more than a hundred years and had yet to enter the Core Form Stage. Chu Yunfan’s age was not even a fraction of his age. How was that possible?","However, Chu Yunfan’s voice was heard.","“You managed to withstand my ultimate skill. Not bad. Unfortunately, this ends here.”","Chu Yunfan’s voice was dark, but to Yun Tian, it wasn’t that uncomfortable because he had already confirmed that Chu Yunfan really had such terrifying strength.","“Second Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and stomped down again. Compared to the First Netherworld Stomp, this stomp was even more terrifying. Even if it was just the terrifying power brought by the stomp, it actually directly broke the barrier on the square.","Fortunately, there was more than one layer of barrier on the square. Several layers were directly revived, which blocked the terrifying power of this kick.","Everyone was completely dumbfounded, especially those Cores. Many of them wanted to see if Chu Yunfan was worthy of being the second strongest expert in the world. Now, it seemed that he was more than just worthy. He was even a hundred times more terrifying than the rumors.","This second stomp landed. Just the terrifying aura alone caused Yun Tian to spit out a mouthful of blood. The small stele failed to block this aura, and it directly landed on his body. Then, he felt a foot stomping down on him.","Bam!","Yun Tian was like a comet falling, smashing into several layers of barriers before crashing into the square.","Boom!","Instantly, the marble on the square floor cracked and turned into dust, forming a monstrous wave of dust. The entire square trembled violently.","When everyone looked over, Yun Tian was motionless. He had been stomped unconscious."]},{"number":1424,"title":"Chapter 1424 The Fight of Two Experts, Everyone Was Shocked","paragraphs":["1424 The Fight of Two Experts, Everyone Was Shocked","Some people gasped. Chu Yunfan had only taken two steps, but everyone could see that he had held back.","It was only the so-called First and Second Netherworld Stomp. Then, would there be a third and fourth?","The answer to this question was self-evident in many people’s hearts. They all knew that Chu Yunfan had not tried his best in this battle.","However, Yun Tian had already done his best. He had even used his middle-grade spirit weapon. Even so, he could not fight a hearty battle. Instead, he was crushed from the beginning to the end. All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only been a short period of time. In just two or three moves, Yun Tian had already lost.","The difference between the two sides was clear at a glance. This was completely beyond everyone’s expectations. After all, in the eyes of many people, Yun Tian’s strength was probably above Chu Yunfan’s. At the very least, it should be about the same.","Who knew that Yun Tian would not be able to withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan?","At this moment, they remembered what Chu Yunfan had said before. Yun Tian was not his match and he wanted Yun Huang to come out personally. Chu Yunfan seemed to be very arrogant before, but now that they thought about it, it wasn’t because he was too arrogant. He was telling the truth.","At this moment, the Monster Subduer disciples were all glaring at Chu Yunfan. He had mercilessly knocked out their chief disciple with a single stomp. It was simply a slap in their faces.","However, many experts didn’t think so. Although Chu Yunfan had warned him, Yun Tian still rushed up. That was asking for humiliation. He couldn’t blame others.","However, the Monster Subduers disciples did not dare to be impudent. After all, even if they wanted to be impudent, they had to be able to beat them. Although the Monster Subduers did not only have Yun Tian as a Core, based on the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, he might not even be inferior to Yun Huang. No matter how many of them came, they would be courting death.","At this moment, a figure slowly walked out. Everyone focused and saw that it was none other than the current Monster Subduers master, Yun Huang.","The moment Yun Huang appeared, he appeared beside Yun Tian. After confirming that Yun Tian had fainted and was fine, he heaved a sigh of relief.","“You really came.” Yun Huang walked up step by step.","The moment the two of them looked at each other, terrifying mental power was released from their bodies. It was like two wild currents colliding fiercely.","Boom!","A violent collision sound came from the void. The two people’s mental power seemed to have formed and scattered in all directions.","The barrier on the entire square shook violently. Although it was only mental power, the cultivation of both parties was terrifying. Their mental power could turn into physical attacks. The power of the collision of mental power was already comparable to Chu Yunfan’s battle with Yun Tian.","To those Divines, seeing this scene was like seeing a miracle. Even Void Cores could not do as easily as Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang.","“You’re pretty good. You’ve reached this stage in three months,” Yun Huang said as he observed Chu Yunfan. It’s not in vain that I thought so highly of you. You didn’t disappoint me!”","Yun Huang looked at Chu Yunfan with surprise in his eyes. He could not suppress his surprise. It was not that he did not know Chu Yunfan. In fact, he knew that Chu Yunfan was only at the peak of Divine Abilities Stage. Many people were just speculating about this, but it was not difficult for Yun Huang.","In just three short months, Chu Yufan had broken through from the peak of the Divine Abilties Stage to the Void Core Stage. When Yun Huang broke through back then, it had taken him several years. Although the situation was different, Chu Yunfan had done it in just three months. It was enough to show that Chu Yunfan was indeed extraordinary.","What was even more surprising was Chu Yunfan’s combat strength. Yun Tian’s strength was second only to Yun Huang. Other than Yun Huang, there was no one in the entire Great Wei who could match Yun Tian. He didn’t expect to be defeated by Chu Yunfan so easily.","When Yun Huang first met Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan was far from this level of strength, so he was slightly surprised.","“But no matter what, Yun Tian is still my disciple. You injured my disciple, so you naturally have to pay a price,” Yun Huang said with a serious expression.","Chu Yunfan smiled and said, “You want me to pay the price? Go ahead if you can do it.”","Yun Huang’s long hair fluttered in the wind. His eyes were filled with intense light. In an instant, he started to move.","“Stele Strike!”","Yun Huang slapped out with his palm. He used the Stele Strike that Yun Tian had used previously. However, the power of the two was simply worlds apart. Just the wild tide created by the Stele Strike that Yun Huang casually slapped out almost shattered the barrier on the square. It was at least ten times the power of Yun Tian’s full strength.","This showed everyone how big the difference between the Core Form Stage and the half-step Core Form Stage was. Although it was only a half-step difference, in reality, the difference was like heaven and earth.","The spirit energy of heaven and earth within a radius of several kilometers also fluctuated violently along with his move.","Chu Yunfan became much more serious, unlike when he was facing Yun Tian, where he didn’t care at all. He retracted his fist and clenched it. A terrifying fist force was released from his fingertips and he threw a punch. In an instant, a huge golden asura appeared behind him and collided with the Stele Strike.","Boom!","The air seemed to be on the verge of exploding. Endless nature energy fluctuated violently like boiling water.","In the square, countless people’s expressions changed when they saw this scene, especially those Innates. At this moment, it was as if they were looking at two gods. Those who had already stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage could feel that it was a terrifying power that far exceeded their imagination.","However, the ones who truly felt a chill run down their spines were the Void Cores. They were also Cores, and it was because of this that they realized how big the gap between the two sides was.","This was especially true for those few peak Void Cores. Although they were reclusive, they were the top experts in the entire Great Wei. However, they realized now that the strength of these two people had far surpassed them. They had completely reached another level."]},{"number":1425,"title":"Chapter 1425 Before Absolute Strength, You Can’t Turn Overturn the Heavens","paragraphs":["1425 Before Absolute Strength, You Can’t Turn Overturn the Heavens","“Chu Yunfan actually did it?” someone exclaimed in disbelief.","Chu Yunfan actually possessed the strength to fight against Yun Huang.","“Not bad. His improvement is fast. I remember that not long ago, he could only defeat a half-step Core at most. Now, his combat strength can actually be compared to the Core Form Stage Yun Huang.”","“What’s truly terrifying is not Chu Yunfan’s current strength, but his growth speed. At this rate, who in the world can control him?”","“I finally understand why the previous emperor would take the risk to kill him. At this rate of growth, it won’t take long. In just twenty years, I’m afraid he’ll change the world with a single word!”","When everyone thought of that possibility, they couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. One had to know that twenty years was a long time for mortals, but for people like them who had achieved success in cultivation, it wasn’t that long.","Within twenty years, Chu Yunfan would be able to reach the level of being invincible. Then, at his age, he might be able to rule Great Wei for another two hundred years.","In those two hundred years, no one could stop his existence. As long as he was in a bad mood, he could overthrow Great Wei.","If they were standing in old emperor’s position, they would not be at ease either. If they had to blame someone, they could only blame the fact that a true dragon had appeared in the shallow waters of Great Wei.","In the sky, after testing the waters with what seemed like a terrifying attacks to ordinary people, the two of them charged at each other without any hesitation. No one thought that the two sides would fight like this. In an instant, in the sky, they had already fought hundreds of times.","Rumble!","The speed at which the two sides exchanged blows was so fast that ordinary people could not even see it. The improvement of martial arts brought about an all-round improvement in one’s physical fitness. Even if a Core Former was not good at speed, he would definitely be much faster than a Void Core.","At this moment, the Innates and Divines could only watch as the air in the sky began to collapse crazily for no reason. It was as if the entire sky had collapsed. They had never known that the other party’s strength could reach such a level.","They were like gods!","Those Cores gathered their divine power in their eyes. With their cultivation, it was impossible for them to see the situation of the fight clearly. They could vaguely see some shadows. Unlike Innates and Divines, who were just watching the show. However, they were even more shocked because they understood how terrifying it was.","The situation of Chu Yunfan and Yun Huang’s battle had far exceeded their understanding.","All of a sudden, everyone saw a figure take the lead in withdrawing from this crazy exchange. Everyone looked and saw that this person was none other than Yun Huang.","Many people were stunned, no one expected that the first person to retreat from such a clash would be Yun Huang.","“How is this possible?”","This was especially true for the Monster Subduers disciples. They could not accept this situation. Yun Huang, which they regarded as a god, had faltered first.","At this moment, although Yun Huang was not in a sorry state, his breathing began to quicken. However, Chu Yunfan, who appeared behind him, was different. His breathing did not even change.","“This is bad. Yun Huang has lost in terms of energy and blood. When I first started out, he was already the number one expert in the world. In terms of experience and the density of his mana, he naturally crushed ordinary people. But he’s old after all, and his qi and blood cannot be compared to young people. Moreover, his opponent is a freak like Chu Yunfan. In terms of mana, they are actually on par.”","“That’s right. He’s old. He’s going all out. He killed the old master with a random punch. Although he’s not in his twilight years, he can’t be compared to a young man like Chu Yunfan.”","“That’s right. Chu Yunfan’s blood and divine power that he lost in the battle can be replenished in an instant, but Yun Huang is different.”","Many people instantly understood why Yun Huang was the first to show weakness in such an intense battle. It was because he was too old. Especially when facing a young man like Chu Yunfan, old age was his biggest problem.","A person’s recovery ability was directly related to his physical body. The recovery ability of young people was stronger than that of the elderly. This was especially true for a freak like Chu Yunfan. With his physical cultivation base, he could fight a middle-grade spirit weapon with his bare hands. For him, he could continue fighting for three days and three nights without feeling anything.","However, if Yun Huang continued to fight at this intensity for three days and three nights, he would die from exhaustion of their blood essence.","There was no possibility for both sides to continue.","Chu Yunfan did not chase after Yun Huang because they were sparring and not fighting to the death. He just looked at Yun Huang and said, “You’d better admit defeat. You can’t outlast me!”","“I didn’t expect you to reach this level in just three months,” Yun Huang said slowly. He could not hide the shock in his heart. One had to know that three months ago, Chu Yunfan was only at the Divine Abilities Stage. Now that he had only stepped into the Void Core Stage, his combat strength had increased by so much.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was clearly not as simple as just entering the Core Form Stage. Yun Huang had entered the Core Form Stage for so long, and his cultivation had long been at the peak of the fledgeling Core Form Stage. However, when facing Chu Yunfan, he did not have the slightest advantage.","This was extremely shocking.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s calm face, he had to admit that he was really old. He did not have much chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","“If you think that’s all I have, then you’re gravely mistaken,” Yun Huang said slowly.","“It doesn’t matter. No matter what trump card you have, in the face of absolute strength, you can’t turn the tables,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","His words immediately caused an uproar among the crowd, especially among the Monster Subduers disciples, who glared at him angrily. Chu Yunfan’s words were too arrogant. What did he mean by absolute strength?","“Chu Yunfan is too arrogant. If the sect master was at his peak, how could he be inferior to him?”","“That’s right, he’s just relying on his youth.”","“So what if he’s young? It’s impossible for him to win.”","Many Monster Subduers disciples said indignantly. They themselves did not realize that they had unknowingly placed Chu Yunfan on the same level as the god in their hearts."]},{"number":1426,"title":"Chapter 1426 The Nine Netherworld Stomps Reveals Its Might Again","paragraphs":["1426 The Nine Netherworld Stomps Reveals Its Might Again","Although they thought that Chu Yunfan could not compare to Yun Huang, he was still an existence on the same level. Just by making them admit this, it was enough to overturn the idea of Yun Huang being the strongest. One could imagine how much shock Chu Yunfan had given them.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re too arrogant. In other places, you might win, but here, that’s impossible!” Yun Huang smiled.","Suddenly, he grabbed out with one hand. In the blink of an eye, the entire Monster Subduer array was activated",". Then, it began to operate crazily. In an instant, the spirit qi in the surrounding ten miles began to tremble violently, turning into qi dragons that bombarded Chu Yunfan.","Compared to when Yun Huang attacked on his own, he was clearly much stronger after borrowing the power of the Monster Subduer array. Many people immediately understood. They seemed to understand why Yun Huang chose to fight in the Monster Subduers.","He had probably been prepared for this long ago. After years of modifications, the Monster Subduers had buried countless formations around it. It was precisely because of this that he could use these formations to borrow the power of nature.","Although a Core Former could use the power of nature, it was still incomparable to the power of nature mobilized by the entire array.","When many people saw this scene, they could not help but be extremely shocked. This was Yun Huang’s true peak. He was the strongest within the Monster Subduers. He was invincible and could not be defeated.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In an instant, Yun Huang had already blasted out countless attacks. After borrowing the power of nature, his original weakness of lacking blood essence had been completely made up for.","So what if human strength was stronger? After all, how could human strength compare to the power of nature?","With the help of the power of nature, his attacks were endless and could be replenished at any time. At this time, Chu Yunfan would only be beaten to death if he fought with consumption.","“Chu Yunfan’s dead meat. Dead meat!”","Many people present said this sentence in their hearts. Many of them wished for him to die and for lose. Only in this way could the situation in Great Wei be reshuffled.","“Interesting, but you can’t do anything to me with just this method.” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. His figure moved, and countless fist shadows swept out from his hands. They were densely packed like a torrential rain, and and they bombarded Yun Huang. Behind him, the shadow of a golden roc appeared, and his speed rose to the limit.","Each of these energy dragons formed from vital qi was extremely terrifying. Under the mobilization of the Monster Subduer array, almost every one of them was no weaker than a strike from a Core Former. With hundreds and thousands of punches falling, even an ordinary Core Former could be killed by the chaotic punches.","However, Chu Yunfan was clearly not an ordinary person. He faced the difficulties head-on and fought against the overwhelming attacks without giving in.","Rumble!","The two terrifying attacks collided in an instant. The air seemed to be unable to withstand such an attack, forming a terrifying aftershock that swept in all directions. The light purple barriers over the Monster Subduers was activated one after another, protecting the entire sect. However, the ground around the Monster Subduers exploded into pieces.","Many people’s pupils contracted slightly. The battle between the two had reached a terrifying level.","“Yun Huang borrowed the power of nature to unleash an attack, but Chu Yunfan actually blocked it with his own strength?”","“How is this possible? What level has Chu Yunfan’s physical cultivation reached? His blood essence is endless!”","“Three months ago, Yun Huang personally said that Chu Yunfan was not his match. However, just three months later, everything is reversed,”","Those who had hoped for Chu Yunfan to be defeated saw this scene and their hearts sank. Chu Yunfan had fought against the power of nature by himself. Even if it was only for a short time, it was still very shocking. It was not something they could imagine.","“Chu Yunfan, try taking on another move from me!” Yun Huang roared. He casually used the Stele Strike to slap down, creating a huge hole in the sky. This huge palm print was aimed at Chu Yunfan.","This strike was much stronger than before. All the spirit energy in the vicinity of the Monster Subduers was mobilized. Under the control of Yun Huang, it bombarded Chu Yunfan.","“Hahaha, just in time!”","Chu Yunfan was not afraid at all. He jumped up and rushed up like a great roc spreading its wings. Then, he welcomed the attack.","He spread out his hands and transformed into golden light that filled the sky. In an instant, he tore apart the Stele Strike in the mid-air.","“Just this level alone is not enough to defeat me. Yun Huang, you were the one attacking just now, now it’s my turn!” Chu Yunfan flew to the highest point and looked down at Yun Huang. “Earlier, Yun Tian could only withstand two of my stomps. I wonder how many of my stomps you can withstand!”","“First Netherworld Stomp!”","Just as everyone was still in shock, the peerless martial art that had shocked everyone just now surfaced again. Chu Yunfan stomped down with his foot, bringing with him a sky full of netherworld water as he fell toward Yun Huang with an overwhelming force.","Facing Chu Yunfan’s move, Yun Huang’s expression was extremely solemn. He did not dare to underestimate it. It was this move that defeated his disciple.","“Stele Strike!” Yun Huang’s palm struck out and collided with Chu Yunfan’s Netherworld Stomp.","Boom!","After a huge explosion, everyone saw that Yun Huang did not move at all and was on par with Chu Yunfan.","The Monster Subduer disciples all looked proud. Chu Yunfan’s attack did not seem to be that powerful. However, those Void Cores did not look so relaxed, because this was only the beginning for Chu Yunfan.","“Not bad. You managed to withstand my attack. Next, Second Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan stepped out again, but compared to before, the power suddenly increased a lot.","Boom!","This attack landed directly on Yun Huang’s body. He was no longer as relaxed as before. He took a few steps back before finally stabilizing himself. However, his face turned pale and he instantly spat out a mouthful of blood.","In just an instant, he was severely injured!"]},{"number":1427,"title":"Chapter 1427 Yun Huang’s Defeat","paragraphs":["1427 Yun Huang’s Defeat","Chu Yunfan stomped on Yun Huang, and the latter retreated while vomiting blood.","Instantly, the entire square fell silent. Everyone’s eyes widened as they watched this scene. It was simply an inconceivable miracle. If they had not seen it with their own eyes, they would not have believed it. Even with the support of the Monster Subduer arrays, he was still defeated by Chu Yunfan.","Some people even felt despair. Chu Yunfan’s strength made them feel a sense of despair. Even breathing was difficult.","“Monster Subduer Stele!”","At this moment, the mini stele that was on Yun Tian’s body flew out. It turned out that this stele did not belong to Yun Tian, but to Yun Huang. Yun Huang casually summoned the mini stele over. Then, it suddenly fused into his body.","“Stele Strike!”","Yun Huang launched a counterattack. He was not willing to lose to Chu Yunfan just like that.","Boom!","As Chu Yunfan’s palm struck out, the palm intent transformed into an incomparably huge Monster Subduer Stele, which then ruthlessly smashed toward Chu Yunfan.","Compared to when it was in Yun Tian’s hands, the power of the stele in the hands of Yun Huang was at least several times stronger. It was a combination of attack and defense. All kinds of terrifying attacks exploded in an instant. These attacks turned into a tide and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. He shouted, “It’s impossible to turn the tables!” He stomped down once again, and the terrifying netherworld water boiled out from the bottom of his feet, forming an overwhelming force that suppressed the Monster Subduer Stele.","Boom!","The terrifying attacks from both sides collided once again. Yun Huang and the Monster Subduer Stele fused into one, and the power of the attack far exceeded the previous limit.","However, the power of Chu Yunfan’s Third Netherworld Stomp was clearly stronger than the previous two. Both sides had used their peak attacks, and the aftershock shattered all the clouds in a radius of more than ten miles. The aftershock swept down to the square and destroyed several layers of defensive barriers on the square. If not for the many layers of defensive barriers, the onlookers would have been affected on the spot.","Everyone’s expressions changed when they saw this scene. The two sides fought and continuously increased their attack strength. It had far exceeded everyone’s imagination.","“This is on a completely different level!”","“To have witness this battle in my lifetime, I will die without regrets!”","When those Cores, especially those at the peak of the Void Core Stage, saw this scene, they felt tears welling up in their eyes. They were so excited that they could not control themselves. It was difficult to advance to the Core Form Stage. They might never have such an opportunity in their lifetime.","They could only guess at everything about the Core Form Stage and had never seen it for themselves. However, now, they had finally seen the Core Form Stage in action. It truly made them understand what kind of extent human strength could achieve. To them, this was tantamount to pointing out the clear path.","Before they could think further, the outcome of the battle between the two sides had already been decided. However, in this terrifying collision, a figure was the first to fly out. Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was none other than the Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang.","“What? How is thus possible?”","Many people gasped and were in disbelief.","Yun Huang failed. After fusing with the Monster Subduer Stele, his strength had returned to its peak. However, he still failed in the collision with Chu Yunfan.","The Monster Subduer disciples, in particular, could not believe that their god-like sect master would fail. This was simply impossible in their previous thoughts.","“How can the sect master be inferior to Chu Yunfan?!” a disciple shouted. Everyone in the Monster Subduers couldn’t believe it.","Spurt!","Yun Huang coughed up a mouthful of blood. He felt a lump in his chest as his internal organs shook violently. Under the attack just now, he had used all his strength to fight Chu Yunfan, but in the end, he had failed. No matter how unwilling he was, he had to accept the fact that Chu Yunfan was powerful.","His eyes flashed with disbelief. In just three months, Chu Yunfan had already become so powerful, even though he wanted Chu Yunfan to be his opponent and his whetstone. However, he did not want Chu Yunfan to be completely above him.","Chu Yunfan looked coldly at Yun Huang. “Not bad, you can withstand my Third Netherworld Stomp. You can be considered worthy of your name, but everything ends here. I’ll finish you off with the next move!”","Chu Yunfan expressed his approval of Yun Huang, but at this moment, no one felt that there was anything wrong. They felt that Chu Yunfan was indeed qualified to comment on Yun Huang.","Many people were shocked to discover that Chu Yunfan could even replace Yun Huang to become the number one. And all of this was in the final move—-the final move that would determine the victor.","It was not a long battle like many people had imagined. The difference between the two sides was already clear, so clear that Yun Huang could not last any longer.","“Brother Fan is going to win. I told you that he wouldn’t lose!” Chu Hongcai shouted from among the crowd on the square. This had attracted the dissatisfaction of many Monster Subduer disciples. However, he did not care.","When they had just arrived, they had suffered a lot of looks of disdain. Many Monster Subduer disciples had even mocked them for overestimating themselves. And everyone thing had been now thrown back in their faces.","“You want to defeat me? Impossible!” Yun Huang shouted. He grabbed at the air with both hands and grabbed onto the nature spirit energy in the surroundings at a terrifying level. He gathered all the nature spirit energy within a radius of ten miles.","Then, it crazily surged into his body. This was a secret technique that could borrow the power of nature, which made his aura several levels stronger. It turned into a terrifying tide that swept toward Chu Yunfan. Another Monster Subduer Stele suddenly suppressed him.","Chu Yunfan also made his move.","“Fourth Netherworld Stomp!”","On the fourths stomp, Chu Yunfan’s movements were a little sluggish. He could not move as smoothly as before because he had already used all his strength.","“Boom!","The two sides collided again. The power that seemed to be able to destroy the world shattered the void, and everyone’s vision was blocked. Before everyone could react, they saw a figure being sent flying.","That person was none other than Yun Huang.","Everyone gasped.","Yun Huang had lost!"]},{"number":1428,"title":"Chapter 1428 The World’s Number One Expert Changes Hand","paragraphs":["1428 The World’s Number One Expert Changes Hand","Everyone gasped.","Yun Huang had lost!","This time, Yun Huang crashed into the square and was heavily injured. He spat out a mouthful of blood and looked extremely miserable. He was no longer as high-spirited as before. Everyone felt the defensive barriers in the Monster Subduers had suddenly activated, and all kinds of attacks were locked on Chu Yunfan.","The Monster Subduer disciples were furious. Chu Yunfan had crippled two of their sect’s pillars as soon as he came up. One could imagine how angry they were toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t someone who would just sit around and do nothing. He naturally wasn’t someone who would submit to adversity. He just sneered and the netherworld water boiled under his feet. He looked like he was going to perform another stomp, wanting to flatten the entire mountain.","Without Yun Huang restraining him, he did not put the Monster Subduers in his eyes. As the saying went, one could attack or retreat. How could the Monster Subduers deal with him?","However, at this moment, a voice sounded.","“Stop!”","Everyone raised their heads and saw that the person was none other than the Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang.","He slowly stood up and pulled on his wound as he coughed up another mouthful of blood. The disciples were furious, but they did not dare to disobey their master. They could only give up on the idea of keeping Chu Yunfan here.","Yun Huang slowly walked into the air and said, “Thank you for showing mercy.”","When everyone heard Yun Huang’s words, they realized that although Chu Yunfan seemed to have used his full strength, he was actually holding back.","Of course, no one would underestimate Yun Huang because of this. However, their evaluation of Chu Yunfan became even higher and they were even more shocked. In such a battle, if it were them, they would only care about attacking and not care about anything else. If Chu Yunfan attacked with all his strength, then they might be the ones to lose.","And Chu Yunfan was still able to hold back in this battle. This in itself was already a miracle. This meant that from the beginning to the end, everything was under his control, and he was still able to hold back. It could be seen how powerful Chu Yunfan was.","Even in a battle that was unimaginable to ordinary people, he still had the strength to fight.","“It’s only been three months. How did he become so much stronger in just three months?”","“The number one expert in the world... The number one has changed hands!”","“That’s right. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I’m afraid I wouldn’t have believed it. Chu Yunfan is terrifying!”","Everyone instantly shouted as if a pot of oil had exploded. They all knew one thing. After today’s battle, regardless of whether they were willing or not, they had to admit that the number one expert in the world had changed hands.","Previously, it was Yun Huang, but now, it was Chu Yunfan.","Compared to Yun Huang who had already passed the peak of middle age, Chu Yunfan had just reached the age of a youth among cultivators. Chu Yunfan’s future was simply limitless","Many people hoped to use Yun Huang to suppress Chu Yunfan, but it seemed like that was not a good idea. Yun Huang was not Chu Yunfan. Furthermore, with Yun Huang’s age, he would not be able to last for many years. Even Yun Tian would probably had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan. After today, Chu Yunfan will be the only one in the world.","In addition, he had used the title of imperial advisor to absorb all kinds of resources from Great Wei. His future achievements were simply unimaginable.","The Monster Subduer disciples cried tears of unwillingness. They had bathed in the title of the number one expert in the world for too long. For many people, from the moment they were born, the number one expert in the world had already belonged to their sect. They were also used to their sect master being the number one. No one could shake their status.","And now, right under their noses, the throne of number one had been swapped to Chu Yunfan. Unconsciously, two lines of tears flowed out.","The representatives and experts of the other major forces were also extremely emotional. Their senses were not as direct, but they were still very shocked. This was an unprecedented change in Great Wei in the past hundred years.","With the rise of a new number one expert in the world, no one would be able to shake Chu Yunfan’s position in the foreseeable future. Yun Huang was not defeated by just one move. Everyone present had seen that he was completely crushed by Chu Yunfan from the beginning to the end. Even the Monster Subduer disciples were indignant and angry, but they had nothing to say.","Chu Yunfan did not resort to trickery. In fact, Yun Huang used trickery and borrowed the power of heaven and earth around the Monster Subduers. However, even so, he still lost to Chu Yunfan. It could be said that he had lost without a word.","As for Yun Huang’s gratitude, Chu Yunfan nodded his head slightly. He did not intend to kill them. It was just a spar, so there was no need to kill them.","Furthermore, three months ago, Yun Huang had the chance to turn the tide of the world. At that time, Chu Yunfan was not Yun Huang’s match, but Yun Huang did not kill him and gave him a chance instead. Chu Yunfan was just returning the favor.","After Yun Huang stabilized his injuries, he thought of other things. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to create a miracle in three months. However, he did not regret it because he did not want to kill Chu Yunfan. He wanted an opponent strong enough to fight with all his strength.","And Chu Yunfan did it. Not only did he do it, but he also did it extremely well.","“It’s just a spar, Master Yun. Don’t take it to heart,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","This made the people below feel a little strange. They didn’t know what kind of riddles these two people were playing, especially since it was the first time they were seeing Chu Yunfan. At this time, they felt that he didn’t seem as unreasonable and aggressive as the rumors say.","They felt as if the previous rumors were all wrong. However, when they thought about how Chu Yunfan had killed several experts without hesitation, they were suddenly confused.","Who was Chu Yunfan?","“No matter what, you showed mercy to me and Yun Tian. I have to acknowledge this favor,” Yun Huang said. Although he was defeated, his pride did not allow him to get away with this.","People may lose, but not their dignity.","“I believe that after this battle, your breakthrough will be on the horizon, Master Yun,” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","For a time, his words shocked everyone."]},{"number":1429,"title":"Chapter 1429 The World’s General Situation Is Set!","paragraphs":["1429 The World’s General Situation Is Set!","Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s words.","Yun Huang was about to break through!","What was going on?","Some quickly came to a realization. This matter had been fishy from the beginning. The former emperor had spent a lot of money to invite Yun Huang to the capital, but unexpectedly, Yun Huang let Chu Yunfan off in front of the army. He proposed a three-month battle agreement, and Chu Yunfan unexpectedly agreed and came to fight. After the two sides fought, they stopped.","It turned out that Yun Huang was about to break through!","Everyone now understood why Yun Huang had let Chu Yunfan off. He wanted to use Chu Yunfan to pressure him so that he could break through.","Everyone knew this method very well because they had encountered it before and had even used this method. Many times, it was better to have a big battle than to cultivate. But to the current Yun Huang, this method was very difficult. At his level, people who could give him such pressure could be said to be very rare.","No such person existed in Great Wei. Even the Half-Step Core Form Yun Tian would not be a match for Yun Huang if he went all out and would only be completely crushed. Hence, to achieve such an effect, Yun Huang had to find another way. And Chu Yunfan’s existence clearly gave him another choice. That was why there was this unprecedented battle.","In the eyes of many people, this battle had started inexplicably and ended inexplicably. Both sides knew their limits.","And now, they finally understood that this was the reason.","The Monster Subduer disciples, who had been feeling like they had lost their parents, all revealed expressions of surprise. They had not expected such a turn of events. To them, this meant that Yun Huang had a high chance of regaining the title of the number one. Although he was defeated now, after he broke through, he should be stronger than Chu Yunfan. At that time, he would naturally become the number one again.","“That’s right. Through this battle, I’ve understood a lot, and this is all thanks to your help,” Yun Huang said. Chu Yunfan clearly knew his goal, but he was still willing to help him. This made him feel extremely grateful.","This battle was far more effective than he had imagined because Chu Yunfan’s pressure on him was much stronger than he had imagined. He had even beaten him to the point where he could not fight back.","In the struggle, he comprehended many things that he could not normally comprehend. The advancement of his cultivation was in front of him.","“It’s fine. Piece of cake.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“Why is Brother Fan helping his enemy? When Yun Huang recovers, his cultivation will improve greatly. I’m afraid he will come to take back the title of number one...!” Chu Hongcai muttered.","He was a little dissatisfied. The joy from Chu Yunfan winning had weakened a lot.","“Oh, you.” Chu Yaowei smiled and shook his head. “You don’t understand. To us, that title may be very important, but to Yunfan, it’s just an empty title. Do you think he cares about it?”","Chu Hongcai thought about it, and it seemed to be the case. Chu Yunfan was not a person who was keen on fame and fortune. Otherwise, Chu Hongcai would not have become the heir of the King of Chu. He could even be the next King of Chu.","“But even so, we can’t just give it to Yun Huang for no reason,” Chu Hongcai said gloomily.","“Do you think it’s that simple? Yun Huang will definitely welcome a breakthrough soon, but do you think that’s all Brother Fan has? With his cultivation speed, he might break through faster than Yun Huang.”","Chu Yaowei couldn’t help but sigh. He was also very emotional in his heart. Like most people, he was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed. It was simply unbelievable.","In such a short period, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had soared like a rocket, so he was not too worried about the future. Yun Huang could achieve a breakthrough, but that was his limit. It was impossible for him to achieve a greater breakthrough in a short period. However, Chu Yunfan was different. His breakthrough speed was simply shocking. Whether it was the Void Core Stage or the Core Form Stage, it was clearly not his limit.","To him, Great Wei was just shallow water. A true dragon had appeared in shallow water. He clearly would not set his sights on the so-called number one expert in the world from Great Wei.","That was the difference between an eagle in the sky and an ant on the ground. They could not be mentioned in the same breath.","Chu Hongcai thought about it for a moment and realized that it was indeed as Chu Yaowei said. He immediately felt relieved.","“When I have a breakthrough, I will come and challenge you again and take back my title,” Yun Huang said slowly but firmly.","His eyes flashed with determination. To Chu Yunfan, this title did not matter at all because it was useless to him. However, he was different. Because he carried the entire Monster Subduers, the title was very important to him.","The difference between the world’s number one and number two seemed to be just a hair’s breadth, but in reality, the difference was difficult to measure. People would only remember the number one, and not many people would have the mood to pay attention to the number two.","“I look forward to it.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Since you’re already here, I’d like to invite you in for a chat, Master Chu.” Yun Huang looked at Chu Yunfan and extended an invitation.","“All right.” Chu Yunfan didn’t refuse and immediately agreed.","The two of them stepped into the depths of the Monster Subduers, one after the other.","At this moment, everyone seemed to have just woken up from a dream and suddenly realized something. No one had expected that it would end up like this. The two who seemed like they were going to fight to the death before were peaceful to one another.","Everyone looked at each other in bewilderment. However, they all understood that from today onwards, the entire world’s situation would be completely reversed.","For the current Imperial Court of Great Wei, Chu Yunfan’s victory was naturally an unprecedented good thing. It also meant that the entire Imperial Court had finally stabilized.","The major forces that hoped to reshuffle the cards had to admit the reality. As long as Chu Yunfan was around, it was impossible for them to overturn the situation.","The world’s situation was set."]},{"number":1430,"title":"Chapter 1430 A Big Harvest","paragraphs":["1430 A Big Harvest","Chu Yunfan stayed in the Monster Subduers as a guest for three days. When he left, he felt that he had gained a lot. Although he had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, many things still needed to be comprehended personally.","In the Core Stage, although Yun Huang’s battle strength was inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, the time he spent in the Core Stage was a hundred times more than Chu Yunfan’s.","Many of his experiences gave Chu Yunfan a feeling of enlightenment. He had originally only known about it, but now it had turned into his own understanding. And in these three days, the gains from Yun Huang far exceeded Chu Yunfan’s.","To Chu Yunfan, the path ahead was clear. It was just how to make the path under his feet firmer. However, to Yun Huang, the path ahead was broken. Although he was not unprecedented in the Monster Subduers, he was at the glass ceiling. At this point, guidance from those in front were few and far between.","Chu Yunfan’s appearance, even if it was just a casual pointer, was a direction for his future cultivation. This was undoubtedly very important to him. Combined with the experience of his predecessors in the Monster Subduers, he had found a way to take a step further.","Yun Huang was different from Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties, but he was about to enter his twilight years. The later he went, the faster death approached. The cultivation of martial artists was a process of defying the heavens and taking lives. If he couldn’t advance further before his lifespan was exhausted, he would lose all hope.","And now, Chu Yunfan had given him hope to take another step forward.","Although Yun Tian wanted to speak, it was clear that he did not have the ability to do so in front of the two of them. He could only listen to them discuss the Dao. However, just through listening, his comprehension had increased greatly.","The three of them had gained a lot of benefits. Each of them had their own comprehension, and no one was at a disadvantage.","During the three days of Dao discussion, the faint hostility between them disappeared, especially Yun Tian, who was originally unconvinced of Chu Yunfan. He had always thought that other than his master, Yun Huang, the second strongest expert in the world should be him. Who knew that this Chu Yunfan who suddenly appeared wanted to provoke his master.","He couldn’t bear to just watch, but after a series of battles, he had completely understood that Chu Yunfan’s strength was not something he could compete with. Even his master was not a match for him at this stage.","In fact, this gap might even widen as time passed. After understanding this, he no longer pursued defeating Chu Yunfan. This way, the relationship between the three was much more harmonious.","During these three days, as they sat down and discussed the Dao, the entire world had also undergone a world-shaking change because of the previous battle.","Originally, many people had suffered great losses in this reshuffle of the Imperial Court, especially the loyal factions of the various princes and the former emperor. They had all been purged. After all, no matter how much the new emperor wanted to win people over, these people still had to be eliminated. And with Chu Yunfan’s support, there was no need to worry about the future.","Thus, many people placed their hopes on Yun Huang, hoping that he could defeat Chu Yunfan and change the situation. However, they had no choice but to give up because of that shocking battle.","Even Yun Huang could not stop Chu Yunfan, let alone the others. They could not help but give up and accept this reality. Many factions that were eager to make a move entered a dormant stage.","After all, compared to the new emperor who controlled the power of the entire world, their strength was too weak, and Chu Yunfan was too young. It could be said that in the next few generations, it was unlikely Chu Yunfan would be overthrown. Under such circumstances, they had no choice but to enter a dormant state.","For a moment, the situation of the world was great, as if they had entered another golden age. Many people knew that this was because of Chu Yunfan’s decisive battle strategy. Although there were many casualties, the war and the world was settled in a short time. The basic order of Great Wei had not been disrupted. As for the 100,000 to 200,000 casualties, no one would care. For the kingdom, the losses were just a scratch. It was far from a battle that hurt their bones.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left the Monster Subduers, an imperial edict came from the capital. The sect master of the Monster Subduers, Yun Huang, was appointed as imperial advisor alongside Chu Yunfan.","For a moment, the world was in an uproar. No one had expected such a change to happen in such a short time. However, most could see clearly that although Yun Huang had lost to Chu Yunfan in the battle, it was only because he not Chu Yunfan’s match. When facing others, he still had an overwhelming advantage. The others had no way to fight against such an existence, and Yun Huang indeed had the qualifications to become an imperial advisor.","However, it was also because of this that some rumors spread. There was no doubt that the new emperor, Wei Wuya, did this to guard against Chu Yunfan and form a balance. Although Yun Huang had been defeated, he was the only person who could restrain Chu Yunfan.","Wei Wuya’s motive for doing this was obvious. In many people’s eyes, there might be a rift between the two sides.","In the eyes of many people, this was the best opportunity.","However, Yun Huang accepted this title and Chu Yunfan did not say anything. This caused many people who had high hopes to feel extremely disappointed.","For Chu Yunfan, these things would happen sooner or later. Distrust and suspicion were engraved in the bones of almost every emperor. It was impossible to change just because someone had changed. Moreover, he and Wei Wuya had only joined forces to seize the world for their own benefit, and there wasn’t much of a relationship between them to begin with.","These things would happen sooner or later, so Chu Yunfan did not care. He did not want to usurp the throne and become the emperor himself. In fact, he could not stay in Great Wei for long, so he naturally just looked on coldly and did not care.","When he returned to his imperial advisor’s residence in the capital, someone unexpectedly came to visit him."]},{"number":1431,"title":"Chapter 1431 Small Pill Origin Meet","paragraphs":["1431 Small Pill Origin Meet","In a pavilion in the back garden of the imperial advisor’s residence.","The three of them sat facing each other. Chu Yunfan took a sip of wine and put down his glass. He looked at the two people in front of him with a faint smile.","One of them was someone he was familiar with— the president of Conglong’s Alchemist Guild, Kong Buyi. Beside him was an old man who looked to be in his sixties or seventies. This old man was dressed in a luxurious robe and exuded a shrewd and capable aura.","“Master Chu, let me introduce you. This is the chief president of Great Wei’s Alchemist Association, Gongsun Wulong,” Kong Buyi broke the silence and introduced.","“So, it’s President Gongsun. I’ve heard a lot about you,” Chu Yunfan said as he cupped his hands.","As the chief president of Great Wei’s Alchemist Association, Gongsun Wulong was naturally considered a big shot at the peak of power throughout Great Wei. Moreover, Chu Yunfan could tell that Gongsun Wulong’s cultivation was not weak and was at the Void Core Stage. Although he was only at the fledgling Void Core Stage, he could be considered one of the top figures in the world in terms of strength.","Of course, in front of Chu Yunfan, it was nothing. Gongsun Wulong could only be considered one of the most powerful people in the world, while Chu Yunfan was the strongest in the world.","Chu Yunfan’s influence was even greater than the current emperor. Who would dare to underestimate his existence?","“Master Chu, you’re too polite.”","Gongsun Wulong looked at Chu Yunfan with emotion. When he first knew Chu Yunfan, it was because he has passed four alchemist test in one go and easily went from an apprentice alchemist to a senior alchemist. If it wasn’t for the fact that he couldn’t take the alchemy expert examination in Conglong, Chu Yunfan might have become an alchemy expert in one go.","At that time, Gongsun Wulong had sighed with emotion. Chu Yunfan was a genius in alchemy. In the next generation, it would be difficult to find a match for him. It was even very likely that he would become the next chief president of Great Wei’s Alchemist Society.","Who knew that in the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already become one of the few martial arts experts in the world. Then, he began his counterattack and even successfully defeated Yun Huang, becoming the number one expert in the world.","This speed was so fast that it was dazzling. It had already happened before anyone could understand. Gongsun Wulong was considered a legendary figure in Great Wei, but compared to Chu Yunfan, he was insignificant.","“It’s a pity that you didn’t take the Alchemist Society’s assessment in the Imperial Capital, Master Chu. Otherwise, we would have been able to see an unprecedented person who advanced from a commoner to an alchemy expert in a single day,” Gongsun Wulong sighed and said that this was a regret in his heart.","After all, that would have been legendary. Judging from Chu Yunfan’s strength, this was definitely possible.","“Hahahaha, it doesn’t matter. It’s just a title.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. At first, he needed the identity of a senior alchemist, but now, he naturally didn’t have much of a need for it.","When Gongsun Wulong saw this, he felt a little pity. He knew that Chu Yunfan might not be interested in continuing to take the alchemy expert examination. Although he would become a legend and the youngest alchemy expert, it was clear that compared to Chu Yunfan’s current strength and reputation, it was nothing.","“May I know why you’ve come to me today, President Gongsun?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“The Alchemist Association’s headquarters will be holding the Small Pill Origin Meet. At that time, all the senior alchemists and alchemy experts from various Alchemist Associations will be attending,” Gongsun Wulong said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","“Small Pill Origin Meet? What’s that?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“You should know by now that our association is spread all over the world. I’m only the president of the Great Wei’s branch, but above us, there’s still the main guild. Now, the main guild is going to hold a Small Pill Origin Meet. The purpose is to give all the alchemists a chance to interact with each other. Moreover, all the alchemists will take out medicinal herbs that they don’t need and trade them at the gathering. Many rare top-grade medicinal herbs will appear at the gathering,” Gongsun Wulong explained.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood. To put it bluntly, this Small Pill Origin Meet was a gathering organized by the Alchemist Association. However, the threshold of this gathering was very high. Only senior alchemists had the opportunity to participate.","What level of existence was a high-grade alchemist? Someone like Kong Buyi could oversee a large city and become the president of a city-level alchemist association, And this was only the minimum requirement for entering the Small Pill Origin Meet.","One could imagine how high the standards of this Small Pill Origin Meet were. In addition, many rare medicinal herbs could be exchanged at the gathering. This had a huge attraction to ordinary alchemists. And this Small Pill Origin Meet was a reflection of the legendary Pill Origin Gathering held by the gods and Buddhas.","“Although it was originally just a small gathering of Alchemists, as time passed, it has now spontaneously formed an extremely lively market. Many ordinary alchemists will travel thousands of miles to go there. In addition, there are some experts who want to sell or buy medicinal herbs,” Gongsun Wulong continued, “And Master Chu is a high-level alchemist registered our Great Wei, so we naturally have to inform about this gathering.”","Chu Yunfan looked at Gongsun Wulong with a faint smile and said, “President Gongsun, you aren’t the truth, are you? If it was just a small matter like this, you could have just sent someone to inform me. Why would two presidents come personally?”","Gongsun Wulong smiled bitterly and said, “As expected, nothing can be hidden from you, Master Chu. In fact, the original purpose of the Small Pill Origin Meet was to give alchemists from all over the world a chance to interact with each other. But now, it has long been different. It has already become a place for alchemists from all over the world to spar with each other.","“Althought you’re not an alchemy expert on the register, I can tell that your strength isn’t inferior to that of one. If you’re willing to join forces with us, our ranking this time won’t be so awful.”","Gongsun Wulong saw that he couldn’t hide it from Chu Yunfan, so he immediately told the truth.","This was definitely not just a simple gathering. In fact, this included the open and secret struggles between the forces of various countries. It was not as simple as it seemed on the surface."]},{"number":1432,"title":"Chapter 1432 Arrangement and Departure","paragraphs":["1432 Arrangement and Departure","Chu Yunfan finally understood. It was similar to what he had guessed. In this area, besides Great Wei and Jingzhanghan, there was the kingdom of Great Qi to the east of Great Wei. It was basically a situation where three forces stood side by side.","Relatively speaking, Jingzhanghan was the most powerful in terms of military strength, followed by Great Qi. Great Wei was at the bottom in all aspects. Because Great Wei had been established for the shortest time, it could not compare to the other two sides in many aspects.","However, just Great Wei alone was huge. Therefore, many people were not very clear that there were other countries outside Great Wei. To them, Great Wei was the entire world.","Although the three kingdoms did not have large-scale wars in recent years, there was no lack of open and secret struggles. Although the Alchemist Associations of each country were subordinate organizations of the headquarters, their members were all locals of each country. Therefore, it was inevitable for them to be hostile to each other. Under the strict ban of the headquarters, they had to maintain harmony on the surface, but there was no lack of scheming in the dark, and this Small Pill Origin Meet was a microcosm of the three great countries’ open and secret struggles.","Among the three kingdoms, Great Wei’s Alchemist Association had been at the bottom for years. Gongsun Wulong was starting to get anxious. This would have a huge impact on his promotion to the headquarters. Therefore, he came to find Chu Yunfan, a high-level alchemist who was suspected to have the strength of an alchemy expert.","“Is the strength of Great Wei that weak?” Chu Yunfan asked with some doubt. In fact, the strength of Great Wei’s Alchemist Association was far above the Alchemist Association of the Federation.","The Federation’s Alchemist Association, which had just developed for hundreds of years, could not compare to Great Wei in this aspect. It could not even be compared to a fraction of Great Wei. But even with such powerful skills, it had been at the bottom of the rankings for years.","“I won’t hide it from you, Master Chu. In the past years of the competition between the three kingdoms, Great Wei has always been at the bottom. It’s not only our association, but the overall strength of Great Wei is weak among the kingdom.”","Gongsun Wulong told a cruel truth. The weakest of the three kingdoms, Great Wei, had no other choice, especially when facing Jinzhanghan. They could only defend themselves.","“In the Small Pill Origin Meet, the true deciding factor is the number of alchemy experts. However, the total number of alchemy experts in Great Wei is only a handful while those in Great Qi and Jinzhanghan far exceeds this,” Gongsun Wulong said, “In addition, some of us have to stay in Great Wei and can’t all go together. Only two or three of us can go each time, and we end up being at the bottom in the end. But this time, we hope you will come with us, Master Chu. At that time, the scene will be much better than before.”","Chu Yunfan could tell that Gongsun Wulong’s greatest hope was to make Great Wei look better. He had never thought of winning. After all, whether it was in terms of foundation or the strength and number of alchemists, Great Wei was far inferior.","It was already good enough that he did not look so bad. As for winning, that was undoubtedly a fantasy. Alchemy required experience from countless failures. A seemingly inconspicuous discovery could be the result of countless repeated experiments. He couldn’t use any tricks.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and said, “All right, I’ll participate in the Small Pill Origin Meet. When and where it will be?!”","Gongsun Wulong was overjoyed and said, “That’s great! With you joining us, Master Chu, our strength will increase greatly. This time, the meet will be held in a basin in the northern outer region in a month.”","In his opinion, with Chu Yunfan’s participation, their strength would immediately increase greatly. Even Kong Buyi, who was beside him, revealed a somewhat excited expression.","Chu Yunfan nodded and did some calculations. He was going to the outer realm to find news of Tang Siyu anyway, so it was impossible for him to stay in Great Wei permanently.","Since Yun Huang had accepted the title of imperial advisor, it had officially expressed the Monster Subduers’ stance. With Yun Huang and Monster Subduers backing them, the various large factions in the world had to be careful. Even without Chu Yunfan, it would not affect the world’s situation. This way, he could leave without worry.","And this Small Pill Origin Meet was a pretty good opportunity. As for making the situation not too ugly, he had never thought of such a boring thing. Since he was going, he had to become the champion.","He could also take a look at the strength of alchemy in the Spirit Realm and see how far it had developed. However, he did not tell Kong Buyi and Gongsun Wulong these words. To the two of them, these were undoubtedly beyond the limits of their imagination.","“Master Chu, are you planning to leave with us? Or do you want to wait for a while before rushing over yourself?” Gongsun Wulong asked again.","“I can go on my own. With time and an address, I’ll get there,” Chu Yunfan said. Anyway, he had a whole month, so he was not in a hurry.","“All right, then we’ll get ready to go on our way,” Gongsun Wulong said.","Then, Gongsun Wulong and Kong Buyi left.","Chu Yunfan began to arrange the matters in Great Wei. He first went to the imperial palace and told Emperor Wei Wuya about his departure. Wei Wuya’s expression was extremely complicated. He was reluctant to let Chu Yunfan leave, but also relieved.","He didn’t want Chu Yunfan to leave when the situation was yet completely stable. On the other hand, Chu Yunfan didn’t have any thoughts of going further, which made him heave a sigh of relief. This was the best situation he had expected. If Chu Yunfan didn’t fight for power, he could relax.","“Master Chu, do you really have to leave? I still need your help,” Wei Wuya said after taking a deep breath.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Wei Wuya and said, “With Master Yun’s help, you don’t have to worry about others rebelling, Your Majesty. It’s actually the same with or without me.”","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had seen through his intentions, Wei Wuya couldn’t help but feel a little embarrassed. However, he quickly regained his composure and said, “In that case, I won’t force you to stay. I’ll announce to the public that the imperial advisor is in seclusion.”","“Yeah, sure.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","After speaking to Wei Wuya, Chu Yunfan returned to the imperial advisor residence. After informing Chu Yaowei of this matter, he immediately left the capital and rushed to the meet."]},{"number":1433,"title":"Chapter 1433 A Shocking Change on a Rainy Night","paragraphs":["1433 A Shocking Change on a Rainy Night","After leaving the imperial capital, Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to rush to the meet. Otherwise, with his speed, even with the meet being held in the outer realm and was far away, he would need less than a day to get there.","After stepping into the Void Core Stage, his strength in all aspects had undergone earth-shaking changes. It was not just his combat strength that had a huge improvement, but his speed was also different from before.","In the past, it would have taken at least two to three days for him to get there. But now, he didn’t even need a day if flying at full speed. Moreover, there was still a month left. Chu Yunfan walked north and visited the mountains and rivers.","After one’s cultivation reached the Core Stage, it was a completely different matter from the Divine Abilities Stage. One’s comprehension of nature far exceeded that of the Divine Abilities Stage. It was far from being as simple as self-cultivation. The human body was like a small world. However, even so, there was an end to human strength. The only way was to accommodate oneself in the world and borrow the power of the world.","Of course, Chu Yunfan’s so-called tour of the mountains and rivers was not just a an ordinary tour. His speed was too fast. Even if he didn’t use the flying light, he could easily travel thousands of miles in a day. It was easy for him to cross mountains and rivers.","Along the way, he saw a lot of things, and he felt that his heart was much broader. This was because after he entered the Core Stage, his perspective on things was completely different from before.","Even after inheriting the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he still lacked these insights. For Chu Yunfan, the Alchemy Emperor’s memories were just a database, but for comprehension of martial arts, he had to rely on himself. Otherwise, the Alchemy Emperor’s fate would be his future.","As he hurried along, Chu Yunfan was waiting for news. Great Wei’s Imperial Court had been overturned and was now in Wei Wuya’s hands. Naturally, the Agency of Secrets had also fallen into Wei Wuya’s hands.","Because of the former director’s involvement with the former emperor, he had no choice but to commit suicide to apologize. Soon after, Wei Wuya promoted one of his trusted aides to become the head of the agency, and Chu Yunfan gave him the task of using the agency’s entire intelligence network to find Tang Siyu.","After all, the Spirit Realm was too big. Chu Yunfan had no way of finding her alone. However, it was different with the agency even though the strength of Great Wei was the lowest among the three countries.","It was the power of the entire country. In addition, it was going all out. The intelligence network was fully operational, and its power was naturally extraordinary, News about Tang Siyu was passed to Chu Yunfan one by one, and he came to his own deduction about her whereabouts. The most likely possibility was that she had already left this area. Otherwise, with all the major forces looking for her whereabouts, it was impossible that there was no trace of her.","What Chu Yunfan wanted to do was to make his name known. He was like a beacon in the dark. As long as Tang Siyu heard about him, she would naturally come to him. It would be much more convenient that way.","But before that, Chu Yunfan still had many things to do.","Half a month later, in the depths of a mountain forest thousands of miles north of the border of Great Wei, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in a temple built at some point in time. In front of him, a pile of fire burned fiercely, illuminating the temple in the night.","The temple had not been maintained for a long time and was in ruins. The wind and rain outside were fierce, and the heavy rain covered everything. The sound of the rainstorm could be heard.","The broken roof was not supposed to be able to withstand such a violent storm, but it seemed to be under the effect of a mysterious force. It bounced in the sky and did not collapse.","Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in front of the bonfire. In less than half a month, he had already crossed mountains and ridges as if he was walking on flat ground and left Great Wei. In his hand was the last piece of information sent by the agency before he left. On this piece of information were the names of various sects.","These sects were all from the outer realm, and many of them were famous first-class sects. Although they couldn’t compare to Nine Stars, they were basically established by Cores and were very powerful.","“Interesting. A total of thirteen sects joined in the encirclement and suppression of Siyu.” Chu Yunfan sneered coldly.","When Tang Siyu was besieged by Nine Stars, these sects had all taken action. They only had one goal, which was to please Nine Stars. Now that Tang Siyu was not around, Chu Yunfan, as her fiancé, naturally had to seek justice for her.","“Let’s do this one by one. We’ll start with the nearest Purity Sect. There’s still time anyway,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Suddenly, he heard hurried footsteps and frowned. He saw a figure jump in as if he was running for his life. Then, he lay on the ground and stopped moving.","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a middle-aged man drenched in sweat. However, there was a shocking knife wound on his back that pierced through his entire body, almost cutting him in half.","Before Chu Yunfan could figure out what was going on, he heard a loud rumble. Then, he saw the door of the temple, which was not very sturdy, explode.","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze over. In the pouring rain, the vision of ordinary people was blocked, but how could it block Chu Yunfan?","He could only tell that it was a group of six cavalrymen. Each of these cavalrymen was dressed in black, and their bodies emitted an extremely fierce aura. Even if the torrential rain fell on them, they seemed to be repelled by a wave of energy.","The horses they rode on were tall and sturdy. They were at least three meters tall and looked like monsters. They did not look like ordinary horses.","Chu Yunfan was no stranger to this. There were similar horses in Great Wei. It was said that horses with the bloodline of monsters were left behind after the crossbreeding of ordinary horses and monsters. After generations of improvement, only a part of the bloodline of monsters was left in the bloodline, but it was completely different from ordinary horses.","These horses could easily travel 1,000 miles a day and 800 miles at night without any effort. However, these horses were usually used as warhorses in the army and were not commonly seen by ordinary people."]},{"number":1434,"title":"Chapter 1434 Ancient Sword Token","paragraphs":["1434 Ancient Sword Token","Chu Yunfan sighed. It seemed that he had encountered some kind of vendetta. However, he didn’t want to ask too much about this matter.","In the past half a month, he had traveled across the northern part of Great Wei to the Small Pill Origin Meet. To him, it was a form of cultivation and a form of vacation. Ever since he started cultivating, he rarely traveled like this. After all, things came one after another and could not be changed by his wishes.","This month was a rare opportunity for him to relax. He did not expect to encounter such a thing in this small rundown temple.","However, before he could say anything, the leader of the cavalrymen glanced at the ruined temple and said, “Fifth Brother, find that sword token. Third Brother, Fourth Brother, go and kill this hindrance. We can’t let anyone know that the token has fallen into our hands.”","Chu Yunfan’s lips twitched. He didn’t want to meddle in this matter, but it was obvious that the other party didn’t want to let him go. However, when he saw the word “Pure” on the right shoulder of these cavalrymen, he recognized it as the symbol of Purity Sect.","“I didn’t expect that you would come to me instead.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","When the leader saw Chu Yunfan’s expression, he instinctively felt that something was wrong. However, before he could react, Chu Yunfan stretched out his index and middle fingers, and a small sword about the size of a palm appeared on his fingertips.","Instantly, a murderous aura filled the entire temple.","“Sh*t! Quickly!”","The third and fourth brothers, who had already pounced over, took the initiative to attack. However, in the next instant, the body of the flying party was split into two halves in mid-air, and blood burst out on the spot.","The leader’s eyes contracted slightly when he saw this scene. He looked at the person in front of him in disbelief. Although the strength of the third and fourth brothers was not as good as his, they were already at the peak of the Innate Stage. Although such were not considered top experts, they could still be considered good ones. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to kill them so easily.","The person in front of him was an expert, and a peak expert at that.","The leader immediately realized this. He did not expect that a random person he met in this dilapidated temple to be a Divine who was above him. As for an existence of a higher level, he did not even dare to think about it. Even Purity only had one person like that.","“Who are you?” the leader did not dare to act rashly. This person in front of them was obviously not someone to be trifled with. He was not someone they could afford to provoke.","“It’s a little too late to ask about my identity now. You’re from Purity, right?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“That’s right. We are disciples of Purity. Do you know the seniors of our sect?” the leader hurriedly brought up Purity. Although it was a question, it was faintly threatening.","Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “No need for such questions. I don’t have a good relationship with your sect. How about it? Are you interested in telling me what this sword token is?” He waved his hand and grabbed the sword token that the fifth brother had just found. From beginning to end, it was as smooth as flowing water.","He played with the sword token. It was simple and unadorned, and he didn’t know what material it was made of. It was neither gold nor jade and looked rather ancient. It was fashioned into the shape of a small sword and was engraved with extremely complicated patterns.","At first glance, it was just a pattern, but Chu Yunfan could see that it was actually an array. It seemed like the array could only be activated through the fulfiment of some special conditions.","The leader immediately understood that the person in front of him was probably a top-notch expert, and he was afraid that he had a grudge against Purity.","“Sir, you killed a disciple of my sect. Aren’t you afraid that Purity will find trouble with you?” the middle-aged man shouted.","“Do I look like I’m afraid of trouble?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","At this moment, the remaining cavalrymen had already sneaked behind Chu Yunfan and started attacking and Chu Yunfan had seemed to not notice them.","However, when their attacks fell, they were shocked to discover a terrifying fact. Their attacks could not even land on Chu Yunfan’s body. They were stopped three inches away from him.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and these people were sent flying, smashing the windows of the ruined temple. They stopped moving and were soon soaked in rain.","The leader’s pupils contracted slightly and his body stiffened. He couldn’t even move. When he looked at Chu Yunfan, it was like a rabbit gazing at a tiger. It was a suppression from the level of life.","“Tell me, what is this thing? Tsk, tsk. You actually want to kill me to silence me?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly and looked at the leader.","“I won’t tell you. Don’t even dream of it!”","The leader wanted to cut off his meridians and self-destruct in front of Chu Yunfan. This was the only thing he could do. He could see that even if he retaliated against Chu Yunfan, it would be a joke.","“Trying to off yourself? Are you kidding me? Did I say you can die?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He glanced at the other party and immediately felt that the flow of true energy in his body was out of his control. It was as if he had been completely grasped.","This feeling was too terrifying. Chu Yunfan didn’t even use his power. He only took a glance at him and completely suppressed him. The combat strength of a Core Former was not something he could contend with.","Then, he suddenly felt sleepy and unknowingly told Chu Yunfan about the token. By the time he came back to his senses, he had already explained everything.","Only then did Chu Yunfan realize that this token was not as simple as a personal vendetta. It even involved Purity’s sect master, and these calvarymen were just small fries.","They did not know much about the token. They only knew that it was something that the sect master had been searching for for a long time. For this, he had even destroyed an entire clan. That dead middle-aged man was the last person of this clan.","These calvarymen were only in charge of chasing and killing. As for the specifics, they did not know anything.","“Interesting, but since you don’t know anything, then good riddance.” Chu Yunfan looked at the leader. The man self-destructed on the spot and died without a sound."]},{"number":1435,"title":"Chapter 1435 Restoration of the Array, Harvest","paragraphs":["1435 Restoration of the Array, Harvest","Chu Yunfan fiddled with the sword token. There were ancient patterns carved on it, and these ancient patterns were imprinted with ancient arrays.","He had some understanding of arrays, but he did not have a deep understanding of them. Of course, he knew more than the average person, but he could tell that this array needed to be activated using certain conditions.","This array was just a part of a bigger one.","Suddenly, at this moment, the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind began to emit bursts of light. In front of Chu Yunfan, the array that he could barely distinguish suddenly began to extend. Before his eyes, with this part of the array formation as the core, the patterns extended out. In just a moment, they formed a complete array in front of him.","Chu Yunfan was stunned for a moment. Then he realized that everything in front of him had disappeared, but he was sure that what he saw just now was definitely not an illusion. He had this ability. Moreover, with his current memory, although that mysterious array was extremely complicated, he had memorized it.","Soon, Chu Yunfan began to compare the Alchemy Emperor’s memories with the records of arrays in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. Although the Alchemy Emperor was not good at arrays, he had reached a height that Chu Yunfan could not imagine. The Mighty Emperor Battle Book also contained many unimaginable divine martial arts manuals and a lot of information.","Soon, he found out that it was a teleportation array. The array engraved on this sword token was only a small part of a bigger circle.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan understood everything. He originally thought that the sword token represented an Innate or Divine treasure. After all, whether it was the person being hunted or those doing the hunting, they were not worth mentioning to him at the moment. He could not even be bothered to look at the treasures buried by Innates. The treasures left behind by Divines were the same to him.","The amount of wealth and resources he needed for his cultivation was astronomical. The entire wealth of an Innate was not even worth a single strand of his hair.","However, according to the leader of the cavalrymen, this matter involved Purity’s sect master, and it was not allowed to be made public. That was a bit strange. Logically speaking, although Purity was not a behemoth like Nine Stars, it was a super first-class force. No matter what, there was a Void Core holding the fort. Whether it was an ordinary treasure or a relic, it was natural for a Core to take action.","A Void Core was a giant in the outer realm. No one could ignore them. According to the current division, a force with a Void Core could be considered a second-rate force in the entire immediate area. Meanwhile, a force with more than two Void Cores could be considered a first-rate force in the entire region.","Nine Stars, on the other hand, had a Core Former, which made them a super force and the ruler of the entire region. For example, the Monster Subduers in Great Wei, the Netherworld Sect in Jinzhanghan, and Nine Stars which was closer to Great Qi, were all giants that dominated the world.","However, no matter what, a Core could not be underestimated. Now, even Purity’s sect master had to be so careful and not let anyone know. In other words, if they were afraid of interference from other forces, then the treasure behind this sword token might be very extraordinary.","This could be seen from the complicated array. It was even beyond the array that an ordinary Core could set up. This token was only a part of this array. Other than this token, there should be other tokens that formed the entire teleportation array.","Originally, it was impossible to obtain this treasure without a complete array. However, now that Chu Yunfan knew the complete array, he could find a way to restore it on his own. There was no need to find other tokens.","But for Chu Yunfan, the most surprising thing was the godhead’s sudden burst of power. For Chu Yunfan, it was undoubtedly the most shocking thing.","He had relied on two trump cards to get to where he was now. One was the huge resources brought by the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, and the other was the godhead which had continuously transformed Chu Yunfan in all aspects. Otherwise, even if he had the memory of the Alchemy Emperor, with Chu Yunfan’s aptitude, he was afraid that he would not be able to understand it to this extent.","However, the godhead had always been a hidden help to Chu Yunfan. However, this time was different. He had only seen a corner of the array, but he was able to calculate this array that was clearly beyond his understanding. The abilities of the godhead had been further unlocked, and the condition for this unlocking should be that Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased further.","After reaching the Void Core Stage, Chu Yunfan’s strength in all aspects had undergone earth-shattering changes. He now had the ability to carry out more functions of the godhead.","This godhead was a natural wonder that many emperors fought over. Even the Alchemy Emperor died before he could understand the many mysteries of this godhead. When it came to Chu Yunfan, he could only fumble around and use it.","Chu Yunfan circulated his divine power again and poured it into the godhead. As expected, the array carved on the sword token extended to other parts, and a complete array appeared in front of him.","As time passed, the array slowly began to operate. As time passed, the array spun faster and faster. In front of Chu Yunfan, a door appeared above the array.","This door slowly opened, leading to another world, like a small dimension.","Chu Yunfan was overjoyed. The godhead had absorbed a large amount of divine power but Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the array soared and increased crazily. In just a few moments, he had already gained a deep understanding of this array. Now, as long as he had enough materials, he could set up the array.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan finally stopped. He felt that although it was only a short time, his understanding of arrays and the Great Dao had made a big leap."]},{"number":1436,"title":"Chapter 1436 Suppressing Purity","paragraphs":["1436 Suppressing Purity","All of this was only a short time, but he had already gained so much.","Chu Yunfan was overjoyed. The ability of the godhead had been further awakened, and he came to understand many things that he couldn’t understand before. From the original understanding, it had turned into his own understanding.","After sensing this, Chu Yunfan became excited. The ability of this godhead far exceeded his imagination. It seemed to give him the ability to see through it.","Originally, he could not ascertain the material of this sword token. However, when his gaze landed on it, he could actually see the material. This sword token was made of a material from beyond the heavens called Flying Great Stone. In front of Chu Yunfan, there was even a lot of information about the process of making this token.","The details of how the sword spirit was refined step by step from the Flying Great Stone, the complicated array formations carved on it, and so on were all broken down in front of Chu Yunfan. Everything could be seen clearly as if he was seeing it with his own eyes.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan was shocked. He didn’t expect the godhead to have such an ability. Thinking of this, he hurriedly took out an Essence Gathering Pill from the Mountain River Diagram. Suddenly, all kinds of information about the pill appeared in his mind. From the various medicinal materials used to refine the pill to the various methods used to refine it, everything appeared.","All of it was exactly as Chu Yunfan had done and used when make the pill. Even with Chu Yunfan’s current state of mind, he couldn’t help but feel ecstatic after understanding everything.","‘No wonder. In the era of the emperors of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, martial arts civilization was extremely glorious, and it could caused many emperors to compete,’ Chu Yunfan thought. He had a further guess about the godhead. It seemed to be condensed from the rules of the great Dao of heaven and earth.","With the power of the godhead, if it was fully released, it might reach that level. It could see everything in the world and use all the laws. It was omnipotent. At that level, it could even be said that it was the embodiment of nature.","These were all Chu Yunfan’s speculations, and there was no actual evidence. However, for him, there were still many unsolvable mysteries about the godhead. H","How had it formed? Was it condensed? Or was it naturally produced by heaven and earth? Did it come from beyond the heavens? Was it related to the destruction of the Ancient Zenith Civilization?","There were too many things. For Chu Yunfan, there was no doubt that he had no clue. But now, he was even more confident. As long as he continued to cultivate step by step, sooner or later, he would be able to solve all the mysteries of this world.","Throughout the night, Chu Yunfan kept experimenting with the new abilities of the godhead. He felt that he had gained a lot. It was not until dawn and the heavy rain gradually stopped that he finally broke away from this state of constant experimentation and comprehension.","In just one night, he had undergone a drastic change.","Chu Yunfan got up and mounted one of the warhorses that the Purity disciples had ridden last night. Then, he turned the horse around and galloped in the direction of Purity.","With the support of Chu Yunfan’s divine power, the warhorse had seemingly endless physical strength. It galloped all the way, with wind under its feet. After a full day and night, it arrived in front of a huge mountain.","On the body of this mountain, a large word was shining brightly and could be seen from afar—Purity!","Chu Yunfan transformed into a swordsman with a long sword on his back. It was the disguise he had used before, Jian Wuchen. His entire temperament changed. From his gentle appearance, he instantly turned into an unsheathed sword, sharp and threatening. Under the cover of the godhead, no one would be able to see through him.","Chu Yunfan did not hide his aura and released it. The aura that belonged to a Void Core was released. Even though he released only a small portion, it was still like a dark cloud covering the top of an ordinary person’s head, covering the sky and earth.","This immediately alarmed of all of Purity. The sect’s protection barriers were activated at once. The disciples reacted immediately as well. They flew into the sky one after another, only to see a figure slowly walking over step by step.","He carried an extremely terrifying and sharp aura. From afar, one could feel a terrifying aura that covered the sky and crushed over. With every step forward, the entire barrier trembled violently.","When many people saw Chu Yunfan walking over step by step, they felt their eyelids twitch as if they had seen a huge monster.","“A Core... It’s a Core!”","A Divine ascertained this immediately and hurriedly cried out in surprise.","“Why would a Core attack our sect?”","“Is he crazy? Is he here to attack our sect all alone?”","“Even if he’s a Core, it’s impossible!”","Many people were nervous, but they were not very afraid. This was because they were inside the barrier. Their barrier had been reinforced by generations of experts. Even if a Void Core wanted to break through it, it was impossible.","Relying on the protective barrier, Purity had escaped death many times. After these years of development, the entire sect had expanded into a small city. Inside were the disciples and their relatives. There were also many people who served Purity’s disciples. It was no longer the size of the past.","“Who are you?!” a Divine shouted.","“Jian Wuchen,” Chu Yunfan said calmly, but his voice was like thunder, ringing in everyone’s ears. Many people were shocked. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was unbelievably strong.","“Jian Wuchen? Wasn’t he the one who went on a killing spree in Yunshan City?”","“That’s right. Nine Stars seems to be looking for him.”","“But why is he here to find trouble with us?”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. They remembered that some time ago, Chu Yunfan had caused a huge ruckus in Yunshan, killing countless people and angering Nine Stars, a huge organization, causing them to look everywhere for him."]},{"number":1437,"title":"Chapter 1437 The Strike Breaks the Protecting Barrier","paragraphs":["1437 The Strike Breaks the Protecting Barrier","During this period, Chu Yunfan returned to Great Wei and caused a massive commotion. However, the people in the outer realm did not know he was the person they sought. Therefore, their search was fruitless. They could not see through Chu Yunfan’s disguise, making it impossible to find him.","Even so, he attracted everyone’s attention now that he had appeared here. They still had time to focus on why he had come to their door. Not everyone knew that Purity had once chased after Tang Siyu.","After all, they could not even touch a battle of that level. Suddenly, a dignified voice sounded from the depths of Purity, “Jian Wuchen, why are you here?”","Chu Yunfan smirked as he said coldly, “Don’t you know why?”","Purity was in an uproar. It seemed Jian Wuchen had a good reason and was not acting on a whim. They naturally understood that Jian Wuchen would not come to them for no reason.","Many bright people were among Purity’s disciples. They could guess many things just from Chu Yunfan’s words. Many knew Purity had sent a considerable force to search for Tang Siyu, and Jian Wuchen was associated with Tang Siyu. It was hard for most to guess he was here to seek revenge for Tang Siyu.","After a long silence, the person said, “You still have time to leave, but I won’t let you if you continue to be impudent.”","“Who can stop me even if I want to leave?” Chu Yunfan grinned. “You should be Purity’s sect master, right? You should know why I came to your doorstep.”","“What do you think?” the person replied. Immediately after, a figure flew out from the depths of Purity. He was a middle-aged man with a prominent jaw. He wore a luxurious robe and had an extraordinary aura.","The confidence of Purity’s disciples grew exponentially when their sect master appeared.","“The master is here. It looks like we no longer have to worry about Jian Wuchen.”","“Yeah, does Jian Wuchen think he’s invincible?”","“Now that he has angered the master to come out of seclusion, Jian Wuchen won’t be able to leave.”","Everyone threatened Chu Yunfan not to flee, but most noticed their master’s embarrassment. After all, Chu Yunfan had casually come knocking on their door. It was like a slap in the face to Purity and its master.","That was because they had utterly shed all pretense of cordiality. If the master did not react, it would undoubtedly be a joke to everyone. Still, the clan master did not seem to have any intentions of attacking. It was more than enough to explain the situation.","Many recalled the legends about Chu Yunfan. He had actual battle records and considered that he had killed his way to fame. Above all, he had forced Mysteries Pavilion to yield and even killed many of Nine Star’s experts.","He resembled the grim reaper. As time passed, the number of people who remembered his substantial battle achievements quickly grew, and everyone view of him changed. They thought the person before them was not a good person.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “It’s elementary. Kill yourself but leave your corpse intact. Everyone in your sect who participated in the siege must also kill themselves.”","His words caused an immediate uproar within Purity. Everyone glared at him because he wanted the sect master and higher-ups to commit suicide.","“That’s going too far! Who does this man think he is?!”","“How dare he tells the master to kill himself!”","“Let’s fight him1 I want to see if he can handle us all!”","Everyone roared and glared at Chu Yunfan, but the latter ignored their clamor. He only looked at Purity’s sect master coldly.","“It looks like you don’t intend to let this matter slide.” The sect master glowered at Chu Yunfan and knew he had ill intentions.","The sect master would not be afraid if it were just an ordinary Void Core. Even if Chu Yunfan was more substantial than the sect master, the former should not be able to harm the sect master in his territory. The sect master was confident he could win.","However, Chu Yunfan differed. Everyone knew he had caused a slaughter in Yunshan. One would say the news spread throughout the outer realm almost instantly.","The clan master was not confident in defeating Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, the clan master would have attacked long ago. Indeed, he had participated in trapping Tang Siyu, but he never expected to face such a side effect. He did not know he would attract such a formidable expert.","“Let it go? Those words aren’t in my dictionary. Since you aren’t willing to kill yourself, I’ll send you on your way.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “But before that, I have something to ask you. What is this token?”","The sect master frowned when he saw the sword token that appeared out of thin air in Chu Yunfan’s hand. He had tried to be careful and stay under the radar, but it still fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands.","It was an unfortunate day for the sect master.","“So it fell into your hands after all. I advise you to hand it over. You can’t afford to play with it,” the sect master said through gritted teeth.","“You have time to care about my matters right now? I think you have too much free time.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","From the sect master’s expression, Chu Yunfan knew he could not get any information. Still, he did not care since he had already memorized the formation. He could set it up in minutes and avoid its restriction if he had enough materials.","“Since you refuse a toast only to drink a forfeit, die!” Chu Yunfan yelled and revealed his palm. It instantly turned into a massive sword. The sword expanded with the wind and grew to several thousand feet.","Suddenly, the sword slashed downward.","Boom!","The strike slashed into Purity’s protection barrier and fell with unstoppable force. Purity’s barrier could not match Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength as it broke with a boom."]},{"number":1438,"title":"Chapter 1438 Kill Yourself","paragraphs":["1438 Kill Yourself","Purity’s protection barrier had multiple layers, making it a vast defense system. Theoretically, it should be impossible for a Void Core to destroy it. However, Chu Yunfan managed with just one strike.","The sect master was astounded.","‘Jian Wuchen is even more formidable than the rumors say. No, he’s at least ten times more powerful!’","The sect master would not be worried if it were just Chu Yunfan’s rumored strength. With its barriers, he thought Chu Yunfan could not do anything to Purity no matter how great his strength was.","‘If I’m careful, I can buy time for Nine Star’s experts to arrive.’","The sect master had already sent Nine Stars a request for backup when he confirmed he was facing Jian Wuchen, who had caused the slaughter in Yunshan.","The sect master knew why Chu Yunfan had come. ‘It must be related to what happened to Tang Siyu.’","The clan master could not avoid this. His only option was to rely on Nine Stars if he wanted to defeat Chu Yunfan and drive him away. No one else other than Nine Stars could deal with Jian Wuchen.","Purity and Nine Stars were related—the former being Nine Stars’ ally. If not for that, they would not have cooperated with Nine Stars’ young master to trap and suppress a Void Core like Tang Siyu.","However, Chu Yunfan’s attack wholly disrupted Purity’s sect master’s plans. The latter never expected his sect’s barriers to be so vulnerable that Chu Yunfan’s casual attack broke it.","Meanwhile, Purity’s disciples were just as shocked as their faces were full of fear. The barriers they were proud of and thought they could rely on were less potent than they had imagined. It simply could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","“How is this possible? How could our barriers be so weak?”","“What’s his cultivation level? This is impossible!”","“I don’t believe it. Those were our sect’s most potent barriers!”","Everyone looked like they had seen a ghost, paler than a white sheet of paper. They looked at the scene before them in disbelief. When the sect members glanced at Chu Yunfan again, they looked like they were looking at a monster.","Simultaneously, they felt a deathly aura approaching.","Purity’s sect master thundered, “Set up the stainless formation and delay him! Nine Stars’ experts will be here soon!”","Soon after, one hundred and eight Divines flew out from Purity and set up a vast array to surround Chu Yunfan. Although each of these experts was not as attention-grabbing as the Core before them, a formation with more than a hundred Divine would be formidable enough to threaten even an ordinary Core.","“Kill him!”","The Divines roared and charged at Chu Yunfan. The group mobilized and formed a terrifying tide. The power of a hundred and eight people condensed into an incomparably horrifying phantom that attacked Chu Yunfan.","“You overestimate yourselves!” Chu Yunfan sneed and retaliated. A sword-shaped light flew across the sky and slashed downward.","Bang!","The sect members only heard a massive explosion. Chu Yunfan slashed the formation apart, and the hundred and eight Divines felt a force hitting their bodies. They let out miserable cries as they spat out mouthfuls of blood. Their bodies flew left and right.","Chu Yunfan instantly broke the hundred-and-eight-men formation.","Immediately after, he slashed outward, and the sword-shaped light split into a hundred and eight lights that rained from the sky.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","The sword-shaped lights fell one after another, sweeping across the formation like a rainstorm. Chu Yunfan’s attack slashed apart the one hundred and eight Divines.","The blood of these experts sprayed everywhere, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky and fell onto Purity’s grounds. The bystanders were in shock and awe as they were drenched in blood, turning them into bloodied messes. A persistent fear arose in their eyes when Chu Yunfan slaughtered the Divines.","After all, those were a hundred and eight Divines, not a hundred and eight tomatoes. Those experts were Purity’s backbone. Their formation was supposedly on par with an ordinary Core.","Still, Chu Yunfan destroyed them with just a few moves. He utterly exceeded the sect’s understanding, and they finally understood why numbers were meaningless before peak experts.","That was because quality had surpassed what quantity could serve.","“How dare you!” Purity’s sect master roared. He was about to mobilize all the divine power in his body to fight Chu Yunfan when he saw a sword-shaped beam sweep across the sky.","Chu Yunfan’s attack had already landed on the sect leader’s body at some point. The sect master did not even know when Chu Yunfan attacked. The former only reacted when Chu Yunfan’s sword-shaped light swept downward.","Bam!","The attack sent the sect master flying, and his chest became bloodied.","Slam!","The clan master fiercely crashed into the mountain wall, immediately turning it into powder. He barely stopped even then, his face distorting from the overwhelming pain. He finally realized how big the gap was between him and Chu Yunfan. What he regretted most was why he had responded to the Nine Stars’ search and attacked Tang Siyu.","She was just a lone cultivator without any foundation in their eyes. He wondered how a mere lone cultivator could fight against Nine Stars.","‘I didn’t know I would provoke such a terrifying person to retaliate.’","However, the sect master did not have time to regret his decision. The foundation Purity had passed down for so many years would get destroyed in a single day because of his injuries.","Still, Chu Yunfan did not take advantage of the sect master’s injuries to pursue him. The former said indifferently, “I’ve already shown mercy, or you’d be dead. Tell me the token’s secret. Then you and all who chased after Tang Siyu will kill yourselves.”"]},{"number":1439,"title":"Chapter 1439 Falling One After Another","paragraphs":["1439 Falling One After Another","Purity went silent when they heard Chu Yunfan’s words. None tried cursing him again. They only dared to curse him before because they thought he was overestimating his strength.","However, they finally understood why Chu Yunfan was so confident—because he had the strength to back up his words. Purity could not fight back if he had decided to destroy them.","Even if Purity had Nine Stars’ help, Chu Yunfan could kill all of Purity’s experts. He did not need to kill everyone in Purity to cause the sect to collapse. There was no doubt about it.","Purity could not help but feel resentment toward their sect master. They dared not feel such resentment toward Chu Yunfan because they knew he could destroy them with just a word, no different from crushing an ant with a boot.","The sect resented their master for offending a formidable monster like Chu Yunfan. They knew their leader and some higher-ups’ participation in Tang Siyu’s encirclement and suppression had caused today’s disaster.","Although the sect members knew these thoughts were wrong, they could not help but think so.","The entire sect was dead silent, waiting for their master’s decision. They knew Chu Yunfan would destroy the sect if their master stubbornly resisted.","The sect master spat a mouthful of blood. He smiled bitterly and said, “Do I have a choice?”","Ultimately, he could not bear to let the sect die alongside him. Although someone else would have done that, he wondered who would care about the flood after he died. Undoubtedly, such a person existed, but the sect master could not do such a thing.","‘The sect’s foundation is something countless people here have worked hard for.’","The sect master closed his eyes and recalled his master entrusting him with the sect before dying. Now, the former had come close to destroying the sect.","“I can tell you the token’s secret and I can kill myself, but you must swear to let Purity go.” The sect master stared at Chu Yunfan. “Otherwise, I’d rather die than tell you the secret.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. “I’ll let them go as long as you tell me the secret and kill yourself.”","He never intended to massacre Purity. Although he had always been decisive and would not be soft-hearted, he was not a murderous demon. Chu Yunfan would not take action if there were no need to kill.","He came to Purity today to learn the token’s secret and avenge Tang Siyu. He had achieved his goals, so there was no point in killing. He did not care about the sect’s hatred for him.","He knew the sect did not threaten him, no matter how many people there were. Moreover, he used another identity—Jian Wuchen. The sect could only hate his alias.","The sect master looked at Chu Yunfan’s cold expression and did not know whether or not he could believe Chu Yunfan. However, he had no other choice at that moment. The entire sect would die if he did not trust Chu Yunfan.","“All right, let me tell you the secret. The token is related to the Violet Thunder Sword Sect that ruled this region in ancient times. They were once a formidable sect. Jinzhanghan, Great Wei, Great Qi, and the outer realms were under they’re rule. Later, they declined and got destroyed by a rising star.","“However, none could find the location of Violet Thunder Sword’s final treasure vault. People believe that token to be one of the keys to opening the sect’s treasury.”","Ultimately, Purity’s sect master decided to tell the truth, not daring to hide anything from Chu Yunfan. He knew Chu Yunfan would destroy the entire sect if he played tricks, and Chu Yunfan noticed it.","Still, the sect master had his plans. Since he was no match for Chu Yunfan, he knew an expert would want to find Chu Yunfan if others knew he had the token. Then Chu Yunfan would die at others’ hands sooner or later.","Though the sect master’s plan was not great, he still had hope for revenge. However, he would never show it for fear that Chu Yunfan would see right through him.","Chu Yunfan nodded, thinking, ‘So, that’s how it is. Violet Thunder Sword’s strength does sound extraordinary. That is evident from the level of the teleportation array engraved on the token.’","The token had surpassed the Void Core Stage and the Core Form Stage. It was impossible to nurture an array expert of this level if it were an ordinary sect.","Although the sect master only briefly explained, Chu Yunfan could feel the power of the former Violet Thunder Swords. It was terrifying.","The current three great empires and vast outer realms were territories ruled by the Violet Thunder Swords. One could imagine just how powerful they once were.","Chu Yunfan also knew that news of his possessing the token would spread like wildfire after today. He worried about attracting many experts’ jealous eyes. Still, he remained fearless.","No matter how many Cores showed up, they would resemble pawns. Moreover, none could recognize Chu Yunfan if he changed his disguise. He knew about the sect master’s little plan but cared not for it.","“In that case, take your own life,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “You don’t have to try and fool me. I have a list of the people who attacked that day.”","“I hope you keep your word.” As the sect master spoke, he circulated all his mana. His body resembled an exploding furnace, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky.","Immediately after, Purity’s members became teary-eyed. Their master had sacrificed himself before Chu Yunfan to protect them. Then the half-step Cores who had participated in Tang Siyu’s entrapment also stood out.","Even if they were unwilling, Purity would not agree.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The half-step Cores self-detonated one after another, dying before their fellow members. Suddenly, one member could not bear the pressure of death and turned to escape. Still, he could not outrun Chu Yunfan’s sword.","His sword-shaped light swept the sky and fell, cutting the half-step Core in two."]},{"number":1440,"title":"Chapter 1440 Shaking the Outer Realms","paragraphs":["1440 Shaking the Outer Realms","After killing the last half-step to Core who was fleeing, Chu Yunfan’s trip to Purity could be considered complete.","He had obtained the secret of the sword token. Although it was only some rough information, it was enough. After all, the Violet Thunder Sword had probably been destroyed for a long time. It was already good enough to have information about the token.","After Chu Yunfan glanced at the people of Purity who were not even daring to move, he stepped on the light and left. In addition to Purity, there were a total of twelve other sects that had participated in the encirclement of Tang Siyu. He wanted to clean them up one by one.","Finally, after watching him leave, everyone in Purity wanted to cry but had no tears. They didn’t know whether to cry or laugh. Purity could be said to have suffered heavy losses overnight. Even the half-step Cores had left. There were only a few of them. The Cores were gone, and more than half of the Divines were dead.","The pillars of Purity had collapsed overnight.","The happy thing was that they had actually survived and were not killed by Chu Yunfan. This could not help but make them feel happy.","No one talked about revenge. Facing such a terrifying opponent like a god, they couldn’t bring themselves to have such thoughts. No matter how many of them there were, they were only ants in front of Chu Yunfan.","There was no such thing as ants biting an elephant to death.","“Seal the mountain. From today onward, Purity will seal off the mountain for a hundred years.”","The few remaining half-step Cores of Purity looked at each other and quickly made a decision. At this moment, they could only seal the mountain for a hundred years to hide.","After all, Purity had offended many people over the years by relying on their Cores. Now that their biggest backer was dead, they were afraid that they would face a series of storms in the future. They could only seal the mountain to hide from the limelight.","The news that Chu Yunfan had single-handedly overturned all of Purity spread at an astonishing speed.","Not long after, Nine Stars experts who had received the news arrived. However, what surprised them was that they had clearly moved out as soon as they received the news, but they still couldn’t catch up to Chu Yunfan’s speed in defeating Purity. When they arrived, Chu Yunfan had already disappeared.","All that was left was the ruined Purity.","They learned of the entire incident from the surviving members. The astonishing battle prowess that Chu Yunfan had displayed caused even the most knowledgeable experts of Nine Stars to look at each other in dismay as if they had seen a ghost.","The combat strength that Chu Yunfan displayed was too terrifying.","However, Chu Yunfan’s unbridled attack also made Nine Stars’ experts furious.","While they flew into a rage, Chu Yunfan had already rushed to the next sect. At the same time, he sent out a message to Great Wei’s Agency of Secrets to collate all the information they had gathered about the Violet Thunder Sword Sect and hand it over to him.","He quickly arrived at the second sect. This sect’s status was similar to that of Purity. It was just a second-rate sect with only a Void Core guarding it. But even so, that Void Core was the overlord of the nearby areas.","But before Chu Yunfan, they had no strength to fight back. He easily broke through the sect protection barriers and forced their sect master to commit suicide in front of everyone. The higher-ups of the sect who tried to resist were also killed.","All of this happened so quickly that even a Core couldn’t last a few breaths in front of Chu Yunfan. The formation formed by ordinary Divines and half-step Cores could not even withstand a single move from him and were instantly killed.","Everything was done quickly, even faster than Nine Stars experts who had just received the news. When the experts rushed over, they saw the mess and were furious. After all, the sects that had participated in the encirclement of Tang Siyu had various connections with Nine Stars. It could be said that they were all their subordinates.","Nine Stars was able to dominate the vast outer region not only through their strength but also through their allies. However, Chu Yunfan challenged two of them in a short period. It could be said that they had lost all face.","At the same time, they were furious.","In an instant, the entire Nine Star Sect began to move. The experts began to fan out, searching for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts all over the world. They even placed a huge reward on the Mysteries Pavilion. As long as they could provide clues about Chu Yunfan’s location, they would be rewarded with millions of low-grade spirit stones. Whoever caught Chu Yunfan would be rewarded with 100 million low-grade spirit stones.","In the many years that the Mysteries Pavilion had existed, such a bounty could be counted as high. Even the wealth of a second-rate sect added up to this level. One could imagine how much Nine Stars hated Chu Yunfan. Such a generous reward could be said to have shocked many sects and high-level forces in the entire outer realm.","Nine Stars had been dominating the outer realms for so many years. They had always been the ones who made others suffer. When did others make them suffer such a big loss?","This was a very rare thing!","Even if Chu Yunfan had defeated one of the peripheral forces of Nine Stars, it was only related to Nine Stars and could not be considered a force under Nine Stars. However, in the eyes of the various large factions, this was simply a slap in the face.","Many people immediately began to search for information about Jian Wuchen—Chu Yunfan’s disguise. However, no matter how much they searched, it was obviously futile because they could not find any information about Jian Wuchen.","To them, it was like he had fallen from the sky. Before this, there had been no traces of the incident. Even with the Mysteries Pavilion’s intelligence-gathering capabilities, they had not been able to find any other information.","This made the major forces very curious. Who was this Jian Wuchen? How could he make Nine Stars suffer so many losses?","In this case, many forces joined the search for Chu Yunfan. Some were trying to get a reward, some wanted to curry favor with Nine Stars, and some wanted to rope in this expert to deal with Nine Stars.","Things obviously wouldn’t go as Nine Stars wished. Just as they were looking for Chu Yunfan with great fanfare, he defeated another sect in one night."]},{"number":1441,"title":"Chapter 1441 Killing Everyone With His Own Strength","paragraphs":["1441 Killing Everyone With His Own Strength","The sect that was overturned this time was not a second-rate sect like Purity, which only had a Void Core overseeing it. Instead, it was a first-rate sect. There were a total of three Void Cores in the sect.","They received a lot of information about Chu Yunfan. They naturally understood that they, who had also participated in the encirclement of Tang Siyu, were also Chu Yunfan’s targets. Therefore, they were already prepared.","The three of them even formed a three-man formation to surround Chu Yunfan. They wanted to use the formation to delay him so that Nine Stars’ experts could come and help.","However, they soon understood that in front of a master like Chu Yunfan, no matter what methods they had, it was meaningless to have a few people.","It didn’t matter if it was one Void Core, two Void Cores, or three Void Cores. Whether it was the fledgling Void Core Stage, the intermediate Void Core Stage, the late Void Core Stage, or the peak Void Core Stage, there was no difference in front of Chu Yunfan, whose combat strength had already broken through to the Core Form Stage.","They were unable to withstand a single blow.","These three experts thought that they could deal with Chu Yunfan with numbers, but the three-men array they formed was broken in three moves in front of Chu Yunfan. Then, in less than ten moves, Chu Yunfan killed these three experts.","In the face of Chu Yunfan’s astonishing might, how could the remaining experts in the sect dare to resist? Those peak half-step Cores who had participated in the encirclement of Tang Siyu all self-destructed and died in front of Chu Yunfan. Even if those people were unwilling to commit suicide, they had no choice but to do so under the pressure of the other experts in the sect.","After all, the remaining experts of the sect did not participate in the encirclement and suppression of Tang Siyu’s matter. Naturally, they were not willing to be buried in this matter.","If Chu Yunfan could not break in, they could still support these people. However, Chu Yunfan had killed the three pillars of their sect in just a few moves. They had no choice but to agree. They could only abandon the car to save the commander.","After all, they knew that Chu Yunfan’s target was only those who had participated in the siege of Tang Siyu. He was not very interested in others. Now that things had come to this, they had nowhere to go.","When the experts of Nine Stars arrived, they were faced with the same scene of ruins. In just a short time, Chu Yunfan had already defeated two second-rate sects and one first-rate sect.","For a moment, the name “Jian Wuchen” shook the entire outer realm.","Even the forces that had no conflict with Chu Yunfan felt as if they were frightened by the twang of a bow, afraid that he would suddenly come knocking on their door one day. The remaining ten sects on the list immediately sent a request for help to Nine Stars.","Seeing the miserable state of the other three sects, they felt sorry for them. There was a feeling of grief. They had also participated in the encirclement and suppression of Tang Siyu, so they naturally understood that Chu Yunfan would not let them go. It was only a matter of time!","However, Nine Stars was very busy at this time. Even though they were like a giant that dominated the outer realms, it was still like looking for a needle in a haystack in the vast outer realms. All the major forces had their own ulterior motives, but they all began to look for Chu Yunfan at the same time.","No matter what kind of goal they had, they could not find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. Even if this information network spread throughout the entire outer realm, it was useless against Chu Yunfan, who could change his appearance at any time. Even if their scouts passed by him, they would not be able to recognize him. This was the Chu Yunfan that all the major forces were looking for.","Under such circumstances, all the experts of Nine Stars came out of the headquarters and went to various places to search for Chu Yunfan. However, there was no such thing as being a thief for a thousand days. Even if they used all their strength, they were unable to locate his whereabouts. All the powers of the major forces were ineffective in front of Chu Yunfan. It was as if he had suddenly disappeared from the perception of the major forces.","Nine Stars couldn’t help the remaining ten forces.","The top ten forces began to shrink their forces at the first moment and began to defend themselves against Chu Yunfan’s attack with all their strength. At the first moment, the entire sect’s barriers were activated. Although the cost of every second after activating the sect’s barriers was extremely high, they had no other choice at this moment.","Who asked them to offend such a terrifying expert?","Many experts began to think about the relationship between Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu. That day, Tang Siyu seemed to have appeared out of thin air and suddenly appeared in everyone’s sight. Even the Mysteries Pavilion could not find out where she was from, shocking countless people.","And now, Chu Yunfan was the same. It was as if he had jumped out from a crack in the stone. There was no trace of their existence before, but they were out-and-out experts.","Under such circumstances, many people’s curiosity about Chu Yunfan increased day by day. While Nine Stars was searching for him, he didn’t stop. In just three days, he defeated another four sects. Two of them were second-rate forces and two were first-rate forces. Chu Yunfan killed their masters or forced them to commit suicide.","No one was an exception. The sect barriers that they were so proud of were completely defenseless against Chu Yunfan. They were all destroyed in one strike. Sometimes, they couldn’t be cut open in one move, but if Chu Yunfan used a second move, he would successfully cut open the barriers.","For a moment, the entire outer realm fell silent. Facing a terrifying existence like Chu Yunfan, all the major forces felt a chill down their spines. What kind of concept was it to single-handedly defeat entire second-rate and first-rate forces? That meant that Chu Yunfan was a strategic deterrent weapon.","Facing such an existence, no one could face it calmly.","The remaining six sects were terrified. They knew that it was impossible for them to fight against this demon alone. They could not help but gather in the last sect, the encampment of Mount Sky School.","Anyway, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to be interested in slaughtering ordinary people. His goal was these experts. In that case, they gave up their sects and focused on defending Mount Sky School."]},{"number":1442,"title":"Chapter 1442 The Final Battle","paragraphs":["1442 The Final Battle","Chu Yunfan had single-handedly terrified the entire outer realm!","This was something that had never happened since ancient times. Even a terrifying existence like Nine Stars sect master wouldn’t go to such an extent. To them, going to the extreme was equivalent to pushing the entire outer realm to the opposite side.","They wouldn’t do such a thing.","However, for a lone ranger like Chu Yunfan, it didn’t matter. He didn’t have any roots. If others wanted to find trouble with him, they could only find trouble with him. However, they couldn’t even locate Chu Yunfan. How were they supposed to deal with him?","Moreover, this was just a disguise. For Chu Yunfan, of course, he had nothing to worry about.","All the major forces were curious about Chu Yunfan at the beginning, but now they were very afraid of him because they knew how much of a threat this lone ranger could pose.","Many forces had even begun to secretly link up. If Chu Yunfan attacked a sect that had nothing to do with the encirclement of Tang Siyu, he would immediately become the target of public criticism. All parties would form an alliance to target him.","The reason why the major forces were sitting still was that Chu Yunfan was very restrained in his attacks. He only wanted to force those who had attacked to commit suicide. He didn’t even kill the sects they left behind.","Therefore, many people thought that Chu Yunfan’s crazy killing was still under control. If he didn’t kill the innocent, he wouldn’t be targeted by everyone.","After all, his combat strength was terrifying. Some people even guessed that he might have already entered the Core Form Stage.","In the beginning, it was just a bold speculation by some people. However, after Chu Yunfan easily defeated many first-rate forces, this theory became popular. After all, only Core Formers could easily do this.","Core Formers were supreme rulers in the outer realm. Their significance was completely different from ordinary Void Cores.","Even if it was just a guess, it was enough to make them extremely afraid of Chu Yunfan. They did not dare to attack casually.","For a time, all kinds of news about him were flying all over the place. Where did Chu Yunfan appear from? When did people see Chu Yunfan again?","The news spread out one after another, and every news would attract the experts of Nine Stars to rush there. During this period, the teleportation circle of Nine Stars was used continuously in various places. It could be said that the number of times they had used the teleportation circle in the past hundred years was not as many as the number of times they had used them in these few days.","Using the teleportation circle on a large scale required an astonishing amount of resources. If it weren’t for the fact that Nine Stars had a very strong foundation and was as rich as a country, they wouldn’t have been able to withstand continuous use.","But even so, they could only watch Chu Yunfan’s lightning-fast actions as he flipped over the sects that were involved in Tang Siyu’s incident. His method of exchanging a shot for a cannon made many experts of Nine Stars furious.","In their opinion, Chu Yunfan must be afraid of Nine Stars’ experts, so he didn’t dare to face them face to face. Just like a mouse, no one could catch a trace of him.","The experts of Nine Stars scolded Chu Yunfan for being timid.","“Jian Wuchen is just a coward. He doesn’t dare to fight Nine Stars!”","“Jian Wuchen, do you dare to fight like a man?”","Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of responding to the clamor of Nine Stars’ experts. He just quietly went through the sects one by one according to his plan.","These sects did not have the slightest strength to fight back. It could be said that as long as they were targeted by Chu Yunfan, they would die.","They still didn’t know how powerful Chu Yunfan was.","In the end, the remaining sects couldn’t stand it anymore. The experts left their sects one after another and gathered at Mount Sky Sect as if they were going to fight to the death with Chu Yunfan. Not only did the remaining masters gather in Mount Sky Sect, but even the masters of Nine Stars also gathered in Mount Sky Sect in a high-profile manner to hold a meeting against Chu Yunfan.","The purpose of this meeting was to eliminate Chu Yunfan.","In addition to Nine Stars and six other great sects, they had also invited many other sects from the outer realm to participate in the event. They had announced this day in a high-profile manner.","In the eyes of many people, this was undoubtedly a challenge to Chu Yunfan.","Nine Stars had had enough of Chu Yunfan’s unpredictable movements. They wanted to force him out in one go!","For a time, the entire outer realm was in turmoil. Even if the various large factions did not want to participate in this battle, they all sent their higher-ups. It could be said to be a gathering of heroes. Now, all that was left was the question of whether Chu Yunfan would dare to attend.","This meeting was clearly a trap set up for Chu Yunfan, but if he didn’t come, their efforts would be in vain. But at the same time, Chu Yunfan’s reputation would also plummet. In everyone’s eyes, this meant that he was afraid. This meant that he was not invincible, and many forces that were ready to make a move might pounce on him like hungry tigers.","In a forest, Chu Yunfan was flipping through a jade slip. The jade slip contained a huge amount of information. Only those above the Divine Abilties Stage could make such a jade slip. Compared to thick books, it was undoubtedly much more convenient to use a jade slip to transmit information.","Of course, the prices of jade slips were not cheap, but it was nothing to Chu Yunfan.","The information in the jade slip contained information regarding the Violet Thunder Sword Sect of Great Wei. However, even in Great Wei State, there was not much information regarding the Violet Thunder Swords.","This was because the sect had already been destroyed before the establishment of Great Wei. It was an extremely distant martial arts sect. Now, there were some sects in Great Wei that had inheritances that were related to the Violet Thunder Swords, but these were merely a portion of the inheritance that the founder of the sect had obtained by chance. They could not be considered a direct descendant of the Violet Thunder Swords.","There might even be no direct descendants at all.","According to the records, the Violet Thunder Swords was once extremely powerful, but later on, due to some unknown reason, it declined. Even the ancestral land was invaded, and the entire sect was wiped out, and their treasury went missing."]},{"number":1443,"title":"Chapter 1443 The Day of the Alliance Meeting","paragraphs":["1443 The Day of the Alliance Meeting","The information given by Great Wei matched what Purity’s sect master had said. Even if the Purity’s sect master had hidden something, it should still be generally correct.","Given how powerful Violet Thunder Swords was, it was likely that there were many good things in the sect’s treasury. It was a behemoth that was equivalent to Jinzhanghan, Great Wei, and Great Qi. It was a terrifying existence that might even be stronger than these three countries combined.","According to the records, the Violet Thunder Swords had organized an army of tens of millions to rule this vast region. Among them, there were over a million elite troops like the Blood Barbarians.","They had suppressed all the major factions in the world.","Not a single power could challenge the Violet Thunder Swords. If it wasn’t for the fact that they had inexplicably declined, there probably wouldn’t have been a chance for other factions to rise.","If Chu Yunfan wanted to find out what was in the sect’s treasure vault, he had to go and explore it himself. However, that was a matter for later.","For Chu Yunfan, the most important thing now was the alliance between Nine Stars and the six major sects. He knew that the purpose of Nine Stars and the six sects was to break the impression of his power.","He had defeated many sects one after another, and many of the restless forces were so scared that they did not dare to move. However, if they could break his invincible legend, then many forces would be willing to take action if there was a reward. At that time, he might face the encirclement and suppression of all the sects in the outer realm.","If Chu Yunfan didn’t want to face this kind of thing, he would have to attend the alliance meeting in person to continue his invincible legend.","Then, he would fall into their trap!","It could be said that this was not a conspiracy, but an open scheme. A conspiracy was hard to guard against, but as long as one was careful and did not fall for it, there would be no problem.","However, if it was an open scheme, there was no question of whether he was fooled or not, because it was not a question of whether he was fooled or not.","‘A conspiracy? An open scheme?’ Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile. These people wanted to use this method to force him out, but little did they know that it was exactly what Chu Yunfan wanted.","‘No matter what kind of strategy it is, it has to be built on the foundation of having sufficient strength. It’s just nice that all of you are gathered together. I don’t need to go looking for you one by one.’","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and decided that it would be a good time to get rid of all the experts from the six sects and Nine Stars before attending the Small Pill Origin Meet.","Thinking of this, he no longer hesitated. A light appeared under his feet and he flew into the distance.","At this time, the Mount Sky Sect was bustling with people. Recently, Chu Yunfan had caused a huge commotion in the outer realm, killing countless people and turning the entire outer realm upside down.","And now, the Battle of Sky Mountain was very likely to be the last battle. Everyone wanted to see the outcome of this shocking battle.","Was Chu Yunfan, who had shown such amazing strength that no one could resist him, stronger, or was the strength of the six sects and Nine Stars more terrifying?","In particular, the higher-ups of the other major powers of the outer realm had received invitations. Even if they did not plan to get involved in the muddy water, they still sent experts over. Judging from Chu Yunfan’s restraint, as long as they did not interfere casually, he should not target them.","Thus, Mount Sky became the center of attention in the entire outer realm","Other than the major powers that had received invitations, there were even more people who had come from all over the world to watch the show. However, Mount Sky couldn’t refuse to entertain them. For a moment, all the inns in the town below the mountain were overcrowded.","On the day of the alliance meeting, they all rushed up the mountain, wanting to occupy a good position. For a moment, Mount Sky was crowded with people.","“This Jian Wuchen is too bold. Is he challenging Nine Stars’ ruling position?”","“This is not impossible. According to many people’s speculations, his strength might even be at the Core Form Stage.”","“That’s impossible. According to the information we received, Jian Wuchen is at most at the Void Core Stage. It’s impossible for him to be at the Core Form Stage. There are no signs of Core Former attacking.”","“That’s right. I don’t believe that a Core Former would suddenly appear. After all, he’s a sword cultivator. The attack power of a sword cultivator can be said to be the best in the same realm, so I think it’s understandable that his combat strength is stronger/”","“But no matter what, it’s fine if he doesn’t appear in today’s alliance meeting. If he does, I’m afraid he’ll die.”","Everyone was discussing. Chu Yunfan was too mysterious to them. Whether it was his strength or his background, he was clearly different from the experts they knew before.","This was too extraordinary for them.","“I think he won’t dare to appear. If he does, wouldn’t he be courting death?”","“That’s right. No one in the world dares to show up even though they know that they’re here to die. Especially when he didn’t dare to meet Nine Stars’ experts, his strength must be limited. Now that all Nine Stars’ experts are gathered here, what ability does he have to overturn the world?”","Many people did not believe that Chu Yunfan would dare to appear. This was mainstream thinking. However, there were some people who had different opinions.","“I don’t think so. Jian Wuchen is bold and reckless. No one knows what he can do. Even if we think this is a dead end, we don’t know what he can do.”","“I also feel that he might show up. Otherwise, this meeting will be meaningless. Facing such a master, how can Nine Stars guard against him for a thousand days?”","While many people were discussing, there were about 30 experts with terrifying auras sitting in the meeting hall of Mount Sky.","Each of these people’s auras was as terrifying as a mountain, forming a powerful aura. Even if they deliberately restrained their auras, their auras were enough to make ordinary Divines speechless.","Behind these people was an extremely large number of Divines. There were even hundreds of them. However, in front of these experts, they did not even dare to say a word. There was silence.","Fortunately, the meeting hall was very large and could accommodate hundreds of experts. Although it was an alliance meeting, the whole of Mount Sky was lively as if it was a huge celebration.","However, to the experts present, they all understood what this alliance meant. They were going to fight against a terrifying monster who could suppress the sect alone."]},{"number":1444,"title":"Chapter 1444 An Inescapable Net Against Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1444 An Inescapable Net Against Chu Yunfan","If it were an ordinary person, even a Void Core, challenging so many of them would be tantamount to courting death. However, the feeling that Jian Wuchen gave them was completely different.","His means were too astonishing. Regardless of whether it was a single person or several Void Cores besieging him, they would all be unable to escape death in the end. There wasn’t even enough time for the Nine Star Cult to come to the rescue.","Although Chu Yunfan’s attack power far surpassed that of ordinary martial artists, to be able to do it to this extent was enough to make them feel terrified. Even if he would be buried here in the end, how many of them would die in the process?","They couldn’t even count.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t refused to let them go and forced the people who had participated in the encirclement of Tang Siyu to commit suicide, they might have long given up on the plan to go against him. It was best not to offend such an expert.","Many of them regretted their decision to participate in this matter. They had only done Nine Stars a favor and cooperated with the young master of Nine Stars. However, they didn’t expect such a terrifying monster would be drawn out.","Many people turned their eyes to Nine Stars’ expert who was sitting at the head of the table. After all, it could be said that this matter was caused by Nine Stars. If it wasn’t for the young master of Nine Stars, none of this would have happened. Now that he was dead, it had implicated so many people.","It was a middle-aged man with sharp eyebrows and starry eyes. It could be seen that he was also a handsome man when he was young. His body emitted an extremely oppressive aura, and his eyes were sharp like an eagle’s.","Seeing that the atmosphere was very gloomy, everyone looked over again. His face revealed a helpless expression. Nine Stars couldn’t escape from this matter, but in any case, they had no way out. They couldn’t let Chu Yunfan destroy these six major sects. Otherwise, no one would dare to mingle with Nine Stars in the future. They would have to stay far away, and Nine Stars’ power would plummet.","At this moment, he had already guessed Chu Yunfan’s intention of not meeting them face to face, but picking out these thirteen sects one by one. He was slapping Nine Stars in the face.","He was not as timid as many people said. He had done a series of things since he appeared. He had suppressed the Mysteries Pavilion, slaughtered Nine Stars’ experts, and challenged several first-class and second-class sects. How could such a person be as timid as a mouse?","He was obviously audacious and had no respect for Nine Stars.","Because of this, he was even more certain that Chu Yunfan was demonstrating his power to Nine Stars. At the same time, he was warning all the forces that followed Nine Stars that whoever dared to follow them would suffer the consequences.","And the effect was obvious. Facing Nine Stars’ invitation, Nine Stars, which usually had a hundred responses, had very few responses. Chu Yunfan had scared them.","The major forces were smart. They knew very well that they didn’t know if Chu Yunfan was a match for the Nine Stars, but it was as easy as playing with them to destroy them.","In a short period, it was enough to kill them all. Who would dare to provoke such a monster?","As a result, Nine Stars had no choice but to personally deal with Chu Yunfan.","Such a smart and cunning opponent was so strong that it made people tremble in fear. It was really a great sin to provoke him.","The man really wanted to scold that idiot for causing all this trouble, but he knew that complaining now was useless.","“Deputy Master Zhang, this matter was caused by Nine Stars. We cooperated with your Nine Stars.” a Void Core stood up and said.","Among the thirty Cores present, only a dozen of them belonged to the six sects. The rest were Nine Stars’ experts. One could imagine how powerful Nine Stars was. Even if it was only a part of their strength, it was still much stronger than the six major sects combined.","“That’s right, this incident was caused by your young master. Your sect master can’t just sit back and do nothing. Jian Wuchen is ruthless and powerful. He’s invincible unless against your master. If your master doesn’t show up, we might as well disband,” the sect master of Mount Sky said slowly.","The experts of the six sects all revealed a somewhat dissatisfied expression.","At this moment, the sect master of Nine Stars should rise up, but he didn’t and allowed the various sects to be slaughtered by Chu Yunfan. This made them very dissatisfied. After all, they were just supporting Nine Stars. Now, Nine Stars was fine, but they were in trouble. This made their dissatisfaction rise day by day.","“That’s right. If your sect master doesn’t appear, won’t we be doomed? What else is there to say?”","“This beast is ferocious. I’m afraid we might not be his match!”","The Cores of the six sects spoke one after another. Although the Divines behind them did not speak, they clearly had the same thoughts.","At this moment, Deputy Master Zhang frowned and shouted, “What are you arguing about? Is Nine Stars so irresponsible? The sect master is busy, so he can’t take care of this. Although the master can’t come, we have invited the old previous master. With the old master around, if Jian Wuchen dares to appear, he won’t be able to escape.”","Hearing this, everyone was shocked. They knew about the old sect master of Nine Stars. When they were young, the old master had been famous all over the world. Later, because of his old age, he passed the position to the current master.","Although he was old, there was no doubt that he was a Core Former.","As for Chu Yunfan, although there were rumors that he had the strength of the Core Former, many people slapped him in the face. When Chu Yunfan attacked, there were no signs of a Core Former attacking. He was clearly a Void Core.","As long as Chu Yunfan was in the Void Core Stage, no matter how powerful he was, he would not be able to escape death.","At the thought of this, their faces revealed a hint of joy, but at the same time, they were slightly shocked. It seemed that Nine Stars really hated Chu Yunfan. To deal with Chu Yunfan, they even invited the old sect master, who was rumored to have passed away.","This was a trap—an inescapable net targeted at Chu Yunfan!"]},{"number":1445,"title":"Chapter 1445 Chu Yunfan Appears, Frightening Everyone","paragraphs":["1445 Chu Yunfan Appears, Frightening Everyone","Everyone relaxed upon finding out that Nine Stars’ old sect master would participate in this battle.","Ordinary people did not understand the difference between the Void Core Stage and the Core Form Stage, but Cores did. One could not simply calculate it with reason.","Nine Stars’ members thought Chu Yunfan would die after meeting their old master.","“I didn’t expect Nine Stars’ old master to be alive. Wasn’t there a rumor stating he had died?”","“That’s right. The old master entrusted his position to the current master a hundred years ago. Nine Stars’ old master was already old at that time. I didn’t expect him to reappear.”","“Nine Stars is terrifying. They have more than two Core Formers guarding them.”","“What’s going on with Nine Stars’ old master? Why didn’t he appear in the battle against Jian Wuchen earlier?”","Everyone felt they had won and were much more relaxed, so they discussed in low voices. Their chances of winning were much higher with the old master’s help. They did not even need to rush to the front lines. Also, it should reduce the probability of casualties.","Someone asked, “When will the old master arrive?”","Deputy Master Zhang looked at the person and said, “He’s already here. He’ll appear when the time is ripe. However, we can’t alert the enemy. It won’t be good if Jian Wuchen gets wind of it and gets scared off. After all, he’s as timid as a mouse.”","He burst into laughter, and others followed suit. It was as if Chu Yunfan was just as Deputy Master Zhang said, easing the previously tense atmosphere. Most of Nine Stars’ members were overjoyed and relieved.","“What if Jian Wuchen doesn’t dare to show up?” someone asked, causing the others to be on tenterhooks again. If that happened, they would have made so many preparations for nothing.","“Don’t worry. Jian Wuchen won’t live up to his legend if he doesn’t dare to show up. Then, everyone will finally understand how overrated he is. His life will be difficult then.”","Deputy Master Zhang sneered and continued, “Our current master will deal with Jian Wuchen when he has time. Also, Jian Wuchen offended the Mysteries Pavilion. If he moves a few more times, it’ll be challenging for him to hide the news.”","Everyone thought about it and agreed. It would be a good thing if Chu Yunfan did not show up. In that case, Nine Stars’ old master would take action and save the clan their efforts.","“Hmph, Jian Wuchen will die for even daring to provoke us. Still, I want him to stay alive for a while longer.” Deputy Master Zhang smirked. “No one needs to worry about today’s alliance meeting. If Jian Wuchen dares not appear, forget it. If he does, this will be his grave.”","Everyone’s mood improved, and their discussions became heated. Most started discussing how to get the powerful secret from Chu Yunfan after they killed him.","Chu Yunfan was formidable and had a mysterious background. Most people suspected he had many secrets. They even began discussing sharing his secret with others.","Suddenly, a young man dressed in black clothes pulled a Mount Sky disciple and asked, “Excuse me, where’s your master? I must talk to him.”","The disciple felt dissatisfied when the person pulled him. The former impatiently said, “What do you want?! Are you blind? Don’t you know we’re amid an alliance to deal with Jian Wuchen?!”","“I know.” The young man grinned with a sunny smile.","“Then why are you wasting your breath? I don’t care who you are. Do you think you can meet my master just because you want to?” the Mount Sky disciple said proudly.","Mount Sky had been cowardly and even had to join forces with other sects to deal with Chu Yunfan since he was a formidable opponent.","Mount Sky’s master was a high and mighty figure to ordinary people, but the young man seemed ignorant.","The young man in black clothing grinned and said, “Isn’t Mount Sky’s master someone I can meet whenever I want? I think that should be possible. You said you’re allying to fight Jian Wuchen, right? What a coincidence. I’m Jian Wuchen.”","“Even if you have the same name, you can’t... What do you mean you’re Jian Wuchen?!” The Mount Sky disciple screamed. He did not get it initially but quickly flinched and looked at Chu Yunfan in horror.","During this period, lower-level disciples knew Chu Yunfan as a murderous demon. After all, he could quickly eradicate sects, making him a terrifying existence.","The higher-ups knew he had a sense of decency and did not kill the innocent. However, those of lower levels had strange sources of information. After the continuous transmission of information, the news changed.","Chu Yunfan had long become a grim reaper to certain folk. What the disciple least expected was for Chu Yunfan to appear before him so nonchalantly.","The disciple thought of the many legends about Chu Yunfan and became so frightened that he almost fainted. He felt like Chu Yunfan could eat him alive.","Meanwhile, the others were also scared out of their wits. The initially lively atmosphere turned dead silent. No one expected Chu Yunfan to appear and mingle among them.","Everyone considered that he must have heard them speaking ill of him and trembled despite themselves. They feared he would kill them with his sword. The whole place instantly fell so silent that one could hear a pin drop.","Everyone paled in fear but dared not try to escape. Their legs would not listen to them even if they tried.","Chu Yunfan touched his face and felt a little depressed. ‘Am I that scary?’","Although Jian Wuchen’s features were slightly sharper than his actual self, he had not shifted into a monster. He had never considered the countless rumors about him frightening ordinary people. After all, rumors stopped at the wise, but there were too few wise men.","Immediately after, news of his appearance spread from Mount Sky’s depths to atop the mountain, and a furious roar came from it, “Jian Wuchen?! Where is he?!”"]},{"number":1446,"title":"Chapter 1446 No One Can Protect the Person I Want to Kill","paragraphs":["1446 No One Can Protect the Person I Want to Kill","After the furious roar, everyone saw hundreds of light beams flying out from the depths of Mount Sky. It was a magnificent sight that covered the sky and sun.","A moment later, hundreds of figures appeared before Chu Yunfan. The weakest was an upper-stage Divine at the seventh Divine Abilities Stage. The thirty people in the lead were Void Cores.","Such a lineup was shocking and could probably sweep through the entire Federation. One would imagine the Federation’s martial arts skills, which they had developed for only hundreds of years, were far inferior to the Spirit Realm.","The hundreds of beams of light lined up neatly before Chu Yunfan and swept toward him with an overwhelming aura.","Chu Yunfan’s existence resembled a small raft in a stormy sea in front of these figures. It was as if they could swallow him whole at any time. Chu Yunfan was a single person fighting against heaven and earth.","Everyone looked at the scene before them with shock and awe. They would never forget what they had seen for the rest of their lives as the scene burned into their memories.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the figures before him and did not feel threatened. The remaining thirty Cores primarily consisted of fledgling Void Cores, intermediate Cores, a few late Void Cores, and peak Void Cores.","The leader, Deputy Master Zhang, was the strongest. He had already stepped into the half-step Core Form Stage and was far more substantial than the others.","However, Chu Yunfan knew Deputy Master Zhang had reached his potential limit. Unlike Yun Tian, the latter could not advance further without unique, fortuitous encounters in his life. Chu Yunfan was also a half-step Core Former and could enter the Core Form Stage if he had enough time. The two might be in the same stage, but their futures were worlds apart.","“I didn’t expect you to show up, Jian Wuchen!” Deputy Master Zhang was surprised. He thought Chu Yunfan would not dare show himself. He thought there was only a 10% chance of Chu Yunfan appearing. After all, this was a trap that he had set up.","‘How stupid is Jian Wuchen not to know it’s a trap and still rush over to die?’","Instead of saying the meeting was a trap for Chu Yunfan, Deputy Master Zhang felt it was more accurate to say it was to extinguish Chu Yunfan’s arrogance and show others he was not invincible.","As for Chu Yunfan rushing in, the probability was not high, even if they made the most optimistic estimate. However, Chu Yunfan slapped Deputy Master Zhang’s face. The former’s actions were not something one could predict.","Still, there was nothing mysterious about it from Chu Yunfan’s perspective. All schemes and plots were pointless before absolute strength.","He grinned and asked, “Why wouldn’t I dare to appear? I heard you cast an inescapable net for me. I want to see how inescapable your net is.”","He glanced at the figures before him and continued, “I’m afraid these people aren’t enough for me to kill. Is this all Nine Stars could come up with?”","“Hmph, anyone can talk big, Jian Wuchen.” Deputy Master Zhang could not wait to move when he saw Chu Yunfan. After all, it would be a miracle if Chu Yunfan could escape such a lineup.","“I must ask you. Jian Wuchen, what’s your relationship with Tang Siyu for you to dare go against Nine Stars?”","“What’s it to you?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Don’t tell me you and Tang Siyu are old flames. Honestly, we’ve already had a good time with her.” One of the Cores from Nine Stars revealed a lustful expression.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan abruptly frowned and rushed toward the one who spoke ill of Tang Siyu.","The Core did not fear Chu Yunfan because the former stood in the crowd, but he did not expect Chu Yunfan to pounce on him as soon as he finished speaking. A terrifying aura locked onto the Core as if he faced an archaic beast.","The Core could not even move and felt like a mountain was pressing down on him. He even felt a sense of despair as a look of disbelief flashed through his eyes.","This Nine Stars member was in the Core stage, so it should be impossible for him to feel suppressed to such an extent just by Chu Yunfan’s aura. But in the end, Chu Yunfan was too formidable and was a monster.","“How dare you act so fiercely before me!” Deputy Master Zhang was outraged. He jumped and formed an array of shields around the Core.","His golden shields were hundreds of meters wide, and the ancient patterns they bore wriggled while forming a solid defense.","“Do you think you can block me?!” Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a punch.","Boom!","He smashed the golden shields into pieces with his punch without even struggling. It was a shocking sight.","Chu Yunfan instantly appeared before the Core with a ball of energy rapidly spinning in his hand. The energy transformed into a sword and cut the Core in half.","Spurt!","Blood squirted everywhere. Although it took a long time to describe, everything happened in a split second. Chu Yunfan had cut the Core into two halves before anyone could react.","Finally, everyone realized how inferior they were to Chu Yunfan. Only Deputy Master Zhang could retaliate. Still, his strength was not enough to stop Chu Yunfan.","The rebound force from Chu Yunfan’s punch even hit Deputy Master Zhang, causing the latter to pale. It was difficult for Deputy Master Zhang to circulate his divine power to block the terrifying force of Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Deputy Master Zhang stared at Chu Yunfan like a hungry wolf and thundered, “How dare you kill someone in front of me!” His eyes were red, and his killing intent intensified.","“So what if I did? No one can stop me from killing whoever I want, let alone you.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “This is what happens to people with big mouths. You can eat what you want but can’t speak out of your *ss!","“Cut the crap and show me the inescapable net you’ve prepared! Show me!”"]},{"number":1447,"title":"Chapter 1447 Inescapable Net? Break!","paragraphs":["1447 Inescapable Net? Break!","Killing a Void Core in one move had stunned the entire arena.","Although Chu Yunfan had challenged many sects before, these experts had never seen him fight with their own eyes. Therefore, when they saw him casually kill a Void Core, they felt incredulous.","It was so fast. When a Void Core faced Chu Yunfan, they were no match at all.","“Do it. Kill him!”","Deputy Master Zhang was completely enraged. Chu Yunfan killing people in front of him was no different from slapping him hard on the face.","Behind Deputy Master Zhang, a large array formed by hundreds of people was formed. They had practiced it long ago. In fact, those who could cultivate to the Divine Abilities Stage had a rather shocking understanding of martial arts and this array formation could be easily mastered without much training.","The power of hundreds of people rushed toward Chu Yunfan in the form of an array. Everyone’s power gathered into a torrent through the array and swept toward him.","“You plan to take me down with this?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. The long sword on his back was suddenly unsheathed. In an instant, he grabbed it in his hand and rushed into the array.","Clang!","The long sword swept out with a shocking sword light, cutting through the sky and instantly slashing a terrifying tide that swept toward the grand array, turning it into nothingness. Then, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s figure charge into the array like a bolt of lightning. He stepped on the power of lightning, increasing his speed to the extreme.","“River Sunset Slash!”","Chu Yunfan’s sword swept out. Everyone could clearly see that under the sword light, a scene of the setting sun in the river was formed. The sword intent came crashing down. Dozens of Divines who were swept by the powerful sword light were struck. They were unable to resist, and their bodies exploded in mid-air.","The entire array shook violently. Under Chu Yunfan’s strike, a corner of the array was shattered.","“Sh*t! Stop him!” Deputy Master Zhang roared.","The thirty Void Cores began to move, wanting to surround Chu Yunfan. Although the strength of Divines was far inferior to theirs, hundreds of high-stage Divines formed the foundation of this array formation. If Chu Yunfan continued to slaughter them like this, the entire array would collapse.","However, how could their speed be compared to Chu Yunfan’s? Just as they were about to surround him, they saw him step on a beam of light and leave the place.","He charged into another group of Divines.","Because there were too many Divines, he didn’t need to worry about them at all. He could casually slaughter a large number of them.","Slice!","Another sword light swept across, and dozens of Divines exploded in the air.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Blood rained down from the sky above Mount Sky, falling on every mountain.","The remaining disciples of Mount Sky and many representatives from the major forces in the outer realm stared at the scene in front of them with wide eyes. No one expected the battle to be so intense from the start.","“So scary. Is this Jian Wuchen’s strength?”","“That’s right. To be able to challenge so many clans in a row, it wouldn’t make sense if he didn’t have such strength.”","Many people felt a chill run down their spines. They had thought that this was a trap set up against Chu Yunfan, but now it seemed that it was not a dead end for him.","In the sky, Chu Yunfan’s slaughter continued. The power of the array was constantly reflected as it operated. It tried to trap Chu Yunfan and launch an attack, but Chu Yunfan was fearless.","It was as if he was walking in the fields, like a fairy strolling in a courtyard. In a leisurely stroll, he carried out a massacre that made countless people marvel. It was truly terrifying.","Chu Yunfan looked very calm. This array formation could not trap him. Instead, these Divines who had gathered together had become his cannon fodder. Whether it was the experts of the six major sects or the experts of Nine Stars, they were all the same in front of Chu Yunfan.","The thirty Void Cores could not keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed. They could only shout in anger and watch as he carried out this shocking massacre.","“Jian Wuchen, fight like a man!” a Void Core roared.","“Is that so? As you wish!”","Chu Yunfan’s voice suddenly sounded in his ears. In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already appeared in front of him. Then, a sword light descended from the sky.","Slash!","This Void Core was killed before he could even react.","When the other Void Cores rushed over to provide support, they only saw Chu Yunfan killing this Void Core.","Then, he started killing again.","Hundreds of people seemed like a lot, but they realized that in front of a true expert, such numbers were useless.","Many people stared at Chu Yunfan intently, but their eyes couldn’t keep up with his speed. They gathered all their divine power in their eyes, but it was useless. They could only see those Divines being slashed apart by Chu Yunfan in the air, and blood blossomed in the sky like flowers.","Many people no longer had the thought of watching the show. On the contrary, when they saw this scene, they felt their entire bodies tremble.","What an astonishing battle... What an astonishing slaughter!","It was completely different from any scene they had imagined. This was not a confrontation, but a complete massacre.","It wasn’t that Deputy Master Zhang and the others had set up an inescapable net to slaughter Chu Yunfan, but that Chu Yunfan had easily slaughtered them.","In just a short period, these hundreds of Divines had been slaughtered by Chu Yunfan. By the time they realized that something was wrong, it was already too late.","This was because Chu Yunfan’s killing speed was too fast. With a single slash of his sword, all the Divines in the entire area would die at his hands.","“This is your inescapable net. It seems that all of you will not be able to escape death today,” Chu Yunfan said coldly."]},{"number":1448,"title":"Chapter 1448 The Last Trump Card of Nine Stars","paragraphs":["1448 The Last Trump Card of Nine Stars","After killing all the Divines, Chu Yunfan turned his gaze to the remaining 30 or so Void Cores.","Immediately, these Void Cores felt as if they had seen a prehistoric ferocious beast come to life. It was as if they had seen a monster. They had never thought that someone’s strength could be so terrifying.","After all, if they were in such a large formation, it would be difficult for them to escape death. It was impossible for them to fight against such a large formation.","However, Chu Yunfan did it. They predicted that the array would be able to trap Chu Yunfan, but they did not expect that it would not be able to stop him.","They couldn’t even slow down his footsteps.","Chu Yunfan directly pierced through them. Hundreds of Divines were slaughtered by him in a short period.","Chu Yunfan sneered. If it was an array formed by hundreds of Cores, he might be a little afraid. However, he did not care about defeating an array formed by Divines. At the end of the day, these people had underestimated him. Cultivation had never represented Chu Yunfan’s combat strength.","Moreover, once one reached a certain level, they could basically fight several people at once, and their combat strength would undergo an earth-shattering change. It was already not easy for ordinary people to defeat opponents of the same realm, let alone kill them. It could be said that it was even more difficult to get on the market.","It was precisely because of such a normal speculation that they had set up such a large array. If they had enough understanding of Chu Yunfan’s strength and combat strength, they would not have done such an indifferent thing.","Such an inescapable net was nothing to Chu Yunfan.","In fact, Chu Yunfan had faced many life-and-death situations since his debut. He did not even remember how many times he had faced them. This kind of situation might have been so scary for others that they did not dare to come, but for him, this was not a problem.","When Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over them, the thirty Void Cores immediately tensed up, and their hair stood on end. They felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","Everyone felt that something was wrong. Experts who had cultivated to their level trusted their intuition more because this intuition was often more reliable than their own judgment. It was a kind of divine power that existed in the unseen world. It was just that it would not usually appear.","They immediately understood that Chu Yunfan had the ability to kill them.","Perhaps Chu Yunfan had never really taken action from the beginning to the end. He was just teasing them. Thinking of this, they couldn’t help but gasp.","When they looked at Chu Yunfan’s expression, they immediately broke out in a cold sweat. They thought that they had set up an inescapable net, but little did they know that this was an opportunity for Chu Yunfan to catch them all in one fell swoop.","But before this, who would have thought that this would actually be the case? After all, no matter how one looked at it, they should have the upper hand in terms of strength.","In the end, hundreds of high-stage Divines were killed in one go. Even for Nine Stars, which had a huge family and business, it was a huge loss. After all, although Divines were not considered top-notch experts, Void Cores, who were top-notch experts, were produced from them.","The loss of hundreds of high-stage Divines was enough to cause a huge force like Nine Stars to be cut off for a certain time.","“It’s your turn next!” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly. “None of you will leave today/”","“Old Master, please!”","At this moment, no matter how stupid Deputy Master Zhang was, he realized that the current Chu Yunfan was not someone they could deal with. Even as a half-step Core Former, it was difficult for him to keep up with Chu Yunfan’s figure.","There was only one explanation for Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength. Chu Yunfan had already entered the Core Form Stage. Whether it was his realm or his combat strength, it was meaningless to talk about it now.","There was only one way to deal with a Core Former, and that was to be a Core Form Stage expert yourself.","This was no longer an existence that he could deal with. He had no choice but to use his trump card.","At this moment, there was a violent fluctuation in the void. In just a moment, an incomparably huge iceberg appeared in front of everyone.","It was an iceberg that was about a hundred meters tall. As soon as the iceberg appeared, the entire Mount Sky felt as if the temperature had dropped by more than ten degrees. A cold wind blew through the sky.","One had to know that there was still a huge sun hanging above their heads. One could imagine how shocking the temperature of this iceberg was.","“What is that? A great big iceberg!”","Many people exclaimed, but soon, someone realized something was wrong. They discovered that there was someone in this huge iceberg. Although it was only a shadow, it did not hinder them, who had cultivated successfully. They could see that there was actually a human figure inside it.","Combined with Deputy Master Zhang’s words, many people seemed to have thought of something. Upon closer inspection, there were layers of patterns carved on the iceberg. It seemed to be an ancient barrier that sealed the figure’s body in ice.","“Don’t tell me the old master of Nine Stars is in there!” someone suddenly said.","“It is said that the old master of Nine Stars had passed away. However, if he is not dead, he should be sealed in this iceberg.”","Someone gave his own guess, and it quickly gained everyone’s approval.","This was especially true for the representatives of the various large factions. They could be sent to represent their respective factions. They might not be the strongest, but their horizons were not bad. They naturally knew that there was indeed such a method. There was no lack of such methods since ancient times.","However, knowing how to do it was one thing, but those who could do it were rare.","The reason was simple. A Core’s vitality was too vigorous. Ordinary ice could not seal such an expert.","It was said that Nine Stars’ sect master had already entered the Core Form Stage. To freeze an expert of this level, it would take at least an iceberg that had not melted for ten thousand years.","Coupled with special arrays and barriers, it could freeze people inside.","The person who was sealed in the ice would undoubtedly reduce the loss of his life to the minimum and preserve his life to the greatest extent.","This was a foundation that only the super giants could achieve. Ordinary forces would not be able to find such an iceberg that would not melt for ten thousand years, let alone the array and barrier that sealed people in.","Just this ice barrier alone showed Nine Stars’ extraordinary strength."]},{"number":1449,"title":"Chapter 1449 The Void Core Massacre","paragraphs":["1449 The Void Core Massacre","Many people could not help but exclaim in admiration. The various resources needed to seal a Core Former into an iceberg were not something that ordinary people could imagine.","Only Core Formers had such value. They were sealed in such an iceberg to achieve the goal of prolonging their lifespan. This was something that many large sects had done since ancient times. However, generally speaking, this was their final trump card and would not be easily used.","They didn’t expect Nine Stars would use such a trump card to kill Chu Yunfan.","“I didn’t expect Nine Stars to have such an arrangement. Their arrangement isn’t that careless. It could even be said that they’ve formed an inescapable net and have considered everything. The only thing they didn’t consider was that Jian Wuchen’s strength was too strong. He actually broke everyone’s expectations one after another.”","“That’s right. Nine Stars has existed for so many years.”","“I’m afraid Jian Wuchen won’t have a good time. Even the old leader of Nine Stars has come out.”","Many people immediately praised Nine Stars’ way of doing things. Many people even felt a chill run down their spine. The more meticulous Nine Stars was, the more it represented their killing intent. They wanted to kill Chu Yunfan.","“But to kill Jian Wuchen, the price is too high. I heard that those who choose to be frozen voluntarily are often at the end of their lives and can’t extend their lives anymore. Once they’re unsealed, it will be their last battle. Even if they can endure until they are frozen again, they won’t have the chance to be unsealed again.”","“That’s right. I’m afraid the old master of Nine Stars will slowly die in the ice.”","“Is it worth paying such a price to deal with Jian Wuchen?”","Some people sighed. They felt that Nine Stars was making a mountain out of a molehill, but when they looked up and saw Chu Yunfan, they immediately felt that they were not making a mountain out of a molehill. After all, no matter how they looked at it, Chu Yunfan was completely qualified.","Chu Yunfan saw the iceberg. The carvings engraved on the iceberg began to rotate rapidly, and the barrier covering the iceberg was unsealed layer by layer. He was much more knowledgeable than the people below. How could he not know what kind of existence was in this iceberg?","Ordinary people couldn’t even sense the old master of Nine Stars in the iceberg, but Chu Yunfan’s divine will was a hundred times more sensitive than these people. In this case, he could easily sense the existence of the old master of Nine Stars in the iceberg.","Although the life force fluctuation was very small, he was still alive.","Chu Yunfan knew that there were indeed many great sects that had such a method. They would freeze those old seniors who were on the verge of death into a ten-thousand-year-old iceberg until the day when they were needed to wake them up. But in reality, most of them could not wait until the day they woke up. After being frozen, they died in the iceberg.","After all, although the loss of vitality would be reduced to the minimum after being frozen, it would still continue to be lost. Ordinary people would be fine, but these people were already on the verge of death. They were just one breath away.","They would slowly die in the iceberg.","“Jian Wuchen, don’t even think about running away now.”","When these thirty Void Cores saw the iceberg emerge, the array and barrier automatically unsealed. It wouldn’t be long before the old master of Nine Stars would awaken. At that time, it would be Chu Yunfan’s doomsday.","At this moment, they were not afraid. Instead, they surrounded Chu Yunfan, afraid that he would escape.","“Run? Why would I run?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “He’s just an old man who’s about to die. Do you think he can kill me?","“It’s a pity for such an expert to die in the iceberg. Since he insists on forcefully reviving, then I’ll send him on his way.” Chu Yunfan continued, “But before that, I’ll get rid of you first.”","Those Void Cores were instantly shocked. They never expected Chu Yunfan to still dare to be so arrogant even at this stage. He simply did not put them in his eyes at all.","“D*mn it, Jian Wuchen. You’re too arrogant!” a Void Core roared. He could feel that the old master of Nine Stars in the iceberg was recovering his life force. His heartbeat, which was originally almost imperceptible, was getting stronger and stronger. If he could hold on for a little longer, the old master of Nine Stars would be able to wake up.","At this moment, Deputy Master Zhang was a little regretful. Why didn’t he revive the old master earlier? Now, Chu Yunfan had the initiative. He should have used all his strength to kill Chu Yunfan in one strike.","“Arrogant? I don’t think so. I’m just telling the truth.”","Chu Yunfan’s voice suddenly appeared in the ears of this Void Core.","Then, the Void Core’s vision suddenly blurred. He realized that Chu Yunfan had appeared in front of him without him knowing. Then, he didn’t have time to think. He only felt a sharp pain in his chest, but he didn’t know when Chu Yunfan had pierced him with a sword.","The long sword that pierced through his body shattered his internal organs into powder.","Quick!","Quick!","Quick!","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast, so fast that even Void Cores couldn’t react in time. Under his feet, waves of thunder ripples appeared.","In an instant, a Void Core had already died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Immediately after, an even more terrifying slaughter began.","Chu Yunfan’s feet constantly stepped out with lightning ripples. In the blink of an eye, another Void Core had fallen by his hands.","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","In the sky, waves of blood mist exploded, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky. Previously, it was the Divines, but now it was the Void Cores’ turn.","At this moment, those Void Cores completely understood the despair that those Divines felt when they were slaughtered by Chu Yunfan without being able to fight back. They had been too optimistic and thought that they were Chu Yunfan’s opponents. But to Chu Yunfan, they were no different from ants.","In just a short while, more than thirty Void Cores had been slaughtered by Chu Yunfan one after another. Only Deputy Master Zhang was left.","At this moment, the old master of Nine Stars had fully recovered. Cracks appeared on the iceberg."]},{"number":1450,"title":"Chapter 1450 Savior? No, They Would Die the Same Way!","paragraphs":["1450 Savior? No, They Would Die the Same Way!","On the iceberg, the cracks were constantly expanding, and more and more shocking divine power fluctuations were released from the 10,000-year-old iceberg. Chu Yunfan’s continuous killing seemed to have alarmed and angered the old sect master of Nine Stars.","Finally, after reaching a certain level, a roar came from the 10,000-year-old iceberg, “Stop!”","With this huge roar, the barrier and array on the iceberg collapsed.","Seeing this scene, Deputy Master Zhang suddenly felt like he had seen hope in the midst of despair. His entire body stiffened, scared silly by Chu Yunfan. In such a short period, all the experts he had brought with him—the trump cards that he had thought could restrain Chu Yunfan—had been singlehandedly killed by Chu Yunfan.","How shocking was this?!","If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed that someone could do this. Even the sect master couldn’t do it. In front of outsiders, he was the high and mighty deputy sect master of Nine Stars, but now he was just a stray dog.","How could he care about his dignity? He quickly fled in the direction of the iceberg. He only wanted to not be killed by Chu Yunfan.","“Old Master, save me!” he roared and turned into a streak of light as he fled.","Although it was only a short distance, it was like a natural moat to him.","Suddenly, at that moment, Chu Yunfan was already in front of him. It was too fast. Chu Yunfan’s speed was like a ghost.","In the next moment, Deputy Master Zhang felt a terrifying aura enveloping the top of his head. He looked up and saw Chu Yunfan with his arms crossed. Chu Yunfan had caught up with him.","Instantly, his soul left his body.","Chu Yunfan immediately began to move. His foot suddenly stomped down, and in an instant, it landed on Deputy Master Zhang.","Chu Yunfan had to hide his identity, so he did not use the Nine Netherworld Stomps. Even so, after cultivating the technique, his understanding of leg techniques had reached a peak. With a casual stomp, it made Deputy Master Zhang feel as if the sky and earth were collapsing.","Boom!","Deputy Master Zhang let out a miserable cry as he was trampled. His entire body exploded into pieces in mid-air as if he had been dismembered by five horses. It was extremely miserable.","Chu Yunfan had stomped him to death.","Instantly, the entire Mount Sky fell silent. Everyone looked at the scene in disbelief.","“Dead... They’re all dead. How could this be?”","Many people gasped. It took them a long time before they finally reacted. Hundreds of Divines had been wiped out. More than 30 Void Core experts had been wiped out. Such a cruel battle could be said to be a loss on the level of a country war.","Generally speaking, only when two or three countries of Great Wei or Great Qi were at war with each other could such an astonishing massacre occur. Otherwise, they would not have been able to gather so many experts. Not to mention, when they usually fought, they would basically leave some face and not kill each other as easily as Chu Yunfan.","Such a massacre had not occurred in the outer realm for hundreds of years. This battle was unforgettable, and this scene was destined to be recorded in history.","“The six major sects are finished this time. With so many experts dead, even if the sect is still around, it might be swallowed up by others,” someone exclaimed.","After all, they all knew that in the outer realm, the top experts were the key to everything. Even if the foundations of the six major sects were not damaged, just the death of so many experts was basically confirmed. Even if the mountains were sealed for hundreds of years, they might not be able to make up for today’s loss.","“Not only the six but all thirteen major sects that helped Nine Stars are all finished. This is a slap to Nine Stars’ face.”","Some people had already analyzed Chu Yunfan’s purpose because this was not a conspiracy, but an open plot. However, they had to admit that even if it was an open plot, they had nothing to say.","They were afraid of helping Nine Stars, or else they would be playing with fire.","“But if Jian Wuchen doesn’t leave, it’s too late!”","A burly man shouted, and the iceberg instantly exploded. A hunchbacked old man in luxurious clothes slowly walked out.","This old man’s hair and beard were all white, and he looked extremely old. His old face was covered with wrinkles, and he looked no different from the old men on the street. However, no one dared to underestimate this old man.","His body carried a monstrous aura, and he suppressed the aura of the entire Mount Sky singlehandedly. This was an astonishing power, but no one was surprised. Instead, they felt that this was the only way to match his status.","He was the previous sect master of Nine Stars, a top-notch figure in the entire outer realm.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move an inch when facing the old master. He wasn’t affected by the aura. On the contrary, he crossed his arms and looked at the furious old man with a faint smile.","Chu Yunfan understood in his heart that if he was not mistaken, this old man was the legendary Nine Stars’ old master.","It was indeed as the rumors said, he had stepped into the Core Form Stage. However, just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, his energy and blood had been exhausted to a certain extent. After being sealed for so many years, his vitality had already declined to the bottom.","However, even so, to an ordinary Void Core, there was still a destructive power that was like Mount Tai pressing down on them. It was not an existence that ordinary Void Cores could contend against.","“Y-You evil man. D&mn you!”","The old man slowly spoke. It seemed that because he had not spoken for many years, his voice was hoarse and sharp, like an owl.","His eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan. From the moment he regained his consciousness, he saw Chu Yunfan slaughtering wantonly. Many of them were Nine Stars’ experts.","Thinking of this, the anger in his heart began to soar.","Before this, his consciousness had been awakened. Deputy Master Zhang had told him about this, so he knew that this guy was a big threat to Nine Stars.","Especially when he looked so young.","A hint of jealousy flashed in his eyes. He was jealous of Chu Yunfan’s youth, and at the same time, there was a hint of terrifying killing intent. He couldn’t let such a person live. Otherwise, he would destroy Nine Stars."]},{"number":1451,"title":"Chapter 1451 Brutal Beating","paragraphs":["1451 Brutal Beating","This was an intuition, and he trusted his intuition.","This young man who was as sharp as an unsheathed sword would probably bury Nine Stars in the future. This was a premonition without any reason.","The old sect master exuded an extremely dangerous aura. Almost the entire Mount Sky was enveloped in this extremely dangerous feeling, which made people tremble in fear. No one dared to speak. Everyone held their breath as if someone was strangling their necks. They couldn’t even breathe.","“How scary. Is this the old master of Nine Stars?”","“The difference between the strength of a Core Former and a Void Core simply can’t be calculated with reason.”","“I’m afraid that Jian Wuchen won’t be able to please us. He’s too arrogant.”","Just as everyone was thinking about it, the old master of Nine Stars suddenly attacked. A giant hand swept down like the sky and earth were collapsing.","It was a terrifying attack as soon as it was launched. Even a Void Core would probably not be able to resist it.","But Chu Yunfan only sneered and casually slashed out with his sword. With a simple slash, the hand exploded in mid-air. All of this seemed so easy for him as if it was not difficult at all.","“Is this the extent of your strength? Then I guess I can only send you on your way.” Chu Yunfan looked at the old master and sneered.","The old master looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, his eyes flashing with a terrifying light.","“I advise you to use your full strength soon. You will die after you reach the peak of glory,” Chu Yunfan continued.","The old master of Nine Stars naturally understood what Chu Yunfan was saying. He was luring him to his death. If he used his full strength and was extremely glorious, he would die. Whether Chu Yunfan died in his hands or not, he would definitely not live.","At the thought of this, the old master shook slightly. In an instant, his figure disappeared. Then, in the next moment, he appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. His entire body emitted waves of light as if waves of starlight had enveloped him.","“You don’t use your muscles and bones as your strength. It seems that you don’t understand this principle. You actually dare to fight me in close combat.”","Chu Yunfan sneered and casually slashed down with his sword.","Clang!","Chu Yunfan’s sword light swept up and hit the old master.","Clang!","A sound like metal clashing was heard, and then the old master was sent flying.","Spurt!","The old master spat out a mouthful of blood. It took him a long time to stabilize himself. A look of disbelief flashed across his eyes. It was too fast. Chu Yunfan’s reaction speed was too fast.","He had launched a surprise attack without any warning in order to succeed in one strike, but he had failed to catch Chu Yunfan off guard.","Chu Yunfan was too calm, so calm that he seemed to have been prepared for this. Chu Yunfan’s attack had already swept over before he could make a move.","To outsiders, it looked as if Chu Yunfan had raised his sword high and then crashed into it. However, he knew that Chu Yunfan had struck first.","It was an incredible miracle that the top cultivator could achieve this in the future. Chu Yunfan was clearly strong. Moreover, he was far more terrifying than he had imagined.","The starlight on his body dimmed and was almost shattered by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","At this moment, everyone in Mount Sky gasped.","“That’s the famous defensive divine art of Nine Stars, the Nine Star Body Protection. It’s rumored that the old master was once besieged by more than ten Void Cores. All kinds of attacks swept over, but they were unable to break through his defense.”","“That’s right, that’s the ultimate technique. I didn’t expect that it would be broken by Jian Wuchen’s strike.”","“The old master is old, and he’s not at the peak anymore.”","“No, you all think that it’s because the old master is old. But I think that even at his peak, he might not be able to block Jian Wuchen’s strike.”","Everyone discussed animatedly. There were people with all kinds of views, but there was no doubt that this was an extremely shocking collision.","However, in the eyes of the representatives of the stronger forces, they saw Chu Yunfan, who was unbelievably confident. The old master of Nine Stars, who made everyone tremble in fear, was simply being toyed with.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t in a hurry to attack, and his counterattacks had such power. If this wasn’t a joke, what was it?","The old sect master, who was flying in the sky, saw Chu Yunfan’s attitude. He was instantly furious. Like an angry old lion, he instantly erupted.","“Jian Wuchen, you look down on me!” the old master roared angrily.","“Looking down on you?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “That’s right. Since you want to see it, I’ll let you see it!”","For the first time, Chu Yunfan’s aura was truly released. The terrifying aura that erupted instantly soared into the sky. If the aura of the old master was like the sky, vast and boundless, making people despair, then Chu Yunfan was like a sharp sword that could cut through everything.","It was as if he had transformed into a divine sword.","Among the representatives of the major forces of the outer realm in Mount Sky, there was no lack of powerful Cores. However, their expressions changed at this time. They had only guessed whether Chu Yunfan’s strength had already entered the Core Form Stage.","However, there was no need to guess now. This was already a clear fact.","There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan had surpassed the Void Core Stage.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a sharp sword, unsheathed in an instant, and slashed down at the old master.","Bam!","The speed of Chu Yunfan’s strike was lightning-fast. The old master didn’t have time to dodge. In just an instant, the heavy strike had struck.","Spurt!","The old master spat out another mouthful of blood. He was sent flying backward, and the starlight around him dimmed.","However, this attack was only the beginning.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan attacked like a shadow. The sword light split in mid-air and turned into thousands of attacks that drowned the old master like a storm."]},{"number":1452,"title":"Chapter 1452 Nine Stars’ Old Sect Master Is Dead!","paragraphs":["1452 Nine Stars’ Old Sect Master Is Dead!","All kinds of violent sword lights swept down and drowned the old master of Nine Stars. Everyone stared at him and gasped.","Those who had already entered the Core Stage were especially terrified. They all understood that if it were them, they wouldn’t even be able to block a single strike.","A casual slash of Chu Yunfan’s sword could flatten the entire mountain of Mount Sky, and this was his true strength.","It was not as simple as they had thought.","They were even more horrified to find that although it was such a violent attack, Chu Yunfan’s control was just right. He controlled it within a certain range and did not fall to any other places.","This in itself was a miracle.","What did this mean?","Many people thought of this in their minds. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s control over energy had reached a shocking level.","Many people couldn’t help but widen their eyes. They didn’t dare to miss this chance, especially when they were wondering if the old master would survive this apocalyptic attack.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan’s attack finally stopped. Everyone thought that after launching so many terrifying attacks, his divine power should have been exhausted, but that was not the case.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm, and his aura was steady. It was as if the person who had just unleashed that shocking attack was not him, but someone else.","Many people were calculating all of this, and the more they calculated, the more they felt a chill down their backs. His shocking sword cultivation, his speed that was so fast that no one could catch him, his powerful physical cultivation, and now, his boundless and bottomless mana.","Any one of them could become a famous expert, not to mention that so many of them were concentrated on one person. That person was really a monster in the flesh.","Such a person had no weakness. Unless one defeated him with absolute strength, it was impossible to find his weakness and defeat him.","The old master of Nine Stars had his weakness, which was that he was old and weak. No matter how glorious he had been in the past, it was an indisputable fact that he was old and weak. His life was coming to an end. As long as Chu Yunfan had a little patience, he could drag him to death.","When the sword lights finally dispersed, everyone saw that the old master was still alive after Chu Yunfan’s bombardment. However, he was in an extremely sorry state, and could even be said to be miserable.","His protective starlight had been completely shattered, and his entire body was covered in huge wounds, all of which were caused by Chu Yunfan’s strikes.","“Huff, huff, huff!”","The old master was panting heavily as if he was about to lose his breath. His old face had long become unsightly. His face was covered in wrinkles, and his face could no longer be seen.","Everyone knew the old master had barely survived because he had overdrawn his life force. However, he didn’t have much life force to begin with. If he overdrew his life force, he would die.","“Not dead yet. You really are tenacious!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The old master trembled as if he would be blown down by a breeze in the next moment. Then, he stared at Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, his hands formed a seal. In the next moment, a terrifying life force surged out of his body. His originally incomparably old and wrinkled face suddenly changed. His white hair turned into black hair. The wrinkles on his face disappeared, and his hunched figure became straight again. In an instant, he seemed to have become a middle-aged man and returned to the peak of his strength.","An even more oppressive aura swept over. That was the power of the old master of Nine Stars. He had taken it back. Although it was only for a short time, it still made everyone gasp in amazement.","“You spent so much effort just to force me to use my full strength. In that case, I’ll use my full strength to take your life!” the old master said in a deep voice. At this moment, he had returned to his peak. Although it was only for a moment, he was infatuated with this feeling. It had been a long time since he had felt like he was at his peak.","It had been so long that he had almost forgotten what it felt like to be at the peak.","In the end, cultivation was to defy the heavens and change one’s fate. If one did not become a god, one would eventually die. The old master wanted to live another 500 years but there was no such chance.","He shook his head and threw the thoughts out of his mind. He could already feel the cells in his body collapsing. He had used all his life force, and this was all he could do.","“Time to die! Saving Stars Crush Punch!”","The old master let out a loud roar and punched out. All his life force was converted into this punch. The fist force swept across the sky and pierced through everything.","As the fist intent exploded, everyone seemed to see millions of terrifying meteors smashing onto the ground. That terrifying destructive power could even destroy a civilization. Destroy a world even!","Of course, the old master wasn’t that powerful, but this punch was enough to scare the whole Mount Sky to death. This punch was enough to destroy them.","Chu Yunfan’s expression finally became serious because he could feel that the strength of the old master had reached the late Core Form Stage now that he was at his peak. Even if this attack had not reached its peak, it had probably reached the intermediate Core Form Stage.","It was enough to make Chu Yunfan serious.","He held his sword in one hand and slashed out. A sword array formed in front of him and flew toward the old master’s punch. This was the defensive sword array of River Sunset Technique.","Boom!","The fist force swept through the sword array with irresistible force. Chu Yunfan’s sword array could not block it, forcing him to slash out several sword arrays in succession before finally blocking this shocking punch.","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. The old master had used all his strength, and it had been a worthwhile trip for him. In fact, he had used several moves in a row. If the other party was an ordinary intermediate or late Core Former, they would definitely not have only used this move.","Facing an expert of that level, Chu Yunfan was still a little lacking. However, he was confident that he had the ability to protect himself.","In front of Chu Yunfan, the old master of Nine Stars turned into ashes."]},{"number":1453,"title":"Chapter 1453 The World Is Shocked","paragraphs":["1453 The World Is Shocked","The battle of Mount Sky shocked the world.","The battle of Mount Sky was the end of the big event that had been raging recently. Before this, no matter how crazy a person was, they would not have expected such a terrifying outcome.","Chu Yunfan had defeated a total of thirteen sects, and a large number of high-level members, including the old sect master, died tragically. In addition, Nine Stars suffered the most losses.","Chu Yunfan had already killed a group of Cores previously. In this battle, he killed another group of Cores. In addition, even the old sect master of Nine Stars, who was originally their trump card, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","And after paying such a huge price, they were still unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan.","After the death of the old master, Chu Yunfan quickly left the scene, and the result of the battle spread throughout the world.","Nine Stars received the news immediately.","It was said that not long after Chu Yunfan left, even Nine Stars’ sect master came personally. His goal was obvious, and that was to target Chu Yunfan.","The furious Nine Stars master wanted to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces, but he missed him. They couldn’t find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts.","The major forces also received detailed information about that battle and were all shocked by Chu Yunfan’s combat strength. Everyone understood that on this piece of land, there was another existence that could call the wind and summon the rain.","The Void Core Stage could be said to be the overlord of this land. However, if one wanted to become the world’s top existence and become a big shot who could control the direction of the entire world, then one had to be a Core Former.","And such an expert was a rare existence in the world. Each of them was a famous expert. Such experts had been famous for many years, and now, a Core Former had suddenly appeared.","How could they not be shocked?","While the major forces were still in shock, Nine Stars activated their network and began to search for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. However, this time, it was not like before where countless people responded to find Tang Siyu’s whereabouts.","This time, everyone was scared out of their wits. Chu Yunfan had defeated thirteen sects in a row, and it was all for Tang Siyu. If they were to attack Chu Yunfan now, it would not be as simple as being defeated. They might be exterminated!","Moreover, the reason why those sects cooperated with Nine Stars to kill Tang Siyu was because they thought that she was just an ordinary half-step Core. At most, she was just an ordinary Core. Although such an existence could already be considered outstanding, it was not that impressive.","However, the combat strength that Chu Yunfan displayed made it clear that he had already entered the Core Form Stage. Those were two completely different concepts.","Any Core Former, even if they were alone, would be as intimidating as a colossus like Nine Stars. In this case, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Nine Stars was like a fight between gods. They didn’t dare to interfere.","Nine Stars was furious that no one dared to intervene, and even if they were forced to search, they refused to do anything. Unfortunately, they could do nothing about it.","The encirclement of Chu Yunfan this time had caused them to suffer heavy losses and lose all face. The top experts of the sect had been severely injured, and more than half of the Cores had been killed or injured.","Even Nine Stars Master, who was busy with other things, had to personally search for Chu Yunfan. For a time after, everyone saw a violent figure patrolling the entire land.","However, even under the carpet-like search of Nine Stars, Chu Yunfan seemed to have evaporated from the face of the earth. They could not find his whereabouts at all.","This made Nine Stars furious, but there was nothing they could do. They didn’t know that Chu Yunfan, who had changed back to his original appearance, had changed his identity. No matter how powerful Nine Stars was, it was impossible to find him.","It wasn’t that Chu Yunfan didn’t want to wipe out Nine Stars, but he knew that he couldn’t do it at the moment. The reason why he forced the old master to fight with all his strength was to deduce the master’s strength.","Judging from the old master’s strength, the current master of Nine Stars had probably surpassed the fledgling Core Form Stage. He was at least an intermediate Core Former, or even a late Core Former.","He should be even stronger than Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan wasn’t confident that he could defeat the Nine Stars Master. After all, it was one thing for him to be confident in protecting himself, but defeating him was another matter.","“There’s no hurry. I’ll take your head soon!” Chu Yunfan said softly but firmly while riding a tall warhorse on a wide road.","According to the information he had obtained from Great Wei’s Agency of Secrets, it was the Nine Stars Master who had personally attacked Tang Siyu and severely injured her, leading to her unknown whereabouts.","At first, Chu Yunfan didn’t think that Tang Siyu would be able to stand on her own, but now that he thought about it, she was definitely in a dangerous situation.","Tang Siyu was supposed to settle this score personally, but now her whereabouts were unknown, so Chu Yunfan had to do it himself. Moreover, he felt that her whereabouts were unknown after she was severely injured by the Nine Stars Master.","Perhaps the Nine Stars Master would know where Tang Siyu was.","Thinking about this, Chu Yunfan rode his horse all the way to the venue of the Small Pill Origin Meet. It was a valley.","In fact, this valley was the territory of the Alchemist Association. Although the Alchemist Association was not a sect, in terms of strength, it was probably above Nine Stars.","As long as one was a martial artist, it was impossible to avoid taking medicinal pills during the process of cultivation. One would inevitably have to have contact with the Alchemist Association.","With the connections it had accumulated over the years, who knew how many experts owed the Alchemist Association a huge favor? If it was necessary, with a single order, it could gather enough terrifying power to destroy Nine Stars.","Of course, the Alchemist Association would have to pay a huge price for doing so, and it would be feared by other forces because it would no longer be neutral. But no matter what, it was indeed one of the most transcendent forces in this land.","As the territory of the Alchemist Association, this valley had been developed into a rather prosperous small town. However, only alchemists could enter.","Chu Yunfan had just arrived at the entrance of the valley when a few uniformed guards stopped him."]},{"number":1454,"title":"Chapter 1454 Are All of Great Wei’s Alchemists Trash?","paragraphs":["1454 Are All of Great Wei’s Alchemists Trash?","“Stop right there, report your name. This is the place where the Alchemist Society holds the Small Origin Pill Gathering!”A guard said.","Chu Yunfan suddenly understood. He grabbed out an invitation card from the void. This was the invitation card issued by the Alchemist Society, inviting him to participate in the Small Origin Core Gathering.","“So it’s Lord Alchemist, please come in!”","When they saw Chu Yunfan take out the invitation card, the guards ‘expressions immediately changed and became much more respectful.","After all, they were all subordinates of the Alchemist Society. And these people who were able to obtain invitations were undoubtedly, even if they weren’t grandmasters, they were still rising stars with great potential.","One of these people might enter the headquarters and become their immediate superior in the future. If they offended these people, their future would not be good.","Even if they were unable to enter the headquarters now, these Alchemists basically had roots. Mobilizing the power of their own faction to find trouble with them was simply a matter of a word.","“Yes!” Chu Yunfan nodded and slowly rode into the city.","The guards looked at each other with strange expressions on their faces. They waited until Chu Yunfan was far away before they dared to speak.","“This is a little interesting. I’ve seen people coming here on light these days, and I’ve also seen people coming here on rare birds and beasts. However, they basically all flew here. This is the first time I’ve seen someone coming here on a horse!”","one of the guards asked in confusion.","In fact, this was also the reason why these people were puzzled. After all, these alchemists came from all over the world.","However, normally, they would fly over. No matter what method they used to fly over, this was correct. Just riding a horse alone might not be able to complete the journey even if they worked themselves to death for a year.","However, what they didn’t know was that although Chu Yunfan’s horse wasn’t very powerful, Chu Yunfan was constantly nourishing it with magic power, allowing it to travel day and night without stopping. It was impossible for ordinary people to do this.","“However, I saw that his invitation letter seems to be from the Great Wei Kingdom. However, didn’t the Great Wei Kingdom’s Alchemy Division arrive a few days ago?”","“That’s right, he should have arrived a long time ago. However, that invitation card is real. No one can impersonate him. Looking at his age, he should be an alchemist of the younger generation in the Great Wei Country!”","“It should be, but the current situation in the Great Wei Country is not very good!”","While the guards were gossiping about Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan had already ridden into the valley. It didn’t look much different from the entrance outside, but in fact, it was a different world inside. The entire valley should be the base of the Alchemist Society, but now it seemed that after many years of development, it had long become a small city that could accommodate tens of thousands of people.","After Chu Yunfan arrived, he wasn’t in a hurry to find the Great Wei Kingdom’s alchemist delegation. Instead, he entered a restaurant first.","It was lunchtime, and the entire restaurant was bustling with noise. Chu Yunfan did not deliberately isolate this lively atmosphere.","This was also a part of his cultivation!","To him, this could completely release his state of mind. At this moment, he was not so anxious about the breakthrough of his realm, because after laying a good foundation, it could be said to have endless benefits for his future cultivation.","After casually ordering a few dishes, Chu Yunfan began to look around at the window seat. The entire small city had tens of thousands of people, so it was actually quite big.","Apart from the members of the Alchemist Society and their families, there were also the alchemists from the various factions who had come to participate in the Small Origin Pill Gathering.","Those who were qualified to participate in this Small Origin Pill Gathering were naturally not ordinary people. Among the alchemists of the various factions, they were either mainstay figures who had already obtained the selection of Alchemy Grandmasters.","They were either the most eye-catching juniors or rookies of the various forces. These people were usually brought by the elders of the forces to broaden their horizons and also to spar with each other.","Although they were all under the Alchemist Guild, the Alchemist Guild’s representative groups were after all from different forces and even from different hostile countries.","Therefore, competition is inevitable!","Originally, the Small Origin Core Gathering was just an exchange meeting, but after so many years, it had long become a competition of confrontation.","The grudges between the various countries and factions also extended to this place.","Other than these people, there were also people from all over the world who had heard of the news. After all, at the Small Origin Pill Gathering, other than the sparring between the various Alchemist Representatives, there were also all kinds of pills and herbs that were usually not seen for sale.","Many people who were related to the profession of alchemists rushed over. For a time, the base that could only accommodate tens of thousands of people was overcrowded.","“I should consider going to the market later to see if there are any good medicinal herbs or pills!”Chu Yunfan whispered.","After all, this was a very rare opportunity. The Spiritual Realm was good in everything, but it did not have an extremely developed network like the Human Federation.","If they wanted to buy something, they had to do it themselves. This also indirectly slowed down the efficiency of the alchemist.","It was not without reason that the Human Federation was able to develop the alchemy system to a considerable extent in just a few hundred years.","However, just as his thoughts were flying, he heard many people discussing.","“The delegation of the Great Wei Kingdom has lost again and again. First, they lost to the Great Qi Kingdom, and now they can’t even beat the Golden Tribe Khaganate.”","“However, the Great Wei Country is the weakest existence among the three great countries. The development of alchemy has never been satisfactory, so it’s normal for them to lose!”","“That’s right. Among the three great countries, the strongest in alchemy is still the Great Qi Kingdom. The Great Wei Kingdom used to be ranked second, but now it can’t even be ranked second. It’s worse than those barbarians of the Golden Tribe Khaganate!”","“Do you want to die? How dare you call the people of the Golden Tribe Khaganate barbarians?”","Someone hurriedly said. The person who had spoken earlier immediately realized something and quickly shut up.","Although the Golden Tribe Khaganate was the most powerful among the three kingdoms, its civilization was at the bottom of the three kingdoms. Therefore, it was ridiculed from time to time. Of course, it was only in private. No one dared to mock them in front of them, or they would be courting death.","“But this time, the Golden Tribe Khaganate has indeed produced a formidable genius in alchemy. He defeated all the alchemists of the younger generation in the Great Wei Kingdom alone. Tsk tsk, guess what? According to my information, that guy had become an Alchemy Grandmaster in the Golden Tribe Khaganate a long time ago!”","“Hiss, is that true or false? He’s only forty years old, right? He actually became an Alchemy Grandmaster. How did he get the test?”","“He’s indeed a genius. Otherwise, how could he dare to say that the Great Wei Kingdom is a bunch of trash? I was there at that time. The face of the Great Wei Kingdom’s Alchemist Association’s President, Gongsun Wulong, turned green!”"]},{"number":1455,"title":"Chapter 1455 Troubles From Jinzhanghan","paragraphs":["1455 Troubles From Jinzhanghan","“But it’s normal. It’s not the first time Great Wei has done this. Anyway, they’re always at the bottom.”","“I think they should be used to it by now.”","“That’s not necessarily true. This time, the people of Great Wei aren’t convinced. They keep saying that they have experts who have yet to arrive. Otherwise, they would have swept the competition clean.”","“Hahahaha, this is really interesting. This is the freshest and most unpretentious bullsh*t I’ve heard today!”","“I think this is just Great Wei trying to save face.”","Many people were discussing this matter in the restaurant, and more and more people came to participate. The previous matter had clearly caused quite a stir.","Most people were talking about this matter as if they were watching a joke. After all, no matter how they looked at it, it was an extremely emBaltzaassing matter for Great Wei.","“Great Wei lost again?” Chu Yunfan sighed. No wonder Gongsun Wulong had come to him in such a humble manner.","It seemed that Great Wei had indeed been suppressed in this aspect and was at the bottom of the three kingdoms. The situation was probably even worse than what Gongsun Wulong had mentioned. Not only was Great Wei crushed in terms of the number of alchemy experts, but even in terms of the cultivation of the younger generation, they were completely crushed.","In Jinzhanghan, there was a 40-year-old who had passed the alchemy expert assessment. Although this age was already very old in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, compared to the hundreds of years of life that an alchemy expert could have, it was at most equivalent to the age of an ordinary person in his early twenties.","The fellow was indeed quite talented.","Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu whom Chu Yunfan had met were far inferior to this guy. They probably couldn’t even touch the fringes of becoming a senior alchemist, let alone become an alchemy expert.","If not for such a genius, perhaps there would not be such an obvious gap, but Jinzhanghan had such an alchemy expert, leading to an all-around suppression.","“Interesting.” The corner of Chu Yunfan’s mouth twitched slightly, but he didn’t take it to heart. These so-called geniuses might be able to dominate in front of ordinary people, but in front of him, they were nothing.","In Great Wei, whenever Chu Yunfan was mentioned, he would definitely be the number one expert in the world. However, no one knew that his attainments in alchemy surpassed his achievements in martial arts.","Chu Yunfan slowly finished his meal, then ambled downstairs and headed toward Great Wei’s representative station. Since he was already here, he had to report himself. But when he arrived at the station, he realized that it was surrounded by many people.","Chu Yunfan rode his horse all the way there. There was a sea of people in front of him, but whenever they were about to touch him, they subconsciously moved aside.","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan arrived at the front of the crowd. Among the group, only he was riding a tall horse. However, no one found this strange and completely ignored his existence.","In front of Chu Yunfan, there were two groups of people confronting each other. One of them was wearing clothes of a foreign style. It was obvious that they were from Jinzhanghan. The other side consisted of young men and women wearing the uniforms of Great Wei’s Alchemist Association.","The two people in the lead were Chu Yunfan’s old acquaintances. They were Great Wei’s famous alchemy geniuses—Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu.","But at this moment, they were glaring at the Jinzhanghan’s people across from them.","The leader of Jinzhanghan was a middle-aged man in luxurious clothes.","“Are all the juniors of the Wei Kingdom so ill-mannered? We sold you medicinal herbs with good intentions, but you injured our people in return,” the middle-aged man said aggressively.","“Do not slander me, Baltza!” Jiang Lan’er’s face flushed red with anger.","“If you hadn’t used the fake Rising Sun Grass to trick us, causing us to fail in our pill concoction, and if I hadn’t come to reason with you, you wouldn’t be so angry that you’d attack me!” Bai Shengzu also sounded furious, his eyes burning with rage.","“Nonsense! The people of Jinzhanghan always keep our promises!” Baltza, the middle-aged man from Jinzhanghan, immediately denied, “It’s clear that you don’t know what’s good for you. It’s none of our business that you failed to make your pill. If you don’t believe me, take out the Rising Sun Grass you bought. There are many experts here. Let’s see if it’s real or fake.”","Baltza was quite confident and was not afraid of Jiang Lan’er taking out the Rising Sun Grass.","When everyone heard this, they immediately understood. When they saw Jiang Lan’er’s angry face and Baltza’s confident look, they thought of the grudges between the two kingdoms. Some people already seemed to understand.","These people were not fools. They could naturally see that Jiang Lan’er had suffered a great loss. Although they did not know how Jinzhanghan had done it, they were confident that they could do it.","Many people looked at Jiang Lan’er sympathetically.","“What’s wrong? You don’t dare to do it?” Baltza sneered at Jiang Lan’er.","“What’s there to be afraid of?”","Jiang Lan’er couldn’t be provoked. She grabbed at the air and produced a wooden box from her private space. Then, she opened it. There was a flame-like herb in the box, emitting a faint medicinal fragrance.","“What do you think? Everyone present is an expert, correct? Is this the Rising Sun Grass?” Baltza looked at Jiang Lan’er proudly.","Jiang Lan’er’s expression was extremely ugly, and so was Bai Shengzu’s. They knew that they had been tricked, but they didn’t know how.","Those who could participate in this meeting, even if they weren’t alchemists, were at least people who had a deep understanding of alchemy. How could they not recognize the famous Rising Sun Grass?","This was a herb that grew in extremely hot environments. Its body was like a flame, and it was an extremely good medicinal herb for refining fire attribute pills. It was the main ingredient for many types of pills.","They couldn’t see any difference, but from the looks of both sides, they knew that Jiang Lan’er had been tricked, but they didn’t know how Baltza had pulled it off.","“You have nothing to say, right? Since you have nothing to say, don’t blame me for being impolite,” Baltza said coldly, “I’ll teach you a lesson on behalf of your elders.”","“What are you thinking of?” Bai Shengzu said angrily.","“It’s simple. I don’t want your lives though you’ve hurt the people of Jinzhanghan. I only want to cripple your martial arts and punish you severely,” Baltza spat out coldly."]},{"number":1456,"title":"Chapter 1456 Jinzhanghan Is Nothing","paragraphs":["1456 Jinzhanghan Is Nothing","Hearing Baltza’s words, many people present sucked in a breath of cold air. Suddenly, many people understood that Baltza had been waiting for this opportunity to attack.","For an alchemist, cultivation was very important. Many pills could not be refined with ordinary furnace fire. They could only be refined with the unique alchemic fire of an alchemist.","The problem was that if their cultivation was crippled, then this alchemist would basically be finished. Although they would not die, they would not be able to refine any powerful pills in their life.","For an alchemist, this was no small punishment. It was simply destroying their future.","The crowd thought about how Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu were currently the most outstanding young alchemists in Great Wei. They were geniuses who were very likely to step into the alchemy expert level in the future.","It was not difficult for many people to guess that Baltza was probably an alchemy genius who wanted to destroy the future of Great Wei.","The grudge between the two kingdoms had already extended to the field of alchemy, and they would do anything to each other if they had the chance.","“But Great Wei’s representatives wouldn’t just watch Baltza make his move, right?” someone said.","“Great Wei’s representatives have been called away by the headquarters for a meeting!” someone in the know shouted. Immediately, many people felt that it was too much of a coincidence. Or rather, this was simply a good thing.","The target was none other than Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu.","“How dare you!”","At that moment, a few martial artists stepped out from behind Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu. Clearly, Great Wei had not come unprepared this time. Each of these martial artists was an expert at the seventh level of the Divine Abilities Stage and above, so they were more than enough to be their followers.","“Hmph, why wouldn’t I dare?”","Baltza sneered and released the aura from his body, crushing the entire scene. The terrifying aura stunned everyone. They could not even move.","“Baltza is a Core. He’s an alchemy expert!”","Someone immediately reacted. Baltza’s cultivation had reached the Core Stage. It was obvious that he was an alchemy expert.","Only alchemy experts could possibly step into the Core Stage. Only when one reached the level of an alchemy expert could it be possible to comprehend by analogy and step into the Core Stage.","Among alchemists, alchemy experts were not necessarily Cores, but those who could cultivate to the Core Stage were definitely alchemy experts.","For many years, this had always been an iron law.","Baltza was a famous alchemy expert in Jinzhanghan. It was not surprising that his cultivation had reached the level of an alchemy expert. Although he was only at the fledgling Core Stage and had broken through by relying on medicinal pills, he still had an overwhelming advantage over ordinary Divines.","Many people cried out in surprise. Baltza must have calculated that the higher-ups of Great Wei’s representatives were not present, which was why he had brazenly attacked.","Instantly, the few warriors who stood out were unable to move under the pressure of a Core and struggled to hold on. Baltza’s cultivation was built up through pills. If it was a true Core, just a gaze from him would be enough to make these Divines kneel and be unable to move.","But even so, they could feel that it was difficult for them to breathe, let alone stop Baltza.","As for Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu, they were in an even worse state. Their cultivation bases were even weaker, so they could only grit their teeth and persevere.","However, it was only limited to not kneeling. They could not move and could only watch Baltza walk toward them step by step.","“Today, I’ll teach you a lesson on behalf of your elders.” Baltza laughed sinisterly.","“How lively!”","After watching for a long time, Chu Yunfan suddenly spoke up. The aura that had originally filled the sky and suppressed everyone to the point that they could not move instantly disappeared.","Jiang Lan’er, Bai Shengzu, and the others felt that they could move again. Their backs were completely drenched, and they felt as if they had just walked through a life-and-death situation.","They looked in the direction of the voice and saw a young man sitting lazily on a tall horse, watching everything. Their eyes flashed with disbelief and surprise. Outsiders did not know who this young man was, but they did.","Especially Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu, who had competed with Chu Yunfan previously. Although he had defeated them, they had been paying close attention to Chu Yunfan’s situation ever since.","They had wanted to compete with Chu Yunfan, but who knew that Chu Yunfan had not exerted his full strength in alchemy? Instead, he rose all the way in martial arts. It was as if he was riding a rocket, and in a short period, he had already become the number one expert in the world.","Previously, Gongsun Wulong had said that Chu Yunfan would participate in this year’s Small Pill Origin Meet, but they had not seen Chu Yunfan until now. Now, they finally saw him.","Under such circumstances, their expressions immediately revealed a mixture of surprise and joy. Not only Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu but even the other members of Great Wei’s representatives were overjoyed when they saw Chu Yunfan.","It was as if they had seen their savior.","Instantly, a huge rock in their heart was lifted.","When the others saw the expressions on the faces of Great Wei’s representatives, they were puzzled. Who exactly was this young man? Why were these people from Great Wei so surprised and happy after seeing him? They were even relieved?","“Who are you?” After his aura was broken, Baltza was a little angry and looked at Chu Yunfan. “Don’t tell me you want to side with the people of Great Wei?”","Chu Yunfan could easily break through Baltza’s momentum. He was a little afraid, and because he couldn’t see through Chu Yunfan’s depth, he didn’t attack.","“You may want to think clearly. This will clearly go against Jinzhanghan.”","“Jinzhanghan is nothing.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Everyone was in an uproar. Although people were unhappy with Jinzhanghan, there were not many who dared to express their disdain for Jinzhanghan in front of everyone.","“This is such a boring farce.”","Baltza’s expression instantly darkened, and he said coldly, “You call this a boring farce? If you can’t come up with something, then don’t blame me for being rude. You’re courting death for being disrespectful to Jinzhanghan.”","“Do you really want me to say it?” Chu Yunfan said coldly as he looked at Baltza with a faint smile."]},{"number":1457,"title":"Chapter 1457 Crippled in One Strike","paragraphs":["1457 Crippled in One Strike","“If you can’t tell me, then don’t blame me for being rude. You’ll not be able to live if you insult Jinzhanghan!” Baltza said coldly.","He didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could tell anything. After all, there were so many experts present who couldn’t tell anything.","“In that case, I won’t hold back,” Chu Yunfan said coldly from his horse. “Although you sold her the Rising Sun Grass, there must be something mixed in it.”","“How is that possible? Don’t spout nonsense!” Baltza’s face revealed a hint of anger, but a hint of horror flashed across his eyes. Then, he sneered and said, “They’re alchemists. If there’s a problem with the herbs, wouldn’t they notice it immediately?”","When the surrounding people heard this, they could not help but nod. Indeed, after an alchemist bought the medicinal herbs, they would check them carefully. If there was something else mixed in, it was impossible for an experienced alchemist not to notice.","“Because you did it very secretly. The Rising Sun Grass is a fire-attribute medicinal herb and is used to make fire-attribute medicinal pills,” Chu Yunfan continued, “However, you should use Extreme Yin Water to water this Rising Sun Grass. Although its appearance has not changed, it actually contains cold water. Once it is used to make pills, it will explode.”","When everyone heard this, they realized that there was a trick to it. Jiang Lan’er, in particular, had a sudden realization. No wonder after she bought it, her furnace exploded the moment she started making pills.","Generally speaking, it was impossible because she was no longer a rookie. The medicinal pills she made were pill formulas that had been tested for many years. Nothing had ever happened to her.","Therefore, she immediately knew that the problem must be with the Rising Sun Grass, but she could not tell exactly what it was.","‘How powerful. He seems to be even more powerful than before.’ Jiang Lan’er looked at Chu Yunfan with her beautiful eyes and suddenly felt her heart beat faster.","She was a talented young lady in the field of alchemy, and no one of her age had ever been able to suppress her. Even Bai Shengzu was not her match, but there was one exception, and that was Chu Yunfan.","Regardless of whether it was the level of alchemy or the cultivation of martial arts, they were far from what she could compare to. Unknowingly, in her heart, even she herself did not realize that there was already a figure.","“You’re talking nonsense. What evidence do you have?”","Baltza was shocked and angry. He was shocked that Chu Yunfan could see through it, and he was angry that Chu Yunfan exposed him in public.","“What evidence does this need? The inside of the Sunrise Grass should be fiery red, but the inside of this stalk is a chilly aqua blue.” Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at Baltza.","When Jiang Lan’er heard this, she hurriedly cut open the Rising Sun Grass. As expected, the middle part had already turned blue in color. This was formed when it had been watered by Extreme Yin Water.","“What?!” Jiang Lan’er was furious.” You really tricked us!”","As expected, everyone looked at Baltza. They all understood that this was just a fuse, and Baltza only needed this excuse to attack Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu.","“Hmph, you bought this Rising Sun Grass so long ago. Do you think can claim whatever you want?” Baltza said coldly, unwilling to admit anything.","“Still don’t want to admit it?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “The Extreme Yin Water you used should be melted from thousand-year-old ice, right? Let me see. To prevent others from seeing it, you even applied a layer of Divine Vanquishing Grass juice on the surface of the Rising Sun Grass to block divine wills, right?”","“How did you know?” Baltza looked at Chu Yunfan in shock and couldn’t help but spill the beans. Chu Yunfan said it so casually and confidently as if he had seen it with his own eyes.","The Divine Vanquishing Grass was a strange medicinal plant. It could be said that it had a wide range of uses. If the juice of the Divine Vanquishing Grass was applied to something, it could block the prying of divine wills to a certain extent. The thicker the application, the better the shielding effect.","This grass was rare. Moreover, the Alchemist Association of Jinzhanghan had accidentally discovered such a record in a notebook of the Ancient Zenith Civilization. However, other than them, no one else should know about it. How did this young man know?","It was because of this that Baltza let it slip.","“Oh, my God!”","Everyone was in an uproar. It was indeed like this. However, they did not expect Baltza to be exposed like this. They all looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief.","“Who is this person? Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu are already considered the top alchemists of the younger generation, but this young man had actually seen through something that even they hadn’t.”","“Amazing. What is this Divine Vanquishing Grass? Why have I never heard of it? It can actually block divine will?”","“It seems that it’s true. The Alchemist Association of Jinzhanghan is so cunning.”","“That’s right. It’s a pity that all our efforts were in vain.”","What they didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan’s eyes were slowly emitting a faint light. All kinds of information about this Rising Sun Grass appeared in front of his eyes.","[Herb Type: Rising Sun Grass]","[Year: 30 years]","[Usage: Used to refine fire-attribute pills]","[Problem: Mistakenly watered using water from a block of melted thousand-year-old ice, causing its attributes to be in disarray. It can’t be used to make pills.]","Various information about this Rising Sun Grass appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. Coupled with the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he immediately found the problem.","It was too far from being able to hide it from him.","“Hmph! Even so, they were the ones who hurt themselves, and they in turn hurt the people of Jinzhanghan.”","Baltza saw that his matter had been completely exposed, so he decided to be completely shameless. Since it had already come to this, there was nothing more to say.","As he spoke, Baltza suddenly pounced toward Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu, but before he could reach the two of them, he realized that his entire body was suspended in mid-air as if he was grabbed by an invisible hand.","“You still dare to be impudent in front of me?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. As he spoke, he pointed with his finger. Suddenly, a terrifying force swept into Baltza’s meridian.","Baltza screamed as his abdomen became a bloody mess.","“Ah, my golden core! My golden core is broken. You crippled my martial arts?!”"]},{"number":1458,"title":"Chapter 1458 A New Vicious Person Has Arrived","paragraphs":["1458 A New Vicious Person Has Arrived","Baltza let out a miserable cry. Immediately, everyone could not help but be attracted by his words. They looked at Baltza’s powerful aura, but now it had all disappeared.","Everyone gasped. Even if Baltza had broken through forcefully with the help of pills, he was still a genuine Core. However, facing this young man, he did not have the strength to fight back and his golden core was easily broken.","For a Core, the destruction of their golden core basically meant that their martial arts were completely crippled. Moreover, one could tell from the blood spurting out of Baltza’s body from time to time. Because the golden core was destroyed, the powerful mana in the golden core instantly ravaged his entire body, shattering all his meridians and flesh.","Baltza was done for.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, looked indifferent, as if he had just casually picked a wildflower by the roadside.","“Who is this person? How is he so terrifying?” someone asked.","“What a ruthless move. Isn’t he afraid of offending Jinzhanghan?” another person said, but he immediately shut up because he remembered what Chu Yunfan had said before—Jinzhanghan was nothing.","“What a powerful technique. A Core is not a match for him. He’s definitely not an ordinary person. No wonder the representatives of Great Wei were surprised and happy when they saw him.”","While everyone was discussing, the strong martial arts experts who had followed Baltza here all seemed to have been frozen, not daring to move. When they saw Baltza’s golden core broken by Chu Yunfan with a single finger, they did not move. Their eyes flashed with extreme fear as if they had seen a terrifying beast.","One had to know that these people had all fought their way out of mountains of corpses and seas of blood. It could be said that they were unafraid of death. They could even accept death without changing their expressions.","However, when they looked at Chu Yunfan now, it was as if they were looking at a terrifying monster.","Chu Yunfan had seized the momentum.","“Jinzhanghan will never let you go!” Baltza gritted his teeth.","He knew that he was finished. His cultivation had been crippled, and he could no longer make high-quality pills in the future. Not only was his future in alchemy ruined but his future in martial arts was also ruined.","At this moment, his eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan. He could not wait to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces. However, he did not think that if he had not used underhanded methods, he would not have been attacked by Chu Yunfan.","“Jinzhanghan is nothing. Get lost. I don’t want to kill anyone today. Crippling your martial arts is a small punishment. I don’t mind either. I’ll kill as many as needed when the time comes. You’re just a group of barbarians.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","At that moment, the martial arts masters of Jinzhanghan were drenched in cold sweat as if they had been pardoned. They hurriedly helped Baltza away.","Only then did Chu Yunfan get down from his horse. The Great Wei representatives quickly came forward and said, “Greetings, Master Chu!”","Many of these representatives were young people, but they were all in their twenties. They were all alchemy geniuses of the younger generation from various places. Even if they couldn’t compare to Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu, they weren’t that far off. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been brought here to see the world.","They were arrogant in front of ordinary people, but in front of Chu Yunfan, they didn’t dare to show any arrogance. Others didn’t know Chu Yunfan’s background, but they did.","He was the number one expert in Great Wei. That terrifying reputation could be said to have been forged from countless white bones.","“Hello.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “You guys were too careless. You have to be careful next time.”","“Yes, sir,” everyone hurriedly answered. Even Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu were no exception. The person in front of them was a big shot that even the president of Great Wei’s Alchemist Association wanted to curry favor with.","Chu Yunfan led the horse into Great Wei’s station. Seeing that there was nothing left to see, the onlookers immediately dispersed. However, they knew that this matter would not be let go so easily. Jinzhanghan’s representatives, which had originally wanted to trick Great Wei, would not let it go so easily after suffering such a huge loss.","After all, this was equivalent to losing an alchemy expert.","Alchemists who had reached the level of alchemy expert were the most precious strategic resources in any kingdom.","As these people left, a shocking piece of news began to spread throughout the base. A new ruthless character had arrived in Great Wei. And the first thing he did was to cripple Baltza, the famous alchemy expert of Jinzhanghan.","It immediately caused an uproar in the base. Was Great Wei going to start an all-out war with Jinzhanghan?","For a time, the discussions were like boiling water.","While everyone outside was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s methods, Chu Yunfan entered Great Wei’s station. A servant came forward to lead Chu Yunfan’s horse to the feeding troughs.","“Where are President Gongsun and the others?” Chu Yunfan asked the people behind him as he stood with his hands behind his back.","“The president and the others have been called to a meeting by the headquarters,” Jiang Lan’er said. When she thought about how she had almost been tricked and had her martial arts crippled, she could not help but feel a little angry. “No one expected Jinzhanghan to be so vicious!”","Chu Yunfan grinned at this. Both Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu looked good, but in reality, they were just flowers cultivated in a greenhouse. That was why they had fallen for the trap.","Chu Yunfan had seen many such schemes. Great Wei and Jinzhanghan were enemies. It was not strange for the people of Jinzhanghan to do what they did. If it were old foxes like Gongsun Wulong, they wouldn’t have been so easily fooled, nor would they have been so easily targeted.","On the other hand, Gongsun Wulong and the others would not be merciful if they had the chance to attack the geniuses of Jinzhanghan.","“Just be careful in the future. After all, they’re a hostile kingdom. They won’t stop when they attack.” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “I heard that you guys lost yesterday?”","When she heard Chu Yunfan mention this, Jiang Lan’er’s face flashed with a hint of dissatisfaction, but then she completely lost her temper. That person had indeed defeated her and Bai Shengzu.","This feeling was the same as when she was defeated by Chu Yunfan. She had no way to fight back at all.","“Yes, we lost. We were no match for the other party,” Bai Shengzu said dejectedly.","“Even you guys are no match for him? This is interesting.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly."]},{"number":1459,"title":"Chapter 1459 A Challenge Letter","paragraphs":["1459 A Challenge Letter","Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu’s faces revealed somewhat depressed expressions. They had indeed been defeated by the other party and had no way to fight back.","“But if the other party is an alchemy expert, it’s very normal for you to lose,” Chu Yunfan said as he turned to look at them.","“Agula is very strong, but he only has the advantage of age. If I were his age, I definitely wouldn’t lose to him,” Bai Shengzu said gloomily.","To him, this was the second time he had suffered a crushing defeat. Although he had lost to Jiang Lan’er before, it was not a crushing defeat. There was a gap between the two of them, but it was not that obvious. Only Chu Yunfan had completely defeated him because Jiang Lan’er had used all her strength to defeat him.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. Chu Yunfan had completely crushed him.","Although Chu Yunfan was only a senior alchemist at that time, it was obvious that Chu Yunfan was still at ease. Some people got full marks because they were strong enough to get full marks, while others got full marks because the limit was only this much.","It was clear that Jiang Lan’er belonged to the former, while Chu Yunfan belonged to the latter.","Toward Chu Yunfan, Bai Shengzu had already lost all his temper. Whether it was his achievements in alchemy or his strength in martial arts, Chu Yunfan was simply not someone he could compare to.","However, he was not convinced by the genius of Jinzhanghan. If he was in his forties, he might have a chance to become an alchemy expert. In his opinion, the other party was just taking advantage of his age.","“No matter how strong Agula is, it’s nothing compared to you, Master Chu,” Jiang Lan’er said, “He’s just a clown.”","Chu Yunfan’s lips curled up. He didn’t take Agula seriously. However, before he could say anything, dozens of flying lights flew past.","Chu Yunfan took a closer look. Who else could it be but Gongsun Wulong and the others?","At this moment, Gongsun Wulong and the others rushed back. When they saw that Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu were fine, they heaved a sigh of relief.","When they heard that Baltza was going to attack the two geniuses of Great Wei, they did not have time to attend the headquarters meeting. They had cursed Jinzhanghan for being shameless many times along the way.","Fortunately, they saw that the two of them were fine, so they did not make a big mistake.","But when they saw Chu Yunfan. Gongsun Wulong quickly went forward and said, “Master Chu, you’re here.”","When they saw Chu Yunfan, they immediately understood why Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu, who were clearly on the verge of death, were fine. Chu Yunfan must have made a move.","Chu Yunfan was the number one expert of Great Wei. With him around, Jinzhanghan would be kicking a hornet’s nest if they acted presumptuously.","When Jiang Lan’er told Gongsun Wulong and the others about what happened, they broke out in cold sweat. They all cursed Jinzhanghan for being shameless. If Jinzhanghan succeeded, the alchemists of Great Wei would probably kill their leader. That would be truly terrifying.","“Thank goodness you were there, Master Chu. Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable,” Gongsun Wulong hurriedly said.","“It’s just a small matter. I got here a little late.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","“You’re not late at all. The real Small Pill Origin Meet hasn’t started yet,” Gongsun Wulong hurriedly said, “This time, Jinzhanghan caught us off guard.”","“Jinzhanghan is becoming more arrogant. I wasn’t going to make a move, but since the people of Jinzhanghan aren’t following the rules and want to make a move, then I won’t be polite. President Gongsun, help me draft a battle invitation to Agula of Jinzhanghan and ask if he dares to compete with me in alchemy,” Chu Yunfan said.","His words made everyone’s eyes light up. They had had enough of Jinzhanghan’s oppression. Back then, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had become a senior alchemist within one day. In many people’s eyes, he probably had the strength of an alchemy expert.","He might not have a chance of winning against a veteran alchemy expert of Jinzhanghan, but at least he would not be at a disadvantage against Agula.","“All right, it’s time to teach them a lesson.” Gongsun Wulong suddenly felt that he could finally hold his head high.","As time went by, the conflict between Jinzhanghan and Great Wei began to spread and become known. While everyone was watching how Jinzhanghan would retaliate, Great Wei sent a challenge letter to Agula.","The new alchemy genius from Great Wei, Chu Yunfan, had issued a challenge to Agula.","Many people were stunned. Wasn’t Chu Yunfan the ruthless person who crippled Baltza’s martial arts? How was it related to an alchemy genius?","Agula’s battle achievements were especially outstanding. At the age of forty, he had already become an alchemy expert. Such a figure was the leader among the young alchemists of this generation.","And who was this Chu Yunfan?","However, news about Chu Yunfan soon spread from Great Wei’s representatives, and it was all about alchemy. Chu Yunfan’s debut test shocked the entire Great Wei. He went from a junior alchemist to a senior alchemist in a day. It was even said that he had the strength of an alchemy expert.","Suddenly, there was an uproar. It turned out that the most talented person in Great Wei was not Jiang Lan’er or Bai Shengzu, but this previously unknown Chu Yunfan.","Many people couldn’t help but feel stunned. After all, they were unfamiliar with Chu Yunfan’s reputation. The fact that he had become the number one expert in the world was also a recent matter. Not even all the people of Great Wei had known about it, let alone citizens of other places.","Although Great Wei’s representatives did not reveal any other information, just this piece of information was already very shocking.","From a commoner to a senior alchemist in one day... What kind of shocking thing was this? They didn’t know if there would be anyone who would ever achieve a similar feat after this, but it was definitely unprecedented.","“From a commoner to a senior alchemist in a day. It really is shocking.”","“It’s unbelievable that there’s such a genius in such a weak situation.”","“That’s true. When I first heard about it, I found it unbelievable. But I believe Great Wei’s representatives wouldn’t speak without thinking. Otherwise, they will be the ones who will lose face.”","For a time, Chu Yunfan’s challenge caused an uproar in the base town."]},{"number":1460,"title":"Chapter 1460 A Storm Is Coming, a Conspiracy Appears","paragraphs":["1460 A Storm Is Coming, a Conspiracy Appears","Recently, Jinzhanghan had been hyping up the fact that their genius Agula had crushed the geniuses of Great Qi and Great Wei. This had made Agula the focus of countless people. In addition, the news that Chu Yunfan was the strongest genius in the history of Great Wei made this challenge letter the focus of countless people.","The battle between the strongest alchemy geniuses in the history of the two kingdoms became the matter that many people were most concerned about.","In the station of Jinzhanghan representatives, everyone was sitting in a circle with a solemn expression. There were six people in the lead. Each of these six people carried extremely powerful auras. They were more than a level stronger than the others.","However, compared to the other people who were either old or close to old age, the person who sat in the last of the six was a young man who looked to be only 28 or 29 years old.","There were old men and young men and women among the rest, and they were all dressed in the splendid clothes of Jinzhanghan. However, their auras were far inferior to these six people.","These were the representatives of Jinzhanghan. The six of them were famous figures throughout Jinzhanghan. They were true alchemy experts. The rest were either senior alchemists or the young geniuses of Jinzhanghan.","In the middle of the crowd was none other than Baltza. At this moment, he was crippled, and he looked as if he had aged decades in an instant. He was extremely dispirited.","“This is simply too much. How dare he break Baltza’s martial arts!” an old man among the six alchemy experts said furiously as he slapped his armrest.","The other alchemists of Jinzhanghan were also furious. They had completely forgotten that they had plotted to cripple Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er’s martial arts.","“We have to appeal with headquarters and have them punished!” a young alchemist said angrily. Baltza was his master, and he was furious to see his master’s martial arts crippled.","“How do we appeal to the headquarters now? They will in turn pursue the matter of us taking the liberty to attack Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er.” A middle-aged man looked at Baltza’s disciple with dissatisfaction.","The others fell silent. They knew that they had done something wrong. The alchemists of Jinzhanghan made up a large part of the headquarters, but they could not help them when there was conclusive evidence.","If Jinzhanghan had succeeded previously, Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er would be crippled by now. No matter how much trouble Great Wei made then, it would be useless. They could only swallow this bitter fruit. However, it just so happened that the person who had their martial arts crippled was one of their own. This made them suffer unspeakably.","They had been using this method many times over to make Great Wei and Great Qi suffer losses. They had not expected that they would suffer today.","“Who is this d*mned Chu Yunfan?” someone asked through gritted teeth, but no one could say anything.","After all, Great Wei was too far away for them. Though Chu Yunfan had been targeted by the Right King of Jinzhanghan, the Right King could not spread this matter everywhere.","“It doesn’t matter. Since he dared to issue a challenge letter, he must have a certain degree of confidence,” an alchemy expert said with a worried expression.","“No worries.”","At this moment, the youngest alchemy expert finally spoke. He was the focus of this matter, the youngest alchemy expert in the history of Jinzhanghan, Agula.","“Although the people of Great Wei boast that this Chu Yunfan became a senior alchemist in a day, it’s all lies.” Agula revealed a cold smile. “Great Wei’s Alchemist Association’s performance has been in shambles for many years. And now, to reverse the decline, they using this obviously laughable gimmick!”","“It might seem shocking to be able to become a senior alchemist within a day, but the truth is that if I didn’t have the will to take the test, I could have done it too. I could even become an alchemy expert within a day. Therefore, this kind of sensationalist thing is completely meaningless. On the contrary, this proves that they are feeling guilty and short of breath. They can’t push out any decent geniuses, so they have no choice but to do this,” Agula continued, “Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu are decent, but there are at least ten people in Jinzhanghan who can compare to them. The development of alchemy is not determined by one or two geniuses. It must be a process of accumulation. The alchemy of Great Wei has been in decline for so many years. How could it possibly suddenly explode?”","“That’s right. The development of alchemy can’t be faked. It has to be advanced step by step.”","“Every step of alchemy requires countless alchemists to explore one step after another. It’s not like martial art where a sudden insight can achieve a rapid breakthrough.”","“That’s true. Instead, the people of Great Wei must be feeling guilty and afraid.”","The people of Jinzhanghan nodded in agreement.","Agula sneered and continued, “So, there’s no need to worry about Chu Yunfan’s challenge. His martial arts strength may be good and he can severely injure Baltza, but he dares to challenge me in alchemy.”","The other alchemy experts looked at each other and agreed with Agula’s words. After all, they knew that Agula’s true level might be even stronger than some of them. It was definitely not as simple as barely becoming an alchemy expert. Otherwise, he would not have become the strongest genius in the history of Jinzhanghan.","“But are we just going to let go of Chu Yunfan crippling my master’s martial arts?” Baltza’s disciples said in grief and indignation.","“Yes, that’s right. We can’t let it slide. We have to make him pay with his blood!” someone shouted.","The rest of the people also nodded in support of this statement.","“Of course not,” an old man from among the alchemy experts said, “I’ve already sent this news back to the kingdom. The Right King has promised to send the experts of the Netherworld Sect. When the Small Pill Origin Meet ends, they will die along their return journey.”","“You are wise, president,” everyone said.","This alchemy expert was the president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association. His eyes were as sharp as an eagle’s.","“Let them be smug for a few more days. How could they continue living after offending Jinzhanghan?”"]},{"number":1461,"title":"Chapter 1461 Stomped on the Head, Humiliated","paragraphs":["1461 Stomped on the Head, Humiliated","Chu Yunfan’s challenge stirred up the meet. Everyone’s eyes were focused on the two kingdoms’ alchemist representatives. Everyone wanted to know what kind of background Chu Yunfan had to dare challenge the well-known alchemy genius of Jinzhanghan.","On the morning of the second day mentioned in the challenge letter, Jinzhanghan’s station was surrounded by many people. All those who could come were in attendance. There were more than ten thousand people surrounding Great Wei’s station too, and it was noisy.","“Will Chu Yunfan really come today?”","“He should be confident. Otherwise, he wouldn’t dare to issue such a direct challenge.”","“I hope to see a fierce battle today. I hope it won’t be like last time when Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu were easily defeated.”","More than ten thousand people were present, and the voices of their discussions were so loud that it was as if they were going to tear apart the sky.","Not long after, a group of people walked out from the crowd. Each of them was dressed in luxurious robes. They stopped in front of the crowd.","Just as everyone was wondering who these people were, someone called out their identities.","“It’s Great Qi’s representatives!”","“It seems that even Great Qi can’t sit still in this confrontation between the two kingdoms.”","“That’s right, it’s them. Isn’t the young man in the lead Tian Yi whom Agula utterly defeated yesterday?”","“This is going to be interesting!”","Many people were discussing animatedly. The person who was the focus of the discussion was a young man who looked to be in his thirties. When he heard the comments of the people around him, the words “utterly defeated” entered his ears, and his face turned green and white.","In Great Qi, he was the only person in this generation who had stepped into the ranks of senior alchemists. There, no one would think that he could not become an alchemy expert. This was only a matter of time.","He had come to participate in this meet to make a name for himself, but who knew that he would become Agula’s background?","He wasn’t the only one who had become Agula’s stepping stone, and although he was unwilling to accept it, there was no other way. After all, the outcome was already a fact. He would have the chance to become an alchemy expert in the future, but Agula was a genuine alchemy expert.","Today, upon hearing that Chu Yunfan had challenged Agula, he had to come over to take a look. Tian Yi had complicated feelings. He hoped that Chu Yunfan could teach Agula a lesson, but he was afraid that Chu Yunfan had the strength to surpass Agula. If that happened, he would be pronounced useless. It would be best if Chu Yunfan lost to Agula. In that case, his failure would not be so obvious.","Not long after, before his thoughts could disperse, in the Jinzhanghan station, a group of people opened the door and walked out. The person in the lead was none other than Agula, who had recently become famous.","He strode out and swept his gaze across the crowd. He then looked at Tian Yi and said, “You, my defeated opponent, still dare to appear in front of me?”","Hearing Agula’s words, Tian Yi’s face turned green and white.","“You didn’t forget about our bet, did you? You said it yourself yesterday. If you lose, you have to bow to me when you see me in the future.” Agula sneered.","“Agula, don’t push it!” Tian Yi’s face turned red with anger.","“And so what if I do? Since you’ve lost, you’ll obediently fulfill your promise.” Agula sneered, and a terrifying aura was released. Tian Yi finally couldn’t withstand the suppression of this terrifying aura. With a muffled groan, he knelt down.","Bam!","Tian Yi’s legs slammed into the marble floor, causing huge cracks to appear. Like a spider web, the cracks spread in all directions.","“How domineering!” someone exclaimed.","They could see that Tian Yi and Agula’s alchemy cultivation was not the only difference. One was a senior alchemist while the other was an alchemist expert. Their martial cultivation was very different.","Tian Yi was only at the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, while Agula was already at the Core Stage. Against Agula, Tian Yi had no way of fighting back.","“This is simply too much!”","Among the crowd, there were many people from Great Qi. When they saw this scene, they revealed expressions of anger on their faces. This was clearly humiliating their kingdom.","However, none of them dared to step forward. A Core was simply a crane among chickens here. To avoid this, the alchemy experts of the three kingdoms did not appear.","Under such circumstances, Agula was simply invincible.","“Ah!” Tian Yi cried out loudly, but his legs felt as if they were filled with lead. They were so heavy that he could not lift them at all. His entire body gradually prostrated as if he was carrying a mountain on his back, suppressing him so much that he could not even raise his head.","All the divine power in his body was completely sealed. This was the power of the Core Stage. He knew that he was not as strong as Agula, but he did not expect the difference to be so great.","It was simply crushing.","“I can’t accept this. I want revenge!” Tian Yi roared loudly. The thought of revenge in his heart was like a flame. Once it rose, it was like a spark of fire that instantly spread throughout his entire body.","However, no matter how hard he tried, it was useless in front of Agula.","Agula walked up to Tian Yi and kicked him in the head, causing him to fall to the ground.","“You want revenge?” He could feel Tian Yi’s anger, but he didn’t take it to heart. “Trash like you won’t be my match even if you cultivated for another hundred years!” He stomped Yi’s head, causing it to sink into the marble floor, creating a huge hole.","The crowd was silent, but no one dared to stop them. Jinzhanghan was a fearsome force, and no one dared to meddle in their business. Even if they did, they were no match for Agula.","Some people understood that Agula was trying to wear down Tian Yi’s pride. If he were to be afraid of him in the future, Tian Yi would not have a future. Thinking of this, many people could not help but suck in a breath of cold air.","“What a vicious move!”","Another group of people walked in while withstanding Agula’s powerful aura. They separated the crowd and entered everyone’s line of sight."]},{"number":1462,"title":"Chapter 1462 The Bet","paragraphs":["1462 The Bet","“The representatives from Great Wei are here!” someone shouted.","Everyone’s gaze turned to this group of people. The person in the lead was a young man in his early twenties wearing black clothes. The two behind him were the alchemy geniuses of Great Wei, Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu. The two of them, who were originally proud and arrogant, now stood obediently behind the young man. There was not a trace of unwillingness on their faces.","This made many people guess the young man’s identity. He was probably the legendary number-one alchemy genius of Great Wei, whose strength was even above Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu.","“He doesn’t look any different. Looks pretty ordinary to me...” someone said.","They thought that Chu Yunfan looked like an ordinary person who was nothing special, but then they remembered, this was the biggest difference. A world-famous alchemy genius should have extraordinary martial cultivation, but it seemed like he didn’t have any martial cultivation. Wasn’t there something wrong here?","Just as everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan walked up to Agula and glanced at Tian Yi, who Agula was stepping on. He sneered and said, “Interesting. You guys really go all out.”","Agula immediately retracted his foot. Tian Yi, who was being stepped on, suddenly felt the terrifying aura that was pressing down on his body disappear. He hurriedly turned around and got up.","He looked extremely miserable at this moment and glared at Agula with hatred. This was the most humiliating moment of his life, but he didn’t dare to take revenge. Then, he looked at Chu Yunfan because he could feel that Agula’s aura had been broken by this young man.","Just like the snow melting in spring, it happened silently without a trace. There was no trace of smoke and fire. This was the most amazing thing.","“Are you Chu Yunfan?” Agula looked at Chu Yunfan with contempt and disdain. Chu Yunfan looked too young. Youth was sometimes an advantage, but sometimes it was a huge disadvantage.","This was especially true for alchemists. They needed to accumulate experience in their profession, and being young was a disadvantage.","“Correct.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“Agula, you’ve gone too far!” Bai Shengzu shouted after seeing had Agula had treated Tian Yi.","Tian Yi was someone that didn’t dare to claim victory so easily, but in the end, he was stomped on the ground by Agula like a dog, unable to move.","“Just in time. You two have an agreement with me too, right? The loser has to bow to the other party in the future. Since you’re here, kneel!” Agula roared as his eyes flashed with malevolence.","A terrifying aura swept toward Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er. However, what made him feel strange was that his previous move was suddenly useless. When this aura swept toward Chu Yunfan, it disappeared. It didn’t affect Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er.","Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er didn’t seem to be afraid. Others might not know Chu Yunfan’s background, but how could they not?","Agula could use this method in front of others, but in front of Chu Yunfan, it was no different from showing off his skills in front of an expert.","At this moment, Agula’s expression finally became a little more serious. His gaze returned to Chu Yunfan.","“Since you like to make people kneel so much, let’s make a bet. If you lose the competition later, you’ll kneel here for three days,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","Agula was a little afraid of Chu Yunfan’s strength. After all, Baltza had suffered a crushing defeat at Chu Yunfan’s hands. However, when it came to alchemy, he was not afraid.","“Hahahaha, fine, but if you lose, I’ll cripple one of your arms!” Agula’s face revealed a ferocious expression, like a wild beast.","“You want to cripple one of my arms? Then come and try.” Chu Yunfan’s expression turned colder. Others might not be able to tell, but how could he not?","What Agula and Jinzhanghan were trying to do was to cripple the young geniuses of the other kingdoms, destroying them both mentally and physically. Fair competition had never appeared in their dictionary. Ordinary people who were not familiar with it could suffer a huge loss if they were not careful, but now that they had bumped into him, it was not certain who would suffer.","Agula grinned and said, “In that case, let’s begin. Since you’re the one who issued the challenge, I’ll decide the rules.”","“Why should you decide? When you came to challenge us the day before yesterday, you didn’t ask us to decide on the rules.” Jiang Lan’er said indignantly.","“That’s right, you’re going too far!” Bai Shengzu shouted.","Tian Yi’s face turned green and white, but he gritted his teeth and did not leave. After being humiliated by Agula, he hoped that Chu Yunfan would defeat Agula. He wished for Chu Yunfan to humiliate Agula in turn.","The crowd was in an uproar. Among the tens of thousands of people present, even if they weren’t experts in alchemy, they were all involved in this industry. Who didn’t understand that Agula wanted to hold the advantage in his hands?","“Agula looks violent, but he’s actually extremely cunning. He doesn’t plan to give Chu Yunfan the slightest chance of winning.”","“How is it? Don’t dare to do it? If you don’t, get lost!” Agula said directly.","“I’ll do it your way.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “But with those stakes, if you lose, I’ll cripple one of your arms too.”","Agula’s shamelessness and treachery angered Chu Yunfan.","“Hmph, save your words for after you’ve succeeded,” Agula said.","“The challenge is simple. I’ll make ten pills, and you’ll have to tell me what ingredients I used and what’s the use of those ten pills. You have to tell me what methods were used and what the process is like.”","When everyone heard this, they sucked in a breath of cold air. This requirement was too high. Even the alchemy expert examination did not have such strict requirements. It was as if he wanted Chu Yunfan to lose.","Agula was prepared!"]},{"number":1463,"title":"Chapter 1463 Agula’s Shocking Strength","paragraphs":["1463 Agula’s Shocking Strength","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan. Even Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu began to worry. If it was a martial arts competition, they wouldn’t be worried at all. Even if Agula had four arms and four legs, they didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan would lose.","However, it was different when it came to alchemy. Although they guessed that Chu Yunfan had the level of an alchemy expert, he was at most on par with Agula.","It was simply impossible to guess what kind of ingredients were used, the process, the methods, and so on. Even if it was relatively simple to guess the uses of the pill, it was a very high requirement for an alchemist.","This was an impossible challenge.","Even an experienced alchemist would not be able to accurately guess all of this. To be able to guess a large portion of it was already very good. Not to mention that Chu Yunfan couldn’t make a single mistake.","Agula had planned this all along!","“Sir, we can’t accept such harsh conditions,” Jiang Lan ‘er said anxiously.","“You’re clearly trying to trick us, Agula.” Bai Shengzu thought so too.","According to the rules of the competition, it should be a competition of alchemy. After all, there were rules and methods in place for the competition between alchemists.","This was what everyone had speculated before.","Agula sneered. “This is not up to you. Do you think you can challenge me when you want to and not challenge me if you don’t want to? What do you take Jinzhanghan for?”","Just as he finished speaking, everyone could feel a powerful aura being released from the surroundings. A few Core auras pressed down like mountains. Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. Jinzhanghan had come prepared. They would not allow Chu Yunfan to give up, and they would not hesitate to use force.","Many people understood that the Jinzhanghan would never let Chu Yunfan go. According to their usual code of conduct, they were determined to cripple Chu Yunfan.","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan with sympathy. Although it was a competition between alchemists, it was not so simple when it involved the struggle between large countries. Jinzhanghan was clearly relying on its powerful national strength to suppress the geniuses of other countries.","“It’s fine.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Agula sneered and looked at Chu Yunfan with a smile on his face. Today’s plan was targeted at Chu Yunfan. Whether Chu Yunfan agreed or not, he would cripple him.","This was not the first time the Jinzhanghan had done something like this.","Agula quickly returned to base and began to make pills.","Everyone was in a heated discussion.","“I’m afraid Chu Yunfan won’t be able to escape.”","“He’s too naive. Does he really think that the people of Jinzhanghan will reason with him?”","“Jinzhanghan is utterly unreasonable.”","“How could it be that easy to guess all of them correctly? This is simply impossible unless Chu Yunfan has memorized all of the pill recipes in the world.”","“That’s impossible. Who knows how many pill recipes Jinzhanghan has improved on over the years? It’s impossible to guess all of them.”1","Jiang Lan ‘er was extremely anxious, but Bai Shengzu looked calm.","“What should we do?” Jiang Lan ‘er said, “Agula is clearly targeting Master Chu.”","“Don’t worry, so what if they target him? Even if Master Chu loses, can Agula do anything to Master Chu?” Bai Shengzu sneered.","Hearing Bai Shengzu’s words, Jiang Lan’er remembered that besides Chu Yunfan being a genius in alchemy, the real thing that shook Great Wei was his almost invincible martial arts. It was not something that ordinary people could look up to.","If Agula wanted to harm Chu Yunfan, he was simply courting death.","Thinking of this, the anxiety on her pretty face disappeared.","On the other side, Tian Yi, the alchemy genius of Great Qi, had a sinister smile on his face. He had hoped that Chu Yunfan would defeat Agula and avenge him, but now it seemed that it was impossible.","However, when he thought about how Agula had trampled him to the ground, he was unwilling to leave. He at least wanted to see Chu Yunfan being treated in the same way. He felt like he wanted to die together with Chu Yunfan.","It did not take long for a cry of surprise to be heard from the crowd near the Jinzhanghan station.","“He isn’t using a furnace and is making pills with his bare hands?” someone exclaimed,","It immediately caused a commotion. After all, alchemists needed an alchemical furnace to make pills. In theory, it was possible to make pills with bare hands, but it required the alchemic fire cultivated by oneself.","One could make pills anywhere by using their alchemic fire, but it was an extremely difficult method. Even alchemy experts who could do this were rare.","This could only be done with special alchemy techniques passed down from the old generation. Otherwise, ordinary herbs would be burned to ashes under the extremely high temperature of the alchemic fire, let alone be turned into pills.","Many people wanted to see how Agula managed to pull off such a miraculous feat, but there were too many people in the way, so they couldn’t see. They could only learn about it through word of mouth.","There was a powerful barrier around Jinzhanghan’s station, which isolated divine wills. Otherwise, everyone would have used their divine wills to observe the situation.","“What a powerful method. Agula really lives up to his reputation. Although his actions are a little despicable, he does have that kind of strength.” Someone sighed.","Although Jinzhanghan was despicable in many people’s eyes, they could do nothing about it. After all, they were too powerful.","“He made ten pills at the same time—ten completely different ones. This is too amazing!”","Someone revealed even more shocking news. The commotion in the crowd became even greater. There were quite a number of alchemy experts present. They had to be careful even if they were making one type of pill, let alone ten at the same time.","Tian Yi, who was in the crowd, was even more shocked. Only now did he understand that when Agula faced him, he did not even use his strength, and he had already suffered a crushing defeat.","How could he not understand that Agula’s alchemy level was probably the best among alchemy experts?","Agula was not bragging. He was indeed a true alchemy genius. A genius who was far above everyone else!"]},{"number":1464,"title":"Chapter 1464 The Pills You Make Are All Trash!","paragraphs":["1464 The Pills You Make Are All Trash!","He had never heard of such a method of making ten types of medicinal pills in one go. If it were him, he would not be able to do it at all because this required him to do ten things at once.","And when he was making pills, he had to be single-minded. He could not even multitask, not to mention having to do ten things at the same time. This was an unbelievable miracle.","Using alchemic fire to make pills without the need for an alchemical furnace was something that he could not do. Even the president of Great Qi’s Alchemist Association could not do this.","This method was not just a matter of talent, but more importantly, inheritance. One must have a complete inheritance of alchemy techniques to be able to completely make pills without a furnace.","“How does such a monster exist?” Tian Yi said unwillingly. If he was only a genius among mortals, then Agula was a genius among geniuses. They were not on the same level at all.","It wasn’t just Tian Yi. Even Jiang Lan’er and Bai Shengzu were looking at each other in shock. To them, this was like a miracle. When they had just stepped onto the path of alchemy, they had been told that they had to be single-minded when making pills and could not be distracted. Otherwise, they would fail.","Who knew that there was someone who could do ten things at once? He was simply a monster!","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s expression was as calm as ever. This was because such a method could be called a miracle to others, but to him, it was not worth mentioning at all. If necessary, he could even make hundreds of pills at the same time.","However, there was no need for that. He could see that Agula was just showing off his skills and trying to break Chu Yunfan’s will. If an ordinary person saw Agula’s ability to multitask, they would have already cowered.","As for the fact that he could make pills without using a furnace and was directly using alchemic fire, this was an even easier guess for Chu Yunfan. From what he knew from the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, there were at least hundreds of alchemy methods that could do similar things.","Just as everyone was discussing, they detected the fragrance of medicine. Agula walked out with a medicine box, his face was filled with extreme confidence.","“That was fast. Not only is he powerful, but his pill-making speed is also terrifying.”","“That’s true. It’s really shocking!”","“How powerful. In a few years, he might become number one in the world in terms of alchemy. There hasn’t been such a powerful genius in the past few hundred years.”","While everyone was discussing, Agula walked up to Chu Yunfan and opened the wooden box. There were ten different kinds of pills inside.","“Come on. Let’s start!” Agula looked at Chu Yunfan with a provocative look in his eyes.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan, not knowing what to say. Unexpectedly, Chu Yunfan shook his head and sighed.","Agula’s face turned ugly as he said, “If you have something to say, say it. Do you think you can get away with this?”","He had already determined that Chu Yunfan was trying to fool him. He knew very well how difficult his request was. It could even be said that if it were him, it would be impossible to do. It was already good enough to be able to guess a part of it.","Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “In that case, I’ll tell you. I’ll elaborate on your alchemy technique first. You’re using a technique that has long been lost. It’s called the Thirteen Brilliant Suns, right? The alchemic fire you cultivate should be related to that technique.","“This alchemic fire requires a special type of ebony to draw on the Grand Sun Primordial Fire to make pills,” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “But as far as I know, this Brillant Sun Fire is extremely difficult to obtain. The Thirteen Brilliant Suns have long been lost. You must have obtained the inheritance of the Thirteen Brilliant Suns from somewhere, right?”","Agula’s expression changed because Chu Yunfan was right about everything. He found it unbelievable. The alchemic fire he practiced was called the Brillant Sun Fire, and the technique he used was an ancient technique. This was something that only a few people in the upper echelons of Jinzhanghan knew.","How did Chu Yunfan know?","Although everyone didn’t know if this was true or not, they could already guess the answer when they saw Agula’s expression change. Chu Yunfan was right. Otherwise, Agula wouldn’t have shown such an expression with his shrewdness.","“You’re just lucky enough to know a little bit of information, but that’s far from enough!” Agula said loudly, “Based on this level, you will lose. What are the effects of these pills and what ingredients were used?”","When everyone heard this, they suddenly felt that Chu Yunfan’s chances of winning were indeed not high. Although they had guessed correctly before, this was only the first step.","“There’s no need to evaluate the pills you made,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“What did you say?” Agula immediately flew into a rage and stared coldly at Chu Yunfan. “Are you admitting defeat?”","“I’m not admitting defeat. I’m saying that the pills you made are all trash. I’ve already mentioned it earlier. I didn’t expect you to be such a blockhead.” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“You dare to say that what I make is trash?! “Agula was so angry that he released all of his aura. The aura that belonged to the Void Core Stage swept out and swept toward Chu Yunfan like a small mountain.","In the eyes of outsiders, Chu Yunfan was like a small boat in a stormy sea that could be destroyed at any time. However, Chu Yunfan did not budge. Agula’s aura had no effect on him. Once it got within three feet of Chu Yunfan, the aura disappeared.","“If you can’t walk the talk, I’ll make you regret being born!” Agula stared coldly at Chu Yunfan. His alchemy was his greatest pride and was the source of his confidence. Chu Yunfan actually dared to point fingers at this matter. It was simply detestable.","“Trash? Chu Yunfan sure has big words!”","“He’s probably forcing himself. After all, no matter how you look at it, Agula’s pills are perfect in terms of color and smell.”","“That’s right. I don’t see any flaws. I’m afraid that Chu Yunfan’s words are just to please the public.”"]},{"number":1465,"title":"Chapter 1465 Are You Worthy of Being an Alchemist?","paragraphs":["1465 Are You Worthy of Being an Alchemist?","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but they all felt that Chu Yunfan was either trying to gain attention or trying to save himself.","In many people’s eyes, his words were simply shocking.","Everyone’s eyes fell on Chu Yunfan, but he didn’t have the slightest self-awareness. He said indifferently, “What were you trying to do by multitasking and making ten different pills at once? From the beginning to the end, you were just showing off your skills. Do you think alchemists are clowns? Do you need to use such a method to show off your skills?”","Agula looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and said, “Chu Yunfan, it’s my freedom to show off my skills or not. If you can’t say anything about these pills, then don’t even think about walking away from today. No one who insults me will be left unscathed.”","“You’re so stubborn. In that case, I’ll tell you clearly. You obtained this Thirteen Brilliant Suns inheritance, right? You also mastered this Brilliant Sun Fire not long ago,” Chu Yunfan said regretfully as he shook his head.","Agula’s talent was the strongest among the people he had met, but it was a pity.","“Yes, and so what?” Agula’s expression was livid, but he did not deny what Chu Yunfan said.","“When you make pills, do you feel like there’s a flame burning in your chest? Especially when you’re using the Thirteen Brilliant Suns?” Chu Yunfan said.","“How did you know?” Agula said in shock. He had never told anyone about this, not even the alchemy experts of Jinzhanghan.","After all, although they were all the representatives of Jinzhanghan and could be considered to be in the same boat, the alchemy experts in Jinzhanghan were in a competitive relationship. How could he expose his own shortcomings?","“That’s why I said that you’re not worthy of being an alchemist. To show off your skills, you dare to casually use a technique that you’re not familiar with. If I’m not wrong, you have only mastered up to the tenth move,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Agula could not conceal his shocked expression. Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan was right again just by looking at Agula’s expression. They were extremely shocked. Chu Yunfan did not even look at Agula making the pills, but he could guess so many things just by looking at the pills.","It was simply an incredible miracle. He could even guess how far Agula had cultivated the Thirteen Brilliant Suns. This could no longer be explained by the experience of an alchemist. Even a veteran alchemist could not achieve such a shocking level.","“Who told you that I haven’t mastered it? I’ve already mastered all of the Thirteen Brilliant Suns!” Agula denied it, immediately turning hostile.","“Still want to lie to me? If you really mastered the thirteen forms of the Thirteen Brilliant Suns, you would’ve burned into a pile of charcoal by now,” Chu Yunfan said coldly and confidently.","Everyone was a little puzzled. They didn’t know why Chu Yunfan was so sure of this. Could it be that he really knew something?","“It’s funny that you don’t know anything about the Thirteen Brilliant Suns, and yet you’re trying to show off in front of me. Do you think I don’t know what I’m cultivating?” Agula looked at Chu Yunfan with a cold smile, but the shock in his eyes could not be hidden. Only he knew that Chu Yunfan was right.","This was really strange. Chu Yunfan couldn’t have known that he was practicing the Thirteen Brilliant Suns. Even if he had guessed it, he couldn’t have guessed his mastery level.","“Is that so?” Chu Yunfan grinned and then said with a cold smile, “Do you know why I’m so sure that the Thirteen Brilliant Suns is a lost pill-making technique from ancient times?”","“Why?” Agula couldn’t help but ask. He didn’t realize that he had been led by the nose by Chu Yunfan.","“Because there are flaws in Thirteen Brilliant Sun. When the thirteenth move is successfully cultivated, that will be when the alchemist dies. The miserable person will be burned by the Brilliant Sun Fire for three days and three nights.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “It’s precisely because of such a huge flaw that the Thirteen Brilliant Suns was banned from cultivation in ancient times. All relevant documents were destroyed. Although I don’t know where you got the inheritance, it clearly wasn’t through formal channels.”","Agula was extremely shocked, and his expression immediately changed. He had achieved the level of an alchemy expert because he cultivated the Thirteen Brilliant Suns and Brilliant Sun Fire, which allowed him to cross the threshold of an alchemy expert that many people could not cross.","Who would have thought that it would become his death seal? If what Chu Yunfan said was true, then what would happen if he continued to cultivate?","“Nonsense! How do you know about the ancient times?” Agula was unwilling to admit it.","“Still not giving up?” Chu Yunfan asked with a cold smile. It was normal for others not to know, but how could he not? It was because the Thirteen Brilliant Suns had been stopped by the Alchemy Emperor.","At first, this technique seemed to be courageous and advanced, which was of great help to the alchemist. However, in reality, the faster one cultivated, the faster one would die.","“It doesn’t matter. You’re going to die soon anyway, because the Thirteen Brilliant Suns is an irreversible process. You’ll die sooner or later.”","Chu Yunfan’s words made Agula’s expression change drastically. At this moment, he began to believe Chu Yunfan’s words. He was afraid that the Thirteen Brilliant Suns were not that simple. At this moment, he remembered that the ancient manual he had obtained had recorded the Thirteen Brilliant Suns, but it also mentioned that the Thirteen Brilliant Suns could not be cultivated. The recorder only recorded it because they thought it was a pity that the Thirteen Brilliant Suns would be lost and the inventor’s hard work was to be destroyed.","At that time, Agula was in high spirits and did not take it to heart. Who knew that it would actually become a death seal now?","“How dare you say I’m going to die,” Agula said coldly, “I don’t know if I’ll die or not, but you will die today. No matter what, if you can’t tell me the use of my pills and the ingredients used, you will still lose.”","“Do you think someone like you is qualified to make pills?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “You don’t even understand the consequences of the Thirteen Brilliant Suns’ moves before you started to use them in alchemy. Your pills have long been wasted. They seem good, but in fact, there are problems. If you don’t believe me, do you dare to use them yourself?”"]},{"number":1466,"title":"Chapter 1466 Agula’s Defeat","paragraphs":["1466 Agula’s Defeat","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Agula’s expression changed and he shouted, “What do you mean, Chu Yunfan?!”","“Don’t you know what I mean? The Thirteen Brilliant Suns itself is a flawed alchemy technique, and the Brilliant Sun Fire is too overbearing. As long as the Brilliant Sun Fire was used, it would inevitably cause huge damage to the pills’ attributes,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“You’re slandering me.” Agula denied it. But in reality, he was no longer as calm as he was at the beginning. Although he had not practiced the Thirteen Brilliant Suns for a long time, he had noticed that there were some problems.","“Whether I’m talking nonsense or not, it’s very simple. We’ll know when we test the pills,” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “There should be a Pill Inspection Beast here. We’ll know if we try.”","Pill Inspection Beasts were similar to the white mice that the Federation liked to use for scientific experiments. They were used for clinical experiments, especially when developing new pill recipes. They could not use humans for experiments so they used Pill Inspection Beasts for experiments.","This was a method passed down from ancient times. These Pill Inspection Beasts had all gone through special training and their bodies were extremely sensitive. After swallowing a pill, the cause and effect would soon be revealed.","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan say this, they understood that he was right. After all, he said it with such certainty.","“That’s true. It should be easy to find a Pill Inspection Beast here. We can try it and know if the pills are really effective.”","“That’s right, but I think Chu Yunfan’s words are true.”","“It’s hard to say. After all, whether it’s true or not depends on the results of the experiment.”","“I refuse to believe it.” Agula gritted his teeth. He didn’t believe that the pills he refined had flaws.","“I brought a Pill Inspection Beast with me.” A middle-aged man walked out from the crowd, carrying a small cage. In the cage, a small beast with pale white scales, looking at the crowd with its eyes wide open.","Before Agula could object, Chu Yunfan reached for one of the pills in the long wooden box.","“The is the Tranquil Heart Pill. This should calm one’s heart and energy,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","For many warriors, their cultivation could not be separated from these sorts of calming pills. If they wanted to have an epiphany, they had to eliminate all distracting thoughts. However, this was not easy, and if there was a calming pill, everything would be much easier.","“However, you changed the formula of this Tranquil Heart Pill. Other than the main ingredient, the Tranquil Heart Grass, you’ve changed all the supplementary ingredients. It was a stupid move. The effects of the pill made through this method increased its effect by only 20%, but the cost has doubled,” Chu Yunfan commented bluntly.","In his eyes, this Tranquil Heart Pill hid no secrets. Everything had appeared in front of him. Everyone listened to him casually say so much information, and they couldn’t help but sigh in admiration.","Chu Yunfan was simply terrifying. If it were them, they would have to use specialized equipment to detect the use of these pills. It was simply impossible for Chu Yunfan to be able to see through everything with just a glance.","“What do you know? This is an improvement! I’m not selling it to civilians, so the cost is not a problem at all.”","Agula was furious. It was because of these improved pills that he was able to pass the alchemy expert test and become the youngest alchemy expert in the history of Jinzhanghan.","“An improvement? What a joke. This was not how it works.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “It’s just your wishful thinking. You actually replaced the most important ingredient of the supplementary medicine, the Traceless Grass. Do you know that the biggest effect of the Traceless Grass is to combine the various medicinal properties? It can increase the absorption efficiency of the pill by 50%. You don’t know anything and only want to increase the medicinal strength. In the end, the Tranquil Heart Pill you refined did increase in strength by 20% on paper, but in reality? The absorption efficiency by the human body is less than 80% of the original, and you still dare to say that your modification is successful?”","Agula’s face turned ashen when he heard Chu Yunfan’s explanation. Chu Yunfan was absolutely right about all these things. In past experiments, all of these flaws had appeared. But even so, the Alchemist Association of Jinzhanghan still allowed him to become an alchemy expert.","Because not every alchemy expert had the ability to modify a pill recipe. The formation of every recipe often required a long time of grinding. It was not a big deal if there were flaws for a while and could be slowly modified in the future. However, this ability and talent were rare. Agula thought so and did not care.","In this competition, he specially chose this version of the Tranquil Heart Pill because he was the one who had modified it. Even if Chu Yunfan could guess the type of pill, Agula had not made it according to the standard process. Even if Chu Yunfan knew that it was a Tranquil Heart Pill, he would not know how he made it.","It was even more impossible for Chu Yunfan to know what ingredients were used.","That was why Agula was so confident. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would expose him with a single sentence? Moreover, from what Chu Yunfan said, it was as if he had seen it with his own eyes.","Chu Yunfan threw away the recipe that Agula had carefully developed and pointed out all kinds of mistakes in it. Thinking of this, Agula felt as if he had been struck by lightning.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan fed the Tranquil Heart Pill to the Pill Inspection Beast. He said, “Normally, the Tranquil Heart Pill should be able to calm a person and eliminate all distracting thought. However, because Agula had changed the process and recipe of this pill, and added the fire element of the Brilliant Sun Fire into it, I dare to say that this Tranquil Heart Pill will not calm this beast and even make it irritable.”","Sure enough, as soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, the Pill Inspection Beast began to roar angrily and bashed against the iron railing. Its originally white scales began to turn red.","When everyone saw this scene, they sucked in a breath of cold air. Chu Yunfan was right. If an ordinary person took that pill, they might not have such a big reaction. However, the Pill Inspection Beast had been specially trained and was very sensitive to pills.","Now that the Pill Inspection Beast was acting like this, it verified Chu Yunfan’s statement. Agula’s pills were simply trash, and they didn’t even have the qualifications to be evaluated.","Agula had lost, and he had suffered a crushing defeat!"]},{"number":1467,"title":"Chapter 1467 Killing Them All","paragraphs":["1467 Killing Them All","Agula stared at the scene in front of him with his mouth agape. If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed it.","There were actually so many problems with the pills he had made, but Chu Yunfan had found them all. At this moment, he felt that Chu Yunfan was like a high and mighty god. No matter what tricks ordinary mortals played, they could not hide from that high and mighty god.","However, he could not deny that there were problems with the pill he made.","This Brilliant Sun Fire was originally where Agula’s pride lay. To refine the Brilliant Sun Fire, he had suffered who knew how much hardship. But now, he was suddenly struck down by Chu Yunfan, telling him that the alchemic fire he cultivated was nothing. This was the most painful thing.","Everyone could see that Agula had lost, and it was a crushing defeat!","What was even more unbelievable was how Chu Yunfan could have known so much. These were aspects that even he had never thought of, but Chu Yunfan had seen through all of them. It was simply an unbelievable miracle.","“You’ve lost. Your pills aren’t qualified to be evaluated by me. According to our previous agreement, go ahead and kneel,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Agula’s expression changed when he heard what Chu Yunfan said. He had forced Tian Yi to kneel just to crush his confidence. Alchemists who had such cultivation bases were rare existences among tens of thousands of people. These people were all geniuses and had absolute confidence in themselves. However, if this absolute confidence was lost, then whether it was in martial arts or alchemy in the future, their progress would be very limited.","And now, Chu Yunfan was going to use his methods on him.","“Chu Yunfan, don’t push it,” Agula said through gritted teeth.","“And so what if I do?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Agula’s expression turned even uglier. This was exactly what he had said to Tian Yi earlier. At that time, he was so high-spirited, but now, when this sentence was said to him, he was unable to accept it.","“Hmph, regardless of the quality of the pills I made, you didn’t even tell me the ingredients or medicinal effects. You’re the one who has lost. However, I’m magnanimous and will let you off this time,” Agula quickly said. Then, he turned around and walked toward Jinzhanghan’s station.","“You dare to act shamelessly in front of me?” Chu Yunfan sneered, “Kneel!”","At that moment, Agula felt as if a mountain was crushing down on him. A terrifying aura pressed down on him, and he instinctively fell to his knees. Just like how Tian Yi had no way to fight back, Agula had no way to fight back when he faced Chu Yunfan.","He was still far from being able to play such tricks in front of Chu Yunfan.","“What are you doing, Chu Yunfan? How dare you humiliate me! Jinzhanghan will not let you off,” Agula hurriedly shouted.","“He really does as he pleases. This Chu Yunfan’s decisiveness is really shocking.”","“Doesn’t Jinzhanghan pose any threat to him?”","“What a joke. Agula was so arrogant just now, and now he’s panicking.”","Everyone was in an uproar, and they all felt disdain for Agula. Before, he said that he wanted others to abide by their earlier bets, but when it came to himself, it was a completely different set of standards.","What was despicable and shameless? This was despicable and shameless!","“Jinzhanghan is nothing. I’m not even afraid of your great khan, let alone a dog like you!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Weren’t you shouting happily just now? And now?”","“How dare you!”","Suddenly, the Jinzhanghan experts in the surroundings finally made a move. Although their alchemy experts had already left to avoid suspicion, there were still many other experts in the surroundings.","There were even Cores!","Swish!","Swish!","Swish!","Many figures rushed toward Chu Yunfan like lightning. However, although they were fast, Chu Yunfan was faster. In the void, Chu Yunfan threw out countless thunderbolts that turned condensed into huge hands of thunder. These experts, whose movements could not be seen by the naked eye, were all instantly caught.","Everyone was shocked as they looked at the experts who were caught in the sky and struggling. They simply could not believe it.","“So many experts... Even Cores! Jinzhanghan must have planned this.”","“That’s right, they must have done this to prevent Chu Yunfan from breaking the bet. No one expected Agula to lose in the end.”","“This is interesting. Jinzhanghan has been shameless too many times, and they finally kicked a hornet’s nest. But who is this Chu Yunfan? How is he so terrifying?”","While many people were still in shock, they saw Chu Yunfan casually stretch out his hand and grab at the air. In an instant, the thunderbolt hands in the sky also clenched. Then, before the experts of Jinzhanghan could use their strength, they were crushed by the hands in mid-air.","In an instant, they all died tragically.","Everyone stared at Chu Yunfan with their eyes wide open. They didn’t know what to say. The strength that he displayed was too shocking. It couldn’t even be compared to a martial artist, let alone an alchemist.","Now they remembered why Chu Yunfan was so confident. He was not afraid of Jinzhanghan jumping up. If they really jumped up, they would be courting death.","Even Agula, who had been extremely arrogant earlier, was completely dumbfounded. Although his back was facing Chu Yunfan and he could not see, his divine will could observe the situation. He was completely scared silly.","Chu Yunfan’s performance was too shocking. He had crushed the experts of Jinzhanghan.","At this moment, Agula realized that Jinzhanghan’s analysis of Chu Yunfan’s strength was completely wrong. Chu Yunfan was definitely not only at the fledgling Void Core Stage. Judging from the divine power that he displayed, he was only at the fledgling Void Core Stage, but who would have thought that he was a wolf in sheep’s clothing?"]},{"number":1468,"title":"Chapter 1468 His Name Spreads","paragraphs":["1468 His Name Spreads","All their previous speculations about Chu Yunfan were wrong.","Chu Yunfan slowly walked up to Agula, and a look of disgust flashed through his eyes. He stepped on Agula’s head, and his head slammed into the ground.","Bam!","Everyone heard a huge explosion, and the entire ground split open. Everyone gasped, seeing Agula’s miserable state. However, no one felt any sympathy for him. Everyone had seen how arrogant and domineering he was earlier.","Tian Yi was gritting his teeth and his eyes were red. He had been humiliated by Agula and had not left just to see this scene. Although he didn’t do it himself, he was already satisfied and didn’t have any more thoughts.","“According to our agreement, I’ll cripple one of your arms,” Chu Yunfan said lightly, and then he grabbed Agula’s hand.","Agula screamed as Chu Yunfan grabbed his entire arm.","“Ah, my arm!”","Agula let out a miserable cry. At the same time, he realized that he might not be able to heal his arm. Cores like them possessed some superpowers that Divines did not. With the help of some secret techniques, it was not entirely impossible for them to heal limbs. It was still possible.","However, he could feel that the arm that Chu Yunfan had crippled was different. There was no possibility of recovery at all. In other words, he would forever be a cripple.","Then, Chu Yunfan kicked Agula, who was sent flying. After a miserable cry, he fainted. After crippling Agula’s arm, he turned around and left. The result of this confrontation spread throughout the entire meet. In an instant, Chu Yunfan’s reputation soared.","Stepping on others to get to fame was the fastest way.","During this period, Agula had stepped on the shoulders of Jiang Lan’er, Bai Shengzu, Tian Yi, and others to become the leader of the new generation of alchemists. And Chu Yunfan became famous after defeating Agula.","He was going to become famous among all the alchemists in the world. After all, a large number of top alchemists had gathered in the meet, and they were all the best alchemists in their respective countries and forces. Even if they weren’t alchemists, they were still people in related industries.","If Chu Yunfan became famous at the meet, it meant that he would be able to amaze the entire circle of alchemists. It was not like before, where although there were people who knew about it, they were all concentrated in the Chu clan. Outside of the clan, no one knew about it.","Compared to Agula, Chu Yunfan was even younger. The latter was already an alchemy expert in his twenties. If Agula was said to be rare in a hundred years, then Chu Yunfan might be the first in history.","After all, the cultivation of alchemy was not like the cultivation of martial arts. The cultivation of martial arts could be done by burying one’s head in it, but the cultivation of alchemy had extremely high requirements on experience, knowledge, inheritance, and so on. The rate of success was much lower than that of martial artists.","There were many Cores in Great Wei, but there were only a handful of alchemy experts with similar cultivation levels. They were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns.","And Chu Yunfan was an alchemy expert. There weren’t many people like him in the entire world.","However, many people were shocked by Chu Yunfan’s ruthlessness. He said he wanted to cripple one of Agula’s arms, he did just that. Such a person was a ruthless character no matter where he went.","Many people understood Chu Yunfan was not someone to be trifled with. Such a person might not have much reputation outside, but it was impossible for him to not have any reputation in Great Wei. Many people had already begun to wonder if they should start asking about Chu Yunfan.","After all, such a person was extraordinary. In the next few decades, he might be an influential figure. There was no harm in understanding him in advance,","At this moment, in Jinzhanghan’s station, the alchemy experts who had got there too late were all wearing grim expressions. The atmosphere in the conference room was like the calm before the storm.","“This is too much. Chu Yunfan actually dared to bully us. He must die!” an alchemy expert of Jinzhanghan roared angrily, breaking the silence in the meeting room.","“Two alchemy experts... Chu Yunfan has crippled two of our alchemy experts! How preposterous!”","“That’s right! We must make him pay with blood!”","“Let him die. Inform the kingdom immediately. Be it the Blood Barbarians or the Netherworld Sect, send someone to kill him now!”","The higher-ups of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association exploded. They were the only ones who bullied others. No one else bullied them. Even if they had planned to deal with the younger generation of alchemists from other countries, they still felt that they had suffered a huge loss.","In fact, they had indeed suffered a huge loss. It could be said that they had failed to steal a chicken and suffered a loss. Even a powerful country like Jinzhanghan, which had far more expert alchemists than Great Wei, could not afford to die like this.","Two of them were crippled in one go, especially Agula, who would be the pillar of Jinzhanghan for many years to come. The loss was so great that it was enough to make these experts, who were usually scheming against each other, feel heartache.","This time, they had avoided suspicion and left. In fact, they did not go far. They went to look for the alchemy experts from Great Wei and held them back. They had wanted to give the people of Great Wei no chance to rescue them, but who knew that their Agula would suffer a great loss instead?","A few Cores and a group of Divines had also died. They had been killed like chickens.","It had been a long time since they had suffered such a loss.","“We can’t let this go. We have to get the Alchemist Association to deal with them.”","“That’s right. We can’t let them off so easily.”","“Get the Alchemist Association to cripple Chu Yunfan!”","Everyone turned their eyes to the president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association, who was a sinister old man with a large aquiline nose.","Seeing that everyone was looking at him, the president said coldly, “How can we take revenge? Agula was stupid. He didn’t even know that he was being set up and made a bet with that person. Now that one of his arms has been crippled, what can he say?","“However, just because headquarters won’t help us doesn’t mean that we don’t have a way.”"]},{"number":1469,"title":"Chapter 1469 Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association Is Frightened!","paragraphs":["1469 Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association Is Frightened!","The president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association said with a sinister smile, “Hmph, you want the Alchemist Association headquarters to punish them? Then you have to work for it.”","“What’s wrong? Why do you say that, sir?” someone asked.","“Everyone wants to kill Chu Yunfan, including me, but we can’t,” the president said indifferently.","“How’s that possible? We have so many Cores on our side. We can also contact some alchemy experts who owe us a favor. Why can’t we kill him? I can ask a peak Void Core for assistance.”","“I know a late Void Core too. Killing Chu Yunfan will be as easy as snapping my fingers.”","“I can also ask someone for help. Chu Yunfan will die!”","Everyone spoke simultaneously as no conflicts were between them. Previously, there were even quite a few people who schemed against each other. Usually, they would fight with each other to compete for resources. However, it was different this time.","Chu Yunfan had crippled two alchemy experts without batting an eye. Although it was them who had suffered, they felt provoked. That was why they were so indignant about Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, many people throughout Jinzhanghan would celebrate that these two were disabled.","“A peak Void Core and a late Void Core? I might as well tell you now that they’ll die no matter what level of martial artists they are.” The president sneered.","“How can that be? There aren’t many experts in Great Wei that are at the peak of the Void Core Stage, right? Will Great Wei’s Alchemist Association fight to the death with us over Chu Yunfan?”","The other alchemists were in disbelief. They wondered what kind of existence a peak Void Core was. After all, their kingdom had very few of them. Only a dozen experts of this level existed in the vast Jinzhanghan.","Each resembled a nuclear weapon overseeing a region. The price for asking even one of them for assistance was too costly. Even if these alchemists knew an expert of that level and had enough owed favors, the price would still be too high to pay.","And according to their president’s words, asking these experts for help would not be enough. Of course, no one believed it. These experts would have a higher chance of success in going to Great Wei’s Imperial Capital to assassinate its emperor. The other alchemists wondered if Chu Yunfan was harder to kill than Great Wei’s emperor.","“Great Wei’s Alchemist Association is nothing. They can’t compare to me.” The president sneered.","He had never paid any attention to Great Wei’s Alchemist Association. They were simpletons, including Great Qi’s Alchemist Association. Great Wei and Great Qi could barely contend with Jinzhanghang even if they joined forces.","“The most terrifying person is Chu Yunfan,” the president said, “I’ve already asked our spies in Great Wei to investigate him. And guess what? I thought it would take longer to find information about him, but they sent me information through the teleportation portal in just half a day. Chu Yunfan is no ordinary person.”","The president usually received information from afar. One could send vital information through a small-scale teleportation portal for better efficiency. However, the price would be relatively high. Still, it would not be too costly if the information was highly urgent.","The president initially did not care about Chu Yunfan. Although the latter had disabled two alchemy experts, the president thought Chu Yunfan was only at the intermediate Void Core Stage at most, which was already shocking.","‘That’s what cultivation was like before I was even born!’","The president became wide-eyed when he read Chu Yunfan’s information. He realized he had underestimated Chu Yunfan and felt a chill run down his spine.","“I have Chu Yunfan’s information right here,” he said as he retrieved a jade slip containing Chu Yunfan’s information from the void.","The alchemists took turns using their primordial spirits to probe and check the information. Immediately after, the whole conference room echoed with gasps. After reading Chu Yunfan’s information, they gasped as the president did when he had first read it.","It was laughable that these alchemists’ cultivation levels had long reached their limit. It had been long since they felt such terror.","‘The number one expert in the world? He’s suspected to be a Core Former!’","‘He single-handedly overturned Great Wei’s Imperial Court and supported an emperor to ascend the throne to start a new regime?’","Those events made everyone gasp. Ordinary people could not comprehend such terror and could laugh it off, but not these alchemists. Even if they were not in the Core Form Stage, they were in the upper tiers of the Divine Abilities stage to the half-step Core Form Stage.","These experts had another name—kingdom guardians. Each could oversee a kingdom and suppress another. It was a good thing for any kingdom to have a firm foothold. Even Jinzhanghan, as powerful as it was, had very few experts of that level.","Regarding combat power, an expert of such a level could single-handedly kill everyone in Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association. And they had been scheming against such a person. The alchemists wondered if they had a death wish.","At that moment, they understood why Chu Yunfan was so fearless. Agula could not force Chu Yunfan to kneel, even with how strong the former was or how many people he brought.","After some thought, the alchemists realized their thoughts were ridiculous. They did not even know what kind of monster Chu Yunfan was."]},{"number":1470,"title":"Chapter 1470 The Net Forms!","paragraphs":["1470 The Net Forms!","None of them could alter the entire country’s fate. After all, there were few existences of this level in the world. If that alone were not enough to shock them, then Chu Yunfan’s age would.","He did not look like a teenager or a mid-aged adult, looking to be only in his early twenties. The alchemists never thought a twenty-year-old could reach such heights. They suspected he had started cultivating the moment his parents conceived him. How could he have reached such astonishing cultivation levels?","Everyone looked at each other in shock. The alchemists had vowed to eliminate Chu Yunfan but never expected him to be such a formidable force. They were in dismay because they had still been apprentices in their twenties. The strongest among them were at most junior alchemists, and those who became senior alchemists were geniuses like Agula.","However, Chu Yunfan differed. He possessed the cultivation of an alchemy expert in his twenties and had also reached the Core Form Stage.","In the deadlock situation, someone finally asked, “I-Is he a monster? How do we kill someone that powerful?”","Everyone had no choice but to stand down after reading Chu Yunfan’s information. After all, his achievements were outstanding. He had defeated Yun Huang—the original number-one expert and leader of the Monster Subduer Sect. Yun Huang was famous even in Jinzhanghan and had been the only kingdom guardian in Great Wei.","Yun Huang had supported more than half of the situations in Great Wei, and Chu Yunfan managed to defeat such a terrifyingly strong person.","“How strong is Chu Yunfan? The experts we know can’t withstand a single blow from him.”","Although the alchemists might not understand it fully, they clearly saw the gap between the Core Form Stage and the Void Core Stage. They were not that ignorant.","“We can’t kill him even if we ask for assistance,” someone lamented.","Jinzhanghan had its own kingdom guardians, but they could not just ask someone of that level for assistance whenever they wanted to. Especially when the target was another kingdom guardian-level master. Hence, the alchemists had to consider their options carefully.","They wondered where else they could find someone to deal with Chu Yunfan.","The president said, “Don’t worry, everyone. Although this b*stard is hard to deal with, his existence has attracted the khan’s attention. I’ve already sent out news of Chu Yunfan’s arrival. The khan has promised to send his men.”","A sharp light glinted in his eyes. ‘Chu Yunfan’s existence is quite a massive threat to Jinzhanghan.’","A senior alchemist pipped up, “I’m afraid fighting here would be inappropriate though. If that happens, Headquarters might have a falling out with our kingdom.”","The Alchemist Association Headquarters was an independent behemoth of the three great kingdoms and had a bottom line. They could disregard the struggles between the various alchemist associations, but if any of them killed people in their territory, there would be a falling out between them and the perpetrators. If that happened, even if many alchemy experts from Jinzhanghan were part of Headquarters, they would not swallow their anger.","After all, the Alchemist Association Headquarters transcended kingdoms and had existed much longer than Jinzhanghan’s history. It was not that no one had tried defying Headquarters since ancient times, but ultimately, they returned in defeat and even aroused Headquarter’s revenge.","They mobilized all their forces and destroyed it. Among them, there were even forces with Core Formers. One could imagine how terrifying Headquarters was. Unless it were essential, no one would be willing to shed all pretense of cordiality with such an existence.","The president said coldly, “It doesn’t matter! The meet is about to end. Chu Yunfan will leave this place, and we can ambush them on the journey back.”","Someone asked, “What if he uses the teleportation portal to leave? This base has a portal, though it is a high price to use it.”","If the alchemists of Great Wei courageously tried to escape, they might be unable to stop them.","“Hmph, it’s not that simple. I’ve already asked our kingdom to shut down the portal so he can’t escape. He’d have to be thousands of miles away to reach the nearest place with a portal. Such a distance is enough to send Chu Yunfan to his death!” the president said coldly and confidently.","The others were relieved.","“In that case, our plan is foolproof. We have to kill Chu Yunfan.”","“That’s right. This b*stard is too much of a threat. Our kingdom will never have a day of peace with him around.”","“Hahaha! We’ll cut off his head and send it to Great Wei’s little emperor!”","The deadlocked atmosphere disappeared. The alchemists felt relaxed now that they had a way to kill Chu Yunfan.","Meanwhile, the alchemists of Great Qi were gloomy. They, too, had received information about Chu Yunfan. After all, Jinzhanghan was not the only place with spies in Great Wei. Other large forces did too.","Though the level of spies differed, Chu Yunfan’s information was no longer a secret. After all, the battle in front of everyone had exposed everything, and it was the first time Chu Yunfan had revealed he possessed a Core Former’s combat strength.","Like the alchemists of Jinzhanghan, the ones in Great Qi were just as dumbfounded, especially Tian Yi. He was a self-proclaimed genius but was now in his thirties. He too had just become a senior alchemist and was still far from becoming an alchemy expert.","Even so, people praised him as a genius, and he had always thought. Until Agula destroyed his pride."]},{"number":1471,"title":"Chapter 1471 Everyone Was Shocked","paragraphs":["1471 Everyone Was Shocked","The president of Great Qi’s Alchemist Association realized that Agula, who he had always regarded as his greatest enemy, was nothing compared to Chu Yunfan.","After all, Agula had barely stepped into the alchemy expert ranks, and the Thirteen Brilliant Suns he cultivated had various problems. Moreover, Chu Yunfan had severely injured one of his arms. He feared that Agula would have to leave the alchemy expert ranks.","The president never imagined a young man in his twenties could possess such astonishing and dazzling cultivation in both alchemy and martial arts.","The president looked around and said, “What should we do? Chu Yunfan is strong, but Is it a good or bad thing for us?”","An alchemy expert from Great Qi said, “I don’t think it’s necessarily a good thing. After all, Jinzhanghan is dominating the world right now. They won’t allow us or Great Wei to stand out. Now that a genius has appeared in Great Wei, Jinzhanghan will not allow Chu Yunfan to live.”","“In that case, we shall just wait and see. It won’t be worse for us, no matter who wins.”","He had already given up on finding trouble with Chu Yunfan when he discovered Chu Yunfan was in the Core Form stage.","‘Is this some kind of joke? That’s a kingdom guardian-level master. Only a few exist in Great Qi. How could we dispatch anyone to deal with him? It’ll be a significant loss for Great Qi if we lose. If we don’t keep this matter a secret and let Chu Yunfan escape, I’ll face the terrifying wrath of a kingdom guardian.’","And Chu Yunfan did not need to fight them head-on. Great Qi would soon collapse if he destroyed one of their cities. They could not deal with an expert of this level. Only experts of the same level could contend with Chu Yunfan.","No matter what, Jinzhanghan should be the first to feel threatened if Chu Yunfan rose. Hence, Great Qi was not too nervous. At that moment, their best chance of survival was to watch them fight.","Everyone soon agreed to remain neutral during the battle between the two sides.","Meanwhile, Tian Yi clenched his fists as he listened from the sidelines. He had no right to speak on this matter. In comparison, Chu Yunfan was the center of attention.","Tian Yi felt aggrieved, thinking, ‘Why did he become the center of attention?’","“Still, Chu Yunfan is a monstrous figure. We must foster a good relationship with him.” Great Qi’s president quickly decided. He did not want to rope Chu Yunfan in, but at least wanted to befriend him.","If a genius like Chu Yunfan survived, everyone would have to obey him a few hundred years later. After all, he was an expert who leveled a country.","After obtaining information about Chu Yunfan, Jinzhanghan, Great Qi, and other major powers finally realized how formidable he was. It was not something they had expected. Instead, it exceeded their expectations a thousand times over.","If a Core Form was dissatisfied, he could slaughter everyone inside and outside the base.","“I never pegged him for a Core Former. He’s much too young.”","“That’s right. Didn’t another Core Former appear a few days ago? Wasn’t that person’s name Jian Wuchen? He’s around the same age.”","“Yes, I heard about that. Jian Wuchen defeated more than ten sects in one go and even slaughtered all of Nine Stars’ masters. There might not have been a master of this level for decades or even centuries.”","“But two of them in just a few days? That’s too much!”","Most compared Chu Yunfan to Jian Wuchen, who had recently become famous, but no one knew the two were one and the same. None dared to think in that direction. Otherwise, it would be too shocking. After all, one was a sword genius, and the other was a prodigy in alchemy.","Everyone sighed when they recalled seeing two geniuses consecutively.","Undercurrents surged, and a storm brewed as all the significant forces investigated Chu Yunfan. While the story’s main character himself remained as steady as a mountain.","He either strolled around and completed transactions with merchants who sold medicinal herbs or participated in the meet to discuss alchemy with various alchemists.","No one dared to underestimate Chu Yunfan after the incident with Agula. Everyone regarded the former as an alchemy expert, especially his outstanding martial arts skills, which made people look at him in a different light.","Soon after, the various influential powers received a notice from the Alchemist Association Headquarters. Since the teleportation portal to the outside world was broken, no one could use it.","Chu Yunfan would have to go to a city thousands of miles away from here if he wanted to use a teleportation portal. The news caused a massive commotion, especially at this sensitive moment.","One would say it caught most people’s interest.","Jinzhanghan was mighty in the Alchemist Association, but its power was not unlimited. The various influential forces also had a considerable pull on the Alchemist Association.","The news could not remain hidden from them since Jinzhanghan was involved. It made many people realize that this matter was not as straightforward as it seemed.","Those who were smarter guessed that Jinzhanghan had come with ill intentions, and their target was Chu Yunfan.","The representatives of Great Wei’s Alchemist Association also received the news at the first possible moment. The leader, Gongsun Wulong, immediately went looking for Chu Yunfan.","Gongsun Wulong said, “Master Chu, I’ve just received news that the city’s teleportation portal has been destroyed and can no longer be used. It’s probably related to Jinzhanghan.”","“Understood.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Gongsun Wulong was astounded. After all, it was an urgent matter, and Chu Yunfan replied with one simple word."]},{"number":1472,"title":"Chapter 1472 On the Verge of Death","paragraphs":["1472 On the Verge of Death","Gongsun Wulong didn’t understand how Chu Yunfan could still be so calm at this point. Even the other forces had sensed that something was wrong, let alone their alchemist association.","They had been fighting against Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association for a long time. They were old rivals, so they naturally understood the way they had always handled things.","He didn’t believe that Jinzhanghan would let Chu Yunfan off easily after suffering such a great loss. If he was the president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association, he would definitely not let Chu Yunfan off either. Even the representatives of Great Wei’s Alchemist Association might be in trouble.","And the teleportation portal suddenly broke down without any warning. It was a sign!","However, Gongsun Wulong knew that Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association would not dare to make a move at the meet. After all, they had people in the Alchemist Association. But this did not mean that they could rest easy. This journey back would be filled with dangers.","“Master Chu, Jinzhanghan is clearly coming at us aggressively. We must be on guard!” Gongsun Wulong said anxiously, “I’ve already sent someone to send back the news, but I’m afraid it’ll take a long time for our kingdom’s reinforcements to arrive. In the meantime, we may be ambushed.”","At this point, Gongsun Wulong’s face revealed a worried expression.","“An ambush?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “They want to kill me, but it’s hard to say who will kill who!”","What the hell was this feeling of not being afraid that the other party would not come? On the contrary, he was afraid that the other party would not come.","Gongsun Wulong suddenly remembered that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was rumored to have reached the Core Form Stage. With his strength, there was nothing to be afraid of.","And now, Jinzhanghan had probably gotten the relevant information about Chu Yunfan. After all, this was not a secret. He did not believe that the major forces would not have arranged for people to lurk in Great Wei.","Under such circumstances, how bold was Jinzhanghan to attack Chu Yunfan?","If it were him, he would probably give up on revenge. After all, wasn’t taking revenge on a Core Former courting death?","An expert of that level could single-handedly destroy their kingdom’s Alchemist Association. Although the status of alchemists in this world was very high, in the end, this was still a world where the strong were respected.","And Chu Yunfan was the strongest.","Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s strength, Gongsun Wulong heaved a sigh of relief. No matter what, as long as Chu Yunfan was here, their safety could be guaranteed. Even if Jinzhanghan wanted to make a move, they would have to see if they had the strength to do so.","Time passed day by day, and in the blink of an eye, three days had passed. The Small Pill Origin Meet finally came to an end. This time, there were endless open and secret struggles between the three great kingdoms, but the one who was truly famous was Chu Yunfan.","This was the so-called instant fame!","Chu Yunfan had never been known by anyone. He was unknown to the world of alchemists. But in just a few short days, he had let all the alchemists in the world know what it meant to be powerful.","After three whole days, the teleportation portal at the base had not been repaired. Finally, most people could not hold it in anymore and began to return to their respective forces. However, among them, the most eye-catching were Great Wei’s representatives.","On this day, Great Wei’s representatives finally set off. However, to everyone’s surprise, Great Qi’s representatives also set off on the same day, though they had to leave early. Although everyone’s goal was the same, it was clear that no one wanted to leave with Great Wei. Everyone knew that Jinzhanghan would not let this matter rest. They were afraid that the journey would be stormy.","In the endless void, on top of an incomparably huge bird that spread its wings and was dozens of meters long, Great Wei’s representatives stood majestically. It was a giant bird with a huge beak and a body of pure gold. It was said to have the bloodline of the legendary golden roc and could travel tens of thousands of miles in a day as fast as thunder.","Riding the bird was like riding the wind. The strong wind that came at them was like a blunt weapon that could kill people alive. Fortunately, these people were all experts with high cultivation. They formed a protective shield around their bodies so that they would not be affected.","This large-beaked bird was a beast that could only be nurtured by a nation-level force for traveling purposes. Ordinary forces could not even afford to raise it. Its daily meat consumption alone was enough to make ordinary forces collapse.","Standing on this large-beaked bird, they would only need a day to reach the next teleportation portal. At that time, they would naturally be able to teleport back to Great Wei. Although there were some twists and turns, everyone now understood that they were in a dangerous situation. Everything was worth it.","Suddenly, just as everyone was closing their eyes to rest, the large-beaked bird suddenly stopped, and everyone was jolted awake from their meditation.","They all looked up and saw a shocking battle taking place in the distance. Tens of thousands of soldiers in blood-red armor and spears in their hands surrounded a group of people.","Everyone’s expression was extremely ugly as they realized it was the rumored elites of Jinzhanghan—the Blood Barbarians. And the people they surrounded were not ordinary people. They were the alchemist representative of Great Qi.","To not encounter a delay, they left earlier than Great Wei’s representatives. However, they were still attacked by the Blood Barbarians.","“Is Jinzhanghan crazy?! How dare you attack us!”","Among them, the [resident of Great Qi’s Alchemist Association roared and continuously blasted out terrifying attacks. Although he was an alchemist, he was also a genuine Void Core. Moreover, his cultivation had already stepped into the late Void Core Stage. Among Void Cores, he was a famous existence.","However, it was useless. Even if there were a few alchemy experts accompanying them, plus the alchemy experts who came to protect them, there were only less than ten of them. Such a scale was a force that could not be underestimated no matter where it was.","But against the Blood Barbarians, they had no strength to fight back.","The Blood Barbarians were too strong. Even if there were only ten thousand of them, they could suppress all of Great Qi’s representatives.","And this time, Jinzhanghan had sent out many experts. Including the original Jinzhanghan representatives, more than twenty Cores had joined the siege.","Great Qi’s representatives were in imminent danger!"]},{"number":1473,"title":"Chapter 1473 The Terrifying Strength of a Kingdom Guardian","paragraphs":["1473 The Terrifying Strength of a Kingdom Guardian","“Hahahaha, you think you’ll be able to escape? If we kill you, who would know that we did it?” The president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association laughed.","Great Qi’s representatives suffered heavy casualties. There were less than ten Cores, to begin with, and now more than half of them were dead or injured. Moreover, they could not shake the terrifying formation formed by the thousands of Blood Barbarians.","Martial arts experts like them could not care less about ordinary military formations. They could easily kill them several times over. Only the Blood Barbarians, the elites among the elites, were completely different.","“Despicable!”","The president of Great Qi’s Alchemist Association shouted miserably. He wanted to send out a message, but he couldn’t do it. A barrier master had set up an array in the surrounding area. All the messages they wanted to send out were blocked.","“That doesn’t look good. We have to go,” Gongsun Wulong said with a pale face.","He had not expected to bump into Jinzhanghan here, especially when Jinzhanghan was besieging and killing Great Qi’s representatives.","Gongsun Wulong reacted immediately. The people of Jinzhanghan were waiting for them here, and their target was not only Great Wei’s representatives, but also Great Qi’s representatives.","Previously, to draw a clear line with Great Wei’s representatives, Great Qi’s representatives had left in earlier. Who knew that they would still be surrounded?","However, it was already too late. The light purple barrier in the sky suddenly expanded, enveloping the large-beaked bird. Great Wei’s representatives instantly panicked.","Half of the Blood Barbarians were sent out. In just a moment, they had surrounded Great Wei’s representatives. The leader was none other than the president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association.","“How dare you! Do you want to start a war with two countries?!” Gongsun Wulong roared in shock and anger.","“Hahahaha, just you guys? If you die, who will know?” The Jinzhanghan president burst into laughter.","As long as they were not caught with concrete evidence, would Great Wei and Great Qi really start a war with Jinzhanghan because of them?","“Brother Gongsun, we have to work together to survive!” The Great Qi president hurriedly shouted.","When he saw Great Wei’s representatives appear, his eyes filled with surprise and joy. He had thought that it would be a dead end, but now, at least there was a chance for them to survive.","Jinzhanghan had mobilized the Blood Barbarians. One could imagine how determined they were. This was his only chance!","Gongsun Wulong was embarrassed. He originally didn’t want to care about this matter. The most important thing was to leave. Who knew that he would still be surrounded?","He then looked at Chu Yunfan in the crowd.","The rest of Great Wei’s representatives also looked to Chu Yunfan. At this moment, only Chu Yunfan was their backbone.","Chu Yunfan was lying on the back of the Giant Beaked Bird with his eyes closed. He had no choice but to open his eyes and say, “Looks like you guys haven’t learned your lesson.” He slowly stood up. “Since you want to die, I’ll send you on your way!”","“Such arrogance! Attack! Kill him!” The Jinzhanghan president shouted.","Thousands of Blood Barbarians marched in an orderly manner and surrounded them. Chu Yunfan glanced at the Blood Barbarians who were surrounding him and sneered. Then, he suddenly stepped forward.","In an instant, a huge footprint appeared in the air, accompanied by endless netherworld water that poured down.","“Netherworld Stomp!” Chu Yunfan shouted and stomped down. It was the Nine Netherworld Stomps.","In an instant, the atmosphere of the entire battlefield seemed to have frozen. It was as if the aura of the entire world had been seized by one person.","Boom!","The kick landed right in the middle of the Blood Barbarian’s formation.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The terrifying netherworld water swept through everything. The five thousand Blood Barbarians were destroyed in an instant. Chu Yunfan trampled thousands of them to death, and more than half of them were either dead or injured.","“How is this possible?!” The Jinzhanghan president looked at scene in disbelief. What kind of concept was five thousand Blood Barbarians? If they wanted to annihilate a sect with several Cores, this lineup was enough.","In the end, more than half of them were killed by Chu Yunfan’s stomp. That terrifying attack crushed everything. The world-famous Blood Barbarian army formation could not withstand a single blow.","And it was not just him. Everyone was frightened by Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength. The rumored invincible Blood Barbarians were so weak in front of Chu Yunfan. This was simply subverting their worldview.","“Can one person really do this?” someone said in shock.","Although they all knew that Chu Yunfan might be a Core Former, knowing was just knowing. How could it be as terrifying as seeing it in person? Only after seeing it for themselves did they understand why a Core Former was regarded as a kingdom guardian.","Ordinary Void Cores were no match for the Blood Barbarians, and the Blood Barbarians could not even withstand a stomp from Chu Yunfan.","On the contrary, the Great Qi and Great Wei representative were greatly motivated. Chu Yunfan’s strength was not exaggerated, but far exceeded the rumors. This meant that he was strong enough to protect them.","However, Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He had shattered the Blood Barbarians’ formation with a single step. This was nothing to him. Previously, his cultivation was far inferior to his current level, but he could still easily kill the Blood Barbarians.","Not to mention now that he had truly stepped into the Core Stage, and his combat strength had soared to the Core Form Stage. The army formed by the mere thousands of Blood Barbarians had no effect on him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked at the president of the Jinzhanghan president and sneered, “It’s your turn!”","“No!”","The Jinzhanghan president immediately sounded the alarm. It was as if he had been targeted by a terrifying beast. His cultivation had long since reached the peak Void Core Stage. He was the strongest on the entire battlefield, but now, when facing Chu Yunfan, he felt suffocated as if he was facing a terrifying existence whose life level was far higher than his.","However, in the next moment, a terrifying sword light swept across the sky and struck the Jinzhanghan president.","Slash!","The Jinzhanghan president was cut in half and died instantly."]},{"number":1474,"title":"Chapter 1474 Group Annihilation, the Right King Appears","paragraphs":["1474 Group Annihilation, the Right King Appears","Instant kill!","In front of Chu Yunfan, a peak Void Core could not even withstand one move.","Whether it was a peak Void Core or an ordinary Void Core, there was no difference in front of Chu Yunfan. When one’s combat strength reached that level, they had long transcended everything.","At this moment, he raised his arm high. Countless dark clouds gathered in the sky, and countless thunder dragons surged within. Everyone could feel a terrifying pressure pressing down. Then, he suddenly dropped his arm. In an instant, countless thunder dragons fell like a storm, instantly sweeping away everything.","The Blood Barbarians, which looked extremely terrifying to outsiders, died instantly when struck by the thunder dragons. In an instant, they were turned into charcoal.","A moment later, the entire battlefield was in a complete mess. The tens of thousands of Blood Barbarians all died tragically. They died without a burial ground and fell to the ground like stones.","As for the remaining twenty Void Cores, they were also in a tragic state. In order to avoid the thunder bolts, they used all their strength. Although they were not killed in this large-scale slaughter, they were in a sorry state. Many of them had already been greviously injured.","They no longer had the power to sweep the world. Under Chu Yunfan’s attack, they simply could not fight back.","At this moment, everyone on the battlefield was dumbfounded. Looking at this scene in front of them, they were scared silly. When the thunder dragons ran amok, they did not dare to move an inch, afraid that they would be swept by them if they were not careful. They had no choice but to face this.","The terrifying power had long surpassed the limits of what they could come into contact with.","Fortunately, the thunder dragons seemed sentient, and none of them landed on them. As they heaved sighs of relief, they also looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s control over the thunder had reached a shocking level.","If it were them, it would be impossible for them to release such terrifying thunder power. Even if they did, it would be impossible to accurately control every bolt.","At the same time, this also meant that Chu Yunfan’s mental powress was so powerful that it was unimaginable. Only then could he achieve such an unbelievable level.","It meant that Chu Yunfan’s strength was beyond reson, which was the most terrifying thing!","“They were all killed just like that? Is this the power of a kingdom guardian?”","Great Qi’s representatives gulped. They had never seen Chu Yunfan fight. Though they had read the information, they had only read it. Only now did they understand what it meant to be a kingdom guardian.","“They couldn’t even withstand a single blow. The Blood Barbarians who almost forced us into a dead end were no match for him,” the Great Qi president said as he spat out a mouthful of blood.","At this moment, his condition was rapidly declining. Previously, he had been burning his life force to increase his combat power. Now that the battle had ended, he could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","Looking at Great Qi’s representatives, he felt like crying. In just a short time, nearly half of them had died. Once the news spread, all of Great Qi would probably riot.","Which of these dead experts had a small number of disciples and grand disciples? Their network of connections spread throughout Great Qi. Even if it was only those Divines, it was the same.","They had been too careless and did not even know that they were being followed by Jinzhanghan. In fact, they did not expect Jinzhanghan to be so crazy as to not let them off.","It was precisely because they had guessed that Jinzhanghan would attack the Great Wei representatives that they were so sure that Jinzhanghan would not offend two big kingdoms at once. However, they had underestimated Jinzhanghan’s madness.","The remaining Cores of Jinzhanghan looked at each other in bewilderment. They were scared silly. However, they reacted immediately and were about to escape.","Suddenly, at this moment, the world changed again. A terrifying pressure swept over from the distance. Instantly, everyone noticed it, and their expressions changed.","“There’s an expert!”","Everyone sensed it immediately, and their expressions changed drastically.","This aura was terrifying. Just from afar, it swept over like an avalanche. That terrifying pressure made everyone’s spirit tremble, and then they felt as if Mount Tai was pressing down on them. The experts of Jinzhanghan were ecstatic because they knew who the newcomer was.","All of a sudden, hope for survival rose in their hearts. One had to know that the pressure Chu Yunfan had given them was too great. There was no way to survive. Facing an expert of this level, they had no choice but to stick their necks out and kill him.","At the thought of this, the 20-odd experts began to instantly rush in the direction of the pressure.","“Thinking of escaping? Do you really think you can leave?” Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold. A sword light began to appear on his fingertip. This sword light spun rapidly. In a moment, it had turned into a sky full of sword light and chased after the Cores.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","Terrifying sword lights pierced through the bodies of those who tried to escape. They could not resist as they were already heavily injured. At this time, how could they still have the slightest chance of winning?","The bodies of these experts exploded in the air, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky. In an instant, the entire battlefield fell silent.","“How dare you!”","A loud roar came from afar, and then a figure appeared in front of everyone.","It was a tall, middle-aged man wearing an exotic robe with a ferocious expression.","“It’s the Rigth King of Jinzhanghan! The experts of Great Qi gasped when they saw the newcomer.","The identity of the newcomer was revealed. Who else could it be but the Right King of Jinzhanghan?","Some people almost fainted. The Right King could be said to be famous in the outer realms because of his fearsome killing record. Who wouldn’t be afraid?!","Even Great Wei’s representatives sucked in a breath of cold air when they saw the newcomer. They felt a chill run down their backs as if they had just crawled out of an ice cave."]},{"number":1475,"title":"Chapter 1475 Clean Sweep","paragraphs":["1475 Clean Sweep","Everyone froze. It was as if a little rabbit had encountered a ferocious tiger. Just that terrifying aura alone was enough to suppress everyone.","“You sure are bold!”","The Right King let out an angry roar. He had got there a little late, and he had not expected that the entire team would be wiped out by the time he arrived. There were over ten thousand Blood Barbarians and over twenty Cores, and ten of them were even rarer alchemy experts. Such a loss, even with the strength of Jinzhanghan, was enough to make his heart ache.","And the culprit of all this was none other than this fellow in front of him!","He recognized the person the moment he saw him. It was none other than Chu Yunfan, whom he had wanted to eliminate earlier.","When the Black and White Emissaries of the Netherworld Sect had gone to Conglong, he had also wanted to teleport over. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would destroy the teleportation portal with a single punch, causing his teleportation to fail?","After that, he sent a large number of experts to Great Wei to kill Chu Yunfan, but they were killed in the end. After Chu Yunfan left Great Wei, the imperial family of Great Wei contacted him. Both sides wanted to join forces to kill Chu Yunfan.","Who knew that the battle would result in heavy casualties? One hundred thousand Blood Barbarians and dozens of Cores were injured.","All this while, Chu Yunfan had killed and injured so many people, and this was the result of the war that destroyed the country. Not to mention the tens of thousands of Blood Barbarians and dozens of Cores who had been injured today.","Thinking of the losses he had suffered, his heart ached so much that he was about to go crazy. This was because the losses were basically his strength. After so many times, it could be said that his strength had been completely exhausted.","The political system of Jinzhanghan was different from that of Great Wei and Great Qi. They were based on tribes. The Right King was the third most important figure in Jinzhanghan, second only to the khan and the Left King.","However, his strength depended on the loyalty of countless experts over the years, which made him the third most powerful figure in all of Jinzhanghan. But now that his high-end subordinates were almost completely slaughtered by Chu Yunfan, it could be said that his position as the Right King was in danger.","After all, although the Right King was only a candidate for the khan. There had been many precedents of the Right King ascending the throne since ancient times. Under such circumstances, not only was the Left King extremely wary of him, but there was also no lack of other brothers who were eyeing his position covetously.","Previously, his position was extremely stable, but now, it was already in danger. An the culprit of everything was the person in front of him. He wished he could tear Chu Yunfan into pieces!","“Is this considered bold?” Chu Yunfan sneered.” This is just the beginning. Last time, we didn’t have a good fight. I think you feel the same way. This time, we can end this.”","From the time he was ambushed by the Emmisaries in Conglong, to the surprise attack between him and the Right King, and then to the Right King attacking Chu Yunfan several times. Today was finally time for Chu Yunfan to settle the score.","“Very well.” The Right King gritted his teeth. ” I took you for an ant back then. I didn’t expect you to become such a huge threat.”","He stared at Chu Yunfan. He had never taken Chu Yunfan seriously before. He didn’t even have the desire to attack. He thought that he had already placed enough importance on Chu Yunfan. Every time, he would mobilize a large number of people.","First, he sent a large number of experts to Great Wei to kill Chu Yunfan. Then, he attacked with thousands of Blood Barbarians. It could not be said that he did not value Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan still managed to escape.","Now, Chu Yunfan had become his biggest worry.","Thinking of the experts he had lost along the way, all of whom were his direct subordinates and confidants, he felt a burning anger in his heart. Back then, Chu Yunfan was no match for him. He couldn’t even block one of his moves. If he hadn’t been repelled by Chu Yunfan during the teleportation, Chu Yunfan would have been killed long ago.","However, there was a hint of surprise in his eyes. How long had it been since Chu Yunfan had become so powerful? He had improved like a rocket.","“It’s too late for you to realize this now!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","In the past, he was indeed not the Right King’s match, but now, the situation had been completely reversed.","“It’s not too late!” the Right King said coldly. In an instant, a terrifying divine power surged from his body and rippled through the air.","“The Core Form Stage. It’s the Core Form Stage!” one of Great Qi’s representatives exclaimed.","It was another Core Former. The Right King had entered the Core Form Stage without a sound.","A hint of surprise flashed across Chu Yunfan’s eyes. Previously, he had fought with the Right King. Although it was only for an instant, he should have been at the peak of the Void Core Stage at that time. He had not expected him to have entered the Core Form Stage.","If the Right King had been in the Core Form Stage, Chu Yunfan’s attack would not have been effective, not to mention repelling him.","During this period, the Right King had not personally taken action. Presumably, he was breaking through to the Core Form Stage. And after he had just broken through, he was summoned.","“Chu Yunfan, you didn’t expect this, did you?” The Right King burst into laughter. Only after he had entered this level could he be considered a true giant in Jinzhanghan.","The Right King, who was able to replace the Left King and become the khan in every generation, must also be a master of the Core Form Stage. He would never have the chance to do so unless he was at the kingdom guardian level.","This was what he was proud of.","“I’ve already entered the Core Form Stage. Next is your death!” the Right King said loudly.","As he spoke, the divine power in his body swept toward Chu Yunfan along with a monstrous tide.","That terrifying concept transformed into a boundless battlefield. On the battlefield, there were countless mountains of corpses and seas of blood. That was the martial will that he had condensed from so many years of fighting on the battlefield.","A bloody battlefield!","In this battlefield, the aura of an ordinary Core would be destroyed immediately. It was impossible for them to pose any threat to him!","Boom!","The battlefield swept across the entire horizon. The representatives of Great Wei and Great Qi were wrapped up in it. In an instant, they felt a terrifying power crushing down on them. Even their breathing began to become difficult."]},{"number":1476,"title":"Chapter 1476 Beating up the Right King","paragraphs":["1476 Beating up the Right King","Whether it was the Divines or the Cores, they all felt a terrifying power crushing them. Especially the Divines, they felt as if their throats were stuck.","The air was filled with a blood-colored aura. It was the smell of blood on the battlefield.","They tried to burst out with their own aura, but they were unable to resist. Dozens of people collectively burst out their aura, but they were still unable to resist the pressure of the Right King’s aura.","Within the martial will, countless blood-colored auras transformed into an army that was charging forward, and then rushed toward everyone.","When the concept of martial arts was in the hands of the Right King, it had already reached the acme of perfection. An expert of the Core Form Stage could slaughter an entire army single-handedly. Even the Blood Barbarians would find it difficult to pose any threat to an expert of this level.","Thousands of troops and horses galloped, and the world trembled slightly. In the sky, the air trembled violently, as if boiling water.","“The Core Form Stage? Is it that amazing?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","As he spoke, a terrifying aura also erupted from his body. Although he was not in the Core Form Stage, he was not inferior to the Core Formers.","The terrifying aura that had suppressed everyone and made them speechless instantly disappeared without a trace as if it had evaporated under the sun. The army that was charging over was shattered inch by inch. The terrifying army formed by the power of the Right King collapsed.","“Go to hell!”","The Right King flew up and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. He held a blood-red spear in his hand. The spear was engraved with complicated runes that contained mysterious power.","The spear was like a giant blood-red snake, opening its bloody mouth and biting down on Chu Yunfan.","Previously, the president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association was also an expert at the peak of the Void Core Stage, only a step away from the Core Form Stage. However, their combat strength was worlds apart.","Boom!","The air around Chu Yunfan collapsed. The representatives of Great Qi and Great Wei could see with their naked eyes that the air around Chu Yunfan had collapsed, and the space had actually produced slight fluctuations.","One could imagine how astonishing the Right King’s attack was.","Just as the Right King was about to injure Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan moved. He retracted his fist to his abdomen and punched out. His fist turned into a golden light that could destroy the world. It swept out and shattered everything in front of it.","If one looked from the sky, they would see that the entire battlefield seemed to be divided into two parts. The golden and blood-red colors occupied half of each other and devoured each other.","Clang!","Chu Yunfan’s punch tore through everything like a hot knife through butter. His fist landed on the blood-red spear, and a sound of metal clashing erupted.","The blood-red energy and the golden energy mixed together, forming a terrifying storm that surrounded the two of them.","The Great Wei and Great Qi representatives widened their eyes, wanting to know who would win. No matter what thoughts they had before, they all hoped that Chu Yunfan would win. Otherwise, they would die. Seeing the Right King’s astonishing strength, how could they not understand that if Chu Yunfan lost, they would not be able to escape and would only die without a burial place.","Boom!","Immediately after, a figure fell out of the raging tide. Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was none other than the Right King.","The Right King’s energy and blood were somewhat disrupted, and his divine power was somewhat chaotic. He retreated frantically, trying to get rid of the terrifying strange power in his body.","Everyone also noticed that the palm of his hand that was holding the blood-red spear had split open. Blood sprayed out and fell on the blood-red spear. It was strangely absorbed by the blood-red spear and turned into its own power. This made the blood-red flames on the blood-red spear seem even more powerful.","“The Core Form Stage is nothing more than this.”","Chu Yunfan slowly walked out of the storm. The thunder power formed around his body and tore the storm that was formed by the golden and blood-red energy into two halves.","The Right King, on the other hand, widened his eyes, unable to conceal the shock within them. He had never expected Chu Yunfan to be so powerful. His full-powered attack was actually blocked by Chu Yunfan.","“Do you need pride in the Core Form Stage?” Chu Yunfan looked at the Right King indifferently. It was obvious that he didn’t take the Right King seriously at all.","One had to know that he had defeated Yun Huang.","Compared to Yun Huang, the Right King was younger and his blood was more vigorous. However, his cultivation was much weaker than Yun Huang. In short, the Right King;s strength was far inferior to Yun Huang.","Chu Yunfan could even defeat Yun Huang, so why would he be afraid of the Right King who had just stepped into the Core Form Stage?","Then, Chu Yunfan grabbed at the air, and a sword formed by the thunder appeared in his hand. He took a step forward, and his entire person was floating like an immortal. In an instant, he had already arrived in front of the Right King.","Quick!","Quick!","Quick!","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. He didn’t give the Right King any chance to catch his breath. The Right King only had time to raise the blood-red spear in his hand to block.","Clang!","With a loud roar, the Right King felt a terrifying force sweep into his entire arm through the spear, causing his palm to crack a little more, and his entire arm was numb from the shock.","But before he could react, Chu Yunfan’s next sword had already swept over.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Every strike of Chu Yunfan’s sword brought with it a terrifying storm, forming a storm-like attack. Such an attack only lasted for a moment before it enveloped the Right King.","In the distance, the two countries’ representatives were completely stunned. They watched as the Right King was beaten back by Chu Yunfan’s attacks.","“This is a complete thrashing...” a Great Qi representative muttered to himself as he watched this scene.","The others’ expressions weren’t any better. It was as if they had seen a ghost. The scene was all wrong. Otherwise, how could they see the Right King being beaten up by Chu Yunfan without any strength to fight back?"]},{"number":1477,"title":"Chapter 1477 The Revived Right King","paragraphs":["1477 The Revived Right King","Whether it was the Divines or the Cores, they all felt a terrifying power crushing them. Especially the Divines, they felt as if their throats were stuck.","The air was filled with a blood-colored aura. It was the smell of blood on the battlefield.","They tried to burst out with their own aura, but they were unable to resist. Dozens of people collectively burst out their aura, but they were still unable to resist the pressure of the Right King’s aura.","Within the martial will, countless blood-colored auras transformed into an army that was charging forward, and then rushed toward everyone.","When the concept of martial arts was in the hands of the Right King, it had already reached the acme of perfection. An expert of the Core Form Stage could slaughter an entire army single-handedly. Even the Blood Barbarians would find it difficult to pose any threat to an expert of this level.","Thousands of troops and horses galloped, and the world trembled slightly. In the sky, the air trembled violently, as if boiling water.","“The Core Form Stage? Is it that amazing?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","As he spoke, a terrifying aura also erupted from his body. Although he was not in the Core Form Stage, he was not inferior to the Core Formers.","The terrifying aura that had suppressed everyone and made them speechless instantly disappeared without a trace as if it had evaporated under the sun. The army that was charging over was shattered inch by inch. The terrifying army formed by the power of the Right King collapsed.","“Go to hell!”","The Right King flew up and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. He held a blood-red spear in his hand. The spear was engraved with complicated runes that contained mysterious power.","The spear was like a giant blood-red snake, opening its bloody mouth and biting down on Chu Yunfan.","Previously, the president of Jinzhanghan’s Alchemist Association was also an expert at the peak of the Void Core Stage, only a step away from the Core Form Stage. However, their combat strength was worlds apart.","Boom!","The air around Chu Yunfan collapsed. The representatives of Great Qi and Great Wei could see with their naked eyes that the air around Chu Yunfan had collapsed, and the space had actually produced slight fluctuations.","One could imagine how astonishing the Right King’s attack was.","Just as the Right King was about to injure Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan moved. He retracted his fist to his abdomen and punched out. His fist turned into a golden light that could destroy the world. It swept out and shattered everything in front of it.","If one looked from the sky, they would see that the entire battlefield seemed to be divided into two parts. The golden and blood-red colors occupied half of each other and devoured each other.","Clang!","Chu Yunfan’s punch tore through everything like a hot knife through butter. His fist landed on the blood-red spear, and a sound of metal clashing erupted.","The blood-red energy and the golden energy mixed together, forming a terrifying storm that surrounded the two of them.","The Great Wei and Great Qi representatives widened their eyes, wanting to know who would win. No matter what thoughts they had before, they all hoped that Chu Yunfan would win. Otherwise, they would die. Seeing the Right King’s astonishing strength, how could they not understand that if Chu Yunfan lost, they would not be able to escape and would only die without a burial place.","Boom!","Immediately after, a figure fell out of the raging tide. Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was none other than the Right King.","The Right King’s energy and blood were somewhat disrupted, and his divine power was somewhat chaotic. He retreated frantically, trying to get rid of the terrifying strange power in his body.","Everyone also noticed that the palm of his hand that was holding the blood-red spear had split open. Blood sprayed out and fell on the blood-red spear. It was strangely absorbed by the blood-red spear and turned into its own power. This made the blood-red flames on the blood-red spear seem even more powerful.","“The Core Form Stage is nothing more than this.”","Chu Yunfan slowly walked out of the storm. The thunder power formed around his body and tore the storm that was formed by the golden and blood-red energy into two halves.","The Right King, on the other hand, widened his eyes, unable to conceal the shock within them. He had never expected Chu Yunfan to be so powerful. His full-powered attack was actually blocked by Chu Yunfan.","“Do you need pride in the Core Form Stage?” Chu Yunfan looked at the Right King indifferently. It was obvious that he didn’t take the Right King seriously at all.","One had to know that he had defeated Yun Huang.","Compared to Yun Huang, the Right King was younger and his blood was more vigorous. However, his cultivation was much weaker than Yun Huang. In short, the Right King;s strength was far inferior to Yun Huang.","Chu Yunfan could even defeat Yun Huang, so why would he be afraid of the Right King who had just stepped into the Core Form Stage?","Then, Chu Yunfan grabbed at the air, and a sword formed by the thunder appeared in his hand. He took a step forward, and his entire person was floating like an immortal. In an instant, he had already arrived in front of the Right King.","Quick!","Quick!","Quick!","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. He didn’t give the Right King any chance to catch his breath. The Right King only had time to raise the blood-red spear in his hand to block.","Clang!","With a loud roar, the Right King felt a terrifying force sweep into his entire arm through the spear, causing his palm to crack a little more, and his entire arm was numb from the shock.","But before he could react, Chu Yunfan’s next sword had already swept over.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Every strike of Chu Yunfan’s sword brought with it a terrifying storm, forming a storm-like attack. Such an attack only lasted for a moment before it enveloped the Right King.","In the distance, the two countries’ representatives were completely stunned. They watched as the Right King was beaten back by Chu Yunfan’s attacks.","“This is a complete thrashing...” a Great Qi representative muttered to himself as he watched this scene.","The others’ expressions weren’t any better. It was as if they had seen a ghost. The scene was all wrong. Otherwise, how could they see the Right King being beaten up by Chu Yunfan without any strength to fight back?","1477","This scene made them feel that their world was collapsing inch by inch.","The Right King was a powerful expert who had been famous for decades. He had long left an indelible shadow in the hearts of the higher-ups of Great Qi and Great Wei.","In comparison, Chu Yunfan was just a rising star, but in the end, Chu Yunfan was able to beat the Right King with just one hand and one magic sword.","The Right King had no way to fight back when faced with such an attack. It could even be said that he did not even have the time to catch his breath.","“River Sunset!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","After the storm-like attack, the sword fell. In front of everyone’s eyes, it was as if a scene of a long river and a setting sun appeared. He integrated this natural landscape into his sword intent and swept down with the power of a rushing river.","Boom!","The sword light instantly landed on the Right King.","Bam!","The Right King was sent flying through the air. Everyone saw that his entire body was covered in blood. The magic armor he was wearing had collapsed and broken into pieces.","Under the attack of Chu Yunfan’s sharp sword light, the Right King found it difficult to organize enough defense. They all collapsed under Chu Yunfan’s sword. Even the Right King exploded in the air as he flew backward.","“Is the Right King dead?” The representatives of the two countries were completely dumbfounded. What was going on? The Right King, who was so arrogant just now, couldn’t even block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","If their worldview had just begun to collapse, then now it was completely collapsing.","The Right King, who they thought was very powerful, was actually so vulnerable!","“He was caught off guard. The Right King underestimated his enemy and was caught off guard by Chu Yunfan. From then on, the entire rhythm was under Chu Yunfan’s control,” the president of Great Qi’s Alchemist Association said.","Great Qi’s representatives nodded their heads. From the overall situation, this was the case. The Right King had underestimated his opponent. In just a few moves, Chu Yunfan had completely controlled the overall situation.","A series of attacks from the beginning to the end had completely defeated him.","“No, I don’t think so. It’s not that the Right King underestimated his enemy, but that his strength is simply inferior to Chu Yunfan.” Gongsun Wu had another way of saying it. “You have to know that Chu Yunfan is the number one expert of Great Wei. Even our kingdom’s number one expert, the Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang, was defeated by him. Therefore, Chu Yunfan’s victory isn’t a fluke, but an all-round suppression.”","Great Wei’s representatives all agreed with this statement because they knew more than Great Qi’s representatives. They knew how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","However, while they were arguing, the Right King of Jinzhanghan, who had been blown into pieces in the sky and thought to be dead, actually reorganized his body in midair.","“That was just the beginning!”","Everyone was in disbelief. Even a Core Former had a mortal body. If an arm was broken, it was possible to regrow it by relying on some secret techniques. However, if the body had already collapsed into pieces, even a Core Former could not be any more dead. It was impossible for them to survive. With the strength of a Core Former, what kind of attack could force their bodies to collapse?","It was definitely an extremely terrifying attack!","But now, the Right King had completely violated the normal rules and was reborn.","“Ahhhhhh, you actually dare to kill me!” the Right King roared angrily. His eyes were red like that of an injured beast.","A terrifying aura swept out like a tsunami, turning into a terrifying tide. With him as the center, it rolled in all directions.","Chu Yunfan, who was in front of him, was a little surprised. He had not held back in those attacks just now, and the Right King had been killed by him. There could not be any accidents.","Faking death couldn’t hide from Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","“You actually survived?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“B*stard, if I hadn’t accidentally obtained a death substitute puppet, I would really have died in your hands today!” An extremely terrifying killing intent burst out from the Right King’s eyes. His face was ashen and his expression was twisted and ferocious.","It was a death substitute puppet that he had found in the ruins of the early years. It was not just this one. Over the years, he had used a few of them one after another, which helped him become the Right King in Jinzhanghan where the strong preyed on the weak.","This was his last puppet. He didn’t understand the principles of this kind of magical puppet, let alone a replica. Therefore, he was extremely careful with it. However, he did not expect that it would still be used at this time.","The Right King’s aura rose. Compared to when he was at his peak, it had actually increased by 50%. Although it was only 50%, he was already very terrifying. Now that it had increased by 50%, his battle prowess had soared to another realm.","This was also another effect of the puppet. Although it only lasted for a short time, it was enough. Between experts, victory and defeat could be determined in an instant.","“You’re dead!” The Right King gritted his teeth. “By forcing out this trump card of mine, no one in the world will be able to save you!”","“You want to kill me? You?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Although I don’t know what method you used to change your fate, I don’t believe that you can do it a few more times. If I can kill you once, I can kill you again.”","“Shut up and die!” the Right King roared angrily. The blood-colored spear in his hand burned fiercely. It was a blood-colored flame—a flame formed from human blood essence. This flame was much more vigorous than before.","Swoosh!","The blood-red spear charged at Chu Yunfan. Then, the entire sky collapsed. The air was violently torn apart and began to tremble like boiling water.","It was terrifying!","Upon attacking again, the Right King’s power was much stronger than before. This attack could flatten the entire mountain range. Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t sit still and wait for death. He shouted and withdrew his fist to his abdomen before throwing another punch. He fought back without giving in.","Boom!"]},{"number":1478,"title":"Chapter 1478 Ash Wolf Flag","paragraphs":["1478 Ash Wolf Flag","The sky exploded. The battle between the two sides caused the entire world to tremble violently.","Compared to the previous collision, this collision was clearly on another level. The representatives of Great Qi and Great Wei retreated one after another. They did not dare to get close. They retreated hundreds of miles away before they stopped.","At the Core Form Stage, it could be said that if one destroyed a city with their own strength, it would be completely destroyed into ruins. It was the literal meaning. It was reality and not an exaggeration.","The Right King retreated repeatedly. A hint of surprise flashed in his eyes. He did not expect that an attack of this level could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","This Chu Yunfan was much more troublesome than he had imagined.","Chu Yunfan looked at the Right King with a faint smile and said, “I told you. With your strength, I can kill you again if I killed you once!”","The Right King’s strength had increased by 50%, but at most, it was not much different from Yun Huang. In terms of methods, he was still inferior to Yun Huang, let alone the current Chu Yunfan.","“Such arrogance! When my spear pierces your heart, I hope you can still say such words!” the Right King said coldly.","The spear in his hand swept out. He didn’t waste any time because he knew that he didn’t have much time left. Maintaining such a state was just the support of the puppet. It didn’t mean that he could maintain this kind of combat strength forever.","Boom!","The battle spear cut through the sky, bringing out a blood-red battlefield martial will that spread out. It was almost tangible, and it had truly reached an extremely terrifying level.","“I want to see how long you can last!”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and shouted, “Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","As he stepped out, the netherworld water under his feet rolled up and turned into a terrifying footprint.","Boom!","His foot landed, crushing the battlefield that the spear had spread out. Then, he landed directly on the Right King.","“What move is this?!” The Right King looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. This stomp was absolutely terrifying. This casual attack had an earth-shattering power. It was as if the entire world was about to be torn apart and turned into the underworld.","However, he didn’t have time to think too much. In an instant, he had stabbed out many spear lights, which exploded into terrifying attacks. Only then did he barely manage to block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","“Not bad. You managed to block my first stomp. Next, Second Netherworld Stomp!”Chu Yunfan shouted loudly and immediately kicked down again. An even larger amount of netherworld water spread out from the void, forming a monstrous force that swept down on the Right King like a tsunami.","“Break!” the Right King roared, and the divine power of his entire body began to spread out, turning into an incomparably huge spear in the air. The spear pierced toward the netherworld water.","Boom!","The huge spear was crushed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s foot, and it cracked inch by inch. Chu Yunfan’s stomp caused the entire sky to tremble violently, forming a tsunami.","The Right King retreated, feeling that the terrifying power was still approaching. A look of horror flashed across his eyes.","Thud, thud, thud!","Under Chu Yunfan’s stomp, the Right King retreated repeatedly. He felt the blood in his entire body churning. It was the shock of Chu Yunfan’s enormous strength.","“How can he be so strong? That wasn’t even his full strength!”","The Right King realized that he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength when he attacked. Now, he truly understood how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s attack was.","“No, I’ll definitely fail if this continues!”","The Right King roared. Then, he formed a seal. The divine power in his entire body trembled violently and spread across the sky as if it extended to an extremely distant place.","At this moment, in the royal tent of Jinzhanghan, there was an extremely huge space. It was a sub-space with a different world. With the use of various spatial barriers, the outside looked like an ordinary tent, but the inside was larger than a huge palace.","In the royal tent, an old man in a golden imperial robe suddenly opened his eyes. Beside him, a flag with a giant golden wolf engraved on it suddenly burst out with intense light. Then, it broke out of the flag and disappeared.","“How is that possible?” The old man suddenly opened his eyes. He felt the wolf in the flag disappear, but he didn’t stop it.","This flag was called the Ash Wolf Flag. It was a superior-grade spirit weapon and the national treasure of Jinzhanghan. It had protected Jinzhanghan from the misfortune of extinction many times.","The people of Jinzhanghan claimed to be the descendants of the Ash Wolf, and the Ash Wolf Flag was a magic tool refined by their founding ancestors. It had been passed down for countless years.","They were usually worshipped in the royal tent. Ordinary people had only heard of them, but they had never seen them before. Ordinary citizens had never even heard of it. In this heavily protected royal tent, the probability of the Ash Wolf Flag being stolen did not exist.","There were only three people in Jinzhanghan who could summon the Ash Wolf Flag. One of them was him, the khan of Jinzhanghan. The other two were the heirs of Jinzhanghan, the Left King and the Right King.","Of course, the three people had different authority to control the Ash Wolf Flag. The khan had the highest authority, followed by the Left King, then the Right King. This was also to prevent anyone from offending their superiors.","In that instant, he had already seen the tactic of using the Ash Wolf Flag. It was the tactic of his son, the second heir, the Right King. In other words, the person who summoned the Ash Wolf Flag was none other than the Right King.","He suddenly felt a little strange. The Right King had recently made great progress and had already entered the Core Form Stage. Throughout the world, he was considered a rare expert. There were not many such experts in the entire world.","What kind of danger would they encounter that he had to summon the Ash Wolf Flag?","To ensure the absolute safety of the Ash Wolf Flag, it was not allowed to be summoned under normal circumstances.","At the thought of this, the khan secretly cursed. His entire body turned into a golden light. He sensed the direction of the Ash Wolf Flag and disappeared from where he stoof."]},{"number":1479,"title":"Chapter 1479 Ash Fire Power Spirit Weapon","paragraphs":["1479 Ash Fire Power Spirit Weapon","Chu Yunfan looked at the Right King’s actions. He didn’t know what he was doing, but he didn’t have the habit of hesitating. He stepped forward again.","Third Netherworld Stomp!” Chu Yunfan shouted and stomped down.","Boom!","The entire sky shook violently as if would collapse in the next moment.","The power of this kick was much stronger than before. It made the Right King feel like Chu Yunfan was about to topple mountains and overturn seas.","“I’m going to give it everything I’ve got!” the Right King roared and stabbed the spear in his hand, colliding with Chu Yunfan’s stomp.","Thud, thud, thud!","The Right King was sent flying. He finally stopped and spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire face suddenly turned pale. In an instant, he was seriously injured by Chu Yunfan’s attack.","At this time, Chu Yunfan’s stomp did not give up and landed.","Suddenly, at this moment, a crack appeared in the air. Then, a beam of light rushed over and turned into a huge flag in the air, blocking Chu Yunfan’s attack.","“What’s that?” the representatives of the two countries exclaimed from the distance. They saw that Chu Yunfan was about to win, but a flag suddenly appeared in the air and blocked Chu Yunfan’s attack.","They looked at each other, knowing very well how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s stomp was. If it were them, even if so many of them attacked together, they would probably die.","Who would have thought that it would be blocked?","“That flag looks familiar. Where have I seen it before?” the president of Great Qi’s Alchemist Association said with narrowed eyes. He felt that the huge flag that had been spread out and divided the world was very familiar.","“Is that the legendary treasure of Jinzhanghan, the Ash Wolf Flag?” Gongsun Wulong said with uncertainty.","“That’s right! It’s the Ash Wolf Flag!”","The Great Qi president exclaimed. That’s right. No wonder it looked so familiar. So this was the legendary Ash Wolf Flag.","It was the famous flag of Jinzhanghan. It could be said that Jinzhanghan had been able to conquer this vast world mostly thanks to this flag.","According to the legends of the people of Jinzhanghan, it was a divine weapon bestowed by the heavens to protect the nation. The first khan of Jinzhanghan was the chosen one. He was bitten by a wolf when he was young. When he returned later, he held the flag in his hand.","Later, as the khan of Jinzhanghan grew up, he unified the grassland with this flag and founded Jinzhanghan. That was why the people of Jinzhanghan claimed to be the descendants of the Ash Wolf and were proud of it.","For ordinary people, the Ash Wolf Flag only existed in legends. However, for a top figure like Gongsun Wulong, it was definitely not just a legend. It really existed. Jinzhanghan had even used it in succession to defeat a large number of armies from the two countries, causing a large number of casualties.","“Oh no! Rumor has it that the Ash Wolf Flag is a superior-grade spirit weapon. It won’t be easy to destroy it,” Gongsun Wulong said.","“Not only is it not easy to destroy, but its attacker might be killed instead,” the Great Qi president said.","Everyone looked at each other. At this moment, the situation on the battlefield had already undergone a huge change.","“Hahahaha! Chu Yunfan, you didn’t kill me before. Now is the time for you to die!” The Right King burst into laughter.","He had managed to hold on until the arrival of the Ash Wolf Flag.","In front of him, the Ash Wolf Flag rolled into a ball and wrapped him up. The flag emitted rays of golden light, and the Ash Wolf carved on it looked extremely ferocious and terrifying.","“This is the power of ash?” Chu Yunfan looked at the flag in front of him and could not help but fall into deep thought.","He had received the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, so he naturally knew many things that others did not know. In the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there was a kind of power, the power of ash. This ash fire power of wishes gathered the power of wish of all living beings, so the Great Dao that extended out was extremely prosperous.","Some experts had developed a great technique that could add the ash fire to their bodies. They could use the ash fire for their own use and could even procure the Ash Fire Physique. Their strength was not inferior to their main body.","Most of them were used to refine ash fire power magic tools. Some of these magic tools had unintentionally received the ash fire power of countless people and naturally produced divine powers, while some were deliberately refined.","However, there was no doubt that compared to ordinary magic tools of the same grade, this magic tool that condensed the power of ash was quite difficult to deal with.","The Ash Wolf Flag in front of him had clearly been refined by someone. It must have received the wish power of ashes from countless generations of Jinzhanghan to condense such a dense golden light.","In the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there were some powerful people who believed that by refining the power of ashes, one could even open up a path to becoming a god. Therefore, in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, this cultivation method of ash fire power was once very popular.","“Chu Yunfan, you should rest in peace now that you’re about to die under the Ash Wolf Flag. Hahahaha!” The Right King burst into laughter as if he was going to unleash all the anger that Chu Yunfan had suppressed for so long.","“Die!” He grabbed the Ash Wolf Flag and waved it fiercely. Suddenly, the sky changed color and a terrible wind blew. Each of these winds was a strong wind, and they swept toward Chu Yunfan like blades.","A sea of lightning formed around Chu Yunfan, and countless thunder power turned Chu Yunfan’s body into a forbidden zone. The strong winds blew in, but they couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. However, as time passed, the winds scattered the thunder power around Chu Yunfan bit by bit.","“Let’s see how long you can last!” The Right King let out a loud roar and poured all of his mana into the flag. In an instant, countless gusts of wind swept up and transformed into a huge golden wolf. This huge golden wolf was hundreds of meters tall and hundreds of meters long, like an incomparably huge divine mountain.","“Roar!”","A giant wolf roared, causing the entire world to tremble. The sound wave that formed swept in all directions."]},{"number":1480,"title":"Chapter 1480 Breaking Through the Weakness","paragraphs":["1480 Breaking Through the Weakness","Faced with this howling wolf, even Chu Yunfan’s face changed. This was because he could feel how terrifying this roaring wolf was.","This Ash Wolf Flag was at least a superior-grade spirit weapon. No, to be precise, it was probably about to become a supreme-grade spirit weapon.","After so many years of prayer and using a secret technique to absorb the ashes and power of will, this Ash Wolf Flag had undergone a transformation. This kind of transformation was magical. Even without human refinement, it still underwent a huge transformation.","This was also why many people in the Ancient Zenith Civilization believed that the path of ashes could pave a brand new path to becoming a god. The practitioners who walked this path would call themselves gods. In the eyes of mortals, they were indeed gods.","Generally speaking, the Right King shouldn’t be able to use the true power of a magic tool of this level. When Chu Yunfan first obtained the Mountain River Diagram, he was also unable to display its full power. It was only later that as his strength continued to increase, he was able to gradually master the power of the diagram.","Logically speaking, with the power of the Ash Wolf Flag, one should at least be at the late Core Form Stage or even at the peak of the Core Form Stage to be able to control this power. If the Ash Wolf Flag underwent a further transformation as time passed, then even a Core Former would not be able to unleash its full power.","But in reality, the Right King easily used the power of the Ash Wolf Flag.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood. It must have something to do with the power of ashes. There were similar methods in the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Many large sects had such magic tools. After countless years of influence from ash fire power, the magic tools had undergone amazing changes.","Moreover, the descendants could use some kind of secret technique to display the full power of these magic tools. They were usually sect protecting magic treasures.","“Not ba. It seems like that’s the case,” Chu Yunfan said.","Just as he was in a daze, the huge golden wolf roared and pounced on him. The mountain-like wolf swept over and arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","“An artifact spirit! This golden wolf is an artifact spirit. I didn’t expect there to be an artifact spirit.”","Chu Yunfan was stunned. The reason why spirit weapons were different from magic weapons was that cultivators could fuse an artifact spirit into a spirit weapon for the first time, which could increase the power of magic weapon. Moreover, this way, it would not be easy for others to snatch it away.","Of course, there were many spirit weapons, and it was still very rare to have the opportunity to fuse with an artifact spirit. This was because a qualified artifact spirit was very difficult to find.","The golden wolf in front of him was probably a ferocious beast when it was alive. After its death, its soul was extracted and sealed in the Ash Wolf Flag, becoming the artifact spirit.","Boom!","The golden wolf bit into the air, and its cold mouth directly bit through the air, causing a huge explosion.","Chu Yunfan’s figure retreated hundreds of meters, avoiding the attack of the golden wolf.","“Hahaha, that’s right. I didn’t expect you to have some knowledge!” The Right King burst into laughter, feeling proud. He had been suppressed by Chu Yunfan for so long before he finally fought back. “That’s right. This golden wolf is an artifact spirit. It was our first generation khan’s comrade in war. After it died, our khan extracted its soul and sealed it into the Ash Wolf Flag. It became the artifact spirit of the flag, and at the same time, it greatly increased the power of the Flag.”","In the distance, the representatives of the two countries saw this scene, and their faces completely changed. They turned pale.","They had guessed it correctly. It was the Ash Wolf Flag, and its power far exceeded their imagination. That golden wolf was much more terrifying than an ordinary Core Former.","“You can’t escape today. Hurry up and surrender!”","The Right King roared with laughter as he continuously poured his divine power into the flag, then waved it. Immediately, a strong wind swept toward Chu Yunfan. Any one of them could easily injure a Divine.","Then, amid the endless winds, the golden wolf flew over and arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. Its speed was so fast that it was like a golden light.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!” Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a punch. Eight huge figures appeared beside him. These eight figures were the eight heavenly figures. They gathered together and then suddenly attacked the golden wolf in front of Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","An incomparably loud explosion sounded. Everyone saw the eight figures scattered by this golden wolf. They were unable to stop this golden wolf.","Thud, thud, thud!","Chu Yunfan used his hind legs to retreat with the help of this terrifying rebound force, avoiding the golden wolf’s devouring. This was the first time he had retreated in his battle with the Right King. He had been forced back. One could imagine how terrifying this golden wolf was.","Although this golden wolf didn’t have many tricks up its sleeve, it was very effective. It suppressed Chu Yunfan with its strength, making Chu Yunfan’s tricks unable to display their original power.","This was just like Chu Yunfan’s usual method. In the face of absolute strength, all methods were useless.","Chu Yunfan’s blood was boiling. This was the first time he was at a disadvantage in a collision of power. The golden wolf was very strong. In fact, with the blessing of ashes, it was probably even stronger than before.","“We can’t fight him head-on!”","Chu Yunfan immediately had an idea. At the same time, countless thunder power turned into a pair of wings behind him. He disappeared from where he was, causing the golden wolf to pounce on nothing.","“Where did he go?” The Right King turned pale with fright. Chu Yunfan had not displayed such terrifying speed in the previous battle. However, before he could react, Chu Yunfan appeared in front of him.","He instinctively raised the Ash Wolf Flag to defend himself, but it was too late. Chu Yunfan took out a sword made of thunder and slashed down.","Bam!","The Right King was sent flying by the slash, and he spat out a mouthful of blood."]},{"number":1481,"title":"Chapter 1481 The Right King Dies!","paragraphs":["1481 The Right King Dies!","The Right King was unable to stop him and was directly injured by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was too fast. The Right King didn’t even have time to use the Ash Wolf Flag to protect himself before he was attacked by Chu Yunfan.","No matter how powerful the Ash Wolf Flag was, it still had a flaw, a huge flaw. And this flaw was the Right King himself. No matter how powerful the flag was, the Right King was the biggest flaw.","The moment the Right King was sent flying, he had already reacted. However, in a sense, this flaw was not considered a flaw at all because he only needed a moment to react. Then, he would immediately use the flag to protect himself. In that case, Chu Yunfan’s attack would not be effective.","But who knew that Chu Yunfan would be so fast?","In the previous battle, although Chu Yunfan had displayed his unparalleled strength, he did not show much strength in terms of speed. The Right King thought that he had already figured out Chu Yunfan’s full strength, but when Chu Yunfan suddenly erupted, he suffered a huge loss.","“How dare you!” the Right King roared.","However, at this moment, how could Chu Yunfan let go of such a good opportunity? His entire body turned into a bolt of lightning, and a golden light rushed toward the Right King.","Boom!","The Right King was struck by Chu Yunfan’s attack again, and he was sent flying.","Behind him, the artifact spirit of the Ash Wolf Flag, a huge golden wolf, was rushing back crazily. This golden wolf was extremely fast, and its feet were moving on a light, moving at an extreme speed.","However, Chu Yunfan’s speed was so fast that it couldn’t catch up.","This was also the first time Chu Yunfan had truly displayed his speed.","Whether it was the Asura Fist or the thunder wings condensed from his Thunderclap Physique, both of them allowed his speed to soar to a level that ordinary people could not imagine.","“He’s so fast! I can’t keep up with Master Chu!” Bai Shengzu said with his mouth agape as he stood among the Great Wei’s representatives.","He looked at the scene in front of him and found it unbelievable. Chu Yunfan’s speed had surpassed the level of being visible to the naked eye. Even if he gathered his divine power in his eyes and opened his heavenly eye, he still could not see Chu Yunfan’s figure. He could only barely see the golden wolf’s figure turning into a line as it chased after him in the sky.","In the sky, Chu Yunfan’s figure kept disappearing. When he reappeared, he was directly in front of the Right King and sent him flying with a punch.","Every time the Right King wanted to counterattack, he would be sent flying.","Everyone could only see the Right King being bombarded by Chu Yunfan like a target.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s every attack seemed to cause the heavens and earth to collapse, and the world trembled violently.","“In the world of martial arts, speed is the only thing that cannot be broken!”","It was not known who shouted this sentence, but the general formula of martial arts in the world was actually nothing more than invincible, only fast and unbreakable.","If Chu Yunfan’s previous performance was said to be invincible, then the current Chu Yunfan’s performance was a legendary speed that was unbreakable.","The speed was so fast that no one could keep up with it with their naked eyes.","Many people felt terrified. If it were them, even if Chu Yunfan only held an iron sword, it would be enough to slit their necks in an instant.","The truth of the world’s martial arts that speed could break everything.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t only in front of them, even the Right King, who had already entered the Core Form Stage, was beaten by Chu Yunfan without any strength to fight back.","“How many trump cards does Master Chu have that he hasn’t used yet?”","Many people exclaimed in shock.","At this moment, they had a feeling that in the face of absolute strength, any magic tool or secret technique was useless.","Everyone could see that the Right King was completely at a disadvantage. If he had not taken out the Ash Wolf Flag at the critical moment and blocked Chu Yunfan’s attacks several times, he would have failed.","But even now, his situation was still very bad.","The crowd couldn’t see the situation of the two sides fighting, but the blood rain that kept falling from the sky couldn’t be Chu Yunfan’s. It must be the Right King.","Everyone had a strange feeling that Chu Yunfan was beating up the Right King. When everyone thought of this, they could not help but be dumbfounded. Before this, they would never have thought that there was such a thing.","“It’s time to end this. Netherworld Stomp!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","Suddenly, the crowd who couldn’t see the battlefield saw countless streams of netherworld water surging out from the sky. Then, a huge foot stomped on the void.","Just as the foot was about to stomp down, a figure appeared there. It was none other than the Right King.","It looked like the Right King had just appeared here and was stomped by Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","The Right King let out a miserable cry as he was stomped onto the ground.","Boom!","The earth trembled violently, and a monstrous wave of dust was set off. Even the two kingdom’s representatives who were flying in the sky could feel the air trembling violently.","Everyone focused their eyes again and finally saw the Right King’s figure. At this moment, the Right King was no longer as arrogant as before. He was covered in blood. The skin on his body cracked as if he would be shattered in the next moment.","If not for the protection of the Ash Wolf Flag, the Right King would have been beaten to death by Chu Yunfan. Whether it was cultivation, martial arts, or divine arts, Chu Yunfan was far above the Right King.","In the distance, a golden wolf was flying toward them at an astonishing speed.","Chu Yunfan didn’t give it a chance. He lifted his leg and stomped down again.","“Second Netherworld Stomp!”","This stomp landed directly on the Right King, causing him to spit out a mouthful of blood. His entire body was stomped into the ground for more than ten meters. With his body as the center, cracks spread out in all directions like spider webs.","“Third Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop and stomped down again. The Right King didn’t have the ability to fight back and was directly stepped on by Chu Yunfan. Instantly, the entire mountain was trampled into nothingness.","The Right King was crushed on the spot. His body was torn into pieces and he died."]},{"number":1482,"title":"Chapter 1482 The Opportunity to Increase His Strength","paragraphs":["1482 The Opportunity to Increase His Strength","“The Right King is dead?” someone said as they inhaled sharply.","“Looks like he’s dead. I’m afraid he won’t be able to resurrect this time.”","“That’s right. To be able to do this, he’s already at his limit!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. In an instant, it was as if a pot had exploded.","Boom!","In the next moment, a bloody mouth appeared where Chu Yunfan was. It aimed to bite Chu Yunfan into pieces, and the air exploded.","However, Chu Yunfan disappeared from where he was, leaving him with nothing.","Chu Yunfan did not relax. After the master was killed, without the support of the master’s divine power, an ordinary spirit weapon would immediately be crippled. However, it was obvious that the Ash Wolf Flag was completely different. It had an artifact spirit, and the artifact spirit itself had intelligence.","It was not a dead object, not to mention that it was supported by the ash fire power that it had absorbed for countless years. This allowed the Ash Wolf Flag to attack Chu Yunfan without its owner.","However, Chu Yunfan was already prepared. In a flash, he disappeared from where he was. Then, he suddenly grabbed the flag. In the next moment, the glag was in Chu Yunfan’s hand. At the same time, it erupted with strong resistance. It erupted with bursts of golden light as if it wanted to break free from Chu Yunfan’s hand.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan used all his divine power and formed a seal on the flag, forming a huge seal. Immediately, the majestic golden wolf in the air disappeared without a trace. There was a terrifying power fluctuating on this flag, trying to struggle free from Chu Yunfan’s hand.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, suppressed it with all his power.","“No matter who you are, you’ll die for daring to steal our kingdom’s treasure!”","Suddenly, an angry roar came from the void. A burly old man in a luxurious robe transformed from the Ash Wolf Flag.","“The khan of Jinzhanghan!”","When the representatives of the two countries saw this scene, someone recognized the identity of this old man and could not help but exclaim.","Everyone gasped. The khan of Jinzhanghan was one of the top experts in the world. Even if he was not the best in the world, he was not far from it.","Jinzhanghan was a country where the strong preyed on the weak. The khan of Jinzhanghan was often the strongest in the world. Otherwise, it would be difficult for him to sit on the throne.","Whether it was his brothers, sons, or even the elders of the older generation, they would all be eyeing him covetously. The current khan of Jinzhanghan had fought for many years and earned his reputation. Everyone knew of his existence.","The representatives were made up of high-level officials from both countries, so they knew a little about the khan of Jinzhanghan. Some people who were not determined felt their legs go weak. It was as if they had seen a ghost. Previously, the Right King alone had posed great pressure on them, not to mention the current khan of Jinzhanghan.","“We’re finished... We’re done for!” someone said with his mouth agape.","That was an existence that was unmatched, a terrifying existence that was the number one expert in the world.","However, at this moment, they saw Chu Yunfan materialize a large hand and suddenly grabbed the khan of Jinzhanghan in his hand, turning him into spirit energy that scattered in all directions.","It turned out that the khan of Jinzhanghan had not come personally. It was just a part of the primordial spirit hidden in the flag.","“Do you only know how to talk? You’ll have to find me first.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The figure formed by the primordial spirit could fool others, but not Chu Yunfan.","If the khan of Jinzhanghan was here, Chu Yunfan would have been a little afraid. But now, it was just a wisp of spirit, and it still dared to shout in front of him.","“Hmm?” Suddenly, Chu Yunfan frowned slightly because he realized that something was wrong. He couldn’t put the flag into the Mountain River Diagram.","The ash fire power in the flag kept bursting out waves of golden light to prevent Chu Yunfan from putting it into the Mountain River Diagram. Unless Chu Yunfan completely refined the flag, he would not be able to store it in the diagram.","This matter was troublesome. He could even feel that there was an aura locked onto this Ash Wolf Flag. This aura was the same as the primordial spirit of the khan of Jinzhanghan, but it was much stronger.","Without a doubt, it was the khan of Jinzhanghan.","The aura was getting stronger and stronger. It was likely that the man from Jinzhanghan was approaching. Moreover, this speed was quite shocking. At this speed, they would probably catch up in no time.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan immediately turned to Gongsun Wulong without hesitation and said, “Get out of here now. The khan is on his way here. If he finds you, your lives will be in danger.”","The crowd, who thought that they had escaped a calamity, was shocked. When they remembered that it was the legendary khan of Jinzhanghan, they were scared out of their wits.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, they wanted to run away immediately.","“What about you, Master Chu?” Gongsun Wulong, still holding on to some courage, asked.","“I’ll be fine alone. I have my ways,” Chu Yunfan said directly,","Everyone thought for a moment. With their strength, staying here would only drag Chu Yunfan down. They stopped hesitating, bid farewell to Chu Yunfan, and left.","After everyone left, Chu Yunfan took the corpse of the Right King and used it to water the Brahma Tree. The roots of the tree absorbed the powerful energy contained in the corpse. This was the first time Chu Yunfan had killed a Core Former. The blood essence of a Core Former was many times stronger than that of an ordinary Void Core.","A Brahma Fruit hung from the Brahma Tree and was maturing at an astonishing speed. Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a smile. This Brahma Fruit would ripen soon. Compared to the previous Brahma Fruit, the effects of this one were several times stronger.","When the time came, it would be enough for Chu Yunfan, who was already at the peak of the fledgling Void Core Stage, to break through to the intermediate Void Core Stage. His strength would be enough to take another step forward."]},{"number":1483,"title":"Chapter 1483 Ash Fire Physique","paragraphs":["1483 Ash Fire Physique","Soon, Chu Yunfan felt the aura of the khan approaching rapidly. He cursed inwardly and hurriedly leaped into the sky. He transformed into a streak of light and disappeared from where he was.","Not long after, a terrifying aura flew over and a figure appeared. Who else could it be but the khan of Jinzhanghan?","“Rrrraaaagh!”","The khan let out a loud roar. He sensed that this was the place where the Right King had died. Although the members of the imperial family were indifferent to each other, that was still his son. Not to mention that the Ash Wolf Flag had disappeared here.","Thinking of this, the anger in his heart was about to burn through the sky.","“No matter who you are, you’re dead!”","Thinking of this, the khan immediately chased after Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had not refined the Flag of the Ash Wolf, so he could easily sense the direction in which Chu Yunfan had left.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who was in midair, began to check the Ash Wolf Flag as he fled. This flag was different from ordinary spirit tools. Without the support of the owner’s divine power, ordinary spirit tools were useless. Even if there was an artifact spirit to control it, it would not be able to last long because there was not enough energy to support it. But the Ash Wolf Flag was different. Because it had the support of countless ash fires, this flag could resist Chu Yunfan’s refinement.","‘No, I have to think of a way to cut off the ash fire first. Otherwise, I won’t be able to refine the flag even if I worked on it for another 100 years!’ Chu Yunfan thought.","Could he continue running like this for another hundred years? The khan would not let him off so easily.","Chu Yunfan immediately began to recall some of the knowledge recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book about ash fire power. As his cultivation deepened, many memories that were originally sealed in the depths of his primordial spirit could be retrieved at any time.","Back then, most of the memories were sealed away by the godhead because Chu Yunfan would be turned into an idiot if all of them were to rush out at once. He could only mobilize a small portion of the memories. But now, his cultivation was much stronger than before, and the memories he could receive were much more.","Soon, countless memories formed a shape in front of him, especially the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, which turned into a book and appeared in front of him. Of course, this was not a physical entity. Only Chu Yunfan could see it.","Soon, he found the records of ash fire power in the book. According to the records, ash fire power was a magical energy, different from spirit energy, which was naturally formed in the world. Instead, it was energy formed by the power of one’s wishes.","In the Ancient Zenith Civilization, countless experts naturally embarked on the path of cultivation according to the power of wishes. It could be said to be prosperous for a time. These people called themselves gods and cultivated the godhood path. In the end, they became a generation of divine emperors, standing side by side with the other emperors.","However, there was a huge flaw in this ash fire power wishing power. Once one chose to cultivate the ash fire power, they would never be able to leave it. To put it simply, when there was ash fire and wish power, those people dared to call themselves gods and had a long lifespan. But once there was no one to worship them, they would quickly die.","Thus, during the Ancient Zenith Civilization, these powerful cultivators who called themselves gods had controlled many countries and had fought many life-and-death battles.","Therefore, although this path of cultivation was quick, many experts chose to stay away from it. The Mighty Emperor Battle Book recorded many methods of cultivating ash fire power and how to extract it for their own use.","There were quite a few methods that were quite mysterious, but these methods all had flaws. This was because once the energy of the ash fire power was extracted, one would have to stick to that path. That was too big of a flaw, and it wasn’t what Chu Yunfan wanted.","However, he immediately thought of something. After using these mysterious methods to extract the ash fire wish power, he could use the Celestial Devouring Art to consume that power. After all, the Celestial Devouring Art claimed that it could devour any form of energy. No matter how special the ash fire and wish power were, they would still be devoured.","At that time, he could turn all of them into his own strength. But even so, judging from the aura he sensed, the khan was at least in the late stage of the Core Form Stage. It was not an exaggeration to call him the number one in the world. Even if Chu Yunfan’s cultivation advanced further, he might not be his match.","“I have to think of another way!”","Chu Yunfan continued to flip through the records of the Mighty Emperor Battle Book and discovered a few divine powers that were unique to the cultivation of the godhood path. They could only be cultivated with ash fire power.","“The Ash Fire Physique?” Chu Yunfan read a record about this physique technique. It was a brilliant way of refining the body according to the godhood path. However, it was not crucial for Chu Yunfan at the moment. He had both the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique—two top physiques. Although the Ash Fire Physique was impressive, it was nothing to him.","‘It is recorded that this Ash Fire Physique can be applied to an external body double. That’s an extremely brilliant method,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","An external body double was different from a primordial spirit body double. The primordial spirit body double was just a physical form formed by a strand of primordial spirit and its strength was much weaker than the main body. It was like how the primordial spirit body double of the khan of Jinzhanghan had been crushed by Chu Yunfan with a single slap. It was no match for Chu Yunfan at all.","However, an external body double was a different matter. It could even be stronger than the main body. It was an extremely mysterious divine power. During the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there were similar techniques in each family, but they were all different.","Usually, one had to rely on a magic tool or a heavenly treasure to refine an external body double. However, the grade of these magic treasures or heavenly treasures had to be very high and were extremely difficult to master.","There was only one faction that was an exception, and that was the dvine path lineage that cultivated ash fire power. The Ash Fire Physique condensed by this lineage was a very different kind of divine power. It could be condensed by one’s physique technique, or refined into an external body double.","There was no need to rely on magic treasures or heavenly resources. As long as there was enough ash fire, it could be condensed. The more ash fire there was, the more shocking the power it could produce. Divine cultivators relied on it to travel the world.","However, to form the Ash Fire Physique, the amount of power required was too much. Ordinary divine cultivators didn’t have enough. But didn’t this Ash Wolf Flag just happen to have enough ash fire and wish power?"]},{"number":1484,"title":"Chapter 1484 Condensing the Ash Fire Physique","paragraphs":["1484 Condensing the Ash Fire Physique","Drawing out the ash fire power of the Ash Wolf Flag would not only suppress it but also make it easier for Chu Yunfan to refine it. Apart from being able to form the Ash Fire Physique, these ash fires could also be refined into some powerful divine arts.","Yes, this was a very unique method of the godhood path. Ordinary cultivators could only refine pills and magic tools, but the godhood path could actually refine divine powers.","It could refine some of the best divine powers into a state similar to a magic tool. When it was needed, it could be released at the same time. Some sects could seal these divine powers in scrolls or in certain magic tools. They were all similar methods, but refining divine powers was unique.","There were quite a number of divine powers recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. There was a huge advantage to refining with ash fire. The more ash fire there was, the more terrifying the power of the divine power would be. And the requirements for the refiner themselves were not very high.","Soon, Chu Yunfan chose one of the spells, which was called Divine Thunderbolt. He would use the power of his ash fire to turn into divine thunderbolt to kill his opponent. The power would vary greatly depending on the amount of ash fire. Even if the khan was in the late Core Form Stage, he would be severely injured or even killed by the thunderbolts.","Chu Yunfan had wanted to use a nuclear bomb, but he was afraid that it would not be effective. An expert at the khan’s level had an amazing sense of danger. From the time Chu Yunfan took out the nuclear missile launcher to the time it was launched, it would be a very long time for a Core Former. It was difficult to plot against a Core Former. He could escape to a safe place in an instant, but he might not be able to kill a Core Former.","Back in the Federation, even the so-called god could not be defeated by nuclear bombs, let alone a master like the khan. Needless to say, the power of the nuclear bomb was enough to devour everything. However, the entire process was too long. Top-notch experts could easily dodge it.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan immediately found one of the cultivation techniques recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book—the Ash Fire Godhood Path. His current comprehension ability was amazing. Coupled with the godhead’s faint light, this allowed Chu Yunfan to instantly enter a state of enlightenment.","In just a moment, he had already understood the Ash Fire Godhood Path and began to extract ash fire power from the Ash Wolf Flag. Soon, under Chu Yunfan’s extraction, the ash fire wish power in the flag was like a river that was continuously absorbed.","The flag had absorbed countless ashes and wish power from Jinzhanghan over the years. The years of war had only consumed a small portion of it, and the rest was stored in the flag.","And now, the ash fire power in the flag had been drawn out. The artifact spirit—the golden wolf—immediately felt the ash fire power being drawn out and began to struggle. But how could it struggle against Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan’s seal had sealed the wolf within the flag. Previously, it had the ash fire power, so it could resist Chu Yunfan’s refinement. But now that the ash fire power had been sucked away, its strength was weakening. How could it resist?","Countless ash fire and wish power surrounded Chu Yunfan. Soon, a figure slowly formed in front of Chu Yunfan. This figure took shape and slowly became clearer and clearer. It looked about 80% similar to Chu Yunfan. As time passed, the figure became more and more like Chu Yunfan.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan was condensing the Ash Fire Physique while comprehending the Ash Fire Godhood Path. He was amazed as he cultivated. Although this path was different from the main path, there was a saying that the stones of other mountains could be used to attack jade. Although it was a completely different martial arts system, many of the wonderful methods recorded in the Ash Fire Godhood Path were indeed unique.","This made Chu Yunfan feel as if his horizons had been broadened.","Especially since the Ash Fire Godhood Path was the supreme cultivation method in the godhood path lineage. It was not something that ordinary godhood path cultivation methods could compare to. It was simply the difference between heaven and earth—the clouds in the sky, and the soil on the ground.","Although he had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, the Alchemy Emperor had been obsessed with alchemy all his life. Most of his experience was also in alchemy. In terms of martial arts, he was far from it. There was no way it could be compared to the many techniques recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book.","However, what Chu Yunfan didn’t know was that if the cultivators of the Ancient Zenith Civilization who also cultivated the godhood path saw Chu Yunfan condense his Ash Fire Physique not long after, they would probably be scared to death.","During the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there were millions of people who cultivated the godhood path, and only one in ten thousand could condense the Ash Fire Physique.","Most people couldn’t even find a spell, let alone someone like Chu Yunfan, who could easily find a record in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. The way to condense the Ash Fire Physique was considered an extremely brilliant way in the godhood path. And those who had the opportunity to come into contact with these godhood path techniques, only a very small portion of them could successfully condense them because it was too difficult.","Even though the Ash Fire Physique condensed by the godhood path did not rely on external objects, the requirements for one’s aptitude were high. Not to mention that Chu Yunfan could condense the Ash Fire Physique with his cultivation. That was a miracle that they would have never dared to imagine.","Generally, only the top experts in the godhood path had the chance to condense the Ash Fire Physique. Only Chu Yunfan himself felt that it was nothing and only treated it as ordinary. He didn’t realize how shocking this opportunity was. His cultivation speed was enough to make the geniuses of the Ancient Zenith Civilization feel ashamed.","Just like that, Chu Yunfan flapped the lightning wings on his back and transformed them into streams of light in the sky. At the same time, he extracted the ash fire wish power and began to condense the Ash Fire Physique. At the same time, he also began to refine the Ash Wolf Flag.","Ordinary people couldn’t do three things at once, but with the support of the godhead, Chu Yunfan could do it with ease.","Somewhere in the sky, the khan, who was frantically rushing toward Chu Yunfan, suddenly had a changed in expression and muttered, “This isn’t good. D*mn it, he actually dared to refine my Ash Wolf Flag!”","The khan was so furious that he stomped his feet."]},{"number":1485,"title":"Chapter 1485 Physique Formed, Who Will Kill Who?","paragraphs":["1485 Physique Formed, Who Will Kill Who?","Although the khan, the Left King, and the Right King all had different privileges to use the Ash Wolf Flag, they were all allowed to use it. But the highest authority was the khan, which meant that the real owner of the Ash Wolf Flag was him.","The Left and Right King only had a certain degree of authority. Unless they became the khan one day, the Ash Wolf Flag would never be theirs.","Now that Chu Yunfan had started to refine the Ash Wolf Flag, he was digging out the khan’s roots.","He was able to sit on the throne of Jinzhanghan because of his strength, and also because of the support of the Ash Wolf Flag. Not only did the Ash Wolf Flag greatly increase his strength, but it was also a symbol of his rule in Jinzhanghan.","It was just like the jade seals of the Great Wei and Great Qi. If Chu Yunfan refined the flag, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Thinking of this, the khan did not dare to delay and hurriedly flew in the direction of the flag. His heart pounded. His strength was far stronger than that of the person who had snatched the Ash Wolf Flag, but that person’s speed was equal to his. Even if he flew at full speed, he could barely close the distance.","If he wanted to catch up to him, he would have to spend a lot of time on the chase.","The khan had not been worried. Since ancient times, many powerful enemies had tried to refine the flag but failed. This was because it contained the ash fire power of Jinzhanghan. It could be said that it was already tied to the fate of Jinzhanghan. It was not that simple.","Even he himself didn’t know how to use ash fire power. He had only refined it roughly according to the secret technique left behind by his ancestors, but now it had actually been broken by someone.","This was the biggest problem!","“You’re dead!” the khan roared angrily.","The chase lasted for a full day and night. Both parties were as fast as lightning. After a full day and night, even Chu Yunfan himself did not know where he had gone. He simply kept changing his route and going in circles. Although he knew that he couldn’t hide it from the khan forever, he could still slow him down.","After a day and a night, Chu Yunfan finally slowed down. In his hand, the Ash Wolf Flag had shrunk to the size of a palm. Its body was no longer emitting golden light because the ash fire and wish power it had stored had been sucked dry by Chu Yunfan.","The flag was in Chu Yunfan’s hand, and it kept changing in size according to his will. This was a sign that Chu Yunfan had completely refined it. Without the ash fire and wish power, how could the flag resist Chu Yunfan’s refinement? It didn’t take long for him to directly wipe out the primordial spirit of the khan, the left King, and the Right King.","Of course, it was impossible for anyone else to refine the Ash Wolf Flag in such a short time. However, the refining techniques that Chu Yunfan had mastered were all the best techniques in the world. Even if the Ash Wolf Flag were ten times stronger, it would not be difficult for Chu Yunfan.","‘It took me a day and a night to finally refine it,’ Chu Yunfan thought. This was the magic tool that had taken him the longest to refine. The fastest one was immediately refined and could be used on the spot. One could imagine how amazing the refining technique he used was.","In front of Chu Yunfan was a figure that was as tall as him and looked exactly the same. This was none other than the external body double that he had condensed with ash fire power. This body double emitted an extremely terrifying aura, even surpassing Chu Yunfan’s.","A body double formed from ash fire power was not dependent on external factor. It was determined by one’s own talent and the amount of ash fire power. Moreover, it could continue to improve with the passage of time. It could be said that the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the more ash fire the body double could absorb, and the strength of its Ash Fire Physique would further increase.","Other than this Ash Fire Physique, there was also an object about the size of a fist around him that emitted a golden light. It was the divine thunderbolt that Chu Yunfan had refined at the same time.","Because the condensation of the Ash Fire Physique had used up too much ash fire wish power, the remaining ash fire wish power could only be refined into this divine thunderbolt. However, Chu Yunfan was not disappointed. This thunder was enough. If he used it well, it would be enough to nail the khan.","Yes, Chu Yunfan had never thought that it would be enough to just chase the khan away. Otherwise, he could have done it with a nuclear bomb. Even a Core Former could not withstand the power of a nuclear bomb and could only escape. With the nuclear bomb in hand, even the khan would be afraid of him.","But at the same time, it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to kill him.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had never thought of using a nuclear bomb. From the beginning to the end, he wanted was to keep the khan alive.","“The khan? Let me fight you!” Chu Yunfan sneered. As he made a seal, the Ash Fire Physique condensed around his body and turned into armor.","This was the method he had come up with on a whim. The method of condensing the Ash Fire Physique recorded in the Ash Fire Godhood Path was either to cultivate special physiques such as the Thunderclap Physique or the Imperial Physique into body-tempering techniques or to transform into a body double. However, there was no one like him who could turn the Ash Fire Physique into something like armor.","Chu Yunfan’s aura became extremely majestic and powerful. Compared to before, he had risen to another level.","Not long after Chu Yunfan stopped, a terrifying aura came from the distance. It was getting closer and closer. In just a moment, it had already arrived before Chu Yunfan. A gust of wind dispersed, revealing the figure within.","Who else could it be but the khan?","After a day and a night of chasing, the khan was both shocked and furious. He felt his control over the Ash Wolf Flag weakening. He then discovered that his control and perception of the flag had completely disappeared. How could he not understand that this meant that the Ash Wolf Flag had been completely refined by the other party?","Thinking of this, the anger in his heart could no longer be suppressed and exploded.","“D*mned fellow! I finally caught up to you. I’ll tear you into pieces!”"]},{"number":1486,"title":"Chapter 1486 Equal Strength","paragraphs":["1486 Equal Strength","“Tear me into pieces? Are you sure you can do it?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","If it was before, he might not have been able to deal with the khan. But now, the situation had changed. Times have changed.","“That’s right, I want you dead!”","The khan let out a loud roar and released his aura, locking it on Chu Yunfan as if he was afraid that Chu Yunfan would run away.","As soon as he finished speaking, the khan moved. He didn’t want to talk nonsense with Chu Yunfan. A spear appeared in his hand and he pointed it at Chu Yunfan. It was very similar to the blood-colored spear that the Right King had used, except that the spear in his hand was silver-white and looked even more powerful.","The Right King had just entered the Core Form Stage, but the khan was different. He had entered the Core Form Stage for countless years. The two are simply incomparable.","The khan did not take Chu Yunfan seriously. In this world, he was an invincible existence. Although he was angry, he did not take Chu Yunfan seriously. All the divine power in his body burned like a monstrous flame, revealing an unparalleled terrifying power.","Chu Yunfan released a terrifying power.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan’s punch immediately set the entire sky ablaze. Eight figures appeared behind him and merged into one, turning into a terrifying torrent that swept toward the khan.","“What martial art is this?” The khan’s eyes revealed a hint of surprise. With his martial arts knowledge, he could naturally see how amazing the Eight Astonishing Punches that Chu Yunfan displayed were. It had surpassed the national level martial arts of Jinzhanghan that had been cultivated over many years.","This was extremely shocking and unbelievable.","However, a greedy look flashed through the khan’s eyes. The more powerful the technique Chu Yunfan displayed, the more he wanted it.","Boom!","The punch landed on the khan’s body, but the latter did not dodge. He took the blow and retreated a few steps before finally stopping.","“You managed to force me to retreat. You are not bad. No wonder you have the guts to provoke Jinzhanghan. But it’s a pity that your strength is only so much, and I have not done anything yet.”","The khan showed a cold smile, but his heart was not as calm as it seemed because Chu Yunfan’s punch had forced him to take a few steps back before he could take the blow without injury. This was a miracle in itself.","If it were his other two sons, the Left and Right King, he wouldn’t even move, especially the Right King. Even if he stood there and let the Right King hit him, he wouldn’t be moved. His cultivation was not something his two sons could compare to at the current stage.","In his eyes, all of this was because of this amazing technique. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan didn’t have any secrets. He wasn’t even in the Core Form Stage, but he had such amazing combat strength. This in itself was unbelievable.","Chu Yunfan sighed slightly. With his strength, it was still very difficult for him to pose a threat to the khan. After all, he had only just stepped into the Void Core Stage.","“Isn’t it too early for you to celebrate? If we were at the same cultivation level, killing you would be as easy as killing a chicken,” Chu Yunfan said lightly. Although he was not as good as the khan, he was not upset because he was absolutely confident that if they were on the same level, the khan would not even be able to block one of his fingers.","“Perhaps, but so what?” The khan was not easily swayed by Chu Yunfan’s words. He just sneered. “Many people value the so-called potential of geniuses, but to me, it’s all bullshit. No matter what kind of potential, it’s nonsense if it can’t be transformed into true strength.","“Perhaps you can kill me like killing a chicken in the future, but you won’t have that chance. How about you tell me about this martial art of yours behind, and I might let you live and give you a chance to be my slave?” the khan offered.","“So, you’ve taken a fancy to my martial arts!” Chu Yunfan sneered at the khan. “But you just said that you haven’t made a move.”","“You still want to be stubborn now? You already used your full strength. You can’t fool me!”","The eyes of the khan were full of vigor. In fact, if it were not for the martial art that Chu Yunfan had, as well as many other divine arts, he would have killed him long ago. Unless there was no hope, he was not willing to kill Chu Yunfan for nothing. After all, he had not squeezed out all the remaining value.","“Go ahead and try me then.”","Chu Yunfan suddenly moved. At that moment, a sword light appeared in his hand. It spun rapidly and expanded. In an instant, it turned into countless sword lights and formed a long river of swords.","“River Sunset!”","Chu Yunfan shouted, and the sword light turned into a torrent of the sword path that fell on the khan.","“What sword technique is this? How is it so terrifying?!”","The khan could feel that Chu Yunfan’s strength had suddenly increased by several levels after using the sword technique. At first, Chu Yunfan could not threaten him at all, but now he could feel danger. He immediately retreated and stabbed out with the silver spear.","In an instant, his spear turned into a vast grassland. On this grassland, thousands of troops and horses were galloping, turning into a terrifying torrent that welcomed the torrent of sword arts.","Boom!","There was another huge explosion. The collision between the two sides formed a terrifying storm that swept out in all directions. The divine power of both sides turned into red light and scattered everywhere.","After the two sides attacked, it was difficult to determine the victor.","After blocking the attack, the khan’s expression changed. He had not taken Chu Yunfan seriously before, thinking that he had reached his limit. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would suddenly burst out with even more shocking strength?","At this moment, he noticed that Chu Yunfan’s body was covered in a layer of strong golden light. It was like a golden armor that wrapped around him. He was like a golden god of war, his might overwhelming the world."]},{"number":1487,"title":"Chapter 1487 The Khan’s Horror","paragraphs":["1487 The Khan’s Horror","“Is this ash fire power?” the khan said in astonishment. Then, his face turned ugly. With his knowledge of martial arts, he immediately understood why the Ash Wolf Flag, which no enemy had ever been able to refine, was refined by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan must have used some unknown method to harvest ash fire power. Without the support of ash fire power and without its master present, the flag was no match for Chu Yunfan. It could not resist.","And Chu Yunfan had used ash fire power on himself. This was a method the khan had never thought of. The way Chu Yunfan used ash fire power was too rough. Or rather, it was not rough. The khan just did not have any way to use it.","The cultivation method of the godhood path was not considered a big secret in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, but it was not a common thing. But times had changed. Up until now, there were very few people who really understood.","The khan didn’t know how to use it either. He basically followed the instructions of his ancestor and worshipped the flag. As for ash fire wish power inside, he had no way to use it. He simply let the flag slowly absorb ash fire wish power on its own. Otherwise, the flag would have been of much higher quality if there was a method to merge ash fire power after absorbing it for so many years.","When he thought of this, his eyes became even more greedy. Compared to Chu Yunfan’s shocking punch technique, he wanted to know more about Chu Yunfan’s method of harvesting ash fire power.","This was what the khan lacked the most. With this method, he would be able to control the entire empire and would be able to break through the boundaries of this world very quickly. He would become unimaginably powerful.","Chu Yunfan did not want to be infected with too many cultivation methods of the godhood path because he was afraid that he would encounter a huge flaw. This was because the requirement for ash fire power to tread the godhood path was too great. Once the source of the ash fire power was destroyed, it would only be a matter of time before the cultivator was destroyed.","Therefore, in the era of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, the people of the godhood path were not very welcomed by others because they were too exclusive. Ordinary sects occupied a country or a region, and at most, they would take in disciples, collect taxes, and collect some heavenly and earthly treasures. They would not interfere too much in other matters. It was even normal for a country to have multiple sects.","However, the godhood path sects were different. They were completely exclusive. It was impossible for others to develop in a country because they wanted to monopolize ash fire and wish power. It even extended to the limit. Many countries and planes only served one person, and it was known as the Heavenly Kingdom.","However, for others, this was a rare path of cultivation. Moreover, this had an innate advantage for the ruler of a country. In the era of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, many people in the godhood path were the rulers of a country or at least the lords of a certain place.","Only existences of this level could possibly cultivate up to the supreme path stage. Other people would basically not be able to succeed unless they had some kind of chance fortuitous encounter.","And now, the khan had the same thought.","“This is good. I now have another reason to capture you,” the khan said coldly, “But it seems that you refused to be captured obediently. In that case, I’ll break your limbs first and seal your power. Then, we’ll slowly talk about your divine arts.”","“Hahahaha, just based on your words, you can forget about running away today.” Chu Yunfan laughed, his eyes flashing with a terrifying light.","The khan wanted to kill him, but he also wanted to kill the khan. This was an opportunity for both sides.","“Conquering Spear!”","The khan displayed his ultimate technique. The first generation khan relied on this set of martial arts to defeat all the opponents in the world and finally established himself as the khan. When this attack burst out, it was as if the heavens and earth were collapsing. Wind and clouds surged, and a phenomenon of heaven and earth appeared. Wherever this spear passed, the power of heaven and earth surged, just like boiling water.","The khan went straight to the point. He stabbed his spear at Chu Yunfan’s chest, wanting to tear him apart. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan’s attitude was unforgivable. He had been high and mighty for too many years.","“Not bad!” Chu Yunfan said loudly.","In the eyes of ordinary people, this spear technique was naturally shocking and powerful to an unimaginable extent. But to Chu Yunfan, who was used to seeing top-notch martial arts, getting a good evaluation was enough to show that the khan was amazing.","However, Chu Yunfan was completely still. From afar, it seemed as if he had been shaken by the terrifying aura emitted by the spear. At the most critical moment, the thunder wings on his back spread out and instantly blocked the attack.","Clang!","When the spear landed on the thunder wings, a series of metallic clashing sounds erupted. At the same time, the wing on his right grew bigger and bigger. Like a sharp sword, he slashed at the khan.","Having failed his first attack, the khan retreated to avoid the strike of the thunder wing. The place where he stood exploded into pieces. One could imagine how powerful the attack was.","“What kind of method is this?”","The khan realized that Chu Yunfan used techniques that he had never seen before. For example, the thunder wings could attack and defend at the same time. It was an extremely shocking thunder ability.","It wasn’t that he hadn’t seen people who cultivated thunder techniques, but he had never seen anyone who could control thunder power to such an extent that it couldn’t be released at once and could form wings. With the help of these wings, Chu Yunfan seemed to have an extra pair of hands. It could be said that his threat level had increased greatly.","However, before the khan could think further, Chu Yunfan stomped his feet and a flash of thunder appeared. He disappeared, and when he reappeared, he was standing right in front of the khan. He punched with one hand and held a sword with the other. With the thunder wings on his back, he slashed down crazily like a long blade.","For a moment, the khan knew that things were not good. He tried his best to resist but was instantly at a disadvantage. It was difficult for two fists to fight against four hands, and he was sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s sword."]},{"number":1488,"title":"Chapter 1488 Heavily Wounding the Khan","paragraphs":["1488 Heavily Wounding the Khan","The khan was sent flying. Although the sword did not hit him directly and only hit his armor, it still made him feel suffocated and rendered him breathless. Chu Yunfan’s attacks rained down like a storm. He couldn’t even fight because he couldn’t keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed. He could only take the hits passively.","However, the greed in his eyes became even stronger. What did Chu Yunfan rely on to jump from a guy who was no match for him to an existence that could be on equal footing with him? Wasn’t it just ash fire and wish power?","Chu Yunfan was able to tie with him by relying on ash fire power. If it were him, wouldn’t his cultivation immediately rise to another level and become invincible? In that case, the dream of the khans to unify the world could be realized in his hands.","At the thought of this, his heart instantly burned with passion.","“You can’t hurt me!” The khan laughed. “Even if you rely on ash fire power to get a huge increase in strength, in essence, you’re still a Void Core who has not even reached the Core Form Stage. I want to see how long you can last.”","“It’s enough to defeat you!” Chu Yunfan shouted and launched another attack.","From his back, countless thunder wings flew out and turned into a thunder sword rain that bombarded the khan.","Rumble!","Countless thunder swords filled the entire world. From afar, it looked like a thunderstorm.","“Break!”","The khan thought about how his strength would increase greatly after he obtained the method to refine ash fire power. He could not hold it in anymore and was extremely pleased with himself. He used the Conquering Spear again. He had already made up his mind to fight a prolonged battle with Chu Yunfan. He knew that Chu Yunfan would not be able to last long.","Boom!","The attacks of both sides collided in the air. The spear was like a silver-white dragon, shuttling through the endless thunder and rain. Then, it bombarded Chu Yunfan, intending to kill him on the spot.","“Break! Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan punched out once again. For the current Chu Yunfan, the complete Eight Astoning Punches consumed a lot of his strength. Under normal circumstances, he would not easily use it. But now, with the Ash Fire Physique, all the consumption was taken care of by this physique technique. He could use this skill without any fear.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan knocked away the spear with a punch and then kicked it down.","“Fourth Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan used the Fourth Netherworld Stomp as soon as he stomped the ground. The entire sky collapsed under his feet. The terrifying force of his feet spread out and turned into a monstrous force as he fell toward the khan.","“Block!”","The khan shattered the Fourth Netherworld Stomp with a spear attack. The battle between the two sides had entered a white-hot stage. Every minute and every second, both sides erupted with a large number of attacks.","“Let’s see how long you can last. Hahahaha!”","The khan laughed loudly because he saw that the golden light on Chu Yunfan’s body was weakening. This kind of battle was too intense. It consumed a lot of divine power every second. Even with Chu Yunfan’s strength, he could not hold on anymore. He had to rely on the consumption of ash fire power.","Chu Yunfan knew that the khan wanted to drag this out, which would be too disadvantageous for him. He gritted his teeth and shouted, “Fifth Netherworld Stomp!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and used the Fifth Netherworld Stomp that his original body was not able to use yet. The power of the Fifth Netherworld Stomp was at least several times stronger than the Fourth Netherworld Stomp, but the consumption was also many times greater. The originally dense golden light on Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly became much thinner.","With just one attack, he had already used up one-tenth of his ash fire wish power. In addition to the one-tenth that he had used up just now, it could be said that in this short period, he had already used up one-fifth of ash fire wish power that the Ash Wolf Flag had accumulated over the years.","The judgment of the khan was not wrong. Chu Yunfan’s biggest weakness was that he could not fight for a long time. However, when this stomp landed, the khan felt like the entire sky had descended, wanting to suppress him.","‘How could this stomp be so terrifying?!’","The khan roared, “I’m going all out!” His silver spear flew out of his hand and transformed into a flood dragon, thrusting at the stomp attack.","Boom!","The silver spear was sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s stomp. The power of the Fifth Netherworld Stomp was several times stronger than the Fourth Netherworld Stomp.","Boom!","Although the stomp was blocked for a moment, it still landed on the khan.","Spurt!","The khan spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward. This was the first time he had suffered a loss in the confrontation between the two sides. He had suffered a great loss in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","How could Chu Yunfan let go of such a good opportunity? He immediately rushed toward the khan and used all kinds of martial arts techniques.","Chu Yunfan knew a lot of martial arts. Now that he was using them, any one of them would have great power. They landed on the khan like a storm.","In a moment, the khan was sent flying again. He spat out another mouthful of blood. He was furious and roared, “I don’t believe that you can last much longer. As long as I’m protected by my armor, you can’t do anything to me!”","“Then let’s give it a try!”","Suddenly, a golden thunderbolt appeared in Chu Yunfan’s hand.","When he saw the thunderbolt in Chu Yunfan’s hand, the khan felt his hair stand on end as if the thunderbolt in Chu Yunfan’s hand could pose a huge threat to him.","Chu Yunfan threw out the divine thunderbolt in his hand and swept it at the khan with lightning speed. The khan wanted to stay away, but under Chu Yunfan’s control, the divine thunderbolt exploded.","Boom!","A thunderous sound rang out, and the entire world shook violently. A terrifying fire and thunderstorm accompanied this violent shaking."]},{"number":1489,"title":"Chapter 1489 The Khan Flees, Breakthrough Is Near","paragraphs":["1489 The Khan Flees, Breakthrough Is Near","This terrifying thunderstorm swept out, and the sky trembled violently.","Even Chu Yunfan was slightly shocked. Although he had read about the divine thunderbolt in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, he had only seen the description. It was nothing compared to seeing it with his own eyes.","This divine thunderbolt’s power was not as good as a direct nuclear bomb, but it was about the same. Even Chu Yunfan had to retreat to avoid the explosion range. The key was that it was effective.","It was unlike a nuclear bomb that required some time to prepare even if it had a launcher. For a top-tier expert, such a long time was enough for them to make a move.","Immediately after, a figure escaped at lightning speed. Chu Yunfan looked closely and saw that the person was none other than the khan.","However, the khan looked extremely miserable. His clothes were torn and tattered, and he looked extremely miserable. The armor that protected him was completely shattered by the attack of the divine thunderbolt. He could not withstand it.","The khan was covered in blood. Many of his muscles had evaporated. Yes, they evaporated. It was so deep that his bones could be seen.","Chu Yunfan had severely injured the khan.","The khan roared angrily. He had never suffered such a loss before, not to mention that he had suffered such a loss at the hands of a guy he had never looked up to before.","“I’ll kill you!” the khan roared angrily.","“You want to kill me? That depends on whether you can do it or not.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Chu Yunfan felt a little regretful that the divine thunderbolt failed to kill the khan, but fortunately, he had not expected to kill the khan with the divine thunderbolt alone.","The situation had completely changed. The khan was originally very powerful, but now he was severely injured by Chu Yunfan, and his strength plummeted. Under the circumstances where he was heavily injured, he could not even use half of his original strength.","The khan stared at Chu Yunfan as if he was calculating something. A hint of fear flashed through his eyes. It was clear that he was very afraid of Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Especially Chu Yunfan’s endless methods, which made him suffer a lot. The divine thunderbolt had injured him. This was something he had never thought of before. He was the number one expert in the world, and he had never suffered such a huge loss.","While the khan was hesitating, Chu Yunfan’s entire body emitted strong killing intent. The khan was a huge threat to him and Great Wei. If he had not tricked him today, it would have been impossible for him to hurt the khan under normal circumstances, where he would be surrounded by 100,000 Blood Barbarians whenever he went out.","It could be said that this was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to kill the khan.","Chu Yunfan’s strong killing intent alarmed the khan. His eyes flashed with shock and anger. He could feel Chu Yunfan’s killing intent, but he never thought that he would end up like this one day.","Thinking of this, he immediately bit the tip of his tongue without any hesitation. A metallic taste erupted in his mouth, and he immediately spat out a mouthful of blood. The mouthful of blood instantly turned into a ball of blood flames, surrounding him and fleeing into the distance.","“I won’t let you off. Wash your neck and wait!” the khan roared indignantly.","Chu Yunfan wanted to chase after him, but he found that the khan had already disappeared. He could tell that this was a secret technique. It was clearly a way to harm the source of life in exchange for a chance to escape. Chu Yunfan could not catch up.","“What a pity.” Chu Yunfan sighed.","It would be great if the khan had stayed. It was a pity that it was all for naught in the end.","‘But it’s not like I didn’t gain anything. Not everyone has the experience of fighting against such an expert,’ Chu Yunfan thought, ‘Also, this lets me know that there are actually such experts in this world.’","After he defeated Yun Huang, he had already advanced to become the number one expert in Great Wei. Later on, he met the Right King, who was weaker than Yun Huang and was no match for Chu Yunfan.","But now, after meeting the khan, he had found a new benchmark. The khan was indeed powerful. If Chu Yunfan had not borrowed ash fire power, he would not have been able to fight against the khan.","The khan was too powerful. He had already reached the late Core Form Stage, and no one in the world was his match. Fortunately, he had severely injured the khan, and the khan had used the secret art of burning his life force. He would probably not be able to come out for a while.","This gave Chu Yunfan ample time to cultivate. Even if the khan appeared again, he would not be afraid. After all, after this series of battles, he still had four-fifths of his ash fire power left. He could fight again. Moreover, he had not used the flag in the battle. That was another trump card.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan grinned. He had gained a lot this time. He had obtained the Ash Wolf Flag and cultivated the secret method of becoming a god through ash fire.","It was a pity that to operate this ash fire power, it needed ash fire wish power at all times. He had to think of a way to find more ash fire wish power to replenish it. When he returned to Great Wei, he could see if there was a magic tool like the Ash Wolf Flag. After all, Great Wei had been established for many years, and there were many secrets that outsiders did not know.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan felt the manas in his entire body surge. The battle had caused the barrier of the intermediate Void Core Stage to loosen.","“Nice timing. This is a good opportunity to break through to the intermediate Void Core Stage,” Chu Yunfan said.","As for the Great Wei representatives, he no longer had to care about them. He had killed the Right King and severely injured the khan. No one should be able to find trouble with them anymore.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan no longer hesitated. With the Ash Wolf Flag in hand, he entered the Mountain River Diagram. He then sat down cross-legged and began to circulate his power to break through the barrier while waiting for the Brahma Tree to mature."]},{"number":1490,"title":"Chapter 1490 Breakthrough, Intermediate Void Core Stage","paragraphs":["1490 Breakthrough, Intermediate Void Core Stage","A series of battles, especially when the opponents were all experts above the Core Form Stage, was a huge harvest for Chu Yunfan. For cultivators, the progress of working behind closed doors was far less rewarding than fighting a real battle.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan kept surging the divine power in his body and began to boil crazily. It continuously charged at the barrier of the intermediate Void Core Stage.","Compared to ordinary Void Cores, Chu Yunfan was so strong that he could kill many of them with a casual slap. However, it was also because of this that it was more difficult for him to advance further than ordinary people.","This was probably the will of the heavens, the balance of the divine path.","“It’s not enough!”","The divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body boiled, but he felt that it was not enough. If he were to break through like this, it might take him a year or even several years to break through. Therefore, he did not hesitate to direct countless spirit stones to fly into the sky and shatter them. They transformed into spirit energy and poured into the Brahma Tree.","This time, he had killed the Right King and his men. The harvest was unimaginable. He had obtained more than 100 million low-grade spirit stones. In addition, he had obtained various grades of magic tools and even some spirit tools, all of which were used by those Cores. There were also many rare medicinal herbs that were expensive.","If they were all exchanged for low-grade spirit stones, they might come up to more than 300 million spirit stones in total. Chu Yunfan would become rich overnight. However, he had expended a lot of his energy. Chu Yunfan had burned through the medicinal herbs and spirit stones in a short period, and the Brahma Tree had absorbed more than half of them.","Now that the Brahma Tree was getting bigger and bigger, the speed at which it absorbed the corpses of those powerful experts was getting faster and faster, turning them into the Brahma Fruit.","Chu Yunfan absorbed the rest of the spirit energy and used it to refine his body. Whether it was the Imperial Physique or the Thunderclap Physique, if he wanted to improve them, he would have to consume a large number of spirit stones.","Seeing that the Brahma Fruit was not ripe yet, he decided to refine his body first. The mountain of spirit stones in the distance flew into the air under the grasp of his divine power. They exploded in mid-air and turned into a long river of spirit energy that rushed into Chu Yunfan’s head.","The top of the head was the location of the Heaven and Earth Bridge. From the Innate Stage onwards, the human body could freely open the Heaven and Earth Bridge and connect with the world. However, no one absorbed spirit energy as violently as Chu Yunfan. Ordinary people would have exploded and died.","Chu Yunfan was different. As he absorbed the spirit energy, he began to refine his body. The process of refining his body was an extremely painful one. At his level of cultivation, his body was incomparably strong. Even so, he had to completely tear himself apart, tearing every cell apart, and then re-infusing spirit energy into it to refine it.","Even someone as determined as Chu Yunfan was grimacing in pain. However, he knew that this was a path he had to take. Otherwise, how could his body be so strong that he could withstand a spirit tool with his bare hands?","While Chu Yunfan was tempering his body, the godhead in his body also emitted a faint light. It flowed throughout his body and rapidly healed his injuries. At the same time, the godhead absorbed a lot of spirit energy, allowing Chu Yunfan to tear his body apart while healing himself.","This process was repeated over and over again. Every minute and every second felt as long as a century. It was extremely painful.","Boom!","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan shouted, and a terrifying divine power boiled from his body. It was about to form a storm, but it was stopped by a flag and disappeared.","It was the Ash Wolf Flag.","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. He could feel that the effect of this physical strengthening was very shocking. It could be said that his physical strength had increased by several levels.","At this moment, even if he had to take on a superior-grade spirit weapon like the Ash Wolf Flag head-on, he would not be afraid. Compared to the initial strength of his physical body, there was simply an earth-shattering change.","The meridians in his body were also wider and could accommodate more mana. As long as his cultivation broke through again, his combat strength would also advance further and directly break through to the intermediate Core Form Stage.","Because of this breakthrough, he would not face too many obstacles in his cultivation at the intermediate Void Core Stage. He could cultivate to the peak in one go.","At this time, Chu Yunfan was covered in blood. It had flowed out when his body was torn apart. The blood was dark as the impurities in his body were eliminated when every cell in his body was torn apart. He shook slightly, and the dried blood was sent flying, turning into ashes in the air.","He took a look. This breakthrough consumed a total of 30 million low-grade spirit stones. The speed of consumption was so fast that it would probably make others dumbfounded.","Chu Yunfan then looked at the Brahma Tree. As expected, the Brahma Fruit had already matured. The medicinal fragrance of the Brahma Fruit was also unprecedentedly rich.","He reached out and the Brahma Fruit flew into his hands. He opened his mouth and swallowed the Brahma Fruit. It instantly turned into a surge of pure energy that began to spread to every meridian and cell in his limbs.","Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the air, circulating the Emperor Method to continuously transform this power into the power he needed to break through.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body exploded. Every time he broke through, his divine power would explode. After each explosion, his divine power suddenly increased a lot.","Finally, after three whole days, Chu Yunfan’s surging mana finally calmed down. This meant that he had finally completed his breakthrough. He slowly opened his eyes, and the breath he exhaled turned into two magnificent dragons.","“I finally broke through!”","Chu Yunfan could feel the tyrannical power in his body. This breakthrough in his physical body and cultivation caused his combat strength to undergo earth-shattering changes. He had broken through to the peak of the intermediate Core Form Stage. If he were to face the khan now, it would be very difficult for the khan to kill him."]},{"number":1491,"title":"Chapter 1491 Peak of the Intermediate Void Core Stage","paragraphs":["1491 Peak of the Intermediate Void Core Stage","Because Chu Yunfan could take a superior-grade spirit weapon with his bare hands, even an expert like the khan would find it hard to kill him. Although he couldn’t defeat the Khan, it wasn’t difficult for him to protect himself.","Chu Yunfan was still not satisfied, but if this news spread to the outside world, it would probably cause countless people to be shocked. What kind of level was it to receive a superior-grade spirit weapon with one’s bare hands? It was not a level that ordinary people could imagine. There were very few physique cultivators in the world who could do this. It was unprecedented.","However, Chu Yunfan did not relax. To him, this cultivation was far from enough.","“I haven’t digested more than half of the medicinal power of the Brahma Fruit in my body. I can break through in one go.”","Chu Yunfan shouted and began to refine the medicinal strength of the Brahma Fruit in his body with all his might. He was already at the peak of the fledgling Void Core Stage. Although breaking through to the intermediate Void Core Stage consumed a lot of medicinal power, more medicinal power was still boiling in his body.","He decided to take advantage of the situation and make another breakthrough. After all, when he was tempering his body, he had re-opened and consolidated his meridians and core. Otherwise, it would not have been so easy for him to make another breakthrough.","After another month, Chu Yunfan finally woke up from his seclusion. At this time, he was no longer the same as a month ago. His strength was at least several times stronger than before.","When he fought the khan, it was already amazing that he could defeat the khan with the Ash Fire Physique. But now, he could also use the Eight Astonishing Punches. If the khan was careless, he would be severely injured.","From standing up and letting the khan attack him without breaking his defense to now being able to heavily injure him, this was a huge leap.","Of course, the khan was not stupid enough to stand there and let Chu Yunfan hit him without retaliating. He gritted his teeth when he saw Chu Yunfan and wanted to kill him.","In this month, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had broken through to the peak of the intermediate Core Form Stage. He was confident that ordinary Core Formers were not his match. After all, in this month of cultivation, he had used another 20 million low-grade spirit stones to consolidate his cultivation.","The consumption was huge!","More than half of the 100 million low-grade spirit stones that he had just seized from the Right King had already been used up. For others, it was an unimaginable consumption. Only then did Chu Yunfan obtain cultivation progress that others did not even dare to imagine.","With a thought, Chu Yunfan appeared outside the Mountain River Diagram. He looked around and saw that he was in a mountain range. Even he himself didn’t know where he had flown to.","There were huge trees that were thousands of feet tall all over this mountain range. The leaves and branches were lush, blocking all the light sources. Only some of the scenes could be vaguely seen.","Of course, this was nothing to Chu Yunfan, who currently was at the Void Core Stage and the combat strength of a Core Former. He could see through them with a glance.","But soon, he noticed a beam of light streak across the sky and fly into the distance. Just as Chu Yunfan was about to catch that person and ask them what was going on, a few more beams of light flew over from different places, but their targets were all very clear, heading in a certain direction.","‘Interesting,’ Chu Yunfan thought. With a sway of his body, he transformed into Jian Wuchen. He stepped on a beam of light and flew in the direction those people had gone.","In just a moment, he followed everyone to a huge mountain peak. This mountain peak was huge, with a length and width of more than 100 kilometers. At the foot of the mountain, there was a town. The destination of these light beams was this town.","Chu Yunfan immediately descended and entered. He casually scanned the town with his divine will and found that the people in the town were divided into two parts. One part did not have much cultivation and was only at the Acquired Stage. The Innates should be the locals.","The other group was different. They were all at the upper stage of the Divine Abilities Stage, and Chu Yunfan even saw quite a few Cores. These people thought that they had sealed their auras and others couldn’t see them at all. However, in front of Chu Yunfan, they were all exposed.","He calmly grabbed an outsider and questioned him. He learned the shocking news that this place was the treasure vault of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect that was rumored to have ruled this world.","The people in this town were the family members of the Violet Thunder Sword disciples. But after so many years, they no longer had any inheritance from the Violet Thunder Swords. They were now just ordinary people.","The residents of the city hurriedly hid to the side when they saw these outsiders. They did not dare to come into contact with these people. It had to be known that any one of these people had the strength to destroy the entire city.","However, before Chu Yunfan could understand more, a Divine arrived in front of Chu Yunfan and bowed. “Greetings, Sword Young Master.”","“Huh? You know who I am?” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows.","The Divine smiled bitterly and said, “That’s naturally because you previously displayed your might, Sword Young Master. Who in this world doesn’t know of your existence?”","Chu Yunfan thought about it and realized that it made sense. He couldn’t hide the fact that he had challenged more than ten sects. People were looking for him everywhere. If Jian Wuchen had not been his disguise, Chu Yunfan would have been discovered long ago.","“You didn’t come to me just to say this, right?” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","“My master invites you to meet with him,” the Divine did not beat around the bush and said directly.","“Who’s your master?” Chu Yunfan said.","“You will know when you meet him, Sword Young Master,” the Divine said.","“All right then. Lead the way,” Chu Yunfan said.","At this moment, he was bold. Even the khan couldn’t do anything to him. There was nothing for him to be afraid of.","Chu Yunfan followed the Divine and soon arrived at a courtyard with three entrances and three exits. The pavilions in the courtyard were artistic. It was clearly the residence of the city’s rich, but it had been commandeered.","Above the pavilion, there was a light violet barrier that was emitting a faint light."]},{"number":1492,"title":"Chapter 1492 The Age of Martial Arts","paragraphs":["1492 The Age of Martial Arts","After a while, a middle-aged man walked out of the courtyard. This man was wearing a violet robe and slowly walked up to Chu Yunfan.","“Sword Young Master.” The man’s expression was indifferent. He only nodded lightly when he saw Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the man. This man’s cultivation had reached the Core Form Stage. He was instantly speechless. Since when did the Core Form Stage become like cabbage? He could see them everywhere.","“May I know how I should address you?” Chu Yunfan said.","“I’m the president of the Alchemist Association, Wang Dong.” The man smiled.","Chu Yunfan was stunned. He had seen the presidents of the other three kingdom’s Alchemist Associations before, so there was only one possibility—this man was the president of the Alchemist Association’s main branch. He came to a realization. No wonder this man had such shocking cultivation. He was actually such a high-ranking person.","The Alchemist Association was spread all over the world, and it had branches in the three powerful kingdoms. Its strength was unfathomable, and its president was in the Core Form Stage. This was not surprising.","After all, a powerful martial artists might not necessarily be a powerful alchemist, but a powerful alchemist would definitely be a powerful martial artist.","If there was no Core Former to oversee it, what right did the Alchemist Association have to extend its tentacles to the three strong kingdoms? The three strong kingdoms had to give him face and did not dare to act rashly.","The president of the Alchemist Association was a master of alchemy. In addition, he was a Core Former. The three powerful kingdoms might not be willing to provoke such an existence.","“Greetings, President Wang!” said Chu Yunfan. Wang Dong was rarely spoken off, but he had heard a lot about the Alchemist Association. “Why have you called me here today?”","“Do you still remember what the Yunshan City’s branch president and you spoke of back then?” Wang Dong went straight to the point.","Chu Yunfan recalled that the president of the Yunshan branch had told him that he needed his help, but at that time, he said to not worry too mch about it.","“I remember. Is it related to the Violet Thunder Sword Sect?”Chu Yunfan said.","“Do you not know what’s happening here?” Wang Dong looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. He thought that Chu Yunfan had followed the clues, but who knew that Chu Yunfan didn’t know at all? This made him quite surprised.","“I don’t. I only came here by accident,” Chu Yunfan said.","To be more precise, he was chased here by the khan and had no idea where he was.","“That’s works out well.” Wang Dong glanced at Chu Yunfan and admired him even more. He thought that Chu Yunfan had followed the clues and found his way here, but he had actually come here by accident.","What did this mean? It meant that Chu Yunfan had great luck protecting him. Some people would trip over gold when they walked out, while others would get a facefull of water. This was the difference in luck.","Everyone’s luck was different. Of course, the experts who could cultivate to this level were basically one in a billion. If they were placed in the country of ordinary people, they would be chosen ones of Heaven. No matter what difficulties they encountered, they would be able to turn misfortune into good luck. In the end, they would be the people who dominated the world.","Even among cultivators, there were not many who had such luck. Although luck could not dominate everything, some people relied on talent, some relied on hard work, and extraordinary willpower could increase their luck.","But to some extent, luck was more important than hard work, willpower, talent, and other cultivation factors. It was just like how some people had been in seclusion for 50 years without breaking through, while others had met an old man who imparted his cultivation to them after going out for a walk. They had become the top experts in the world in minutes.","Wang Dong naturally understood this. He knew that one couldn’t just look at luck, but to underestimate a person with great luck was to fail miserably. Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties, but he already had such cultivation. His sword cultivation was earth-shattering, and he could be called the overlord of a generation.","It was normal for such a person to be guided here when they got lost.","“I heard that you have the Violet Thunder Swords’ sword token, Sword Young Master?” Wang Dong asked.","“That’s right, I do have the sword token,” Chu Yunfan admitted.","He knew that this matter could not be hidden. When he had transformed into Jian Wuchen, he had been so ostentatious. How could he hide it? Moreover, with his current cultivation, he was not afraid of others finding out. If others wanted to snatch it, it would depend on whether they had the ability.","“Then there’s nothing wrong with this.” Wang Dong nodded, but he was still a little surprised that Chu Yunfan could admit it without hesitation. This was not the courage of an ordinary person. “This matter is related to this token to a certain extent. How much you know about the Violet Thunder Swords, Sword Young Master?” Wang Dong asked.","“I only know a little. The Violet Thunder Swords once ruled this land,” Chu Yunfan said.","“That’s right, the Violet Thunder Swords did indeed once rule over this land. At that time, they were very powerful. There were over a million disciples of all kinds, and there were countless experts among them. Even those in the Core Stage weren’t that impressive at that time. It was an era when martial arts were at their peak,” said Wang Dong, “After that, the sect suddenly declined, and then there was the frequent replacement of the various kingdoms, all the way until now.”","“It suddenly declined? Why? How could a sect with millions of disciples suddenly decline?” Chu Yunfan was a little curious about how powerful a sect with millions of disciples was. He didn’t even dare to think about it.","Even in the Federation, such sects did not exist. Just the disciples alone numbered in the millions. If one were to include some of the internal and external handymen of the sect, as well as the relatives of the disciples, and so on, some sects could even build their own exclusive armies. The population that this sect could control would probably exceed tens of millions.","If one was to include the peripheral forces, it could indeed be considered a rule.","Although there was indeed a difference in the number of people controlled compared to the current large countries, the way a sect ruled was different from the way a country ruled. For a sect to be able to control so many people was indeed shocking.","After all, the requirements of the sect were much lower than that of a country. They would not require the rule of all aspects of the people. As long as they could ensure that they could continuously recruit disciples and collect taxes, it would be fine."]},{"number":1493,"title":"Chapter 1493 It’s Easy to Fish in Muddy Waters","paragraphs":["1493 It’s Easy to Fish in Muddy Waters","As the saying goes, a rotten boat has three pounds of nails. A starving camel is still bigger than a horse. How could a sect with millions of disciples disappear just like that?","He noticed that Wang Dong had used the term “sudden decline.” Normally, for a behemoth like this, if there was no external force, even if it declined, it would be a long process.","“We don’t know much about the specific situation. After countless wars, even the Alchemist Association, which doesn’t participate in the world’s hegemony, has been on the verge of destruction,” Wang Dong said calmly as if that was not their Alchemist Association. “During that process, many books were lost. Therefore, we do not know much about what happened back then. The only thing we know is that the Violet Thunder Swords went on an expedition to an unknown place and suffered a great defeat. Less than ten percent of the people who went returned, and the remaining people were not enough to suppress the restless powers in the various places. In the end, they quickly declined and their sect was breached.”","“An expedition?” Chu Yunfan was shocked. The Violet Thunder Swords had millions of disciples, yet they failed in their expedition? What powerful had they met on their expedition?","“Yes, an expedition, and many more things have been drowned in history. Nobody knows,” said Wang Dong, “Ever since the Violet Thunder Swords’ decline, the sect was breached and all of its disciples were massacred. As for the treasures that were originally stored in the sect, they disappeared without a trace.","“Actually, the entrance to the treasury has always been there. It’s located on this mountain. The residents of this town are the descendants of the disciples who guarded the Violet Thunder Swords treasury.”","“Is this all because you lack a token?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Wang Dong nodded and said, “It’s one of the reasons, but it’s not the whole reason. The key is that the timing isn’t right. The truth is, this mountain range is just an entrance, and the treasury is built in another space. After the Violet Thunder Swords’ decline, th treasury left the Spirit Realm and returns once every few hundred years. It’s about to return once again.”","“But if I don’t appear, this opportunity will be lost,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“No, you will appear!” said Wang Dong, “The reason we’re gathered here is because we’re confident. This time, the master of Mysteries Pavilion will personally use the Book of Changes to deduce when the treasury will see the light of day again.”","Chu Yunfan’s interest was piqued. He had come here by accident during his battle with the khan. It was all a coincidence, but someone had predicted it in advance.","“Impossible. As far as I know, it’s impossible to predict the future even if you’re in the Core Stage. It’s impossible even above the Core Stage.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor in his mind, so he naturally knew how amazing the cultivation base was needed to predict the future. Even if he was one level higher than the Core Stage, he wouldn’t be able to do it.","This was especially true for experts. The stronger the expert, the more difficult it was to predict. The traces of these experts in the river of fate became so shallow until they finally left the the physical world and were no held back by the five elements.","Even with cultivation of the Void Core Stage, or even the Core Form Stage, it was impossible to find out other’s roots.","“Of course, it’s impossible to predict arrival your, Sword Young Master. When the Mysteries Pavilion master made this deduction, it was a year ago. He predicted that there might be a turning point in this matter through the Book of Changes. It’s naturally impossible to predict everything. Otherwise, wouldn’t all the benefits in the world be taken by the Mysteries Pavilion?” said Wang Dong with a smile.","Chu Yunfan finally understood. If that was the case, then it was normal. They had only calculated through some means that the treasury would open today, but as for how it would open and who would open it, these were all unknown.","They could only confirm that it would definitely open today.","This was the fate of the universe. However, there were always some variables. Destiny was destiny, and variables were variables. The two were unrelated and could exist at the same time.","Even so, the Mysteries Pavilion master could not be underestimated. Even if he had only vaguely deduced some things, if he did it well, he could obtain many benefits. The Book of Changes that Wang Dong was talking about was probably related to this. The fact that Wang Dong could predict these things must have something to do with the Book of Changes.","“How many sword tokens are there?” Chu Yunfan said.","“To open the Violet Thunder Sword treasury, we need a total of seven sword tokens. The Alchemist Association has one and you have one. Jinzhanghan, Great Wei, and the imperial family of Great Qi each have one. The Netherworld Sect has one too, and the last is in the hands of Nine Stars,” Wang Dong said.","Chu Yunfan thought to himself. No wonder the sect master of the Purity Sect was so nervous at that time. The forces involved in these sword tokens were all huge. Compared to these forces, any one of them could easily crush them. That was why he didn’t dare to make a sound.","Who knew that the token would end up in Chu Yunfan’s hands?","“Since the Mysteries Pavilion was the one who deduced this matter, why don’t they have a token?” Chu Yunfan asked in confusion.","“They’d love to have one, but unfortunately, they don’t have the means,” said Wang Dong indifferently.","Chu Yunfan thought about it and agreed. Although the Mysteries Pavilion was a huge force and a behemoth, which of the forces that held the sword token was weaker than the Mysteries Pavilion?","Immediately, Wang Dong’s eyes flashed with a fierce light as he said, “It is precisely because of this that the Mysteries Pavilion decided to leak the criticism, which attracted many experts from various factions.”","“The Mysteries Pavilion wants to fish in troubled waters?” Chu Yunfan almost immediately understood what the Mysteries Pavilion wanted to do. They didn’t have a sword token, but they wanted a share of the pie. The only way was to muddy the waters so that they could fish in troubled waters.","If it was before, the other families could have played without the Mysteries Pavilion. However, now that the experts of all the forces had come. Many Cores had gathered. There might even be itinerant Core Former. Even the other six forces had to be wary."]},{"number":1494,"title":"Chapter 1494 The Conditions Offered by the Alchemist Association","paragraphs":["1494 The Conditions Offered by the Alchemist Association","“You are indeed quick-witted, Sword Young Master. That’s right, the Mysteries Pavilion wants to fish in troubled waters,” said Wang Dong, “Back then, when we joined forces to invite the Mysteries Pavilion master to predict the day the Violet Thunder Swords treasury would appear, we already knew that this day would come.","“Since ancient times, the few major factions have been separated and united, but that’s all. If they want to fish in troubled waters, it depends on whether they have the means to back it up!”","Chu Yunfan nodded. Whether one wanted to monopolize the treasury, fish in troubled waters, or obtain some benefits, in the end, it all depended on whether one had the means. It was just like how Wang Dong had to treat him as a distinguished guest because he had displayed the strength of the Core Former and could rival an entire country.","Strength was power.","“I understand the general situation. What would you like me to do, President Wang?” Chu Yunfan said.","“I would like you to lend me a hand, Sword Young Master,” said Wang Dong.","“Why should I help you? I alone can rival an enemy country. No one can do anything to me,” Chu Yunfan immediately said.","Although it was a good choice to join forces, he was not afraid at all with his current strength. Even if he encountered the khan, he could escape easily. Therefore, it was Wang Dong who had something to ask of him, not him.","“That’s true.” Wang Dong smiled bitterly. “How about in exchange I help you make a pill with all my strength in the future. How about it?”","The price Wang Dong offered was pretty high. With his current cultivation and achievements in alchemy, it would be difficult for even a Core Former to obtain the pills he made. Unfortunately, he didn’t know that in front of him sat an alchemy master who was a hundred times more powerful than him. This condition that was enough to move people’s hearts was completely ignored by Chu Yunfan.","“Change the condition. I won’t beg you to make a pill for me,” Chu Yunfan said with certainty.","If Chu Yunfan couldn’t make a certain pill with his current strength, then Wang Dong definitely couldn’t either. This was something that was obvious without even thinking.","Wang Dong was stunned. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to reject this condition. He was most afraid of meeting people like Chu Yunfan who seemed to have no desires. The conditions that ordinary people could only dream of were not attractive to Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","“I can help you fend off Nine Stars,” Wang Dong said, “Once the news of your arrival gets out, I’m afraid Nine Stars will hear of it immediately. It’s just a matter of time. How will you face Nine Star’s sect master then?”","“That’s unnecessary.” Chu Yunfan’s mouth twitched. “So what if it Nine Star’s sect master? I can suppress him with a flip of my hand.”","If it was before, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t dare to say such a thing, but now he was completely confident. Unless Nine Star’s sect master had reached the late Core Form Stage, he wouldn’t be afraid at all.","Wang Dong looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. He was a little stunned, but Chu Yunfan didn’t look like he was joking. He knew that Chu Yunfan was confident, but when he thought of this, he couldn’t help but be shocked.","They had analyzed Chu Yunfan’s previous fight with the former sect master of Nine Stars. Chu Yunfan should only have the combat strength of the fledgling Core Form Stage. And it had only been a short time since then, and Chu Yunfan was no longer afraid of Nine Star’s sect master? Was he hiding his strength, or did he have another breakthrough?","Wang Dong’s eyes flashed with horror. He couldn’t figure out Chu Yunfan’s background. After all, this person had appeared too mysteriously. He couldn’t find any trace of Chu Yunfan. He appeared as a top-notch expert and then disappeared mysteriously.","Even with the strength of the Mysteries Pavilion, they could not find any trace of Chu Yunfan. This was the most shocking thing.","Wang Dong gritted his teeth and said, “I guess there’s no other choise. After everything is done, we can provide you with a Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill.”","“The Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill?” Chu Yunfan said in astonishment. “How do you have such a thing?”","Ordinary people might not know about the Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill, but how could Chu Yunfan not? It was a peerless medicinal pill made from nine top-notch heavenly and earthly treasures. It was impossible for an alchemy expert to make it. Even an alchemy king, who was stronger than an alchemy expert, would find it difficult to make.","The most important factor was that these nine treasures were extremely difficult to obtain, but Wang Dong somehow had a Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill. This surprised Chu Yunfan.","The Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill was a kind of pill that could rapidly increase one’s strength. It was used by experts who had transcended the Core Form Stage. If Chu Yunfan had one of the Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pills now, he could immediately break through to the Core Form Stage. His combat strength would break through the Core Form Stage and increase his strength by several levels.","Wang Dong was a little puzzled that Chu Yunfan’s first reaction wasn’t to ask him what the Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill was and clearly knew what kind of pill it was.","In the Alchemist Association, there weren’t many who knew about this pill. It was asn ancient folk prescription that was quite difficult to follow. Although there was a pill recipe, it had always been shelved.","“Since you know about the Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill, then I’ll be straightforward. I won’t beat around the bush in front of an honest person. It isn’t the real Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill because the nine medicinal ingredients required for this pill are too difficult to find. This is something we came up with after many years of improving the recipe. Its medicinal effects are similar to the Nine Heavens Great Rejuvenating Pill, so we named it the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill,” said Wang Dong.","Chu Yunfan pondered. He wasn’t tempted by ordinary things. After all, with his cultivation, he could have as many ordinary treasures and pills as he wanted. However, this Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill was different. Although its medicinal effect was a little weaker, it was enough for Chu Yunfan.","“Okay, but I want to know what your goal is. Don’t tell me you want my help to monopolize the treasury,” Chu Yunfan said.","Taking out the Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill naturally meant that Wang Dong had a big goal in mind.","“Nothing like this,” Wang Dong quickly said, “As far as we know, there’s a herb garden in the Violet Thunder Sword treasury, and there’s a Herb King in this herb garden. That is what we want.”","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath. Wang Dong really had a good appetite. What was a Herb King? It was the king of all herbs. Most herbs would be picked very early on. Only a few could grow to a certain age and become a Herb King, and even then it was a low probability.","The medicinal effects of this Herb King were often a hundred times stronger than ordinary herbs. It could be said to be of the highest quality. Once the news spread, it would attract countless people to fight for it. No wonder Wang Dong wanted to find someone to help."]},{"number":1495,"title":"Chapter 1495 Forced to Retreat, Becoming Famous","paragraphs":["1495 Forced to Retreat, Becoming Famous","Even Chu Yunfan was envious of such a divine item, but it was just envy. Although he had killed many people to steal treasures, he had his principles when it came to dealing with people. He was not completely unscrupulous.","This was the foundation of his martial path will. If he were to violate this bottom line, his martial path will would probably collapse and he could forget about making any progress in his martial arts for the rest of his life.","To a martial artist, a firm belief was the foundation of everything.","From this point of view, all of these martial arts experts was paranoid.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan’s eyes were still clear and there was no change, Wang Dong’s heart was finally relieved. If Chu Yunfan was greedy, then he would have another opponent on this trip.","“No problem. I’ll help you get one of the Herb Kings for one Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill. The rest will not be within my promise,” Chu Yunfan said.","“That’s great!” Wang Dong said. Although it was not the best condition, it was not easy to invite a Core Former to help. “After this is done, I will immediately hand over a Nine Heavens Small Rejuvenating Pill with both hands!”","“Sure.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “In that case, I’ll be taking my leave now. When the treasury opens, send someone to inform me.”","“All right, take care,” said Wang Dong.","After Chu Yunfan left, he found an inn to stay in. Then, he sat cross-legged and continued to cultivate, waiting for the day the treasury opened.","“Jian Wuchen, come out and die!”","Suddenly, a loud shout came from the sky. The entire town felt a terrifying pressure pressing down on them. It instantly alarmed the experts in the entire town.","“Who said that? Oh, my god... It’s Nine Star’s sect master!” Someone noticed a middle-aged man in a brocade robe looking angrily at an inn from the sky above the town.","“Why is he so angry?”","“Jian Wuchen... This name sounds familiar. I think I’ve heard it somewhere before. Oh, isn’t he the one who challenged more than ten sects and killed the former sect master of Nine Stars?”","“That’s right, it’s him. No wonder Nine Stars’ sect master is so angry. Jian Wuchen had stepped on Nine Stars’ back to get to his position. How could the sect master not be angry?”","“This is going to be interesting. I didn’t expect to see a Core Form Stage battle as soon as I arrived today!”","“That’s right. Nine Stars’ sect master is a veteran Core Former, but I’m afraid Jian Wuchen too has the combat strength of a Core Former. Tsk, tsk. I’m afraid it’ll be another fierce battle!”","Everyone discussed animatedly. After figuring out the identities of both parties, it was no longer strange.","“If you don’t come out, I’ll catch you!” Nine Star’s sect master said coldly.","Then, he reached down, and a huge hand made of energy reached toward the inn. But immediately after, a sword light shot into the sky and broke through this energy hand.","This shocking sword light shot into the sky and was thousands of feet tall. It shook the entire town, letting everyone in the town know how terrifying and ruthless the owner of this sword light was.","The martial artists who were watching the show instantly felt a chill run down their spines. They shivered because they felt that if this sword fell on the town, the place would be turned into ashes and they would not be able to escape death.","“If you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish,” a cold voice came from inside the inn and a threatening sharpness shot into the nine heavens.","The sect master was livid and his eyes filled with bewilderment. He felt threatened by this sword light. If it were anywhere else, he would have taken action long ago.","Ever since Jian Wuchen had appeared, he had been targeting Nine Stars. Now, he had become a huge threat. The sect master had been looking for Chu Yunfan but failed to find him. He was not expecting to meet Chu Yunfan here.","However, it was at this juncture that it became troublesome. If it was anyone else, it would be fine, but Chu Yunfan’s strength made him feel threatened. Although he was confident that he could defeat Chu Yunfan, he wasn’t confident that he would come out unscathed. If he was injured, it might affect the opening of the treasury.","That was not be worth it.","The sect master was determined to obtain the treasury. He needed the treasures within to advance his cultivation. If he got injured and could not recover quickly, his trip to the treasury would be delayed.","‘Since Chu Yunfan appeared here, it’s obvious that he’s interested in the treasury. After I obtain that item in the treasury and my cultivation has greatly improved, I’ll kill him in the treasury,’ the sect master thought.","He couldn’t bear to fight with Chu Yunfan at this time and let others take advantage of him. There were quite a few experts present, so he didn’t need to decide the victor at this time.","“Hmph, I’ll let you live for a few more days!” the sect master shouted coldly and turned to leave.","Everyone in the town was in an uproar. Chu Yunfan has forced Nine Star’s sect master to retreat. This made many people who believed that the sect master would definitely win drop their jaws. Although many people guessed the reason why he didn’t make a move in the end, it was an indisputable fact that Chu Yunfan had forced him away.","This made many people readjust their opinions of Chu Yunfan. They were afraid that he was much stronger than they had expected. He could even fight against Nine Star’s sect master. He was not completely helpless.","This shocked everyone.","Chu Yunfan was so young, but in terms of cultivation, he was at an extremely high level. Nine Star’s sect master was a veteran Core Former. He was at the peak of his age, but Chu Yunfan was at the age where he was rising rapidly. His future was hard to predict.","Many people knew that there would be other top-notch experts in the world. Chu Yunfan’s strength was tyrannical, even Nine Star’s sect master was afraid","In the distance, Wang Dong stood with his hands behind his back. He had seen the confrontation at the inn. His expression carried a hint of shock. Although he had long guessed it, he was still shocked when he saw the scene.","“President Wang, because of Jian Wuchen, we’ll definitely offend Nine Stars,” an old man behind Wang Dong said.","“So what? As the saying goes, there are gains and losses. Everything has its pros and cons. It’s impossible to only think about the benefits and not pay the price. Besides, will Nine Stars really dare to involve us?” said Wang Dong indifferently."]},{"number":1496,"title":"Chapter 1496 Opening of the Treasury, the Ultimate West Demon League","paragraphs":["1496 Opening of the Treasury, the Ultimate West Demon League","Wang Dong was confident in the strength of the Alchemist Association. After all, it had stood tall in the world for so many years. So what if Nine Stars was dissatisfied? They wouldn’t implicate the Alchemist Association.","After all, not only was the Alchemist Association powerful, but it also had a wide network of friends. Provoking the Alchemist Association was equivalent to poking a hornet’s nest.","However, he wouldn’t offend Nine Stars for Chu Yunfan’s sake. He was just using Chu Yunfan to get the Herb King.","“All right, let’s get ready. The opening time of the treasury is about to arrive, and we have to rush to meet up as soon as possible,” Wang Dong said.","“He’s already here. He’ll meet with us soon,” the old man said.","“Good.” Wang Dong nodded.","At the same time, all the experts in the town noticed Jian Wuchen’s arrival and listed him as a key target. In a short time, there were already many spies outside the inn.","Of course, this couldn’t be hidden from Chu Yunfan’s eyes, but he didn’t really care. Through the test just now, he already understood that Nine Star’s master was indeed very powerful. He was much stronger than the Right King, but he was only at the peak of the intermediate Core Form Stage. He was still one step away from the late Core Form Stage.","An ordinary intermediate Core Former was no match for him. There was a big gap between him and Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan could have killed him earlier, but he did not do so because he realized that there were too many experts hidden in this small town. There were even more than Chu Yunfan thought. There were probably no less than ten Core Formers, not to mention Void Cores. There were probably more than a hundred of them, and they were all experts at the late Void Core Stage or above.","Experts of this level were extremely rare. They were among the top hidden experts of various kingdoms and factions. Not to mention a Core Former, who was said to be an existence that could rule a kingdom on their own.","With so many masters gathered here, one could imagine how chaotic the scene was. Chu Yunfan had the right to be arrogant, but he did not want to become the target of public criticism. If that happened, he would be targeted everywhere.","At least before entering the treasury, Chu Yunfan did not want to expose his strength. Although others were afraid of him, they were only afraid. They would not specifically target him.","During the confrontation earlier, Chu Yunfan had sensed a familiar divine will. It was the chief disciple of the Monster Subduers, Yun Tian.","Previously, when he was defeated by Chu Yunfan, Yun Tian was only a half-step to the Core Form Stage. But now, he had truly stepped into the Core Form Stage. He had become the second Core Former in the Monster Subduers since Yun Huang. It seemed that after being defeated by Chu Yunfan, he had worked hard and broken through to the Core Form Stage.","‘This is going to get interesting. Experts from all over the world have gathered. It depends on who is more capable,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","An ordinary treasury would not attract all the experts in the world. However, the Violet Thunder Swords treasury was different. This was the treasury of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect that had once ruled the world. Just thinking about how many good things there were in it was enough to make these experts tempted.","In addition, with the Mysteries Pavilion spreading the news everywhere, all the experts in the world must have rushed over. If not for this, how could these behemoths who held the other six sword tokens easily compromise and agree to enter together? No matter how strong they were, they could not fight against the entire world. It was not worth it.","Chu Yunfan waited in the inn for three whole days. Three days later, Wang Dong sent someone to inform him that the treasury was finally about to open.","Early in the morning, Chu Yunfan arrived outside the city and met up with Wang Dong and the others. Just as he had expected, other than Wang Dong, there were about 20 other experts. The weakest among them was at the half-step Core Stage, and there were also a few at the Void Core Stage. All of these people, without exception, had strong traces of alchemy cultivation on them.","They were experts nurtured by the Alchemist Association.","The only thing that surprised Chu Yunfan was an old man in a linen robe. This old man was wearing a tattered linen robe, and he grimaced as if he had suffered all the sufferings of the world.","Chu Yunfan glanced at him again because this old man’s cultivation was in the Core Form Stage. However, he had never heard of this old man before, so he was probably another figure at the level of an old ancestor among itinerant rogue cultivators.","“You’re here, Sword Young Master. Let me introduce you. This is Ancestor Hemp Garb. Ancestor, this is the Sword Young Master,” Wang Dong introduced them enthusiastically.","The old man nodded. He had heard about Chu Yunfan recently. Although he was proud, he was not a fool. Judging from the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, he was not inferior to him. He was not someone he could neglect.","“If the three of us work together, our chances of getting the Herb King will increase greatly.” Wang Dong smiled and nodded.","“President Wang, with our combined, isn’t it enough to guarantee that we can get the Herb King?” Chu Yunfan asked. In his opinion, even if he hid his strength, was three Core Formers joining forces insufficient?","“Now that things have come to this, I won’t hide it from you, Sword Young Master. The reason why I sought you out is that our opponent this time isn’t ordinary. We obtained a map of the treasury, but this map was divided into several parts. We only got a part of it, which marked the location of the herb garden. A few old monsters in the Ultimate West Demon League have come out of the mountains, and their target is the Herb King. I’m afraid the three of us can’t be said to have a guaranteed victory,” said Wang Dong.","“The Ultimate West Demon League?” Of course, Chu Yunfan had heard of the existence of the Monster Subduers at the western border of Great Wei. The Monster Subduers were at odds with the demon league the.","There were countless demons in this demon league, and some of them were top-notch experts. However, they had always been at the western border of the world and had not appeared in front of everyone. However, they should not underestimate this Ultimate Weste Demon League. After all, it bordered Jinzhanghan and Great Wei but was not destroyed by the two kingdoms, which was enough to show that it was very powerful."]},{"number":1497,"title":"Chapter 1497 The Gathering of Heroes","paragraphs":["1497 The Gathering of Heroes","Previously, when discussing the Dao with Yun Huang, Yun Huang had mentioned the Ultimate West Demon League. The Monster Subduers had occupied this place for generations to suppress the Ultimate West Demon League at the western border.","Great Wei had turned a blind eye to the Monster Subduers for generations because of this reason. If they were to always be the first barrier to block the Western demon league’s eastward advance, unless the Monster Subduers rebelled, Great Wei had no reason to go against the Monster Subduers.","Chu Yunfan knew some things about the Ultimate West Demon League. In the demon league, there were tribes, and each tribe was a race. There were seventy-two tribes, and their leaders were known as the seventy-two demon kings. Each of these seventy-two demon kings was a Core.","Among the 72 demon kings, there were 10 who were extra strong. They were Core Formers. However, these ten demon kings lived deep in the Ultimate West Demon League and rarely appeared. Therefore, ordinary people had not heard of them.","At first glance, the strength of the Ultimate West Demon League was indeed extremely powerful, much stronger than the Monster Subduers. But in fact, it was much weaker than many forces in the three major human kingdoms.","Although the human race was divided into many kingdoms, the Ultimate West Demon League was just a comprehensive name. The tribes in it had many conquests and were not peaceful with one another. This was why the Monster Subduers could guarantee the stability of Great Wei’s western border alone.","“They’re indeed a troublesome opponent, but how many did they send?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“As far as I know, 20 of the 72 demon kings have come. Among them, four of them are Core Formers who are among the top ten demon kings,” Wang Dong said solemnly.","Chu Yunfan finally understood why Wang Dong had said that they had a chance of winning if he joined them. If he didn’t, their group would have no chance of winning at all.","Based on what Wang Dong had said, the other major powers probably had their own goals and were not aligned with each other. In other words, they had divided their territories to prevent uncontrollable disputes from erupting. The various factions were wary of each other and did not want to fight to the death unless it was necessary.","Of course, this was his plan before entering the treasury. If he really entered, things would be unpredictable.","‘It’s indeed very troublesome,’ Chu Yunfan thought. The Ultimate West Demon League rarely appeared. If it wasn’t for the rumor that the Violet Thunder Swords was involved, the Ultimate West Demon League probably wouldn’t have appeared.","“It doesn’t matter. Since I’ve promised you, I’ll do my best to help you obtain a Herb King,” Chu Yunfan said.","When he attacked earlier, many auras had appeared at the same time. Chu Yunfan had not found any aura similar to that of the khan, so he was not too worried.","“All right, we’ll set off immediately.” Wang Dong nodded, and the group of people flew toward the mountain peak outside the city.","At this moment, there were already countless people waiting on the mountain peak outside the city. These experts were floating in the air, standing according to their respective camps.","Chu Yunfan and the others were not the first to arrive. The first to arrive was a group from Great Wei’s imperial family. There were two people in the lead. One of them was the chief disciple of the Monster Subduers, Yun Tian. Beside him was an old man dressed in a dragon robe and exuding a noble aura. Chu Yunfan had never seen him before, but he could tell from the royal aura on his body that he was a member of Great Wei’s imperial family.","Chu Yunfan was a little stunned. He never thought there was such a person in Great Wei’s imperial family. Previously, he and Wei Wuji had joined forces to fight against the previous emperor, but they hadn’t encountered this man. He didn’t know whether it was because he didn’t want to get involved in worldly affairs or because of the previous emperor’s instructions.","In short, if this old man had attacked at that time, Chu Yunfan would not have been able to get away with it. After all, he only had the combat strength of a half-step Core Former at that time. At most, he could only protect himself.","However, it made sense when he thought about it. Jinzhanghan had more than one Core Former. It was unlikely for Great Wei’s imperial family to not have a single Core Former. If that was the case, the khan alone could probably overturn the entire capital of Great Wei.","Although there was a difference in cultivation between Core Formers, it was a completely different matter if there was another Core Former overseeing them.","Other than the group of people from Great Wei’s imperial family, there was also a group of people carrying the banner of Great Qi’s imperial family. The leader was also an old man wearing a royal robe. He was probably similar to the expert from Great Wei’s imperial family. They were all hidden experts from the two kingdoms’ imperial families. Most likely, they were even part of the imperial family. With the wealth, resources, and manpower of the two imperial families, it would be unbelievable if they couldn’t produce a few experts.","In addition, the imperial family of a third kingdom was also present. They were the experts of Jinzhanghan. The leader of the experts was a middle-aged man who wore a robe embroidered with wolves.","‘The Left King of Jinzhanghan!’ Chu Yunfan’s pupils contracted slightly.","This middle-aged man was somewhat similar to the khan and the Right King. In addition, his cultivation was much stronger than the Right King’s. He had reached the peak of the intermediate Core Form Stage and was one of the strongest experts in this group.","Therefore, it was not difficult to guess the identity of this person. He was the crown prince of Jinzhanghan, the Left King.","Jinzhanghan was indeed the most powerful among the three kingdoms. They had brought with them forty to fifty experts. The weakest of them was at the half-step Core Stage, and most of them were top experts who had entered the Core Stage. In terms of strength, only Great Wei and Great Qi combined could be compared to Jinzhanghan.","In addition to Jinzhanghan, there was a group of experts wearing the uniform of the Netherworld Sect. They were undoubtedly the experts of the Netherworld Sect, the largest sect in Jinzhanghan. The status of the Netherworld Sect in Jinzhanghan was similar to that of the Monster Subduers in Great Wei.","There was also a group who stood at the side and did not fit in with everyone else. Their bodies emitted a dense demonic aura. Chu Yunfan took a look and saw that these fellows were all hidden in their cloaks. But there was no doubt that they were the experts of the Ultimate West Demon League. Because they were demons, they kept a distance from everyone.","Not long after, the owner of the last sword token, Nine Stars, arrived. The sect master of Nine Stars took the lead. When he saw Chu Yunfan, he snorted coldly and his eyes flashed with an unfriendly light.","Seeing that everyone had arrived, an old man in yellow walked out from the crowd and said, “Now that everyone is here, take out your sword tokens and prepare to open the treasury.”"]},{"number":1498,"title":"Chapter 1498 Indomitable Force","paragraphs":["1498 Indomitable Force","“That’s the master of the Mysteries Pavilion,” said Wang Dong.","Chu Yunfan nodded. In his perception, this old man was probably at the intermediate Core Form Stage. Among the people present, he was considered the best.","However, the old man was a little hostile toward Chu Yunfan because Chu Yunfan had previously forced the Mysteries Pavilion to lower their heads. This was undoubtedly a great humiliation for the master of the Mysteries Pavilion. However, he knew that Chu Yunfan was not easy to deal with, so he could only stared unhappily.","No one hesitated. They knew that there was not much time left, so they took out their tokens. The seven sword tokens combined into one and opened up a passage on the mountain. It was about ten meters long and wide.","Everyone looked at each other and immediately stepped into the passage without any hesitation. Everyone fought to get to the front. A moment later, over 1,000 peak experts had already entered the passageway.","After entering the passage, a huge hall appeared in front of everyone. This hall was huge, reaching up to a hundred feet. Upon entering, everyone discovered that there were a total of ten different passages in this hall. These ten different passages clearly led to different places.","The various major factions did not hesitate. Within moments, they had lready charged toward the route that they had chosen. Chu Yunfan and the others flew toward the third passage on the left. A moment later, the experts of the Ultimate West Demon League followed closely behind.","Only the rogue cultivators were left in a daze. They weren’t like the experts of the major forces. They had more or less received some information long ago and had tacitly divided their territories. After thinking for a long time, they could only choose a path and fly away.","Chu Yunfan and the others were speeding along this passage, but the experts of the Ultimate West Demon League were getting closer and closer.","“This isn’t ideal. if we continue like this, we’ll be caught sooner or later,” said Wang Dong.","The reason why the experts of the Ultimate West Demon League were slower than them was that they did not have the map, so they had to follow Wang Dong and the others.","At this rate, by the time Wang Dong and the others arrived at the herb garden, the Ultimate West Demon League will get there as well. When that happened, it would just be giving a gift to others.","“Allow me!” Chu Yunfan shouted and used his divine power to lift everyone up. The wings of lightning on his back instantly spread out and he used the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations. He flew into the distance at an amazing speed.","The Ultimate West Demon League, who had followed the crowd, was instantly left behind by Chu Yunfan. In just a moment, Chu Yunfan and the others could no longer be seen in the winding passage.","“Argh! D*mn it, after them!”","The Ultimate West Demon League didn’t care. They just needed to follow behind Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would shake them off?","In the passageway, Wang Dong, Ancestor Hemp Garb, and the others looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. His methods were too shocking. He had managed to speed up while bringing everyone with him. How shocking was this?","Thinking of this, they realized that they had underestimated him.","Chu Yunfan and his team had left the Ultimate West Demon League far behind. In just a moment, they had already arrived at the exit of the passage.","However, a large golden hand suddenly grabbed at them.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan shouted. Sword Qi condensed above his head and he slashed at the golden hand.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s sword deflected the golden hand. Then, everyone realized that a golden puppet about three meters tall had appeared in front of them.","It was this golden puppet that had blocked everyone.","“This is the guard of the treasury!” said Wang Dong. “We can’t let it hold us back. Otherwise, the Ultimate West Demon League will catch up with us.”","“It’s fine. You guys go on ahead. I’ll cover you guys,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Okay!” Wang Dong said decisively. He knew that this was not the time to be modest.","He immediately passed through with the others. The golden puppet was about to block them when a shocking sword light swept past and cut off the golden puppet’s arm.","Chu Yunfan walked over and saw that the golden puppet’s arm had reattached itself to the golden puppet. After a fluctuation, it had returned to its original state.","“Interesting!” Chu Yunfan laughed, but he was unperturbed.","This golden puppet was quite powerful. Its cultivation was comparable to the early stage of the Core Form Stage. It was not a threat to Chu Yunfan at the moment. It was just that this ability to continuously recover was a little troublesome.","However, it was only a little troublesome. No matter what kind of puppet it was, it had its core. As long as the core was destroyed, it would be destroyed.","With a thought, Chu Yunfan grabbed at the air. A bolt of thunder turned into a long sword and stabbed out. Thousands of sword lights swept out and fell on the golden puppet like a storm.","In just a moment, the golden puppet was cut into pieces. Just as the golden puppet was about to reassemble, Chu Yunfan reached out and grabbed one of the crystal cores.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan crushed the crystal core into powder, and the golden puppet that was about to reassemble stopped moving. This crystal core was the core of this golden puppet.","Chu Yunfan rubbed his chin. This golden puppet was quite interesting. Although Chu Yunfan seemed to have easily destroyed this golden puppet, if it were anyone else, such as Wang Dong and Ancestor Hemp Garb, they would probably be stopped by this golden puppet.","This was because they did not have the ability to break through the golden puppet’s defense.","Even an ordinary intermediate Core Former would find it difficult to break through the golden puppet’s defense. Only Chu Yunfan, who had unparalleled attacks, could easily do so and destroy the golden puppet’s crystal core.","Even the Ultimate West Demon League would have a headache if they met this puppet. It was just that Chu Yunfan was like their nemesis.","The Ultimate West Demon League arrived at the entrance of the passage and saw Chu Yunfan guarding the entrance.","“Go! Kill him!”"]},{"number":1499,"title":"Chapter 1499 One Person Suppressing Many Demon Kings","paragraphs":["1499 One Person Suppressing Many Demon Kings","The demons first reaction was to kill Chu Yunfan. Humans and demons were different, and they were enemies.","“Let’s see if you have the strength to kill me!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Rrrraaagh!”","Loud roars rang out like terrifying primordial beasts. Countless demonic energy rose up and swept toward Chu Yunfan like thick smoke. The attacks of the demon kings in the demon league were hidden in the surging demonic energy and came from all directions.","They didn’t want to waste time, so they used their killing moves right away.","If it was an ordinary Core Former, they would probably be severely injured at once. But Chu Yunfan was no ordinary Core Former. Although his cultivation level was only at the Void Core Stage, he was much more terrifying than an ordinary Core Former.","“River Sunset Slash!”","Chu Yunfan’s sword swept out, directly transforming into a scene of a long river with a setting sun. The entire world was instantly torn apart and suppressed. The attack that was accompanied by the thick demonic energy was broken by Chu Yunfan’s slash. It could not stop his attack at all.","“I’ll stop him. You guys hurry up and chase after the others!”","At this moment, a tall figure walked out from the ranks of the Extreme West Demon League. This figure looked extremely tall, more than two meters tall, like a pillar that held up the sky. Immediately, the rest of the demons moved to the side, trying to go around Chu Yunfan. But just as they were about to surpass him, a sword light slashed down from the sky.","Boom!","With a loud boom, one of the cloaked demons screamed and flew backward. There was a big hole in his chest. He was breathing out more air than he was breathing in. He was going to die.","Chu Yunfan killed a Core in one move.","The entire place was dead silent. All the demons stopped. At first, they had looked down on Chu Yunfan. Among the major forces that came this time, the Ultimate West Demon League was the strongest. Although the other forces also had dozens of people, there were only Divines and half-step Cores among them. Only the Ultimate West Demon League was full of Cores, and there were even several Core Formers.","With such a lineup, even if they were to enter human society, they would not be afraid of being surrounded by human experts. Even if they were besieged by an army, they could easily kill their way out. It was almost impossible for a mere human expert to stop them, but who knew that Chu Yunfan had done it.","“Human, do you know what you are doing?” The leader of the Ultimate West Demon League stared at Chu Yunfan coldly. “You have completely angered me!”","“So what if I anger you? If I don’t let you pass, you won’t be able to!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Kill him!” the leader shouted.","Immediately, the demons roared and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","These demons were at least above the Core Stage. Dozens of them rushed over with great power, like a landslide or a tsunami. It was as if the entire treasury was shaking.","A great battle instantly erupted!","Chu Yunfan shouted, and his entire body emitted a golden light. He was like a golden god of war as he pressed down on the rolling dark clouds.","Boom!","Everyone was fighting. The dozens of top experts surrounded Chu Yunfan. Each of their attacks could easily destroy a city. They all fell on Chu Yunfan’s body, but they could not break through his defense.","After a while, the demons realized that something was wrong. Chu Yunfan’s defense was too strong. When their attacks landed on his body, they could see only barely a ripple and they could not break through his defense.","Chu Yunfan had no intention of fighting them to the death. The sword in his hand was for defense, but his defense was actually flawless.","“How is this possible? Is he human? How can he be stronger than us demons?!” One of the demons widened their eyes in disbelief. Chu Yunfan’s attack was terrifying, but their defense was equally terrifying.","It was terrifying and unbelievable.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan arrived in front of him. A sword light swept through the sky. In just a moment, a figure accompanied by sword light appeared in front of the demon.","Slash!","The sword light pierced through the demon. Their eyes were still wide open, completely in disbelief.","“Aaargh!” A loud roar came from behind Chu Yunfan. “D*mned human! You’re courting death!”","At this moment, a terrifying demonic aura rushed into the sky. It caused the entire world to tremble violently.","A lion with golden fur roared and rushed over. It was the leader of the Ultimate West Demon League, Golden Lion King.","He couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan and could only watch as Chu Yunfan started killing. Finally, he couldn’t hold it in anymore and transformed into his original appearance.","This was a common technique of the demons. Although the demons could use all kinds of martial arts and divine powers in human form, their true strength was in their original form. In their true forms, their combat power would increase by at least 20%. Although it was only 20%, it was the key to determining the outcome of a battle between peak experts.","“Rrraaagh!”","Golden Lion King was powerful. He was at the peak of the intermediate Core Form Stage. After transforming into its true form, its strength increased by 20%. It was amazing.","It opened its bloody jaws, and its sharp fangs were like sharp swords. They turned into a sky full of swords and slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan was not flustered. He shouted, “Get lost!”","Chu Yunfan turned his hand and slashed with his sword. The sword light landed on the body of Golden Lion King, cutting the golden fur that was like armor and tearing open a bloody wound. The pain made Golden Lion King scream.","Bam!","Golden Lion King was sent flying. Its huge body landed heavily on the ground, creating a huge pit.","Chu Yunfan’s body shook slightly, and in an instant, he disappeared from where he was and killed his way into the group of demon kings."]},{"number":1500,"title":"Chapter 1500 Big Harvest","paragraphs":["1500 Big Harvest","Bam!","Chu Yunfan was like a golden lightning bolt, constantly flashing among the demon kings. From time to time, he sent a demon king flying.","Each of these demons were the supreme king of a tribe. They were the most powerful experts in the entire Ultimate West Demon League. But against Chu Yunfan, there was nothing they could do.","These demon kings formed an array and used the power of the array to resist Chu Yunfan. And sure enough, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was suppressed. But even so, they could only suppress him. It was impossible to hurt him.","Golden Lion King flashed crazily through the array to catch Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan was too fast. He continuously sidestepped using thunder power, and Golden Lion King couldn’t keep up. He could only bite the dust behind Chu Yunfan’s back.","“Aaargh! D*mned human! Do you have the guts to fight me?!” Golden Lion King roared.","“Hahahaha, Golden Lion King, there are so many of you fighting me, and you have the cheek to say that I don’t have the guts?” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud.","Facing such a terrifying formation, he was at ease because he had not used his full strength. What he was displaying now was the sword path. Everyone thought that he was only a sword cultivator, but his sword attack was only one of his many methods.","Chu Yunfan calculated the time. The blocking of the meridians for so long should be enough.","“Hahaha, I’m not going to waste any more time with you guys.”","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar and rose from the ground. He instantly turned into a bolt of lightning and disappeared from where he was. In a short while, he disappeared.","The demons looked at each other. They finally realized that the reason why Chu Yunfan was trapped in the array was because he wanted to delay them. Otherwise, it would be impossible to delay him.","“Is this fellow really a human?”","“How is this possible? How can there be such a terrifying existence among humans?”","“His entire person is like a sword, and his sword cultivation is earth-shattering. No one can compare to him!”","The demon kings discussed animatedly. Some of them even let out a sigh of relief when they saw Chu Yunfan retreat. This was because he had killed several demon kings in the short confrontation just now.","It was needless to say how terrifying a Core was, especially their tenacious vitality, which made them very difficult to kill. Not to mention a Core demon king, which was even more extreme. In the end, under Chu Yunfan’s attack, one move would be fatal. If they were careless, they would die at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Ordinary Cores, even those at the intermediate Void Core Stage or late Void Core Stage, would not be able to fight back in front of Chu Yunfan.","These demons were not even afraid of being attacked by the Blood Barbarians of Jinzhanghan. They could escape, but now, they were helpless and suffered heavy losses just because they met Chu Yunfan. This dealt a huge blow to their confidence. There were countless experts among the humans. This human was not an expert they knew, but the strength he possessed shocked them.","He had managed to stall them single-handedly. There were not many experts of this level among the humans. This caused the demons to be shocked.","Many of the demon kings were unwilling to remain at the Western border. Why could humans occupy the endless colorful world while the demons could only stay in the western border?","This was especially true for those who believed that their strength far surpassed that of humans.","However, the expert they met today had given them a hard slap in the face. It made them understand that there were countless experts in the human world. The humans were not as weak as they had thought.","It even gave them a feeling that human experts were unfathomable. However, they did not know that even among humans, there was only one person like Chu Yunfan. There was no such thing as countless experts.","“After him! Don’t forget what we’re here for today!” Golden Lion King roared, “If we don’t get the Herb King, we’ll all have to commit suicide!”","At this moment, the demon kings remembered the goal of this trip. Their goal was the Herb King. As the saying went, humans and demons could not coexist. The battles and grudges between humans and demons were not just a day or two.","No matter how much the humans fought among themselves, they were still at odds with the demons. There was still room for reconciliation with the other kingdoms, but with the demons, it was only life and death.","It was the same for the demons.","Even if they were very strong, it was still a very risky operation to go deep into the human territory. If they weren’t careful, they would face the combined attacks of the three human kingdoms. No one would forget the great war between humans and demons.","However, they still came for the Herb King. If the Herb King was gone, then they would have taken such a big risk for nothing.","They couldn’t bear the consequences.","At the thought of this, the demon kings’ morale was boosted. No matter who this human sword master was, they would not give up on the Herb King.","Thinking of this, they all roared and chased after Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was fast. He rushed in and what entered his eyes was a huge herb garden. In the garden, the fragrance of herbs pervaded the air. There were medicinal herbs that were at least hundreds of years old and thousands of years old everywhere.","This was an extremely rare sight. Few medicinal herbs planted in the outside world could be raised for so many years. When they matured, they would be plucked and made into medicine.","‘No wonder this place produced a Herb King. After so many years, it’s normal for medicinal herbs to mutate and advance to become Herb Kings,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","To nurture a Herb King, the herb had to first be of high quality, and then there had to be enough time and spirit energy. This was the only way. This method was simple, but very few people could wait that long.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up as he looked at the herbs. Many of them were rare herbs. As he flew past, he conjured a large hand of divine power and grabbed the herbs and placed them into the herb mountain in the Mountain River Diagram."]}]);
